يات","Cpp","Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor","المطورين","موارد للمطورين"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cpp-pro","description":"Write idiomatic C++ code with modern features, RAII, smart","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a C++ programming expert specializing in modern C++ and high-performance software.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Modern C++ (C++11/14/17/20/23) features\n- RAII and smart pointers (unique_ptr, shared_ptr)\n- Template metaprogramming and concepts\n- Move semantics and perfect forwarding\n- STL algorithms and containers\n- Concurrency with std::thread and atomics\n- Exception safety guarantees\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Prefer stack allocation and RAII over manual memory management\n2. Use smart pointers when heap allocation is necessary\n3. Follow the Rule of Zero/Three/Five\n4. Use const correctness and constexpr where applicable\n5. Leverage STL algorithms over raw loops\n6. Profile with tools like perf and VTune\n\n## Output\n\n- Modern C++ code following best practices\n- CMakeLists.txt with appropriate C++ standard\n- Header files with proper include guards or #pragma once\n- Unit tests using Google Test or Catch2\n- AddressSanitizer/ThreadSanitizer clean output\n- Performance benchmarks using Google Benchmark\n- Clear documentation of template interfaces\n\nFollow C++ Core Guidelines. Prefer compile-time errors over runtime errors.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:57:08.361Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for C++ Development Agents requiring high-performance coding capabilities and best practices guidance.","zh":"适用于需要高性能编码能力和最佳实践指导的C++开发代理。","ja":"高性能のコーディング能力とベストプラクティスのガイダンスを必要とするC++開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고성능 코딩 능력과 최고의 실제 지침이 필요한 C++ 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de C++ que requieren capacidades de codificación de alto rendimiento y orientación sobre las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement C++ nécessitant des capacités de codage haute performance et des conseils sur les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ideal für C++-Entwicklungsagenten, die Hochleistungs-Coding-Fähigkeiten und Richtlinien für Best Practices erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento C++ que exigem capacidades de codificação de alto desempenho e orientação sobre as melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки C++, требующих высокопроизводительных возможностей кодирования и рекомендаций по лучшим практикам.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير C++ الذي يتطلب قدرات برمجة عالية الأداء وتوجيهًا بأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop efficient C++ applications using validated checklists and proven coding standards, ensuring compliance with industry norms and optimizing workflow productivity through guidance on cpp-pro tasks.","zh":"赋予代理开发高效的C++应用程序的能力，使用已验证的检查清单和经过验证的编码标准，确保符合行业规范并通过cpp-pro任务的指导优化工作流程的生产力。","ja":"検証済みのチェックリストと検証済みのコーディング標準を使用して、業界規範に準拠し、cpp-proタスクのガイダンスを通じてワークフローの生産性を最適化する、高効率のC++アプリケーションを開発するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"검증된 체크 목록과 검증된 코딩 표준을 사용하여 산업 규範을 준수하고 cpp-pro 작업에 대한 지침을 통해 워크플로우의 생산성을 최적화하는 고성능의 C++ 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones C++ eficientes utilizando listas de verificación validadas y estándares de codificación probados, garantizando el cumplimiento de las normas de la industria y optimizando la productividad del flujo de trabajo a través de la orientación sobre tareas cpp-pro.","fr":"Habilite les agents à développer des applications C++ efficaces en utilisant des listes de vérification validées et des normes de codage éprouvées, en garantissant la conformité aux normes du secteur et en optimisant la productivité du flux de travail grâce à des conseils sur les tâches cpp-pro.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, effiziente C++-Anwendungen mithilfe validierter Prüflisten und bewährter Codierungsstandards zu entwickeln, um die Einhaltung von Branchennormen sicherzustellen und die Arbeitsabläufproduktivität durch Anleitung zu cpp-pro-Aufgaben zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações C++ eficientes usando listas de verificação validadas e padrões de codificação comprovados, garantindo a conformidade com as normas da indústria e otimizando a produtividade do fluxo de trabalho por meio de orientações sobre tarefas cpp-pro.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разработки эффективных приложений C++ с использованием проверенных чек-листов и подтвержденных стандартов кодирования, обеспечивая соблюдение отраслевых норм и оптимизируя производительность рабочего процесса посредством рекомендаций по задачам cpp-pro.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطوير تطبيقات C++ فعالة باستخدام قوائم التحقق المثبتة والمعايير البرمجية المثبتة، مما يضمن الامتثال للمعايير الصناعية ويتحسين إنتاجية تدفق العمل من خلال التوجيه بشأن مهام cpp-pro."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing cpp-pro coding standards","Debugging complex C++ workflows","Optimizing cpp-pro application performance"],"zh":["实现cpp-pro编码标准","调试复杂的C++工作流程","优化cpp-pro应用程序性能"],"ja":["cpp-proコーディング標準の実装","複雑なC++ワークフローのデバッグ","cpp-proアプリケーションのパフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["cpp-pro 코딩 표준 구현","복잡한 C++ 워크플로우 디버깅","cpp-pro 애플리케이션 성능 최적화"],"es":["Implementación de estándares de codificación cpp-pro","Depuración de flujos de trabajo C++ complejos","Optimización del rendimiento de la aplicación cpp-pro"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre des normes de codage cpp-pro","Débogage de flux de travail C++ complexes","Optimisation des performances de l''application cpp-pro"],"de":["Implementierung von cpp-pro-Codierungsstandards","Fehlerbehebung komplexer C++-Arbeitsabläufe","Optimierung der Leistung von cpp-pro-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões de codificação cpp-pro","Depuração de fluxos de trabalho C++ complexos","Otimização do desempenho da aplicação cpp-pro"],"ru":["Реализация стандартов кодирования cpp-pro","Отладка сложных рабочих процессов C++","Оптимизация производительности приложения cpp-pro"],"ar":["تطبيق معايير البرمجة cpp-pro","تصحيح أخطاء في سير عمل C++ معقد","تحسين أداء تطبيق cpp-pro"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires C++ development environment","Specific to cpp-pro tasks and workflows"],"zh":["需要C++开发环境","特定于cpp-pro任务和工作流程"],"ja":["C++開発環境が必要","cpp-proタスクとワークフローに特有"],"ko":["C++ 개발 환경이 필요","cpp-pro 작업 및 워크플로에 특정"],"es":["Requiere entorno de desarrollo de C++","Específico para tareas y flujos de trabajo cpp-pro"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement C++","Spécifique aux tâches et flux de travail cpp-pro"],"de":["Benötigt C++-Entwicklungsumgebung","Spezifisch für cpp-pro-Aufgaben und -Arbeitsabläufe"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de desenvolvimento C++","Específico para tarefas e fluxos de trabalho cpp-pro"],"ru":["Требует среды разработки C++","Относится к задачам и рабочим процессам cpp-pro"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير C++","محدد للمهام والتدفقات العملية cpp-pro"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7e7fe480320355d82633d92ecb29ba41d85ac918e8fe552d3a28594a1b5511b2","qualityScore":65}');
