a REST API/MCP","ja":"JiraJira REST API/MCP","ko":"JiraJira REST API/MCP","es":"La gestión de problemas de Jira te permite crear y gestionar problemas de Jira de manera eficiente. Utiliza la API de Jira o MCP para integrar esta función e...","fr":"La gestion des problèmes Jira vous permet de créer et de gérer des problèmes Jira de manière efficace. Utilisez l''API Jira ou MCP pour intégrer cette fonctio...","de":"Das Jira-Problemmgmt. ermöglicht es Ihnen, Jira-Probleme effizient zu erstellen und zu verwalten. Verwenden Sie die Jira-API oder MCP, um diese Funktion in I...","pt":"O gerenciamento de issues Jira permite criar e gerenciar tarefas de forma eficiente. Aprenda a configurar o Jira MCP Server ou usar a API REST.","ru":"Управление задачами Jira позволяет создавать и управлять задачами эффективно. Узнайте, как настроить сервер Jira MCP или использовать REST API.","ar":"إدارة قضايا جيرا تسمح بإنشاء وإدارة المهام بفعالية. تعرف على كيفية ضبط خادم جيرا MCP أو استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST.","en":"Homebrew for AI Agent Skills."},"definition":{"en":"Homebrew for AI Agent Skills."},"features":{"zh":["Jira REST API","MCP","Jira","API","Jira MCP"],"ja":["Jira REST API","MCP","Jira","API","Jira MCP"],"ko":["Jira REST API","MCP","Jira","API","Jira MCP"],"es":["Creación de problemas de Jira con la API de Jira","Gestión de problemas de Jira con MCP","Integración con el flujo de trabajo existente","Autenticación con token de API","Soporte para Jira Cloud y Server"],"fr":["Création de problèmes Jira avec l''API Jira","Gestion de problèmes Jira avec MCP","Intégration avec le flux de travail existant","Authentification avec jeton d''API","Support pour Jira Cloud et Server"],"de":["Erstellung von Jira-Problemen mit der Jira-API","Verwaltung von Jira-Problemen mit MCP","Integration in den bestehenden Arbeitsablauf","Authentifizierung mit API-Token","Unterstützung für Jira Cloud und Server"],"pt":["Criação de issues Jira","Gerenciamento de tarefas","Integração com Jira MCP Server","Uso da API REST do Jira","Configuração de variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Создание задач Jira","Управление задачами","Интеграция с сервером Jira MCP","Использование REST API Jira","Настройка переменных окружения"],"ar":["إنشاء قضايا جيرا","إدارة المهام","التكامل مع خادم جيرا MCP","استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST لجيرا","ضبط متغيرات البيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jira","Jira REST API","MCP","Jira","Jira API","Jira MCP"],"ja":["Jira","Jira REST API","MCP","Jira","Jira API","Jira MCP"],"ko":["Jira","Jira REST API","MCP","Jira","Jira API","Jira MCP"],"es":["gestión de problemas de Jira","API de Jira","MCP","integración con Jira","autenticación con token de API","Jira Cloud","Jira Server","desarrollo de software","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["gestion des problèmes Jira","API Jira","MCP","intégration avec Jira","authentification avec jeton d''API","Jira Cloud","Jira Server","développement de logiciels","gestion de projets"],"de":["Jira-Problemmgmt.","Jira-API","MCP","Integration mit Jira","Authentifizierung mit API-Token","Jira Cloud","Jira Server","Softwareentwicklung","Projektmanagement"],"pt":["gerenciamento de issues jira","jira mcp server","api rest jira","criação de issues","gerenciamento de tarefas","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["управление задачами jira","сервер jira mcp","rest api jira","создание задач","управление задачами","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["إدارة قضايا جيرا","خادم جيرا MCP","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST لجيرا","إنشاء قضايا","إدارة المهام","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"skillcreatorai","repo":"Ai-Agent-Skills","repoPath":"skillcreatorai/Ai-Agent-Skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jira-issues","description":"Create, update, and manage Jira issues from natural language. Use when the user wants to log bugs, create tickets, update issue status, or manage their Jira backlog.","bodyPreview":"# Jira Issue Management\n\nCreate and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Option 1: Jira MCP Server\nInstall the Jira MCP server for seamless integration:\n```bash\nnpx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct API\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nexport JIRA_BASE_URL=\"https://yourcompany.atlassian.net\"\nexport JIRA_EMAIL=\"your-email@company.com\"\nexport JIRA_API_TOKEN=\"your-api-token\"\n```\n\nGet your API token: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/sec","body":"# Jira Issue Management\n\nCreate and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Option 1: Jira MCP Server\nInstall the Jira MCP server for seamless integration:\n```bash\nnpx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct API\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nexport JIRA_BASE_URL=\"https://yourcompany.atlassian.net\"\nexport JIRA_EMAIL=\"your-email@company.com\"\nexport JIRA_API_TOKEN=\"your-api-token\"\n```\n\nGet your API token: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens\n\n## Creating Issues\n\n### Basic Issue\n```python\nimport requests\nfrom requests.auth import HTTPBasicAuth\nimport os\n\ndef create_issue(project_key, summary, description, issue_type=\"Task\"):\n    url = f\"{os.environ[''JIRA_BASE_URL'']}/rest/api/3/issue\"\n\n    auth = HTTPBasicAuth(\n        os.environ[''JIRA_EMAIL''],\n        os.environ[''JIRA_API_TOKEN'']\n    )\n\n    payload = {\n        \"fields\": {\n            \"project\": {\"key\": project_key},\n            \"summary\": summary,\n            \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"doc\",\n                \"version\": 1,\n                \"content\": [{\n                    \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                    \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": description}]\n                }]\n            },\n            \"issuetype\": {\"name\": issue_type}\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, json=payload, auth=auth)\n    return response.json()\n\n# Example\nissue = create_issue(\"PROJ\", \"Fix login bug\", \"Users can''t login with SSO\", \"Bug\")\nprint(f\"Created: {issue[''key'']}\")\n```\n\n### With Labels and Priority\n```python\ndef create_detailed_issue(project_key, summary, description,\n                          issue_type=\"Task\", priority=\"Medium\",\n                          labels=None, assignee=None):\n    payload = {\n        \"fields\": {\n            \"project\": {\"key\": project_key},\n            \"summary\": summary,\n            \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"doc\",\n                \"version\": 1,\n                \"content\": [{\n                    \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                    \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": description}]\n                }]\n            },\n            \"issuetype\": {\"name\": issue_type},\n            \"priority\": {\"name\": priority},\n        }\n    }\n\n    if labels:\n        payload[\"fields\"][\"labels\"] = labels\n    if assignee:\n        payload[\"fields\"][\"assignee\"] = {\"accountId\": assignee}\n\n    # ... make request\n```\n\n## Common Issue Types\n\n| Type | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| Bug | Something broken |\n| Task | Work item |\n| Story | User-facing feature |\n| Epic | Large initiative |\n| Sub-task | Part of larger task |\n\n## Updating Issues\n\n### Change Status\n```python\ndef transition_issue(issue_key, transition_name):\n    # Get available transitions\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/issue/{issue_key}/transitions\"\n    transitions = requests.get(url, auth=auth).json()\n\n    # Find matching transition\n    transition_id = None\n    for t in transitions[''transitions'']:\n        if t[''name''].lower() == transition_name.lower():\n            transition_id = t[''id'']\n            break\n\n    # Execute transition\n    requests.post(url, json={\"transition\": {\"id\": transition_id}}, auth=auth)\n```\n\n### Add Comment\n```python\ndef add_comment(issue_key, comment_text):\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/issue/{issue_key}/comment\"\n\n    payload = {\n        \"body\": {\n            \"type\": \"doc\",\n            \"version\": 1,\n            \"content\": [{\n                \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": comment_text}]\n            }]\n        }\n    }\n\n    requests.post(url, json=payload, auth=auth)\n```\n\n## Searching Issues\n\n### JQL Queries\n```python\ndef search_issues(jql):\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/search\"\n    params = {\"jql\": jql, \"maxResults\": 50}\n    response = requests.get(url, params=params, auth=auth)\n    return response.json()[''issues'']\n\n# Examples\nmy_bugs = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND type = Bug AND assignee = currentUser()\")\nopen_items = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND status != Done\")\nrecent = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND created >= -7d\")\n```\n\n## Quick Commands\n\nWhen user says... create this:\n\n| Command | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| \"log bug about X\" | Bug issue with description |\n| \"create task for X\" | Task issue |\n| \"what''s on my plate\" | JQL: assignee = currentUser() AND status != Done |\n| \"move X to done\" | Transition issue to Done |\n| \"add comment to X\" | Add comment to issue |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Summary**: Keep under 80 chars, start with verb (Fix, Add, Update)\n2. **Description**: Include steps to reproduce for bugs\n3. **Labels**: Use for categorization (frontend, backend, urgent)\n4. **Links**: Reference related issues when relevant\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:56:29.592Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing seamless Jira issue integration via REST API or MCP","zh":"非常适合需要通过REST API或MCP实现Jira问题无缝集成的项目管理代理","ja":"Jiraの問題をREST APIまたはMCP経由でシームレスに統合する必要があるプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適","ko":"REST API 또는 MCP를 통해 Jira 문제를 무결점으로 통합해야 하는 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que necesitan una integración perfecta de problemas de Jira a través de REST API o MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une intégration transparente des problèmes Jira via REST API ou MCP","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Jira-Probleminitialisierung über REST-API oder MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que precisam de integração perfeita de problemas do Jira via REST API ou MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления проектами, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с задачами Jira через REST API или MCP","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المشروع الذي يحتاج إلى دمج مثالي لقضايا جيرا عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST أو MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Jira issues using environment variables and API tokens, providing direct access to Jira''s issue tracking capabilities through HTTPS and the Jira REST API","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理Jira问题的能力，使用环境变量和API令牌，通过HTTPS和Jira REST API直接访问Jira的问题跟踪功能","ja":"エージェントにJiraの問題を作成および管理する機能を提供し、環境変数とAPIトークンを使用して、HTTPSとJira REST API経由でJiraの問題追跡機能に直接アクセス","ko":"에이전트가 환경 변수와 API 토큰을 사용하여 Jira 문제를 생성 및 관리할 수 있도록 하며, HTTPS 및 Jira REST API를 통해 Jira의 문제 추적 기능에 직접 액세스","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar problemas de Jira utilizando variables de entorno y tokens de API, proporcionando acceso directo a las capacidades de seguimiento de problemas de Jira a través de HTTPS y la API de REST de Jira","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des problèmes Jira en utilisant des variables d''environnement et des jetons d''API, fournissant un accès direct aux capacités de suivi des problèmes Jira via HTTPS et l''API REST Jira","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Jira-Probleme mithilfe von Umgebungsvariablen und API-Tokens zu erstellen und zu verwalten, und bietet direkten Zugriff auf Jiras Problemmeldefunktionen über HTTPS und die Jira-REST-API","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar problemas do Jira usando variáveis de ambiente e tokens de API, fornecendo acesso direto às capacidades de rastreamento de problemas do Jira por meio de HTTPS e da API REST do Jira","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять задачами Jira с помощью переменных среды и токенов API, обеспечивая прямой доступ к возможностям отслеживания задач Jira через HTTPS и REST API Jira","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وإدارة قضايا جيرا باستخدام متغيرات البيئة وأسماء التوكن ، مما يوفر وصولًا مباشرًا إلى إمكانيات تتبع المشكلات في جيرا عبر HTTPS و واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST لجيرا"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Jira issue creation","Managing issue assignments using Jira API tokens","Debugging Jira issue integration with MCP servers"],"zh":["自动化Jira问题创建","使用Jira API令牌管理问题分配","使用MCP服务器调试Jira问题集成"],"ja":["Jiraの問題作成の自動化","Jira APIトークンを使用した問題割り当ての管理","MCPサーバーを使用したJira問題統合のデバッグ"],"ko":["Jira 문제 생성 자동화","Jira API 토큰을 사용한 문제 할당 관리","MCP 서버를 사용한 Jira 문제 통합 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas de Jira","Administración de asignaciones de problemas utilizando tokens de API de Jira","Depuración de la integración de problemas de Jira con servidores MCP"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes Jira","Gestion des affectations de problèmes à l''aide de jetons d''API Jira","Débogage de l''intégration de problèmes Jira avec des serveurs MCP"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Jira-Problemen","Verwaltung von Problembesitzverhältnissen unter Verwendung von Jira-API-Tokens","Fehlersuche bei der Integration von Jira-Problemen mit MCP-Servern"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas do Jira","Gerenciar atribuições de problemas usando tokens de API do Jira","Depurar a integração de problemas do Jira com servidores MCP"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания задач Jira","Управление назначением задач с помощью токенов API Jira","Отладка интеграции задач Jira с серверами MCP"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في إنشاء مشكلات جيرا","إدارة تعيينات المشكلات باستخدام رموز توكن API جيرا","تصحيح أخطاء دمج مشكلات جيرا مع خوادم MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jira API token","Needs Jira base URL and email configuration","Dependent on MCP server or direct API setup"],"zh":["需要Jira API令牌","需要Jira基 URL和电子邮件配置","依赖于MCP服务器或直接API设置"],"ja":["Jira APIトークンの必要性","JiraベースURLとメール設定の必要性","MCPサーバーまたは直接API設定への依存"],"ko":["Jira API 토큰 필요","Jira 기본 URL 및 이메일 구성 필요","MCP 서버 또는 직접 API 설정 의존"],"es":["Requiere token de API de Jira","Necesita configuración de URL base de Jira y correo electrónico","Dependiente del servidor MCP o configuración de API directa"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''API Jira","Nécessite une configuration d''URL de base Jira et d''e-mail","Dépendant du serveur MCP ou de la configuration d''API directe"],"de":["Benötigt Jira-API-Token","Benötigt Jira-Grund-URL- und E-Mail-Konfiguration","Abhängig von MCP-Server oder direkter API-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Exige token de API do Jira","Necessita de URL base do Jira e configuração de e-mail","Dependente do servidor MCP ou configuração de API direta"],"ru":["Требует токена API Jira","Требует базового URL-адреса Jira и конфигурации электронной почты","Зависит от сервера MCP или прямой настройки API"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز توكن API جيرا","يحتاج إلى URL القاعدة لجيرا وتكوين البريد الإلكتروني","يعتمد على خادم MCP أو إعداد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المباشر"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"649a1012fe6ddb0e7e86e83e267dd23b27dad0ac22195311205d5d4e7b0632fc","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('remorses/playwriter/playwriter', 'community', 'remorses', 'playwriter', 'remorses/playwriter', 'playwriter', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-24T11:52:28.983Z', '2026-02-24T11:57:18.619Z', '8ffdbb46a03476f557d793333d8b3ea38396b223dc65e36854088ac73c2b866d', '{"id":"remorses/playwriter/playwriter","name":"playwriter","description":{"zh":"Playwriter技能是一种Chrome扩展，允许开发者控制浏览器并运行Playwright代码，提高开发效率","ja":"Playwriterスキルは、ブラウザを制御し、Playwrightコードを実行するChrome拡張機能です","ko":"Playwriter 스킬은 브라우저를 제어하고 Playwright 코드를 실행하는 Chrome 확장 프로그램입니다","es":"Playwriter es una extensión de Chrome que permite a los agentes controlar el navegador de forma segura. Ofrece funcionalidades como gestión de sesiones y configuración de timeouts","fr":"Playwriter est une extension Chrome qui permet aux agents de contrôler le navigateur de manière sécurisée. Elle offre des fonctionnalités telles que la gestion de sessions et la configuration de timeouts","de":"Playwriter ist eine Chrome-Erweiterung, die es Agents ermöglicht, den Browser sicher zu steuern. Sie bietet Funktionen wie Sitzungsverwaltung und Timeout-Konfiguration","pt":"Playwriter é uma extensão do Chrome que permite controlar o navegador com Playwright. Fornece gerenciamento de sessão e configuração de tempo limite.","ru":"Playwriter — расширение Chrome, которое позволяет контролировать браузер с Playwright. Предоставляет управление сессией и настройку времени ожидания.","ar":"Playwriter هو ملحق Chrome يسمح بالتحكم في المتصفح مع Playwright. يوفر إدارة الجلسة وتكوين وقت الإنتظار","en":"Chrome extension to let agents control your browser. Runs Playwright snippets in a stateful sandbox. Available as CLI or MCP"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Playwriter技能：控制浏览器并运行Playwright代码","ja":"Playwriterスキル：ブラウザを制御してPlaywrightコードを実行","ko":"Playwriter 스킬: 브라우저 제어 및 Playwright 코드 실행","es":"Playwriter: Controla tu navegador con esta extensión de C...","fr":"Playwriter : Contrôlez votre navigateur avec cette extens...","de":"Playwriter: Steuern Sie Ihren Browser mit dieser Chrome-E...","pt":"Playwriter: Controle de Navegador com Playwright","ru":"Playwriter: Управление браузером с Playwright","ar":"Playwriter: التحكم في المتصفح مع Playwright","en":"playwriter"},"description":{"zh":"Playwriter技能是一种Chrome扩展，允许开发者控制浏览器并运行Playwright代码，提高开发效率","ja":"Playwriterスキルは、ブラウザを制御し、Playwrightコードを実行するChrome拡張機能です","ko":"Playwriter 스킬은 브라우저를 제어하고 Playwright 코드를 실행하는 Chrome 확장 프로그램입니다","es":"Playwriter es una extensión de Chrome que permite a los agentes controlar el navegador de forma segura. Ofrece funcionalidades como gestión de sesiones y con...","fr":"Playwriter est une extension Chrome qui permet aux agents de contrôler le navigateur de manière sécurisée. Elle offre des fonctionnalités telles que la gesti...","de":"Playwriter ist eine Chrome-Erweiterung, die es Agents ermöglicht, den Browser sicher zu steuern. Sie bietet Funktionen wie Sitzungsverwaltung und Timeout-Kon...","pt":"Playwriter é uma extensão do Chrome que permite controlar o navegador com Playwright. Fornece gerenciamento de sessão e configuração de tempo limite.","ru":"Playwriter — расширение Chrome, которое позволяет контролировать браузер с Playwright. Предоставляет управление сессией и настройку времени ожидания.","ar":"Playwriter هو ملحق Chrome يسمح بالتحكم في المتصفح مع Playwright. يوفر إدارة الجلسة وتكوين وقت الإنتظار","en":"Chrome extension to let agents control your browser. Runs Playwright snippets in a stateful sandbox. Available as CLI or MCP"},"definition":{"en":"Chrome extension to let agents control your browser. Runs Playwright snippets in a stateful sandbox. Available as CLI or MCP"},"features":{"zh":["浏览器控制","Playwright代码运行","状态沙盒","CLI和MCP支持","会话管理","超时配置"],"ja":["ブラウザ制御","Playwrightコード実行","状態サンドボックス","CLIとMCP対応","セッション管理","タイムアウト設定"],"ko":["브라우저 제어","Playwright 코드 실행","상태 샌드박스","CLI 및 MCP 지원","세션 관리","타임아웃 설정"],"es":["Gestión de sesiones","Configuración de timeouts","Ejecución de snippets de Playwright en un entorno de sandbox","Compatibilidad con CLI y MCP","Variables de contexto y funciones de utilidad","Estrategias de selectores y reglas para prevenir timeouts"],"fr":["Gestion de sessions","Configuration de timeouts","Exécution de snippets de Playwright dans un environnement de sandbox","Compatibilité avec CLI et MCP","Variables de contexte et fonctions d''utilité","Stratégies de selecteurs et règles pour prévenir les timeouts"],"de":["Sitzungsverwaltung","Timeout-Konfiguration","Ausführung von Playwright-Snippets in einer Sandbox-Umgebung","Kompatibilität mit CLI und MCP","Kontextvariablen und Utility-Funktionen","Selektor-Strategien und Regeln zur Vermeidung von Timeouts"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de sessão","Configuração de tempo limite","Estratégias de seletor","Regras para prevenir timeouts e falhas","Melhores práticas para páginas lentas e SPAs","Variáveis de contexto e funções de utilidade"],"ru":["Управление сессией","Настройка времени ожидания","Стратегии селектора","Правила для предотвращения таймаутов и сбоев","Лучшие практики для медленных страниц и SPAs","Контекстные переменные и утилитные функции"],"ar":["إدارة الجلسة","تكوين وقت الإنتظار","استراتيجيات المحدد","قواعد لمنع الإنتظار والفشل","أفضل الممارسات للصفحات البطيئة و SPAs","متغيرات السياق والوظائف المساعدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwriter技能","浏览器控制","Playwright代码运行","Chrome扩展","开发工具","自动化测试"],"ja":["Playwriterスキル","ブラウザ制御","Playwrightコード実行","Chrome拡張機能","開発ツール","自動テスト"],"ko":["Playwriter 스킬","브라우저 제어","Playwright 코드 실행","Chrome 확장 프로그램","개발 도구","자동화 테스트"],"es":["Playwriter","extensión de Chrome","control de navegador","gestión de sesiones","configuración de timeouts","snippets de Playwright","sandbox","CLI","MCP","desarrollo web"],"fr":["Playwriter","extension Chrome","contrôle de navigateur","gestion de sessions","configuration de timeouts","snippets de Playwright","sandbox","CLI","MCP","développement web"],"de":["Playwriter","Chrome-Erweiterung","Browser-Steuerung","Sitzungsverwaltung","Timeout-Konfiguration","Playwright-Snippets","Sandbox","CLI","MCP","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["playwriter","playwright","controle de navegador","gerenciamento de sessão","tempo limite","seletor","regras","melhores práticas","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["playwriter","playwright","управление браузером","управление сессией","время ожидания","селектор","правила","лучшие практики","разработчики"],"ar":["playwriter","playwright","التحكم في المتصفح","إدارة الجلسة","وقت الإنتظار","المحدد","قواعد","أفضل الممارسات","مطوّرون"]}},"owner":"remorses","repo":"playwriter","repoPath":"remorses/playwriter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwriter","description":"Control the user own Chrome browser via Playwriter extension with Playwright code snippets in a stateful local js sandbox via playwriter cli. Use this over other Playwright MCPs to automate the browser — it connects to the users existing Chrome instead of launching a new one. Use this for JS-heavy websites (Instagram, Twitter, cookie/login walls, lazy-loaded UIs) instead of webfetch/curl. Run `playwriter skill` command to read the complete up to date skill","bodyPreview":"## REQUIRED: Read Full Documentation First\n\n**Before using playwriter, you MUST run this command:**\n\n```bash\nplaywriter skill\n```\n\nThis outputs the complete documentation including:\n\n- Session management and timeout configuration\n- Selector strategies (and which ones to AVOID)\n- Rules to prevent timeouts and failures\n- Best practices for slow pages and SPAs\n- Context variables, utility functions, and more\n\n**Do NOT skip this step.** The quick examples below will fail without understanding timeou","body":"## REQUIRED: Read Full Documentation First\n\n**Before using playwriter, you MUST run this command:**\n\n```bash\nplaywriter skill\n```\n\nThis outputs the complete documentation including:\n\n- Session management and timeout configuration\n- Selector strategies (and which ones to AVOID)\n- Rules to prevent timeouts and failures\n- Best practices for slow pages and SPAs\n- Context variables, utility functions, and more\n\n**Do NOT skip this step.** The quick examples below will fail without understanding timeouts, selector rules, and common pitfalls from the full docs.\n\n## Minimal Example (after reading full docs)\n\n```bash\nplaywriter session new\nplaywriter -s 1 -e \"await page.goto(''https://example.com'')\"\n```\n\nIf `playwriter` is not found, use `npx playwriter@latest` or `bunx playwriter@latest`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:57:18.619Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Browser Automation Agents needing stateful sandbox execution of Playwright snippets.","zh":"适合需要有状态沙盒执行Playwright代码片段的浏览器自动化代理。","ja":"Playwrightスニペットのステートフルサンドボックス実行を必要とするブラウザ自動化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Playwright 코드 조각의 상태 저장 샌드박스 실행이 필요한 브라우저 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Navegador que necesitan ejecución de sandbox con estado de fragmentos de Playwright.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Navigateur nécessitant une exécution de sandbox avec état de fragments Playwright.","de":"Ideal für Browser-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine stateful Sandbox-Ausführung von Playwright-Snippets benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Navegador que necessitam de execução de sandbox stateful de trechos do Playwright.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации браузера, требующих выполнения состояний sandbox для фрагментов Playwright.","ar":"مثالي لعميل آلي لتحسين متصفح الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ حجز sandbox مع状態 لقطع من Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to control browsers via Chrome extension, leveraging Playwright for automated browsing, and utilizing context variables and utility functions for advanced interactions, including session management and selector strategies.","zh":"赋予代理通过Chrome扩展控制浏览器的能力，利用Playwright进行自动浏览，并使用上下文变量和实用函数进行高级交互，包括会话管理和选择器策略。","ja":"エージェントにChrome拡張機能を介してブラウザを制御する機能を与え、Playwrightを使用して自動ブラウジングを実行し、コンテキスト変数とユーティリティ関数を使用して高度な相互作用を行うことができるようにし、セッション管理とセレクタ戦略を含む。","ko":"에이전트가 Chrome 확장 프로그램을 통해 브라우저를 제어 할 수있는 기능을 제공하고 Playwright를 사용하여 자동 브라우징을 수행하며 컨텍스트 변수 및 유틸리티 함수를 사용하여 고급 상호 작용을 수행 할 수있게 하며, 세션 관리 및 선택기 전략을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a controlar los navegadores a través de una extensión de Chrome, aprovechando Playwright para la navegación automatizada y utilizando variables de contexto y funciones de utilidad para interacciones avanzadas, incluyendo la gestión de sesiones y estrategias de selectores.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler les navigateurs via une extension Chrome, en exploitant Playwright pour la navigation automatisée et en utilisant des variables de contexte et des fonctions d''utilité pour des interactions avancées, y compris la gestion de sessions et les stratégies de sélecteurs.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Browser über eine Chrome-Erweiterung zu steuern, indem Playwright für automatisiertes Browsen genutzt wird und Kontextvariablen und Utility-Funktionen für erweiterte Interaktionen verwendet werden, einschließlich Sitzungsverwaltung und Selektorstrategien.","pt":"Habilita agentes a controlar navegadores via extensão do Chrome, aproveitando o Playwright para navegação automatizada e utilizando variáveis de contexto e funções de utilidade para interações avançadas, incluindo gerenciamento de sessão e estratégias de seletor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью контролировать браузеры через расширение Chrome, используя Playwright для автоматизированного просмотра и используя контекстные переменные и функции утилиты для продвинутых взаимодействий, включая управление сессиями и стратегии селектора.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية التحكم في المتصفحات عبر ملحق كروم، واستخدام Playwright للتصفح الآلي، واستخدام متغيرات السياق ووظائف الأداة للمتغيرات المتقدمة، بما في ذلك إدارة الجلسة واستراتيجيات محدد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser interactions for data scraping","Debugging web applications using stateful sandbox execution","Generating automated browsing scripts with Playwright snippets"],"zh":["用于数据抓取的浏览器交互自动化","使用有状态沙盒执行调试Web应用程序","使用Playwright代码片生成自动浏览脚本"],"ja":["データスクレイピングのためのブラウザの相互作用の自動化","ステートフルサンドボックス実行を使用したWebアプリケーションのデバッグ","Playwrightスニペットを使用した自動ブラウジングスクリプトの生成"],"ko":["데이터 수집을 위한 브라우저 상호작용 자동화","상태 저장 샌드박스 실행을 사용한 웹 애플리케이션 디버깅","Playwright 코드 조각을 사용한 자동 브라우징 스크립트 생성"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones del navegador para la extracción de datos","Depurar aplicaciones web utilizando la ejecución de sandbox con estado","Generar scripts de navegación automatizados con fragmentos de Playwright"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions de navigateur pour le scraping de données","Déboguer les applications Web en utilisant l''exécution de sandbox avec état","Générer des scripts de navigation automatisés avec des fragments Playwright"],"de":["Automatisieren von Browser-Interaktionen für Daten-Scraping","Debuggen von Web-Anwendungen unter Verwendung von stateful Sandbox-Ausführung","Generieren von automatisierten Browsingskripten mit Playwright-Snippets"],"pt":["Automatizar interações de navegador para extração de dados","Depurar aplicações web usando execução de sandbox stateful","Gerar scripts de navegação automatizados com trechos do Playwright"],"ru":["Автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера для сбора данных","Отлаживать веб-приложения с помощью выполнения состояний sandbox","Генерировать автоматизированные сценарии просмотра с фрагментами Playwright"],"ar":["تأتميم التفاعلات المتصفح للتصفية البيانات","إصلاح تطبيقات الويب باستخدام تنفيذ حجز sandbox مع حالة","توليد سيناريوهات تصفح آلي مع قطع من Playwright"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires running the `playwriter skill` command for full documentation","Mandatory understanding of session management and timeout configuration","Specific rules and best practices must be followed to prevent timeouts and failures"],"zh":["需要运行`playwriter skill`命令以获取完整文档","需要理解会话管理和超时配置","必须遵循特定的规则和最佳实践以防止超时和失败"],"ja":["完全なドキュメントを取得するには、`playwriter skill`コマンドを実行する必要があります","セッション管理とタイムアウト設定を理解することが必要です","タイムアウトや失敗を防ぐために、特定のルールとベストプラクティスに従う必要があります"],"ko":["전체 문서를 얻으려면 `playwriter skill` 명령을 실행해야 합니다.","세션 관리 및 시간 초과 구성 이해가 필요합니다.","시간 초과 및 실패를 방지하기 위해 특정 규칙 및 모범 사례를 따라야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere ejecutar el comando `playwriter skill` para la documentación completa","Comprensión obligatoria de la gestión de sesiones y la configuración de tiempo de espera","Reglas y mejores prácticas específicas deben seguirse para evitar tiempos de espera y fallos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''exécution de la commande `playwriter skill` pour la documentation complète","Compréhension obligatoire de la gestion de sessions et de la configuration de délai d''attente","Règles et bonnes pratiques spécifiques doivent être suivies pour éviter les délais d''attente et les défaillances"],"de":["Erfordert die Ausführung des Befehls `playwriter skill` für die vollständige Dokumentation","Verpflichtendes Verständnis der Sitzungsverwaltung und der Timeout-Konfiguration","Spezifische Regeln und Best Practices müssen befolgt werden, um Timeouts und Ausfälle zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer a execução do comando `playwriter skill` para documentação completa","Entendimento obrigatório de gerenciamento de sessão e configuração de tempo limite","Regras e práticas recomendadas específicas devem ser seguidas para evitar tempos limite e falhas"],"ru":["Требуется выполнение команды `playwriter skill` для полной документации","Обязательное понимание управления сессиями и конфигурации времени ожидания","Конкретные правила и рекомендации должны быть соблюдены, чтобы избежать истечения времени и неудач"],"ar":["يتطلب تشغيل الأمر `playwriter skill` للوثائق الكاملة","فهم إجباري لإدارة الجلسة وتكوين الوقت المحدد","يجب اتباع قواعد وأفضل الممارسات المحددة لتجنب انتهاء الوقت والفشل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8ffdbb46a03476f557d793333d8b3ea38396b223dc65e36854088ac73c2b866d","qualityScore":40}');
