iones JavaScript modernas","Enrutamiento y controladores del lado del servidor","Compatibilidad con React, Vue y Svelte","Implementación del protocolo Inertia.js v2","Uso de Sails.js como backend"],"fr":["Développement d''applications JavaScript modernes","Routage et contrôleurs côté serveur","Compatibilité avec React, Vue et Svelte","Mise en œuvre du protocole Inertia.js v2","Utilisation de Sails.js comme backend"],"de":["Entwicklung moderner JavaScript-Anwendungen","Server-seitiges Routing und Controlling","Kompatibilität mit React, Vue und Svelte","Implementierung des Inertia.js v2-Protokolls","Verwendung von Sails.js als Backend"],"pt":["Roteamento de servidor e controladores","Criação de aplicativos de página única modernos","Integração com Sails.js","Suporte a React, Vue e Svelte","Sem necessidade de API"],"ru":["Серверный маршрутизацией и контроллеры","Создание современных одностраницных приложений","Интеграция с Sails.js","Поддержка React, Vue и Svelte","Без необходимости API"],"ar":["مارشروطة الخادم والمحكمين","إنشاء تطبيقات صفحة واحدة حديثة","التكامل مع Sails.js","دعم React و Vue و Svelte","بدون حاجة إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Inertia.js","Sails.js","单页应用","服务器端路由","控制器","React","Vue","Svelte","JavaScript"],"ja":["Inertia.js","Sails.js","シングルページアプリ","サーバーサイドルーティング","コントローラー","React","Vue","Svelte","JavaScript"],"ko":["Inertia.js","Sails.js","싱글 페이지 애플리케이션","서버측 라우팅","컨트롤러","React","Vue","Svelte","JavaScript"],"es":["Inertia.js","Desarrollo de aplicaciones JavaScript","Sails.js","React","Vue","Svelte","Enrutamiento del lado del servidor","Controladores del lado del servidor"],"fr":["Inertia.js","Développement d''applications JavaScript","Sails.js","React","Vue","Svelte","Routage côté serveur","Contrôleurs côté serveur"],"de":["Inertia.js","Entwicklung von JavaScript-Anwendungen","Sails.js","React","Vue","Svelte","Server-seitiges Routing","Server-seitige Controlling"],"pt":["Inertia.js","Sails.js","JavaScript","Roteamento de servidor","Controladores","Aplicativos de página única","React","Vue","Svelte"],"ru":["Inertia.js","Sails.js","JavaScript","Серверный маршрутизацией","Контроллеры","Одностраницные приложения","React","Vue","Svelte"],"ar":["Inertia.js","Sails.js","JavaScript","مارشروطة الخادم","المحكمين","تطبيقات صفحة واحدة","React","Vue","Svelte"]}},"owner":"sailscastshq","repo":"boring-stack","repoPath":"sailscastshq/boring-stack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inertia","description":">","version":"1.0.0","tags":"inertia, sails, boring-stack, spa, forms, redirects, shared-data, props","bodyPreview":"# Inertia.js for The Boring JavaScript Stack\n\nInertia.js is the bridge between Sails.js and your frontend framework (React, Vue, or Svelte) in The Boring JavaScript Stack. It lets you build modern single-page apps using classic server-side routing and controllers -- no API required. The `inertia-sails` package implements the full Inertia.js v2 protocol as a Sails hook.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Rendering pages with Inertia (`responseType: ''inertia''`)\n- Handling form submissions an","body":"# Inertia.js for The Boring JavaScript Stack\n\nInertia.js is the bridge between Sails.js and your frontend framework (React, Vue, or Svelte) in The Boring JavaScript Stack. It lets you build modern single-page apps using classic server-side routing and controllers -- no API required. The `inertia-sails` package implements the full Inertia.js v2 protocol as a Sails hook.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Rendering pages with Inertia (`responseType: ''inertia''`)\n- Handling form submissions and redirects (`responseType: ''redirect''` vs `''inertiaRedirect''`)\n- Sharing data globally across all pages (`sails.inertia.share()`, `once()`, `refreshOnce()`)\n- Working with flash messages (`sails.inertia.flash()`)\n- Handling validation errors (`responseType: ''badRequest''`, `form.errors`)\n- Using advanced props: deferred, optional, always, merge, scroll\n- Building frontend components with `useForm`, `usePage`, `Link`, `Head`, `router`\n- Setting up `createInertiaApp` and persistent layouts\n- Handling server errors with the Inertia error modal\n- Working with partial reloads, history encryption, or asset versioning\n\n## Rules\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/getting-started.md](rules/getting-started.md) - How Inertia works, the protocol, client and server setup\n- [rules/rendering-pages.md](rules/rendering-pages.md) - Server-side rendering, page objects, the `inertia` response type\n- [rules/actions-and-exits.md](rules/actions-and-exits.md) - Action2 patterns, exit response types, the four action patterns\n- [rules/redirects-and-responses.md](rules/redirects-and-responses.md) - redirect vs inertiaRedirect, when to use each, location visits\n- [rules/shared-data-and-flash.md](rules/shared-data-and-flash.md) - share(), once(), refreshOnce(), flushShared(), flash()\n- [rules/forms-and-validation.md](rules/forms-and-validation.md) - useForm, form submission, validation errors, badRequest flow\n- [rules/props-system.md](rules/props-system.md) - AlwaysProp, DeferProp, MergeProp, OnceProp, OptionalProp, ScrollProp\n- [rules/client-side-components.md](rules/client-side-components.md) - Link, router, usePage, Head, layouts, createInertiaApp\n- [rules/error-handling.md](rules/error-handling.md) - Server errors, the dev error modal, production error handling\n- [rules/advanced-features.md](rules/advanced-features.md) - History encryption, partial reloads, asset versioning, CSRF, SSR\n\n### Framework-Specific APIs\n\n- [rules/react.md](rules/react.md) - React: useForm, usePage, Link, Head, Deferred, WhenVisible, usePoll, layouts\n- [rules/vue.md](rules/vue.md) - Vue: useForm, usePage, Link, Head, Deferred, WhenVisible, usePoll, defineOptions layouts\n- [rules/svelte.md](rules/svelte.md) - Svelte: useForm (stores), page store, Link, inertia action, svelte:head, layouts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:56:41.102Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing rapid JavaScript application development with Inertia.js and Sails.js","zh":"非常适合需要快速JavaScript应用开发的全栈代理，使用Inertia.js和Sails.js","ja":"Inertia.jsとSails.jsを使用した迅速なJavaScriptアプリケーション開発が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Inertia.js와 Sails.js를 사용하여 빠른 JavaScript 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing rapid JavaScript application development with Inertia.js and Sails.js","fr":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing rapid JavaScript application development with Inertia.js and Sails.js","de":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing rapid JavaScript application development with Inertia.js and Sails.js","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de desenvolvimento rápido de aplicações JavaScript com Inertia.js e Sails.js","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, которым требуется быстрая разработка приложений JavaScript с использованием Inertia.js и Sails.js","ar":"مثالي لعميل مُكَمِّل يحتاج إلى تطوير تطبيقات سريعة بالجافا سكريبت باستخدام Inertia.js و Sails.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build modern single-page apps using classic server-side routing and controllers with Inertia.js, leveraging Sails.js and frontend frameworks like React, Vue, or Svelte, all without requiring an API","zh":"赋予代理构建使用经典服务器端路由和控制器的现代单页应用的能力，使用Inertia.js，利用Sails.js和前端框架，如React、Vue或Svelte，无需API","ja":"Inertia.jsを使用してクラシックなサーバーサイドルーティングとコントローラーを持つモダンなシングルページアプリケーションを構築するエージェントをEmpowerする、Sails.jsとフロントエンドフレームワークsuch as React、Vue、またはSvelteを利用し、APIは必要ない","ko":"Inertia.js를 사용하여 클래식한 서버 사이드 라우팅과 컨트롤러를 갖춘 현대적인 单页 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 Empower하는 것, Sails.js와 프론트엔드 프레임워크 如 React, Vue, 또는 Svelte를 활용하며, API가 필요하지 않음","es":"Empowers agents to build modern single-page apps using classic server-side routing and controllers with Inertia.js, leveraging Sails.js and frontend frameworks