コードの安全性と効率の最適化","開発者のコーディングスキルの向上"],"ko":["E0382 및 E0597 오류 해결","데이터의 역할 및 수명주기 이해","데이터의 소유권 및 대출 관리","코드의 안전성 및 효율성 최적화","개발자의 코딩 스킬 향상"],"es":["Análisis de propiedad y duración de vida de datos","Resolución de errores de propiedad en Rust","Mejora de la seguridad del código","Guía sobre mecánica de lenguaje y duración de vida de datos","Compatibilidad con Rust"],"fr":["Analyse de propriété et de durée de vie des données","Résolution des erreurs de propriété dans Rust","Amélioration de la sécurité du code","Guide sur la mécanique du langage et la durée de vie des données","Compatibilité avec Rust"],"de":["Analyse von Besitz und Lebensdauer von Daten","Lösung von Besitzfehlern in Rust","Verbesserung der Codesicherheit","Anleitung zur Sprachmechanik und Datenlebensdauer","Kompatibilität mit Rust"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de dados compartilhados e exclusivos","Resolução de erros de propriedade","Otimização do desempenho do código","Análise de ciclo de vida de dados","Suporte à linguagem Rust"],"ru":["Управление общими и эксклюзивными данными","Исправление ошибок владения","Оптимизация производительности кода","Анализ времени существования данных","Поддержка языка Rust"],"ar":["إدارة البيانات المشتركة والحصريّة","إصلاح أخطاء الملكية","تحسين أداء الكود","تحليل مدة الحياة للبيانات","دعم لغة رست"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust语言","所有权","生命周期","E0382","E0597","代码优化","安全性","效率","开发者工具"],"ja":["Rust言語","所有権","ライフタイム","E0382","E0597","コード最適化","安全性","効率","開発者ツール"],"ko":["Rust 언어","소유권","수명주기","E0382","E0597","코드 최적화","안전성","효율성","개발자 도구"],"es":["Rust","propiedad","duración de vida","errores de propiedad","seguridad del código","desarrollo de software","lenguaje de programación"],"fr":["Rust","propriété","durée de vie","erreurs de propriété","sécurité du code","développement de logiciels","langage de programmation"],"de":["Rust","Besitz","Lebensdauer","Besitzfehler","Codesicherheit","Softwareentwicklung","Programmiersprache"],"pt":["desenvolvedor rust","propriedade de dados","ciclo de vida de dados","erros de propriedade","otimização de desempenho","análise de dados","linguagem rust","programação rust"],"ru":["разработчик rust","владение данными","время существования данных","ошибки владения","оптимизация производительности","анализ данных","язык rust","программирование rust"],"ar":["مطور رست","ملكية البيانات","مدة الحياة للبيانات","أخطاء الملكية","تحسين الأداء","تحليل البيانات","لغة رست","برمجة رست"]}},"owner":"actionbook","repo":"rust-skills","repoPath":"actionbook/rust-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m01-ownership","description":"CRITICAL: Use for ownership/borrow/lifetime issues. Triggers: E0382, E0597, E0506, E0507, E0515, E0716, E0106, value moved, borrowed value does not live long enough, cannot move out of, use of moved value, ownership, borrow, lifetime, a, static, move, clone, Copy, 所有权, 借用, 生命周期","bodyPreview":"# Ownership & Lifetimes\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Who should own this data, and for how long?**\n\nBefore fixing ownership errors, understand the data''s role:\n- Is it shared or exclusive?\n- Is it short-lived or long-lived?\n- Is it transformed or just read?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0382 | \"Clone it\" | Who should own this data? |\n| E0597 | \"Extend lifetime\" | Is the scope bound","body":"# Ownership & Lifetimes\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Who should own this data, and for how long?**\n\nBefore fixing ownership errors, understand the data''s role:\n- Is it shared or exclusive?\n- Is it short-lived or long-lived?\n- Is it transformed or just read?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0382 | \"Clone it\" | Who should own this data? |\n| E0597 | \"Extend lifetime\" | Is the scope boundary correct? |\n| E0506 | \"End borrow first\" | Should mutation happen elsewhere? |\n| E0507 | \"Clone before move\" | Why are we moving from a reference? |\n| E0515 | \"Return owned\" | Should caller own the data? |\n| E0716 | \"Bind to variable\" | Why is this temporary? |\n| E0106 | \"Add ''a\" | What is the actual lifetime relationship? |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore fixing an ownership error, ask:\n\n1. **What is this data''s domain role?**\n   - Entity (unique identity) → owned\n   - Value Object (interchangeable) → clone/copy OK\n   - Temporary (computation result) → maybe restructure\n\n2. **Is the ownership design intentional?**\n   - By design → work within constraints\n   - Accidental → consider redesign\n\n3. **Fix symptom or redesign?**\n   - If Strike 3 (3rd attempt) → escalate to Layer 2\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nWhen errors persist, trace to design layer:\n\n```\nE0382 (moved value)\n    ↑ Ask: What design choice led to this ownership pattern?\n    ↑ Check: m09-domain (is this Entity or Value Object?)\n    ↑ Check: domain-* (what constraints apply?)\n```\n\n| Persistent Error | Trace To | Question |\n|-----------------|----------|----------|\n| E0382 repeated | m02-resource | Should use Arc/Rc for sharing? |\n| E0597 repeated | m09-domain | Is scope boundary at right place? |\n| E0506/E0507 | m03-mutability | Should use interior mutability? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nFrom design decisions to implementation:\n\n```\n\"Data needs to be shared immutably\"\n    ↓ Use: Arc<T> (multi-thread) or Rc<T> (single-thread)\n\n\"Data needs exclusive ownership\"\n    ↓ Use: move semantics, take ownership\n\n\"Data is read-only view\"\n    ↓ Use: &T (immutable borrow)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Ownership | Cost | Use When |\n|---------|-----------|------|----------|\n| Move | Transfer | Zero | Caller doesn''t need data |\n| `&T` | Borrow | Zero | Read-only access |\n| `&mut T` | Exclusive borrow | Zero | Need to modify |\n| `clone()` | Duplicate | Alloc + copy | Actually need a copy |\n| `Rc<T>` | Shared (single) | Ref count | Single-thread sharing |\n| `Arc<T>` | Shared (multi) | Atomic ref count | Multi-thread sharing |\n| `Cow<T>` | Clone-on-write | Alloc if mutated | Might modify |\n\n## Error Code Reference\n\n| Error | Cause | Quick Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----------|\n| E0382 | Value moved | Clone, reference, or redesign ownership |\n| E0597 | Reference outlives owner | Extend owner scope or restructure |\n| E0506 | Assign while borrowed | End borrow before mutation |\n| E0507 | Move out of borrowed | Clone or use reference |\n| E0515 | Return local reference | Return owned value |\n| E0716 | Temporary dropped | Bind to variable |\n| E0106 | Missing lifetime | Add `''a` annotation |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why Bad | Better |\n|--------------|---------|--------|\n| `.clone()` everywhere | Hides design issues | Design ownership properly |\n| Fight borrow checker | Increases complexity | Work with the compiler |\n| `''static` for everything | Restricts flexibility | Use appropriate lifetimes |\n| Leak with `Box::leak` | Memory leak | Proper lifetime design |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Need smart pointers | m02-resource |\n| Need interior mutability | m03-mutability |\n| Data is domain entity | m09-domain |\n| Learning ownership concepts | m14-mental-model |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:49:46.921Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust Developer Agents needing advanced ownership and lifetimes management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级所有权和生命周期管理能力的Rust开发人员代理。","ja":"Rust開発者エージェントが高度な所有権とライフタイム管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 소유권 및 수명 관리 기능이 필요한 러스트 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador de Rust que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de propiedad y duración de vida.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développeur Rust nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion de propriété et de durée de vie.","de":"Perfekt für Rust-Entwickler-Agenten, die erweiterte Eigentums- und Lebensdauer-Managementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores Rust que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de propriedade e tempo de vida.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработчиков Rust, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления владением и временем существования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مبرمج روست الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة الملكية وأوقات الحياة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to resolve ownership errors by understanding data roles, including shared or exclusive access, and short-lived or long-lived data, using Rust''s core concepts like cloning and lifetime extension, and error codes such as E0382 and E0597.","zh":"使代理能够通过了解数据角色（包括共享或独占访问和短期或长期数据）来解决所有权错误，使用Rust的核心概念，如克隆和生命周期扩展，并使用错误代码，如E0382和E0597。","ja":"エージェントが所有権エラーを解決できるようにし、データの役割（共有または専有アクセス、短期間または長期間のデータなど）を理解し、Rustの基本概念（クローンやライフタイムの延長など）やE0382およびE0597などのエラーコードを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 데이터 역할(공유 또는 배타적 액세스 및 단기 또는 장기 데이터)을 이해하여 소유권 오류를 해결할 수 있도록 하며, 러스트의 핵심 개념(클론 및 수명의 확장 등) 및 E0382 및 E0597 등의 오류 코드를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resolver errores de propiedad al comprender los roles de los datos, incluyendo acceso compartido o exclusivo, y datos de vida corta o larga, utilizando conceptos básicos de Rust como clonación y extensión de duración de vida, y códigos de error como E0382 y E0597.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre les erreurs de propriété en comprenant les rôles des données, y compris l''accès partagé ou exclusif, et les données à vie courte ou longue, en utilisant les concepts de base de Rust tels que le clonage et la prolongation de la durée de vie, et les codes d''erreur tels que E0382 et E0597.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Eigentumsfehler zu beheben, indem sie die Rollen der Daten verstehen, einschließlich gemeinsamem oder exklusivem Zugriff und Daten mit kurzer oder langer Lebensdauer, unter Verwendung von Rusts Kernkonzepten wie Klonen und Lebensdauerverlängerung und Fehlercodes wie E0382 und E0597.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver erros de propriedade, entendendo os papéis dos dados, incluindo acesso compartilhado ou exclusivo e dados de curta ou longa duração, usando conceitos principais do Rust, como clonagem e extensão de tempo de vida, e códigos de erro como E0382 e E0597.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью решать ошибки владения, понимая роли данных, включая общий или исключительный доступ, и краткосрочные или долгосрочные данные, используя основные концепции Rust, такие как клонирование и продление срока жизни, и коды ошибок, такие как E0382 и E0597.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية حل أخطاء الملكية من خلال فهم أدوار البيانات، بما في ذلك الوصول المشترك أو الحصري والبيانات قصيرة أو طويلة الأمد، باستخدام المفاهيم الأساسية للروست، مثل الاستنساخ وتوسيع مدة الحياة، ورموز الخطأ مثل E0382 و E0597."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging ownership errors in Rust code","Determining optimal data ownership models","Resolving lifetime issues in complex data structures"],"zh":["调试Rust代码中的所有权错误","确定最佳数据所有权模型","解决复杂数据结构中的生命周期问题"],"ja":["Rustコードの所有権エラーのデバッグ","最適なデータ所有権モデルを決定する","複雑なデータ構造のライフタイムの問題を解決する"],"ko":["러스트 코드의 소유권 오류 디버깅","최적의 데이터 소유권 모델 결정","복잡한 데이터 구조의 수명 문제 해결"],"es":["Depuración de errores de propiedad en código Rust","Determinar modelos de propiedad de datos óptimos","Resolución de problemas de duración de vida en estructuras de datos complejas"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs de propriété dans le code Rust","Détermination de modèles de propriété de données optimaux","Résolution de problèmes de durée de vie dans des structures de données complexes"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Eigentumsfehlern in Rust-Code","Bestimmung optimaler Daten-Eigentumsmodelle","Behebung von Lebensdauerproblemen in komplexen Datenstrukturen"],"pt":["Depuração de erros de propriedade em código Rust","Determinação de modelos de propriedade de dados ótimos","Resolução de problemas de tempo de vida em estruturas de dados complexas"],"ru":["Дебагинг ошибок владения в коде Rust","Определение оптимальных моделей владения данными","Решение проблем срока жизни в сложных структурах данных"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء ملكية في رمز روست","تحديد نماذج ملكية البيانات المثالية","حل مشاكل وقت الحياة في هياكل البيانات المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming knowledge","Limited to Rust''s ownership and lifetimes system"],"zh":["需要Rust编程知识","仅限Rust的所有权和生命周期系统"],"ja":["Rustプログラミングの知識が必要","Rustの所有権とライフタイムシステムのみ"],"ko":["러스트 프로그래밍 지식 필요","러스트의 소유권 및 수명 시스템만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de programación Rust","Limitado al sistema de propiedad y duración de vida de Rust"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation Rust","Limité au système de propriété et de durée de vie de Rust"],"de":["Benötigt Rust-Programmierkenntnisse","Begrenzt auf Rusts Eigentums- und Lebensdauersystem"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de programação Rust","Limitado ao sistema de propriedade e tempo de vida do Rust"],"ru":["Требует знаний программирования на Rust","Ограничен системой владения и срока жизни Rust"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ببرمجة روست","محدود بنظام ملكية ووقت الحياة في روست"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"cb4ebbeefbbace5f163cc51a0f693b7ee46980c0a1303c12525ee596d854c3b4","qualityScore":0}');
