ИИ","ar":"Baseline UI: تعزيز الواجهات باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"baseline-ui"},"description":{"zh":"Baseline UI 是一个用于优化 AI 生成界面的技术，确保界面的一致性和质量","ja":"Baseline UI は、AI 生成のインターフェイスを最適化し、一貫性と品質を確保する技術です","ko":"Baseline UI는 AI 생성 인터페이스를 최적화하여 일관성과 품질을 보장하는 기술입니다","es":"Baseline UI es un conjunto de habilidades para mejorar y estandarizar interfaces de usuario, utilizando Tailwind CSS por defecto.","fr":"Baseline UI est un ensemble de compétences pour améliorer et standardiser les interfaces utilisateur, en utilisant Tailwind CSS par défaut.","de":"Baseline UI ist ein wachsendes Set von Fähigkeiten, um Benutzeroberflächen zu verbessern und zu standardisieren, wobei Tailwind CSS standardmäßig verwendet w...","pt":"O Baseline UI é um conjunto de habilidades para aprimorar as interfaces construídas por agentes de IA. Ele aplica restrições para melhorar a qualidade da UI.","ru":"Baseline UI - это набор навыков для улучшения интерфейсов, созданных агентами ИИ. Он применяет ограничения для повышения качества UI.","ar":"Baseline UI هو مجموعة من المهارات لتعزيز الواجهات التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي. يطبق قيودًا لتحسين جودة الواجهة","en":"A growing set of skills to polish interfaces built by agents."},"definition":{"en":"A growing set of skills to polish interfaces built by agents."},"features":{"zh":["优化 AI 生成的界面","确保界面的一致性和质量","支持 Tailwind CSS 默认值","提供代码级别的建议","检查代码违规并提供修复方案","提高开发效率"],"ja":["AI 生成のインターフェイスを最適化","インターフェイスの一貫性と品質を確保","Tailwind CSS デフォルト値をサポート","コードレベルの提案を提供","コード違反をチェックし、修正案を提供","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["AI 생성 인터페이스 최적화","인터페이스의 일관성과 품질 보장","Tailwind CSS 기본값 지원","코드 수준의 제안 제공","코드 위반 점검 및 수정方案 제공","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Estándariza interfaces de usuario con Tailwind CSS","Revisa archivos contra restricciones preestablecidas","Ofrece correcciones concretas a nivel de código","Aplica restricciones a cualquier trabajo de interfaz de usuario","Utiliza comandos como `/baseline-ui` y `/baseline-ui <file>`"],"fr":["Standardise les interfaces utilisateur avec Tailwind CSS","Vérifie les fichiers contre les contraintes prédéfinies","Offre des corrections concrètes au niveau du code","Applique des contraintes à tout travail d''interface utilisateur","Utilise des commandes comme `/baseline-ui` et `/baseline-ui <file>`"],"de":["Standardisiert Benutzeroberflächen mit Tailwind CSS","Überprüft Dateien gegen vorgegebene Einschränkungen","Bietet konkrete Korrekturen auf Code-Ebene","Wendet Einschränkungen auf alle Benutzeroberflächenarbeiten an","Verwendet Befehle wie `/baseline-ui` und `/baseline-ui <file>`"],"pt":["Aplicação de restrições para melhorar a UI","Uso de Tailwind CSS defaults","Análise de violações e sugestões de correção","Compatibilidade com vários formatos de arquivo","Melhoria da qualidade das interfaces geradas por agentes de IA"],"ru":["Применение ограничений для улучшения UI","Использование Tailwind CSS defaults","Анализ нарушений и предложения исправлений","Совместимость с разными форматами файлов","Повышение качества интерфейсов, созданных агентами ИИ"],"ar":["تطبيق القيود لتحسين الواجهة","استخدام Tailwind CSS defaults","تحليل الانتهاكات وتقديم اقتراحات لتصحيحها","التوافق مع تنسيقات الملفات المختلفة","تحسين جودة الواجهات التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Baseline UI","AI 生成界面","界面优化","Tailwind CSS","代码检查","开发效率","AI 技术","界面设计","一致性和质量"],"ja":["Baseline UI","AI 生成インターフェイス","インターフェイス最適化","Tailwind CSS","コードチェック","開発効率","AI 技術","インターフェイスデザイン","一貫性と品質"],"ko":["Baseline UI","AI 생성 인터페이스","인터페이스 최적화","Tailwind CSS","코드 점검","개발 효율성","AI 기술","인터페이스 디자인","일관성과 품질"],"es":["Baseline UI","Interfaz de usuario","Tailwind CSS","Estándarización","Mejora de interfaz de usuario","Desarrollo de software","Herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Baseline UI","Interface utilisateur","Tailwind CSS","Standardisation","Amélioration de l''interface utilisateur","Développement de logiciels","Outils de développement"],"de":["Baseline UI","Benutzeroberfläche","Tailwind CSS","Standardisierung","Verbesserung der Benutzeroberfläche","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Baseline UI","IA","Interfaces","Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento de software","Melhoria da UI","Agentes de IA","Desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Baseline UI","ИИ","Интерфейсы","Tailwind CSS","Разработка программного обеспечения","Улучшение UI","Агенты ИИ","Разработчики"],"ar":["Baseline UI","الذكاء الاصطناعي","الواجهات","Tailwind CSS","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين الواجهة","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","المطورون"]}},"owner":"ibelick","repo":"ui-skills","repoPath":"ibelick/ui-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.984Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baseline-ui","description":"Validates animation durations, enforces typography scale, checks component accessibility, and prevents layout anti-patterns in Tailwind CSS projects. Use when building UI components, reviewing CSS utilities, styling React views, or enforcing design consistency.","bodyPreview":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values already exist or are explicitly requ","body":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values already exist or are explicitly requested\n- MUST use `motion/react` (formerly `framer-motion`) when JavaScript animation is required\n- SHOULD use `tw-animate-css` for entrance and micro-animations in Tailwind CSS\n- MUST use `cn` utility (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`) for class logic\n\n## Components\n\n- MUST use accessible component primitives for anything with keyboard or focus behavior (`Base UI`, `React Aria`, `Radix`)\n- MUST use the project’s existing component primitives first\n- NEVER mix primitive systems within the same interaction surface\n- SHOULD prefer [`Base UI`](https://base-ui.com/react/components) for new primitives if compatible with the stack\n- MUST add an `aria-label` to icon-only buttons\n- NEVER rebuild keyboard or focus behavior by hand unless explicitly requested\n\n## Interaction\n\n- MUST use an `AlertDialog` for destructive or irreversible actions\n- SHOULD use structural skeletons for loading states\n- NEVER use `h-screen`, use `h-dvh`\n- MUST respect `safe-area-inset` for fixed elements\n- MUST show errors next to where the action happens\n- NEVER block paste in `input` or `textarea` elements\n\n## Animation\n\n- NEVER add animation unless it is explicitly requested\n- MUST animate only compositor props (`transform`, `opacity`)\n- NEVER animate layout properties (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`)\n- SHOULD avoid animating paint properties (`background`, `color`) except for small, local UI (text, icons)\n- SHOULD use `ease-out` on entrance\n- NEVER exceed `200ms` for interaction feedback\n- MUST pause looping animations when off-screen\n- SHOULD respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n- NEVER introduce custom easing curves unless explicitly requested\n- SHOULD avoid animating large images or full-screen surfaces\n\n## Typography\n\n- MUST use `text-balance` for headings and `text-pretty` for body/paragraphs\n- MUST use `tabular-nums` for data\n- SHOULD use `truncate` or `line-clamp` for dense UI\n- NEVER modify `letter-spacing` (`tracking-*`) unless explicitly requested\n\n## Layout\n\n- MUST use a fixed `z-index` scale (no arbitrary `z-*`)\n- SHOULD use `size-*` for square elements instead of `w-*` + `h-*`\n\n## Performance\n\n- NEVER animate large `blur()` or `backdrop-filter` surfaces\n- NEVER apply `will-change` outside an active animation\n- NEVER use `useEffect` for anything that can be expressed as render logic\n\n## Design\n\n- NEVER use gradients unless explicitly requested\n- NEVER use purple or multicolor gradients\n- NEVER use glow effects as primary affordances\n- SHOULD use Tailwind CSS default shadow scale unless explicitly requested\n- MUST give empty states one clear next action\n- SHOULD limit accent color usage to one per view\n- SHOULD use existing theme or Tailwind CSS color tokens before introducing new ones\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:56:50.608Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to enforce consistent UI styling with Tailwind CSS defaults.","zh":"非常适合需要强制执行一致的 UI 样式的前端代理，使用 Tailwind CSS 默认值。","ja":"Tailwind CSS のデフォルト値を使用して一貫した UI スタイルを適用する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS 기본값을 사용하여 일관된 UI 스타일을 적용해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan hacer cumplir un estilo de UI consistente con los valores predeterminados de Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de faire respecter un style d''interface utilisateur cohérent avec les valeurs par défaut de Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein konsistentes UI-Design mit den Standardwerten von Tailwind CSS durchsetzen müssen.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to enforce consistent UI styling with Tailwind CSS defaults.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to enforce consistent UI styling with Tailwind CSS defaults.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to enforce consistent UI styling with Tailwind CSS defaults."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a polished interface by enforcing an opinionated UI baseline, utilizing Tailwind CSS, and providing concrete code-level suggestions for fixes, all while ensuring adherence to specific constraints and best practices.","zh":"赋予代理维护精致界面的能力，通过执行有见解的 UI 基线，利用 Tailwind CSS，并提供具体的代码级别的修复建议，同时确保遵守特定的约束和最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが洗練されたインターフェースを維持できるようにし、意見を持った UI ベースラインを適用し、Tailwind CSS を利用し、修復のための具体的なコードレベルの提案を提供し、同時に特定の制約とベストプラクティスに従うことを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 정교한 인터페이스를 유지할 수 있도록 하고, 의견을 가진 UI 기준선을 적용하고, Tailwind CSS를 활용하며, 수정을 위한 구체적인 코드 수준의 제안을 제공하며,同時に 특정 제약과 최고의 관행을 준수하는 것을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener una interfaz pulida al hacer cumplir una línea de base de interfaz de usuario con opiniones, utilizando Tailwind CSS y proporcionando sugerencias concretas de nivel de código para solucionar problemas, todo esto mientras se garantiza el cumplimiento de restricciones y mejores prácticas específicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une interface polie en faisant respecter une ligne de base d''interface utilisateur avec opinion, en utilisant Tailwind CSS et en fournissant des suggestions concrètes de niveau de code pour les corrections, le tout en garantissant le respect de contraintes et de bonnes pratiques spécifiques.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, eine polierte Schnittstelle zu warten, indem sie eine Meinungsbasierte UI-Baseline durchsetzen, Tailwind CSS nutzen und konkrete Code-Ebene-Vorschläge für die Behebung von Fehlern bereitstellen, während sie gleichzeitig die Einhaltung spezifischer Einschränkungen und Best Practices sicherstellen.","pt":"Empowers agents to maintain a polished interface by enforcing an opinionated UI baseline, utilizing Tailwind CSS, and providing concrete code-level suggestions for fixes, all while ensuring adherence to specific constraints and best practices.","ru":"Empowers agents to maintain a polished interface by enforcing an opinionated UI baseline, utilizing Tailwind CSS, and providing concrete code-level suggestions for fixes, all while ensuring adherence to specific constraints and best practices.","ar":"Empowers agents to maintain a polished interface by enforcing an opinionated UI baseline, utilizing Tailwind CSS, and providing concrete code-level suggestions for fixes, all while ensuring adherence to specific constraints and best practices."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing UI code for violations against predefined constraints","Applying consistent Tailwind CSS defaults to new interface components","Debugging UI issues by identifying and fixing violations with suggested code snippets"],"zh":["检查 UI 代码是否违反预定义的约束","将一致的 Tailwind CSS 默认值应用于新接口组件","通过识别和修复违规并提供代码片段来调试 UI 问题"],"ja":["事前定義された制約に違反する UI コードをレビューする","新しいインターフェイス コンポーネントに一貫した Tailwind CSS デフォルト値を適用する","違反を識別して修正し、コード スニペットを提供して UI の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["미리 정의된 제약에 위반하는 UI 코드를 검토","새로운 인터페이스 구성 요소에 일관된 Tailwind CSS 기본값을 적용","위반을 식별하고 수정하고 코드 조각을 제공하여 UI 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Revisar el código de interfaz de usuario para violaciones contra restricciones predefinidas","Aplicar los valores predeterminados de Tailwind CSS consistentes a nuevos componentes de interfaz","Depurar problemas de interfaz de usuario identificando y solucionando violaciones con fragmentos de código sugeridos"],"fr":["Réviser le code d''interface utilisateur pour les violations contre les contraintes prédéfinies","Appliquer les valeurs par défaut de Tailwind CSS cohérentes à de nouveaux composants d''interface","Déboguer les problèmes d''interface utilisateur en identifiant et en corrigeant les violations avec des extraits de code suggérés"],"de":["Überprüfen des Benutzeroberflächen-Codes auf Verstöße gegen vordefinierte Einschränkungen","Anwenden konsistenter Tailwind CSS-Standardwerte auf neue Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Fehler bei der Benutzeroberfläche durch Identifizierung und Behebung von Verstößen mit vorgeschlagenen Code-Snippets debuggen"],"pt":["Reviewing UI code for violations against predefined constraints","Applying consistent Tailwind CSS defaults to new interface components","Debugging UI issues by identifying and fixing violations with suggested code snippets"],"ru":["Reviewing UI code for violations against predefined constraints","Applying consistent Tailwind CSS defaults to new interface components","Debugging UI issues by identifying and fixing violations with suggested code snippets"],"ar":["Reviewing UI code for violations against predefined constraints","Applying consistent Tailwind CSS defaults to new interface components","Debugging UI issues by identifying and fixing violations with suggested code snippets"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires use of Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values are explicitly required","Limited to enforcing predefined UI baseline constraints"],"zh":["需要使用 Tailwind CSS 默认值，除非显式要求自定义值","仅限于执行预定义的 UI 基线约束"],"ja":["カスタム値が明示的に必要な場合を除き、Tailwind CSS のデフォルト値を使用する必要がある","事前定義された UI ベースラインの制約を適用することのみに限定される"],"ko":["자定义 값이 명시적으로 필요하지 않는 한 Tailwind CSS 기본값을 사용해야 함","미리 정의된 UI 기준선 제약을 적용하는 것만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere el uso de los valores predeterminados de Tailwind CSS a menos que se requieran valores personalizados explícitamente","Limitado a hacer cumplir las restricciones de línea de base de interfaz de usuario predefinidas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''utilisation des valeurs par défaut de Tailwind CSS à moins que des valeurs personnalisées soient explicitement requises","Limité à faire respecter les contraintes de ligne de base d''interface utilisateur prédéfinies"],"de":["Erfordert die Verwendung der Standardwerte von Tailwind CSS, sofern nicht explizit benutzerdefinierte Werte erforderlich sind","Begrenzt auf die Durchsetzung vordefinierter UI-Baseline-Einschränkungen"],"pt":["Requires use of Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values are explicitly required","Limited to enforcing predefined UI baseline constraints"],"ru":["Requires use of Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values are explicitly required","Limited to enforcing predefined UI baseline constraints"],"ar":["Requires use of Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values are explicitly required","Limited to enforcing predefined UI baseline constraints"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9bb2f868098a9d28ce7d10383039a28169d838cea6299f9df3706ecda7932949","qualityScore":35}');
