understanding-flow"],"pt":["como usar walkeros-understanding-flow","o que é walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow alternativa","walkeros-understanding-flow vs google tag manager","instalar walkeros-understanding-flow","guia de configuração do walkeros-understanding-flow"],"ru":["как использовать walkeros-understanding-flow","что такое walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow альтернатива","walkeros-understanding-flow vs google тег менеджер","установить walkeros-understanding-flow","руководство по настройке walkeros-understanding-flow"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام walkeros-understanding-flow","ما هو walkeros-understanding-flow","بديل walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow مقابل مدير العلامات من جوجل","تثبيت walkeros-understanding-flow","دليل إعداد walkeros-understanding-flow"]}},"owner":"elbwalker","repo":"walkerOS","repoPath":"elbwalker/walkerOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.984Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"walkeros-understanding-flow","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Understanding walkerOS Flow\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS follows a **Source → Collector → Destination(s)** architecture for\ncomposable, modular event processing.\n\n**Core principle:** Separation of concerns. Each component has one job.\nComponents are composable and replaceable.\n\n## The Flow Pattern\n\n```\nSources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations\n(Capture)  (source.next)    (Processing) (dest.before)       (Delivery)\n\n- Browser DOM              - Validation   - Valid","body":"# Understanding walkerOS Flow\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS follows a **Source → Collector → Destination(s)** architecture for\ncomposable, modular event processing.\n\n**Core principle:** Separation of concerns. Each component has one job.\nComponents are composable and replaceable.\n\n## The Flow Pattern\n\n```\nSources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations\n(Capture)  (source.next)    (Processing) (dest.before)       (Delivery)\n\n- Browser DOM              - Validation   - Validation        - Google Analytics\n- DataLayer                - Enrichment   - Enrichment        - Meta Pixel\n- Server HTTP              - Redaction    - Consent check     - Custom API\n- Cloud Functions                         - Routing           - Data Warehouse\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n### Composability\n\nA Flow combines components. You can:\n\n- Use multiple sources feeding one collector\n- Route events to multiple destinations\n- Swap components without changing others\n\n### The Flow Type\n\nSee [packages/core/src/types/flow.ts](../../packages/core/src/types/flow.ts) for\nthe canonical interface.\n\n```typescript\n// Conceptual structure (see source for full type)\ninterface Flow {\n  sources?: Record<string, Source>;\n  transformers?: Record<string, Transformer>;\n  destinations?: Record<string, Destination>;\n  collector?: Collector.InitConfig;\n}\n```\n\n### Universal Push Interface\n\n**All components communicate via `push` functions:**\n\n| Component   | Push Signature                | Purpose               |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| Source      | `push(input) → events`        | Capture external data |\n| Collector   | `push(event) → void`          | Process and route     |\n| Destination | `push(event, context) → void` | Transform and deliver |\n\nThe `elb()` function is an alias for `collector.push` - used for component\nwiring.\n\n### startFlow Helper\n\nSee [packages/collector/src/flow.ts](../../packages/collector/src/flow.ts) for\nthe `startFlow` function.\n\n```typescript\nimport { startFlow } from ''@walkeros/collector'';\n\nconst { collector, elb } = await startFlow({\n  sources: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n  transformers: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n  destinations: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Separation of Concerns\n\n| Concern          | Handled By     | NOT Handled By          |\n| ---------------- | -------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Event capture    | Sources        | Collector, Destinations |\n| Event structure  | Event model    | Components              |\n| Consent checking | Collector      | Sources, Destinations   |\n| Transformation   | Mapping system | Raw push calls          |\n| Delivery         | Destinations   | Sources, Collector      |\n\n## Transformer Chains\n\nTransformers run at two points in the pipeline, configured via `next` and\n`before`:\n\n### Pre-Collector Chain\n\nRuns after source captures event, before collector processing:\n\n**Bundled mode (flow.json):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sources\": {\n    \"browser\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/web-source-browser\",\n      \"next\": \"validate\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"transformers\": {\n    \"validate\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-validator\",\n      \"next\": \"enrich\"\n    },\n    \"enrich\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-enricher\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Integrated mode (TypeScript):**\n\n```typescript\nsources: {\n  browser: {\n    code: sourceBrowser,\n    next: ''validate''\n  }\n},\ntransformers: {\n  validate: {\n    code: transformerValidator,\n    config: { next: ''enrich'' }\n  },\n  enrich: {\n    code: transformerEnrich\n  }\n}\n```\n\nNote: In flow.json, `next` is at the reference level. The CLI bundler\nautomatically moves it into `config.next` for runtime - you don''t need to handle\nthis yourself.\n\n### Post-Collector Chain\n\nRuns after collector enrichment, before destination receives event:\n\n**Bundled mode (flow.json):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"destinations\": {\n    \"gtag\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/web-destination-gtag\",\n      \"before\": \"redact\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"transformers\": {\n    \"redact\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-redact\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Integrated mode (TypeScript):**\n\n```typescript\ndestinations: {\n  gtag: {\n    code: destinationGtag,\n    before: ''redact''\n  }\n},\ntransformers: {\n  redact: {\n    code: transformerRedact\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Chain Resolution\n\n- `source.next` → starts pre-collector chain\n- `transformer.next` (flow.json) or `transformer.config.next` (runtime) → links\n  transformers\n- `destination.before` → starts post-collector chain per destination\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [walkeros-understanding-events](../walkeros-understanding-events/SKILL.md) -\n  Event model\n- [walkeros-understanding-sources](../walkeros-understanding-sources/SKILL.md) -\n  Source interface\n- [walkeros-understanding-destinations](../walkeros-understanding-destinations/SKILL.md) -\n  Destination interface\n\n**Package READMEs:**\n\n- [packages/collector/README.md](../../packages/collector/README.md) - Collector\n  details\n\n**Source Files:**\n\n- [packages/collector/src/flow.ts](../../packages/collector/src/flow.ts) -\n  startFlow implementation\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n- [Website: Flow](../../website/docs/getting-started/flow.mdx) - Flow concept\n- [Website: Collector](../../website/docs/collector/index.mdx) - Collector docs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:58:11.064Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Modular Event Processing Agents needing composable architecture and separation of concerns.","zh":"非常适合需要可组合架构和关注点分离的模块化事件处理代理。","ja":"モジュラーなイベント処理エージェントが必要とする、構成可能なアーキテクチャと関心の分離に最適です。","ko":"구성 가능한 아키텍처와 관심사 분리が 필요한 모듈 이벤트 처리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Procesamiento de Eventos Modulares que necesitan una arquitectura componible y separación de preocupaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Traitement d''Événements Modulaires ayant besoin d''une architecture composable et d''une séparation des préoccupations.","de":"Perfekt für modulare Ereignisverarbeitungsagenten, die eine komponierbare Architektur und eine Trennung von Belangen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Modular Event Processing Agents needing composable architecture and separation of concerns.","ru":"Perfect for Modular Event Processing Agents needing composable architecture and separation of concerns.","ar":"Perfect for Modular Event Processing Agents needing composable architecture and separation of concerns."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process events using a Source → Collector → Destination(s) architecture, leveraging composable and modular components with pre-transformers and post-transformers, and supporting protocols like source.next and dest.before for advanced event handling.","zh":"赋予代理使用源 → 收集器 → 目标（s）架构处理事件的能力，利用可组合和模块化的组件，包括预转换器和后转换器，并支持诸如 source.next 和 dest.before 的协议以实现高级事件处理。","ja":"ソース → コレクター → 宛先（s）アーキテクチャを使用してイベントを処理するエージェントの能力を付与し、事前変換器と事後変換器を含む構成可能なモジュラー コンポーネントを利用し、source.next や dest.before などのプロトコルをサポートして高度なイベント処理を実現します。","ko":"소스 → 수집기 → 대상(s) 아키텍처를 사용하여 이벤트를 처리하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며 구성 가능한 모듈 구성 요소를 활용하고 事前 변환기와 事後 변환기를 포함하며 source.next 및 dest.before와 같은 프로토콜을 지원하여 고급 이벤트 처리를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para procesar eventos utilizando una arquitectura de Origen → Recopilador → Destino(s), aprovechando componentes componibles y modulares con pre-transformadores y post-transformadores, y soportando protocolos como source.next y dest.before para un manejo avanzado de eventos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter les événements en utilisant une architecture Source → Collecteur → Destination(s), en exploitant des composants componibles et modulaires avec des pré-transformateurs et des post-transformateurs, et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que source.next et dest.before pour un traitement avancé des événements.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Ereignisse mithilfe einer Quelle → Sammler → Ziel(s)-Architektur zu verarbeiten, indem komponierbare und modulare Komponenten mit Vor- und Nachtransformatoren genutzt werden und Protokolle wie source.next und dest.before für erweitertes Ereignishandling unterstützt werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to process events using a Source → Collector → Destination(s) architecture, leveraging composable and modular components with pre-transformers and post-transformers, and supporting protocols like source.next and dest.before for advanced event handling.","ru":"Empowers agents to process events using a Source → Collector → Destination(s) architecture, leveraging composable and modular components with pre-transformers and post-transformers, and supporting protocols like source.next and dest.before for advanced event handling.","ar":"Empowers agents to process events using a Source → Collector → Destination(s) architecture, leveraging composable and modular components with pre-transformers and post-transformers, and supporting protocols like source.next and dest.before for advanced event handling."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event processing workflows with replaceable components","Generating modular event pipelines with validation and transformation","Debugging complex event flows using the walkerOS Flow pattern"],"zh":["使用可替换组件自动化事件处理工作流","生成具有验证和转换的模块化事件管道","使用walkerOS Flow模式调试复杂事件流"],"ja":["交換可能なコンポーネントを使用してイベント処理ワークフローを自動化する","検証と変換を備えたモジュラー イベント パイプラインを生成する","walkerOS Flow パターンを使用して複雑なイベント フローをデバッグする"],"ko":["교체 가능한 구성 요소를 사용하여 이벤트 처리 워크플ロー 자동화","검증 및 변환을 갖춘 모듈 이벤트 파이프라인 생성","walkerOS Flow 패턴을 사용하여 복잡한 이벤트 흐름 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de procesamiento de eventos con componentes reemplazables","Generar tuberías de eventos modulares con validación y transformación","Depurar flujos de eventos complejos utilizando el patrón de flujo de walkerOS"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de traitement d''événements avec des composants remplaçables","Générer des pipelines d''événements modulaires avec validation et transformation","Déboguer des flux d''événements complexes en utilisant le modèle de flux de walkerOS"],"de":["Automatisierung von Ereignisverarbeitungs-Workflows mit austauschbaren Komponenten","Erzeugen von modularen Ereignispipelines mit Validierung und Transformation","Fehlerbehebung komplexer Ereignisflüsse unter Verwendung des walkerOS-Flussmusters"],"pt":["Automating event processing workflows with replaceable components","Generating modular event pipelines with validation and transformation","Debugging complex event flows using the walkerOS Flow pattern"],"ru":["Automating event processing workflows with replaceable components","Generating modular event pipelines with validation and transformation","Debugging complex event flows using the walkerOS Flow pattern"],"ar":["Automating event processing workflows with replaceable components","Generating modular event pipelines with validation and transformation","Debugging complex event flows using the walkerOS Flow pattern"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of composable architecture and separation of concerns","Limited to event processing use cases","Dependent on walkerOS ecosystem and compatible components"],"zh":["需要了解组合架构和关注点分离","仅限于事件处理用例","依赖于walkerOS生态系统和兼容组件"],"ja":["構成可能なアーキテクチャと関心の分離についての理解が必要","イベント処理用途に限定される","walkerOS エコシステムと互換性のあるコンポーネントに依存する"],"ko":["구성 가능한 아키텍처와 관심사 분리에 대한 이해가 필요","이벤트 처리 용례에 한정","walkerOS 생태계 및 호환 구성 요소에 의존"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la arquitectura componible y la separación de preocupaciones","Limitado a casos de uso de procesamiento de eventos","Dependiente del ecosistema de walkerOS y componentes compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de l''architecture composable et de la séparation des préoccupations","Limité aux cas d''utilisation du traitement d''événements","Dépendant de l''écosystème de walkerOS et de composants compatibles"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der komponierbaren Architektur und der Trennung von Belangen","Begrenzt auf Anwendungsfälle für die Ereignisverarbeitung","Abhängig vom walkerOS-Ökosystem und kompatiblen Komponenten"],"pt":["Requires understanding of composable architecture and separation of concerns","Limited to event processing use cases","Dependent on walkerOS ecosystem and compatible components"],"ru":["Requires understanding of composable 