talación de ui-ux-pro-max","alternativas a ui-ux-pro-max"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour la recherche","configuration de Claude Code","science des données","écriture académique","optimisation du flux de travail","productivité et efficacité","guides d''installation de ui-ux-pro-max","alternatives à ui-ux-pro-max"],"de":["KI-Tools für Forschung","Claude-Code-Konfiguration","Data Science","wissenschaftliches Schreiben","Optimierung des Forschungsworkflows","Produktivität und Effizienz","Installationsanleitungen für ui-ux-pro-max","Alternativen zu ui-ux-pro-max"],"pt":["como usar ui-ux-pro-max","o que é ui-ux-pro-max","ferramentas de ia para pesquisa","ui-ux-pro-max alternativa","ui-ux-pro-max vs outras ferramentas","instalar ui-ux-pro-max","guias de configuração ui-ux-pro-max"],"ru":["как использовать ui-ux-pro-max","что такое ui-ux-pro-max","ИИ инструменты для исследования","ui-ux-pro-max альтернатива","ui-ux-pro-max vs другие инструменты","установить ui-ux-pro-max","руководства по конфигурации ui-ux-pro-max"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ui-ux-pro-max","ما هو ui-ux-pro-max","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبحث","بديل ui-ux-pro-max","ui-ux-pro-max مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت ui-ux-pro-max","دليل تكوين ui-ux-pro-max"]}},"owner":"Galaxy-Dawn","repo":"claude-scholar","repoPath":"Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.984Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing acce","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\n\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\n\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\n\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\n\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\n\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\n\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\n\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\n\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\n\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\n\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\n\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\n\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\n\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\n\n## How to Use\n\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\n```\n\nThis command:\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n### Step 2b: Persist Design System (Master + Overrides Pattern)\n\nTo save the design system for **hierarchical retrieval across sessions**, add `--persist`:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\"\n```\n\nThis creates:\n- `design-system/MASTER.md` — Global Source of Truth with all design rules\n- `design-system/pages/` — Folder for page-specific overrides\n\n**With page-specific override:**\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\" --page \"dashboard\"\n```\n\nThis also creates:\n- `design-system/pages/dashboard.md` — Page-specific deviations from Master\n\n**How hierarchical retrieval works:**\n1. When building a specific page (e.g., \"Checkout\"), first check `design-system/pages/checkout.md`\n2. If the page file exists, its rules **override** the Master file\n3. If not, use `design-system/MASTER.md` exclusively\n\n**Context-aware retrieval prompt:**\n```\nI am building the [Page Name] page. Please read design-system/MASTER.md.\nAlso check if design-system/pages/[page-name].md exists.\nIf the page file exists, prioritize its rules.\nIf not, use the Master rules exclusively.\nNow, generate the code...\n```\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**When to use detailed searches:**\n\n| Need | Domain | Example |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`, `jetpack-compose`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\n| `jetpack-compose` | Composables, Modifiers, State Hoisting, Recomposition |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\n```bash\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\n```\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Output Formats\n\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\n\n```bash\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\n\n# Markdown - best for documentation\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\n\n### Interaction\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:58:25.685Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-oriented Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX guidelines and data visualization capabilities for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面 UI/UX 指南和数据可视化功能的面向设计的代理，尤其适用于网页和移动应用程序。","ja":"デザイン志向のエージェントが、包括的な UI/UX ガイドラインとウェブおよびモバイル アプリケーション向けのデータ可視化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"디자인 지향 에이전트가 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 종합적인 UI/UX 가이드라인과 데이터 시각화 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes orientados al diseño que necesitan directrices de UI/UX completas y capacidades de visualización de datos para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur la conception nécessitant des directives UI/UX complètes et des capacités de visualisation de données pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die umfassende UI/UX-Richtlinien und Datenvisualisierungsfähigkeiten für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes orientados ao Design que necessitam de diretrizes abrangentes de UI/UX e capacidades de visualização de dados para aplicações web e móveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым необходимы комплексные рекомендации по UI/UX и возможности визуализации данных для веб- и мобильных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكيلات التي تركز على التصميم التي تحتاج إلى إرشادات شاملة لتوافق واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم وقدرات تصور البيانات للتطبيقات الويب والجوال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces using 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while adhering to 99 UX guidelines and utilizing 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks, all accessible through a searchable database with priority-based recommendations.","zh":"赋予代理创建视觉上吸引人和用户友好的接口的能力，使用 50+ 样式、97 色调板和 57 字体配对，同时遵循 99 个 UX 指南，并利用 25 种图表类型跨 9 个技术栈，所有这些都可以通过一个带有优先级推荐的可搜索数据库访问。","ja":"エージェントが、50 種類以上のスタイル、97 種類のカラーパレット、57 種類のフォントのペアを使用して、視覚的に魅力的なユーザーインターフェイスを作成できるようにし、99 の UX ガイドラインに従い、9 つのテクノロジースタックにわたる 25 種類のチャートタイプを利用し、優先度に基づいた推奨事項を備えた検索可能なデータベースからアクセスできます。","ko":"에이전트가 50개 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 폰트 페어를 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적이고 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 99개의 UX 가이드라인을 따르며, 9개의 기술 스택에 걸친 25종류의 차트 유형을 활용하며, 우선순위 기반의 추천을 갖춘 검색 가능한 데이터베이스를 통해 모든 것을 액세스할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces visuales atractivas y fáciles de usar utilizando más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, mientras se adhieren a 99 directrices de UX y utilizan 25 tipos de gráficos en 9 pilas de tecnología, todo accesible a través de una base de datos searchable con recomendaciones basadas en prioridades.","fr":"Habilite les agents à créer des interfaces visuelles attrayantes et conviviales en utilisant plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en respectant 99 directives d''UX et en utilisant 25 types de graphiques sur 9 piles de technologie, le tout accessible via une base de données searchable avec des recommandations basées sur les priorités.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, visuell ansprechende und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem sie 50+ Stile, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen verwenden, während sie sich an 99 UX-Richtlinien halten und 25 Chart-Typen über 9 Technologiestacks hinweg nutzen, alles über eine durchsuchbare Datenbank mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen zugänglich.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces visualmente atraentes e amigáveis ao usuário, usando 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, enquanto adere a 99 diretrizes de UX e utiliza 25 tipos de gráficos em 9 pilhas de tecnologia, todos acessíveis por meio de um banco de dados pesquisável com recomendações baseadas em prioridade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально привлекательные и удобные для пользователя интерфейсы, используя 50+ стилей, 97 цветовых палитр и 57 парных шрифтов, при этом соблюдая 99 рекомендаций по UX и используя 25 типов графиков в 9 технологических стеках, все доступные через поисковую базу данных с рекомендациями на основе приоритета.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيلات من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم جذابة وسهلة الاستخدام، باستخدام أكثر من 50 نمطًا و97 لوحة ألوان و57 زوجًا من الخطوط، مع اتباع 99 توجيهًا لتوافق واجهة المستخدم واستخدام 25 نوعًا من الرسوم البيانية عبر 9 مجموعات تقنية، وكلها يمكن الوصول إليها من خلال قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث مع توصيات بناءً على الأولوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimized color schemes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing accessibility features","Building landing pages or dashboards with data-driven chart types and styles"],"zh":["使用优化的颜色方案和字体设计新的 UI 组件或页面","查看代码中的 UX 问题并实施无障碍功能","使用数据驱动的图表类型和样式构建登陆页面或仪表盘"],"ja":["最適化された色彩スキームとタイポグラフィを使用して新しい UI コンポーネントまたはページを設計する","コードの UX の問題をレビューし、アクセシビリティ機能を実装する","データ駆動のチャートタイプとスタイルを使用してランディングページまたはダッシュボードを構築する"],"ko":["최적화된 색상 스키마와 타이포그래피를 사용하여 새로운 UI 컴포넌트 또는 페이지를 설계합니다.","코드의 UX 문제를 검토하고 접근성 기능을 구현합니다.","데이터 주도형 차트 유형과 스타일을 사용하여 랜딩 페이지 또는 대시보드를 구축합니다."],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de UI o páginas con esquemas de color optimizados y tipografía","Revisar el código para problemas de UX e implementar características de accesibilidad","Crear páginas de aterrizaje o paneles de control con tipos de gráficos y estilos impulsados por datos"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants d''interface utilisateur ou des pages avec des schémas de couleur optimisés et une typographie","Examiner le code pour les problèmes d''UX et mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités d''accessibilité","Créer des pages de destination ou des tableaux de bord avec des types de graphiques et des styles impulsés par les données"],"de":["Neue UI-Komponenten oder Seiten mit optimierten Farbschemata und Typografie entwerfen","Code auf UX-Probleme überprüfen und Zugriffsmöglichkeiten implementieren","Landingpages oder Dashboards mit datengetriebenen Chart-Typen und Stilen erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar novos componentes de UI ou páginas com esquemas de cores e tipografia otimizados","Revisar código para problemas de UX e implementar recursos de acessibilidade","Construir páginas de destino ou painéis com tipos de gráficos e estilos impulsionados por dados"],"ru":["Проектировать новые компоненты UI или страницы с оптимизированными цветовыми схемами и типографией","Проверять код на проблемы UX и реализовывать функции доступности","Строить целевые страницы или панели с типами графиков и стилями, управляемыми данными"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجديدة أو الصفحات مع مخططات الألوان والتنسيق المثالي","مراجعة الكود لمشاكل توافق واجهة المستخدم وتطبيق ميزات إمكانية الوصول","بناء صفحات الهبوط أو لوحات القيادة مع أنواع الرسوم البيانية والأشكال التي تعتمد على البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to a searchable database for design guidelines","Limited to web and mobile application design"],"zh":["需要访问可搜索的数据库以获取设计指南","仅限于网页和移动应用程序设计"],"ja":["デザイン ガイドラインにアクセスするための検索可能なデータベースへのアクセスが必要","ウェブおよびモバイル アプリケーションのデザインのみに限定されます"],"ko":["디자인 가이드라인에 액세스하기 위한 검색 가능한 데이터베이스에 액세스해야 함","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 디자인에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a una base de datos searchable para directrices de diseño","Limitado al diseño de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à une base de données searchable pour les directives de conception","Limité à la conception d''applications Web et mobiles"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf eine durchsuchbare Datenbank für Designrichtlinien","Begrenzt auf das Design von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a um banco de dados pesquisável para diretrizes de design","Limitado ao design de aplicações web e móvel"],"ru":["Требует доступа к поисковой базе данных для рекомендаций по дизайну","Ограничен дизайном веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث لإرشادات التصميم","محدود بتصميم التطبيقات الويب والجوال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d34ca9a7ec3104f60ae1cfabccb6bfa7f0a62e6c52cfe26327756a13cbeaab70","qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('elbwalker/walkerOS/walkeros-understanding-events', 'community', 'elbwalker', 'walkerOS', 'elbwalker/walkerOS', 'walkeros-understanding-events', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z', '2026-02-20T04:51:56.315Z', '0a9fff852cbf7e80db58ffb7aa2a1a642fed7de50235d1f89a6cd61af147494d', '{"id":"elbwalker/walkerOS/walkeros-understanding-events","name":"walkeros-understanding-events","description":{"pt":"walkerOS events são estruturas de dados auto-descritivas e stateless para gerenciamento de tags. Capturam interações do usuário em um formato padronizado que pode ser transformado para qualquer destino, seguindo o princípio de descrever O QUE aconteceu, não PARA ONDE vai.","ru":"walkerOS events — это самодокументирующиеся и stateless структуры данных для управления тегами. Они захватывают взаимодействия пользователя в стандартизированном формате, который можно преобразовать для любого направления, следуя принципу описания того, ЧТО произошло, а не КУДА это направляется.","ar":"أحداث walkerOS هي هياكل بيانات ذاتية الوصف ومستقلة لإدارة العلامات. تلتقط تفاعلات المستخدم بتنسيق موحد يمكن تحويله لأي وجهة، تتبع مبدأ وصف ما حدث، وليس إلى أين يذهب.","en":"Open-source tag manager for developers"},"seo":{"title":{"pt":"walkerOS Events: Gerenciador de Tags Open-Source para Devs","ru":"walkerOS Events: Опенсорс менеджер тегов для разработчиков","ar":"walkerOS Events: مدير علامات مفتوح المصدر للمطورين","en":"walkeros-understanding-events"},"description":{"pt":"walkerOS events são estruturas de dados auto-descritivas e stateless para gerenciamento de tags. Capturam interações do usuário em um formato padronizado que...","ru":"walkerOS events — это самодокументирующиеся и stateless структуры данных для управления тегами. Они захватывают взаимодействия пользователя в стандартизирова...","ar":"أحداث walkerOS هي هياكل بيانات ذاتية الوصف ومستقلة لإدارة العلامات. تلتقط تفاعلات المستخدم بتنسيق موحد يمكن تحويله لأي وجهة، تتبع مبدأ وصف ما حدث، وليس إلى أ...","en":"Open-source tag manager for developers"},"definition":{"en":"Open-source tag manager for developers"},"features":{"pt":["Formato ''entidade ação'' obrigatório","Estruturas de dados stateless","Design vendor-agnostic","Eventos auto-descritivos","Dados padronizados para qualquer destino","Open-source e para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Строгий формат ''сущность действие''","Stateless структуры данных","Vendor-agnostic дизайн","Самодокументирующиеся события","Стандартизированные данные для любого направления","Опенсорс и для разработчиков"],"ar":["تنسيق إلزامي ''كيان فعل''","هياكل بيانات مستقلة","تصميم خالي من البائعين","أحداث ذاتية الوصف","بيانات موحدة لأي وجهة","مفتوح المصدر ومخصص للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"pt":["walkeros events","gerenciador tags open source","formato entidade ação","eventos stateless","dados vendor agnostic","gestão de tags desenvolvedor","eventos auto-descritivos","transformação dados destino"],"ru":["walkeros events","опенсорс менеджер тегов","формат сущность действие","stateless события","vendor agnostic данные","управление тегами разработчик","самодокументирующиеся события","преобразование данных направление"],"ar":["أحداث walkeros","مدير علامات مفتوح المصدر","تنسيق كيان فعل","أحداث مستقلة","بيانات خالية من البائعين","إدارة علامات المطورين","أحداث ذاتية الوصف","تحويل بيانات الوجهة"]}},"owner":"elbwalker","repo":"walkerOS","repoPath":"elbwalker/walkerOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"walkeros-understanding-events","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Understanding walkerOS Events\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS events are self-describing, stateless, vendor-agnostic data structures.\nThey capture user interactions in a standardized format that can be transformed\nfor any destination.\n\n**Core principle:** Events describe WHAT happened, not WHERE it goes. Stateless.\nSelf-describing. Industry-agnostic.\n\n## Entity-Action Naming (Critical)\n\n**STRICT REQUIREMENT:** All events use \"entity action\" format with space\nseparation.\n\n```typescript\n// Correct\n''page","body":"# Understanding walkerOS Events\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS events are self-describing, stateless, vendor-agnostic data structures.\nThey capture user interactions in a standardized format that can be transformed\nfor any destination.\n\n**Core principle:** Events describe WHAT happened, not WHERE it goes. Stateless.\nSelf-describing. Industry-agnostic.\n\n## Entity-Action Naming (Critical)\n\n**STRICT REQUIREMENT:** All events use \"entity action\" format with space\nseparation.\n\n```typescript\n// Correct\n''page view'';\n''product add'';\n''order complete'';\n''button click'';\n\n// Wrong\n''page_view''; // underscore\n''pageview''; // no separator\n''purchase''; // no entity\n''add_to_cart''; // wrong format\n```\n\n**Parsing:** `const [entity, action] = event.split('' '')`\n\n- **Entity:** Noun (page, product, user, order, button)\n- **Action:** Verb (view, add, complete, click, login)\n\n## Event Properties\n\nSee\n[packages/core/src/types/walkeros.ts](../../packages/core/src/types/walkeros.ts)\nfor canonical types (Event interface, plus event helpers in `event.ts`).\n\n| Property    | Type   | Purpose                    | Example                               |\n| ----------- | ------ | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `name`      | string | \"entity action\" format     | `\"product view\"`                      |\n| `data`      | object | Entity-specific properties | `{ id: \"P123\", price: 99 }`           |\n| `context`   | object | State/environment info     | `{ stage: [\"checkout\", 1] }`          |\n| `globals`   | object | Global properties          | `{ language: \"en\" }`                  |\n| `user`      | object | User identification        | `{ id: \"user123\" }`                   |\n| `nested`    | array  | Related entities           | `[{ type: \"category\", data: {...} }]` |\n| `consent`   | object | Consent states             | `{ marketing: true }`                 |\n| `id`        | string | Auto-generated unique ID   | `\"1647261462000-01b5e2-2\"`            |\n| `timestamp` | number | Auto-generated Unix ms     | `1647261462000`                       |\n| `entity`    | string | Parsed from name           | `\"product\"`                           |\n| `action`    | string | Parsed from name           | `\"view\"`                              |\n\n### data Property\n\nEntity-specific properties. Schema-free but consistent within entity type.\n\n```typescript\n// product entity\ndata: { id: \"P123\", name: \"Laptop\", price: 999, currency: \"USD\" }\n\n// page entity\ndata: { title: \"Home\", path: \"/\", referrer: \"https://...\" }\n```\n\n### context Property\n\nHierarchical state information. Format: `{ name: [value, order] }`\n\n```typescript\ncontext: {\n  stage: [\"checkout\", 1],    // checkout stage, first step\n  test: [\"variant-A\", 0],    // A/B test variant\n  group: [\"premium\", 2]      // user segment\n}\n```\n\n### globals Property\n\nProperties that apply to ALL events in the session.\n\n```typescript\nglobals: {\n  language: \"en\",\n  currency: \"USD\",\n  environment: \"production\"\n}\n```\n\n### nested Property\n\nRelated entities captured together.\n\n```typescript\n// Order with line items\nnested: [\n  { type: ''product'', data: { id: ''P1'', quantity: 2 } },\n  { type: ''product'', data: { id: ''P2'', quantity: 1 } },\n];\n```\n\n### user Property\n\nUser identification across sessions.\n\n```typescript\nuser: {\n  id: \"user123\",        // Your user ID\n  device: \"device456\",  // Device fingerprint\n  session: \"sess789\"    // Session ID\n}\n```\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Statelessness\n\nEvents are immutable snapshots. They don''t reference previous events or maintain\nstate.\n\n### Self-Describing\n\nEvents contain all context needed to understand them. No external lookups\nrequired.\n\n### Vendor-Agnostic\n\nEvents use generic concepts (product, order) not vendor-specific (GA4 item, FB\ncontent).\n\nTransformation to vendor formats happens in **mapping**, not in event creation.\n\n## Creating Events\n\n```typescript\nimport { elb } from ''@walkeros/collector'';\n\n// Basic event\nawait elb(''page view'', { title: ''Home'', path: ''/'' });\n\n// With all properties\nawait elb(\n  ''product add'',\n  { id: ''P123'', price: 99 }, // data\n  { stage: [''cart'', 1] }, // context (optional)\n  { currency: ''USD'' }, // globals (optional)\n);\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [walkeros-understanding-mapping](../walkeros-understanding-mapping/SKILL.md) -\n  Transform events for destinations\n- [walkeros-understanding-flow](../walkeros-understanding-flow/SKILL.md) - Data\n  flow architecture\n\n**Source Files:**\n\n- [packages/core/src/types/walkeros.ts](../../packages/core/src/types/walkeros.ts) -\n  Event types\n- [packages/core/src/schemas/](../../packages/core/src/schemas/) - Event schemas\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n- [Website: Event Model](../../website/docs/getting-started/event-model.mdx) -\n  User-facing docs\n- [walkeros.io/docs](https://www.walkeros.io/docs/) - Public documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:51:56.315Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Event-Driven Agents needing standardized event management and vendor-agnostic data structures.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化事件管理和供应商无关数据结构的事件驱动代理。","ja":"イベント駆動型エージェントが標準化されたイベント管理とベンダー非依存のデータ構造を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 이벤트 관리와 벤더 중립 데이터 구조가 필요한 이벤트 驱动 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de eventos impulsados que necesitan una gestión de eventos estandarizada y estructuras de datos agnósticas de proveedor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents à événements impulsés nécessitant une gestion d''événements standardisée et des structures de données agnostiques de fournisseur.","de":"Perfekt für ereignisgesteuerte Agenten, die eine standardisierte Ereignisverwaltung und anbieterunabhängige Datenstrukturen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Orientados a Eventos que necessitam de gerenciamento de eventos padronizados e estruturas de dados agnósticas de fornecedor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на события, которым необходим стандартный менеджмент событий и поставщико-независимые структуры данных.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الحدث الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة حدث معيارية وهيكل بيانات غير متجاوز للبائع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture and transform user interactions into self-describing, stateless events using entity-action naming conventions and space separation, enabling seamless data integration across industries and destinations.","zh":"使得代理能够使用实体-操作命名约定和空格分隔来捕获和转换用户交互为自描述的、无状态的事件，从而实现跨行业和目的地的无缝数据集成。","ja":"エージェントがエンティティーアクション命名規則と空白区切りを使用してユーザーインタラクションを自己記述的でステートレスなイベントにキャプチャし変換できるようにし、業界や宛先を跨いだデータ統合を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 엔티티-액션命명 규칙과 공백 구분을 사용하여 사용자 상호 작용을 자체적으로 설명하고 상태가 없는 이벤트로 캡처 및 변환할 수 있도록하여 산업 및 목적지 간의 무제한 데이터 통합을 가능하게합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar y transformar las interacciones del usuario en eventos auto-descriptivos y sin estado utilizando convenciones de nomenclatura de entidad-acción y separación de espacios, lo que permite una integración de datos sin problemas en diferentes industrias y destinos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer et de transformer les interactions de l''utilisateur en événements auto-descriptifs et sans état en utilisant des conventions de nommage d''entité-action et de séparation d''espaces, ce qui permet une intégration de données transparente dans les différentes industries et destinations.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Benutzerinteraktionen in selbstbeschreibende, staatlose Ereignisse zu erfassen und zu transformieren, indem sie Namenskonventionen für Entität-Aktion und Leerzeichen-Trennung verwenden, was eine nahtlose Datenintegration über Branchen und Ziele hinweg ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar e transformar interações do usuário em eventos auto-descritivos, sem estado, usando convenções de nomenclatura de entidade-ação e separação de espaço, permitindo uma integração de dados sem problemas em várias indústrias e destinos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватывать и преобразовывать взаимодействия пользователя в самодостаточные, безсостояние события, используя соглашения об именовании сущность-действие и разделение пробелами, что позволяет обеспечить беспроблемную интеграцию данных в различных отраслях и местах назначения.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على التقاط وتحويل التفاعلات مع المستخدم إلى أحداث自واصف، بدون حالة، باستخدام اتفاقيات تسمية الكيان-الإجراء والفراغ بين المسافات، مما يتيح دمج البيانات بسلاسة عبر الصناعات والوجهات المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing event data for cross-platform analytics","Transforming events for vendor-specific APIs","Debugging event-related issues using strict entity-action formatting"],"zh":["为跨平台分析标准化事件数据","将事件转换为特定于供应商的API","使用严格的实体-操作格式调试与事件相关的问题"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム分析のためのイベントデータの標準化","ベンダーごとのAPI用のイベントの変換","厳密なエンティティーアクション形式を使用したイベント関連の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 분석을 위한 이벤트 데이터 표준화","벤더별 API용 이벤트 변환","엄격한 엔티티-액션 형식을 사용한 이벤트 관련 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Estandarizar datos de eventos para análisis de plataformas cruzadas","Transformar eventos para APIs específicas de proveedor","Depurar problemas relacionados con eventos mediante un formato de entidad-acción estricto"],"fr":["Standardiser les données d''événement pour l''analyse de plates-formes croisées","Transformer les événements pour les API spécifiques au fournisseur","Déboguer les problèmes liés aux événements en utilisant un format d''entité-action strict"],"de":["Ereignisdaten für Cross-Platform-Analytics standardisieren","Ereignisse für anbieterspezifische APIs transformieren","Ereignisbezogene Probleme mithilfe eines strengen Entität-Aktions-Formats debuggen"],"pt":["Padronização de dados de evento para análise cross-plataforma","Transformação de eventos para APIs específicas de fornecedor","Depuração de problemas relacionados a eventos usando formatação de entidade-ação estrita"],"ru":["Стандартизация данных событий для аналитики на нескольких платформах","Преобразование событий для API, специфичных для поставщика","Отладка проблем, связанных с событиями, с использованием строгого форматирования сущность-действие"],"ar":["تقييس بيانات الحدث لتحليل منصات متعددة","تحويل الأحداث إلى واجهات برمجة تطبيقات محددة للبائع","تصحيح أخطاء تتعلق بالأحداث باستخدام تنسيق كيان-إجراء صارم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to entity-action naming format with space separation","Stateless events may not be suitable for applications requiring event history or context"],"zh":["需要严格遵守实体-操作命名格式和空格分隔","无状态事件可能不适合需要事件历史或上下文的应用程序"],"ja":["エンティティーアクション命名形式と空白区切りの厳密な遵守が必要","ステートレスイベントはイベント履歴またはコンテキストが必要なアプリケーションには適さない可能性がある"],"ko":["엔티티-액션命명 규칙 및 공백 구분의 엄격한 준수 필요","상태가 없는 이벤트는 이벤트 기록 또는 컨텍스트가 필요한 애플리케이션에 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adherencia al formato de nomenclatura de entidad-acción con separación de espacios","Los eventos sin estado pueden no ser adecuados para aplicaciones que requieren un historial o contexto de eventos"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte au format de nommage d''entité-action avec séparation d''espaces","Les événements sans état peuvent ne pas être adaptés aux applications nécessitant un historique ou un contexte d''événements"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung des Entität-Aktions-Namensformats mit Leerzeichen-Trennung","Staatlose Ereignisse sind möglicherweise nicht für Anwendungen geeignet, die ein Ereignisverlauf oder -kontext erfordern"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita ao formato de nomenclatura de entidade-ação com separação de espaço","Eventos sem estado podem não ser adequados para aplicações que requerem histórico de eventos ou contexto"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения формата именования сущность-действие с разделением пробелами","События без состояния могут быть не подходящими для приложений, требующих истории событий или контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع صارم لتنسيق تسمية الكيان-الإجراء مع الفاراز بين المسافات","الأحداث بدون حالة قد لا تكون مناسبة للتطبيقات التي تتطلب تاريخاً للأحداث أو سياقاً"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0a9fff852cbf7e80db58ffb7aa2a1a642fed7de50235d1f89a6cd61af147494d","qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/PHP Language Standards', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'PHP Language Standards', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z', '2026-02-20T04:51:35.372Z', '1b790567cf5f28bb7da6101b29710f1b4d5c0cd84e52e83282e667f14130a242', '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/PHP Language Standards","name":"PHP Language Standards","description":{"es":"Estándares y mejores prácticas para programar en PHP de manera efectiva","fr":"Normes et meilleures pratiques pour programmer en PHP de manière efficace","de":"Standards und Best Practices für effektives Programmieren in PHP","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Estándares de Lenguaje PHP","fr":"Normes de Langage PHP","de":"PHP-Sprachstandards","en":"PHP Language Standards"},"description":{"es":"Estándares y mejores prácticas para programar en PHP de manera efectiva","fr":"Normes et meilleures pratiques pour programmer en PHP de manière efficace","de":"Standards und Best Practices für effektives Programmieren in PHP","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"es":["Declaración de tipado estricto","Uso de hinting de tipos y tipos de retorno","Uso de tipos modernos como Union e Intersection","Propiedades de solo lectura","Promoción de constructores"],"fr":["Déclaration de typage strict","Utilisation de l''indication de types et de types de retour","Utilisation de types modernes tels que Union et Intersection","Propriétés en lecture seule","Promotion de constructeurs"],"de":["Erklärung von striktem Typisieren","Verwendung von Typ-Hinweis und Rückgabetypen","Verwendung von modernen Typen wie Union und Intersection","Schreibgeschützte Eigenschaften","Konstruktor-Förderung"]},"keywords":{"es":["estándares de lenguaje PHP","mejores prácticas PHP","programación en PHP","tipado estricto","hinting de tipos","tipos modernos"],"fr":["normes de langage PHP","meilleures pratiques PHP","programmation en PHP","typage strict","indication de types","types modernes"],"de":["PHP-Sprachstandards","Best Practices PHP","Programmierung in PHP","striktes Typisieren","Typ-Hinweis","moderne Typen"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"PHP Language Standards","description":"Core PHP language standards and modern 8.x features.","bodyPreview":"# PHP Language Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\n## Structure\n\n```text\nsrc/\n└── {Namespace}/\n    └── {Class}.php\n```\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **Strict Typing**: Declare `declare(strict_types=1);` at file top.\n- **Type Hinting**: Apply scalar hints and return types to all members.\n- **Modern Types**: Use Union (`string|int`) and Intersection types.\n- **Read-only**: Use `readonly` for immutable properties.\n- **Constructor Promotion**: Combine declaration and assignment in `__const","body":"# PHP Language Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\n## Structure\n\n```text\nsrc/\n└── {Namespace}/\n    └── {Class}.php\n```\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **Strict Typing**: Declare `declare(strict_types=1);` at file top.\n- **Type Hinting**: Apply scalar hints and return types to all members.\n- **Modern Types**: Use Union (`string|int`) and Intersection types.\n- **Read-only**: Use `readonly` for immutable properties.\n- **Constructor Promotion**: Combine declaration and assignment in `__construct`.\n- **Match Expressions**: Prefer `match` over `switch` for value returns.\n- **Named Arguments**: Use for readability in optional parameters.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **No Type Context**: Avoid functions without return or parameter types.\n- **Sloppy Comparison**: **No ==**: Use `===` for strict comparison.\n- **Legacy Syntax**: **No switch**: Use `match` for simple value mapping.\n- **Global Scope**: **No Globals**: Never define logic in global namespace.\n\n## References\n\n- [Modern PHP Patterns](references/implementation.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:51:35.372Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for PHP Development Agents requiring adherence to strict coding standards and best practices.","zh":"适用于需要遵守严格编码标准和最佳实践的PHP开发代理。","ja":"PHP開発エージェントが厳格なコーディング規範とベストプラクティスに従う必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"엄격한 코딩 표준과 최선의 배려를 요구하는 PHP 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de PHP que requieren adherirse a estrictas normas de codificación y mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement PHP nécessitant le respect de normes de codage strictes et de meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ideal für PHP-Entwicklungsagenten, die die Einhaltung strenger Codierungsstandards und Best Practices erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento PHP que exigem aderência a padrões de codificação estritos e melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки PHP, требующих соблюдения строгих стандартов кодирования и лучших практик.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطورون PHP الذين يتطلبون الالتزام بمعايير الترميز الصارمة وأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict typing, apply type hinting, and utilize modern types such as Union and Intersection types, ensuring robust and maintainable PHP codebases through declaration of `declare(strict_types=1);` and adherence to PSR standards.","zh":"赋予代理人强制严格类型、应用类型提示、并利用现代类型（如联合类型和交叉类型），通过声明`declare(strict_types=1);`和遵守PSR标准，确保PHP代码库的强壮和可维护性。","ja":"エージェントに厳格な型付けを強制し、型のヒントを適用し、Union型やIntersection型などのモダンな型を利用することを可能にし、`declare(strict_types=1);`の宣言とPSR規範の遵守を通じて、強固で保守可能なPHPコードベースを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 타이핑을 강제하고, 타입 힌트를 적용하고, 유니언 타입이나 인터섹션 타입과 같은 모던한 타입을 사용하도록 하여, `declare(strict_types=1);` 선언 및 PSR 표준 준수를 통해 강력하고 유지 보수 가능한 PHP 코드베이스를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar tipificación estricta, aplicar sugerencias de tipo y utilizar tipos modernos como Union e Intersection, garantizando bases de código PHP robustas y mantenibles a través de la declaración de `declare(strict_types=1);` y el cumplimiento de los estándares PSR.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une typification stricte, d''appliquer des suggestions de type et d''utiliser des types modernes tels que Union et Intersection, garantissant des bases de code PHP robustes et maintenables grâce à la déclaration de `declare(strict_types=1);` et au respect des normes PSR.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, strenge Typisierung zu erzwingen, Typ-Hinweise anzuwenden und moderne Typen wie Union- und Schnitttypen zu nutzen, um robuste und wartbare PHP-Codebasen durch die Deklaration von `declare(strict_types=1);` und die Einhaltung der PSR-Standards sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor tipagem estrita, aplicar dicas de tipo e utilizar tipos modernos, como tipos Union e Intersection, garantindo bases de código PHP robustas e mantenedoras por meio da declaração de `declare(strict_types=1);` e aderência aos padrões PSR.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать строгую типизацию, применять типизированные подсказки и использовать современные типы, такие как типы Union и Intersection, гарантируя, таким образом, прочные и поддерживаемые базы кода PHP посредством объявления `declare(strict_types=1);` и соблюдения стандартов PSR.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض التصنيف الصارم وتطبيق تلميحات النوع واستخدام أنواع حديثة مثل أنواع الاتحاد والتقاطع، مما يضمن قواعد بيانات PHP قوية وقابلة للصيانة من خلال إعلان `declare(strict_types=1);` والامتثال لمعايير PSR."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing strict typing and type hinting for improved code readability","Implementing modern PHP features like Union and Intersection types for enhanced type safety","Optimizing class structures with constructor promotion and readonly properties for better performance"],"zh":["强制严格类型和类型提示以提高代码可读性","实现现代PHP功能，如联合类型和交叉类型，以增强类型安全性","通过构造函数推广和只读属性优化类结构以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["コードの可読性を向上させるために厳格な型付けと型のヒントを強制する","Union型やIntersection型などのモダンなPHP機能を実装し、型の安全性を高める","コンストラクタのプロモーションと読み取り専用プロパティを使用してクラス構造を最適化し、パフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["코드 가독성을 개선하기 위해 엄격한 타이핑과 타입 힌트를 강제한다","유니언 타입이나 인터섹션 타입과 같은 최신 PHP 기능을 구현하여 타입 안전성을 향상한다","생성자 승격과 읽기 전용 속성을 사용하여 클래스 구조를 최적화하고 성능을 개선한다"],"es":["Aplicar tipificación estricta y sugerencias de tipo para mejorar la legibilidad del código","Implementar características modernas de PHP como tipos Union e Intersection para mejorar la seguridad de los tipos","Optimizar las estructuras de clase con promoción de constructores y propiedades de solo lectura para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Appliquer une typification stricte et des suggestions de type pour améliorer la lisibilité du code","Implémenter des fonctionnalités modernes de PHP comme les types Union et Intersection pour améliorer la sécurité des types","Optimiser les structures de classe avec la promotion des constructeurs et les propriétés en lecture seule pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Strenge Typisierung und Typ-Hinweise anwenden, um die Lesbarkeit des Codes zu verbessern","Moderne PHP-Features wie Union- und Schnitttypen implementieren, um die Typsicherheit zu verbessern","Klassenstrukturen mit Konstruktor-Förderung und schreibgeschützten Eigenschaften optimieren, um die Leistung zu verbessern"],"pt":["Impor tipagem estrita e dicas de tipo para melhorar a legibilidade do código","Implementar recursos modernos do PHP, como tipos Union e Intersection, para melhorar a segurança do tipo","Otimizar estruturas de classe com promoção de construtores e propriedades somente leitura para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Обеспечивать строгую типизацию и типизированные подсказки для улучшения читаемости кода","Реализовывать современные функции PHP, такие как типы Union и Intersection, для повышения безопасности типов","Оптимизировать структуры классов с помощью продвижения конструкторов и свойств только для чтения для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["فرض التصنيف الصارم وتلميحات النوع لتحسين قراءة الكود","تنفيذ ميزات PHP الحديثة مثل أنواع الاتحاد والتقاطع لتحسين سلامة النوع","تحسين هياكل الفئة مع تعزيز البنائين والخصائص للقراءة فقط لأداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 7.4 or later for full feature support","Strict typing must be declared at the top of each PHP file"],"zh":["需要PHP 7.4或更高版本才能全面支持所有功能","必须在每个PHP文件的顶部声明严格类型"],"ja":["すべての機能を完全にサポートするにはPHP 7.4以上が必要","厳格な型付けを宣言するには、各PHPファイルの先頭に`declare(strict_types=1);`を宣言する必要がある"],"ko":["모든 기능을 완전히 지원하려면 PHP 7.4 이상이 필요합니다","엄격한 타이핑을 선언하려면 각 PHP 파일의 맨 위에 `declare(strict_types=1);`를 선언해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere PHP 7.4 o posterior para una compatibilidad total con las características","La tipificación estricta debe declararse en la parte superior de cada archivo PHP"],"fr":["Nécessite PHP 7.4 ou ultérieur pour une prise en charge complète des fonctionnalités","La typification stricte doit être déclarée en haut de chaque fichier PHP"],"de":["Benötigt PHP 7.4 oder höher für eine vollständige Funktionsunterstützung","Die strenge Typisierung muss am Anfang jeder PHP-Datei deklariert werden"],"pt":["Exige PHP 7.4 ou posterior para suporte total de recursos","A tipagem estrita deve ser declarada no topo de cada arquivo PHP"],"ru":["Требует PHP 7.4 или более поздней версии для полной поддержки функций","Строгая типизация должна быть объявлена в начале каждого файла PHP"],"ar":["يتطلب PHP 7.4 أو أحدث لدعم الميزات الكاملة","يجب إعلان التصنيف الصارم في الجزء العلوي من كل ملف PHP"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1b790567cf5f28bb7da6101b29710f1b4d5c0cd84e52e83282e667f14130a242","qualityScore":0}');
