d Vitest","Fokus auf Benutzerverhaltens-Tests","Verwendung von Abfragen wie getByRole und getByText","Implementierung von asynchronen Ereignissen mit userEvent","Verwendung von MSW zum Mocken von Netzwerkanfragen","Barrierefreitest"],"pt":["Utilização de React Testing Library e Vitest","Testes de comportamento do usuário","Uso de `getByRole` e `getByText`","Suporte a atualizações assíncronas","Uso de MSW para mock de rede","Testes de acessibilidade"],"ru":["Использование React Testing Library и Vitest","Тестирование поведения пользователя","Использование `getByRole` и `getByText`","Поддержка асинхронных обновлений","Использование MSW для имитации сети","Тестирование доступности"],"ar":["استخدام مكتبة اختبار رياكت و فيتست","اختبار سلوك المستخدم","استخدام `getByRole` و `getByText`","دعم التحديثات غير المتزامنة","استخدام MSW لمحاكاة الشبكة","اختبار إمكانية الوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React ","React ","React ","React ","React ","React ","React "],"ja":["React ","React ","React ","React ","React ","React ","React "],"ko":["React ","React ","React ","React ","React ","React ","React "],"es":["pruebas de React","mejores prácticas de pruebas","React Testing Library","Vitest","pruebas de comportamiento","pruebas asíncronas","mockear peticiones de red","pruebas de accesibilidad"],"fr":["tests React","meilleures pratiques de tests","React Testing Library","Vitest","tests de comportement","tests asynchrones","mocking des requêtes réseau","tests d''accessibilité"],"de":["React-Tests","bewährte Methoden für Tests","React Testing Library","Vitest","Benutzerverhaltens-Tests","asynchrone Tests","Mocken von Netzwerkanfragen","Barrierefreitest"],"pt":["testes em react","react testing library","vitest","testes de comportamento","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de software","testes automatizados","react js","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["тестирование react","react testing library","vitest","тестирование поведения","разработка программного обеспечения","качество программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование","react js","веб-разработка"],"ar":["اختبار رياكت","مكتبة اختبار رياكت","فيتست","اختبار السلوك","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة البرمجيات","اختبار آلي","رياكت جس","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"React Testing","description":"Testing strategies with RTL and Jest/Vitest.","bodyPreview":"# React Testing\n\n## **Priority: P2 (MAINTENANCE)**\n\nReliable tests focusing on user behavior.\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **Tooling**: React Testing Library + Vitest.\n- **Philosophy**: Test behavior, not implementation (State/Internal vars).\n- **Queries**: `getByRole` > `getByText` > `getByTestId`.\n- **Events**: Use `userEvent` (async) over `fireEvent`.\n- **Async**: `await screen.findBy*` for async updates.\n- **Mocks**: MSW for network. Mock heavy 3rd-party libs.\n- **Accessibility**: Testin","body":"# React Testing\n\n## **Priority: P2 (MAINTENANCE)**\n\nReliable tests focusing on user behavior.\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **Tooling**: React Testing Library + Vitest.\n- **Philosophy**: Test behavior, not implementation (State/Internal vars).\n- **Queries**: `getByRole` > `getByText` > `getByTestId`.\n- **Events**: Use `userEvent` (async) over `fireEvent`.\n- **Async**: `await screen.findBy*` for async updates.\n- **Mocks**: MSW for network. Mock heavy 3rd-party libs.\n- **Accessibility**: Testing Lib implicitly tests a11y roles.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **No Shallow Rendering**: Render full tree.\n- **No Testing Implementation Details**: Don''t check `component.state`.\n- **No Wait**: Use `findBy`, avoid `waitFor` if possible.\n\n## Code\n\n```tsx\ntest(''submits form'', async () => {\n  const user = userEvent.setup();\n  render(<LoginForm />);\n\n  await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/email/i), ''test@test.com'');\n  await user.click(screen.getByRole(''button'', { name: /login/i }));\n\n  expect(await screen.findByText(/welcome/i)).toBeInTheDocument();\n});\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:51:59.277Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focused on ensuring reliable user interfaces with React Testing Library and Vitest","zh":"适用于专注于使用 React Testing Library 和 Vitest 确保可靠用户界面的前端代理","ja":"React Testing Library と Vitest を使用して信頼性の高いユーザー インターフェイスを確保することに重点を置くフロントエンド エージェントに最適","ko":"React Testing Library와 Vitest를 사용하여 신뢰할 수 있는 사용자 인터페이스를 보장하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend centrados en garantizar interfaces de usuario confiables con React Testing Library y Vitest","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend axés sur la garantie d''interfaces utilisateur fiables avec React Testing Library et Vitest","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf die Gewährleistung zuverlässiger Benutzeroberflächen mit React Testing Library und Vitest konzentrieren","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend focados em garantir interfaces de usuário confiáveis com React Testing Library e Vitest","ru":"Идеально для агентов фронтенда, сосредоточенных на обеспечении надежных пользовательских интерфейсов с помощью React Testing Library и Vitest","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يركز على ضمان واجهات مستخدم موثوقة مع مكتبة اختبار React و Vitest"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust tests focusing on user behavior, utilizing `getByRole`, `getByText`, and `getByTestId` queries, while leveraging `userEvent` for async interactions and MSW for network mocking, thereby enhancing overall application stability and accessibility","zh":"赋予代理写入强大的测试能力，专注于用户行为，利用 `getByRole`、`getByText` 和 `getByTestId` 查询，同时利用 `userEvent` 进行异步交互和 MSW 进行网络模拟，从而提高整体应用稳定性和可访问性","ja":"エージェントが強力なテストを記述できるようにし、ユーザーの動作に焦点を当て、`getByRole`、`getByText`、`getByTestId` クエリを利用し、`userEvent` を使用して非同期のやり取りを行い、MSW を使用してネットワークのモッキングを行うことで、全体的なアプリケーションの安定性とアクセシビリティを高める","ko":"에이전트가 강력한 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 하여 사용자 행동에 중점을 두고, `getByRole`, `getByText`, `getByTestId` 쿼리를 사용하며, `userEvent`를 사용하여 비동기 상호작용과 MSW를 사용하여 네트워크 모의를 수행함으로써 전체 애플리케이션의 안정성과 접근성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas sólidas centradas en el comportamiento del usuario, utilizando consultas `getByRole`, `getByText` y `getByTestId`, mientras aprovecha `userEvent` para interacciones asíncronas y MSW para la simulación de red, mejorando así la estabilidad y accesibilidad generales de la aplicación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests solides axés sur le comportement de l''utilisateur, en utilisant des requêtes `getByRole`, `getByText` et `getByTestId`, tout en exploitant `userEvent` pour les interactions asynchrones et MSW pour la simulation du réseau, améliorant ainsi la stabilité et l''accessibilité générales de l''application","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, robuste Tests zu schreiben, die sich auf das Benutzerverhalten konzentrieren, indem sie Abfragen wie `getByRole`, `getByText` und `getByTestId` verwenden und `userEvent` für asynchrone Interaktionen und MSW für Netzwerksimulation nutzen, wodurch die Gesamstabilität und -zugänglichkeit der Anwendung verbessert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes robustos, focando no comportamento do usuário, utilizando consultas `getByRole`, `getByText` e `getByTestId`, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita `userEvent` para interações assíncronas e MSW para simulação de rede, melhorando assim a estabilidade e a acessibilidade geral do aplicativo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать прочные тесты, фокусируясь на поведении пользователя, используя запросы `getByRole`, `getByText` и `getByTestId`, а также использует `userEvent` для асинхронных взаимодействий и MSW для имитации сети, тем самым повышая общую стабильность и доступность приложения","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من كتابة اختبارات قوية تركز على سلوك المستخدم، باستخدام استفسارات `getByRole` و `getByText` و `getByTestId`، وفي الوقت نفسه الاستفادة من `userEvent` للتفاعلات غير المتزامنة و MSW لمحاكاة الشبكة، مما يحسن من الاستقرار والإمكانية العامة للتطبيق"},"useCases":{"en":["Writing tests for complex React components","Debugging issues with async updates using `await screen.findBy*`","Implementing accessibility testing with React Testing Library"],"zh":["编写复杂 React 组件的测试","使用 `await screen.findBy*` 调试异步更新问题","使用 React Testing Library 实现可访问性测试"],"ja":["複雑な React コンポーネントのテストを記述する","`await screen.findBy*` を使用して非同期の更新に関する問題をデバッグする","React Testing Library を使用してアクセシビリティ テストを実装する"],"ko":["복잡한 React 컴포넌트에 대한 테스트 작성","`await screen.findBy*`를 사용하여 비동기 업데이트 문제 디버깅","React Testing Library를 사용하여 접근성 테스트 구현"],"es":["Escribir pruebas para componentes React complejos","Depurar problemas con actualizaciones asíncronas utilizando `await screen.findBy*`","Implementar pruebas de accesibilidad con React Testing Library"],"fr":["Écrire des tests pour des composants React complexes","Déboguer des problèmes avec des mises à jour asynchrones en utilisant `await screen.findBy*`","Mettre en œuvre des tests d''accessibilité avec React Testing Library"],"de":["Schreiben von Tests für komplexe React-Komponenten","Beheben von Problemen mit asynchronen Updates unter Verwendung von `await screen.findBy*`","Implementierung von Zugriffstests mit React Testing Library"],"pt":["Escrita de testes para componentes React complexos","Depuração de problemas com atualizações assíncronas usando `await screen.findBy*`","Implementação de testes de acessibilidade com React Testing Library"],"ru":["Написание тестов для сложных компонентов React","Отладка проблем с асинхронными обновлениями с помощью `await screen.findBy*`","Реализация тестирования доступности с помощью React Testing Library"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات لمكونات React معقدة","تصحيح الأخطاء المتعلقة بالتحديثات غير المتزامنة باستخدام `await screen.findBy*`","تنفيذ اختبارات إمكانية الوصول باستخدام مكتبة اختبار React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Testing Library and Vitest setup","Limited to React applications","Needs MSW for network mocking"],"zh":["需要 React Testing Library 和 Vitest 设置","仅限 React 应用","需要 MSW 进行网络模拟"],"ja":["React Testing Library と Vitest の設定が必要","React アプリケーションにのみ限る","ネットワークのモッキングには MSW が必要"],"ko":["React Testing Library와 Vitest 설정이 필요","React 애플리케이션에만 제한","네트워크 모의를 위해 MSW가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de React Testing Library y Vitest","Limitado a aplicaciones React","Necesita MSW para la simulación de red"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de React Testing Library et Vitest","Limité aux applications React","Nécessite MSW pour la simulation du réseau"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von React Testing Library und Vitest","Begrenzt auf React-Anwendungen","Benötigt MSW für die Netzwerksimulation"],"pt":["Requer configuração do React Testing Library e Vitest","Limitado a aplicações React","Necessita MSW para simulação de rede"],"ru":["Требует настройки React Testing Library и Vitest","Ограничен для приложений React","Требует MSW для имитации сети"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مكتبة اختبار React و Vitest","محدود للتطبيقات React","يحتاج إلى MSW لمحاكاة الشبكة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9a35bd3811f1f1bf4463abcf4fd2baeb5913e5565d1f4b1ca0bc86cdb63d074a","qualityScore":40}');
