,"Iteración y mejora","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Sélection d''outils d''IA","Flux de travail de développement","Tests et débogage","Déploiement d''applications","Itération et amélioration","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Auswahl von KI-Tools","Entwicklungsworkflow","Tests und Debugging","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Iteration und Verbesserung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Seleção de ferramentas de código","Fluxo de trabalho de construção personalizado","Integração com IA para desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Otimização do ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software","Suporte para fundadores não técnicos"],"ru":["Выбор инструментов кодирования","Пользовательский рабочий процесс построения","Интеграция с ИИ для разработки приложений","Оптимизация цикла разработки программного обеспечения","Поддержка нетехнических основателей"],"ar":["اختيار أدوات الكود","تدفق عمل بناء مخصص","التكامل مع الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير التطبيقات","تحسين دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات","دعم المؤسسين غير التقنيين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS应用构建","AI工具","开发工作流","MVP构建","代码优化","自动化测试","非技术创始人","快速开发"],"ja":["SaaSアプリケーションの構築","AIツール","開発ワークフロー","MVPの構築","コードの最適化","自動テスト","非技術的な創業者","迅速な開発"],"ko":["SaaS 애플리케이션 구축","AI 도구","개발 워크플로","MVP 구축","코드 최적화","자동 테스트","비기술 창업자","빠른 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones SaaS","herramientas de IA","ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software","construir aplicaciones","desarrollo de software","SaaS","IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement d''applications SaaS","outils d''IA","cycle de vie de développement de logiciels","concevoir des applications","développement de logiciels","SaaS","IA","développement d''applications","outils de développement"],"de":["Entwicklung von SaaS-Anwendungen","KI-Tools","Lebenszyklus der Softwareentwicklung","Erstellen von Anwendungen","Softwareentwicklung","SaaS","KI","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos SaaS","IA para desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de código","ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software","fundadores não técnicos","construção de aplicativos com IA"],"ru":["разработка приложений SaaS","ИИ для разработки программного обеспечения","инструменты кодирования","цикл разработки программного обеспечения","нетехнические основатели","построение приложений с ИИ"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات SaaS","الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الكود","دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات","المؤسسون غير التقنيين","بناء التطبيقات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"whawkinsiv","repo":"solo-founder-superpowers","repoPath":"whawkinsiv/solo-founder-superpowers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.984Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"build","description":"Use this skill when the user needs to build features with AI coding tools, choose between Claude Code, Lovable, Replit, or Cursor, write effective prompts for code generation, or iterate on AI-generated code. Covers tool selection, prompting strategies, and development workflows for non-technical founders.","bodyPreview":"# Build\n\n## Tool Selection\n\n**Starting from scratch?** → Lovable (fastest MVP)  \n**Existing codebase?** → Claude Code (best context)  \n**Learning to code?** → Replit (educational)  \n**Already code?** → Cursor (power features)\n\nSee [TOOLS.md](TOOLS.md) for detailed comparison.\n\n---\n\n## Build Workflow\n\n```\n- [ ] Start with spec (use scope skill)\n- [ ] Give spec to AI tool\n- [ ] Test happy path + edge cases\n- [ ] Give specific feedback on issues\n- [ ] Iterate (expect 2-4 rounds)\n- [ ] Deploy when w","body":"# Build\n\n## Tool Selection\n\n**Starting from scratch?** → Lovable (fastest MVP)  \n**Existing codebase?** → Claude Code (best context)  \n**Learning to code?** → Replit (educational)  \n**Already code?** → Cursor (power features)\n\nSee [TOOLS.md](TOOLS.md) for detailed comparison.\n\n---\n\n## Build Workflow\n\n```\n- [ ] Start with spec (use scope skill)\n- [ ] Give spec to AI tool\n- [ ] Test happy path + edge cases\n- [ ] Give specific feedback on issues\n- [ ] Iterate (expect 2-4 rounds)\n- [ ] Deploy when working\n```\n\n---\n\n## Giving AI Your Spec\n\n### Claude Code\n```\nBuild this feature: [paste spec]\n\nCodebase: React + TypeScript + Tailwind\nReference: src/components/Button.tsx for button patterns\n```\n\n### Lovable\n```\nBuild: [paste simplified spec focusing on outcome]\nMake it look like Linear (minimal, clean)\n```\n\n### Replit\n```\nCreate: [paste spec emphasizing what user sees]\nUse React. Keep simple.\n```\n\nSee [PROMPTS.md](PROMPTS.md) for patterns.\n\n---\n\n## Reviewing What AI Built\n\nTest, don''t just run:\n\n```\n- [ ] Looks right?\n- [ ] Happy path works?\n- [ ] Edge cases work?\n- [ ] Works on mobile?\n- [ ] Error messages clear?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Giving Feedback\n\n**Bad:** \"This doesn''t work\"  \n**Good:** \"Clicking ''Save'' does nothing. Expected: ''Saved!'' message\"\n\n**Template:**\n```\nWhat I tried: [action]\nExpected: [outcome]\nGot: [what happened]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Iteration Expectations\n\n**Normal:** 2-4 rounds per feature  \n**First build:** AI builds from spec, you find 3-5 issues  \n**Second build:** Fixes those, you find 1-2 more  \n**Third build:** Final polish\n\n**Stop when:**\n- Happy path works\n- Edge cases handled\n- Mobile works\n- No obvious bugs\n\n**Don''t iterate for:**\n- Perfection\n- Features beyond spec\n- Premature optimization\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| No spec | Use scope skill first |\n| \"Build a dashboard\" | Specify what''s on it |\n| Skip edge case testing | Try breaking it |\n| Accept without review | Always test |\n| Add features mid-build | Finish current feature first |\n| Fix code yourself | Describe problem, let AI fix |\n\n---\n\n## Right-Sizing Work\n\n**Too big:** \"Build entire app\"  \n**Too small:** \"Add one button\"  \n**Right:** \"Build user auth flow\" (1-3 hours)\n\n**Good chunks:**\n- User login/signup flow\n- Dashboard with 4 metrics\n- Settings page with profile editing\n\n---\n\n## When Stuck\n\n**AI keeps breaking things:**\n→ Break into smaller piece, start fresh session\n\n**Can''t figure out complex feature:**\n→ Ask: \"What''s simplest way?\" Accept simpler solution\n\n**Each fix breaks something else:**\n→ Stop. Ask: \"Better approach?\" Consider starting over\n\n---\n\n## Working with Existing Code\n\n```\nAdd [feature] to existing project.\n\nStack: [React, Next.js, etc]\nPatterns: Check src/components for examples\nStyle: Tailwind + custom design system\nFollow existing code style\n```\n\n---\n\n## Prompting Patterns\n\n**Reference existing:**\n```\nBuild Settings page.\nReference Dashboard page layout.\nUse same Card/Button components.\n```\n\n**Provide examples:**\n```\nPricing page with 3 tiers.\nLike Linear''s pricing - clean, minimal.\n```\n\n**Specify constraints:**\n```\nBuild profile page.\nMust work offline.\nLoad under 2 seconds.\nWCAG AA accessible.\n```\n\nSee [PROMPTS.md](PROMPTS.md) for more.\n\n---\n\n## Review for Non-Technical Founders\n\n**Check:**\n- Does it match spec?\n- Buttons work?\n- Forms validate?\n- Looks like design reference?\n- Works on mobile?\n- Error messages clear?\n\n**Don''t check:**\n- Code cleanliness\n- Optimization\n- \"Best practices\"\n\nAI handles code quality. You handle requirements.\n\n---\n\n## Success Looks Like\n\n✅ Features match specs  \n✅ 2-4 iterations (not 10+)  \n✅ Can explain what''s wrong  \n✅ Building faster each week\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:57:24.887Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing streamlined software development lifecycle management for SaaS applications","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等 AI 代理，需要简化的软件开发生命周期管理，用于 SaaS 应用程序","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの AI エージェントに適しており、SaaS アプリケーション向けのストリームライン化されたソフトウェア開発ライフサイクル管理が必要","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, SaaS 애플리케이션을 위한简化된 소프트웨어 개발 생명주기 관리가 필요","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan una gestión del ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software optimizada para aplicaciones SaaS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain ayant besoin d''une gestion du cycle de vie de développement de logiciels rationalisée pour les applications SaaS","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine optimierte Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklusverwaltung für SaaS-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de gestão do ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software simplificada para aplicações SaaS","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым требуется упрощенное управление жизненным циклом разработки программного обеспечения для приложений SaaS","ar":"مثالية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات المبسطة للتطبيقات السحابية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage tools like Lovable, Replit, and Cursor for rapid MVP development, educational coding, and power feature implementation, streamlining the build workflow with spec-driven development, AI tool integration, and iterative testing using protocols like happy path and edge case analysis","zh":"赋予代理使用 Lovable、Replit 和 Cursor 等工具进行快速 MVP 开发、教育编码和功能实现，通过使用规范驱动开发、AI 工具集成和迭代测试等方式简化构建工作流，并使用诸如 happy path 和边缘情况分析等协议","ja":"Lovable、Replit、Cursor などのツールを使用して、迅速な MVP 開発、教育コーディング、機能実装を可能にし、ビルド ワークフローをストリームライン化するために、仕様駆動開発、AI ツール統合、反復テストなどの方法を使用し、happy path やエッジ ケース分析などのプロトコルを使用","ko":"Lovable, Replit, Cursor 등의 도구를 사용하여 빠른 MVP 개발, 교육 코딩, 기능 구현을 가능하게 하며, 빌드 워크플로우를簡化하기 위해 규격 주도 개발, AI 도구 통합, 반복 테스트 등의 방법을 사용하고, happy path 또는 에지 케이스 분석 등의 프로토콜을 사용","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar herramientas como Lovable, Replit y Cursor para un desarrollo de MVP rápido, codificación educativa y implementación de características potentes, racionalizando el flujo de trabajo de compilación con desarrollo basado en especificaciones, integración de herramientas de IA y pruebas iterativas utilizando protocolos como análisis de ruta feliz y caso límite","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser des outils comme Lovable, Replit et Cursor pour un développement de MVP rapide, une codification éducative et une mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités puissantes, en rationalisant le flux de travail de construction avec un développement basé sur des spécifications, une intégration d''outils d''IA et des tests itératifs en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''analyse de chemin heureux et d''analyse de cas limite","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Tools wie Lovable, Replit und Cursor für eine schnelle MVP-Entwicklung, Bildungscoding und leistungsstarke Funktionsimplementierung zu nutzen, indem sie den Build-Workflow mit spezifikationsgetriebenem Entwicklungsprozess, KI-Tool-Integration und iterativem Testen unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Happy-Path- und Edge-Case-Analyse rationalisieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar ferramentas como Lovable, Replit e Cursor para desenvolvimento rápido de MVP, codificação educacional e implementação de recursos poderosos, simplificando o fluxo de trabalho de compilação com desenvolvimento orientado por especificações, integração de ferramentas de IA e teste iterativo usando protocolos como análise de caminho feliz e caso de bordo","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать инструменты, такие как Lovable, Replit и Cursor, для быстрой разработки MVP, образовательного кодирования и реализации мощных функций, оптимизируя рабочий процесс сборки с помощью разработки, управляемой спецификациями, интеграции инструментов ИИ и итеративного тестирования с использованием протоколов, таких как анализ счастливого пути и краевого случая","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من أدوات مثل Lovable و Replit و Cursor من أجل تطوير MVP سريع والبرمجة التعليمية وتنفيذ ميزات قوية، وبذلك تُبسط تدفق العمل لبناء البرمجيات باستخدام تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات وتكامل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي والاختبار التكراري باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تحليل المسار السعيد و تحليل الحالات الحدودية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SaaS application builds with Lovable","Debugging existing codebases with Claude Code","Generating educational coding environments with Replit"],"zh":["使用 Lovable 自动化 SaaS 应用程序构建","使用 Claude Code 调试现有代码库","使用 Replit 生成教育编码环境"],"ja":["Lovable を使用して SaaS アプリケーションのビルドを自動化する","Claude Code を使用して既存のコードベースをデバッグする","Replit を使用して教育コーディング環境を生成する"],"ko":["Lovable을 사용하여 SaaS 애플리케이션 빌드를 자동화","Claude Code를 사용하여 기존 코드베이스를 디버깅","Replit을 사용하여 교육 코딩 환경을 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de aplicaciones SaaS con Lovable","Depuración de código existente con Claude Code","Generación de entornos de codificación educativa con Replit"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création d''applications SaaS avec Lovable","Débogage de codebases existantes avec Claude Code","Génération d''environnements de codage éducatif avec Replit"],"de":["Automatisierung von SaaS-Anwendungsbuilds mit Lovable","Fehlerbehebung in bestehenden Codebasen mit Claude Code","Erzeugung von Bildungscoding-Umgebungen mit Replit"],"pt":["Automatizar compilações de aplicações SaaS com Lovable","Depurar código existente com Claude Code","Gerar ambientes de codificação educacional com Replit"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сборку приложений SaaS с помощью Lovable","Отлаживать существующий код с помощью Claude Code","Генерировать образовательные среды кодирования с помощью Replit"],"ar":["تأتمتة بناء تطبيقات السحابة باستخدام Lovable","تصحيح أخطاء الكود الموجود باستخدام Claude Code","إنشاء بيئات برمجة تعليمية باستخدام Replit"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AI tool access like Lovable, Replit, or Claude Code","Limited to SaaS application development"],"zh":["需要访问 AI 工具，如 Lovable、Replit 或 Claude Code","仅限 SaaS 应用程序开发"],"ja":["Lovable、Replit、または Claude Code などの AI ツールへのアクセスが必要","SaaS アプリケーション開発に限定"],"ko":["Lovable, Replit, Claude Code 등의 AI 도구 액세스가 필요","SaaS 애플리케이션 개발에 한정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a herramientas de IA como Lovable, Replit o Claude Code","Limitado a la desarrollo de aplicaciones SaaS"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des outils d''IA comme Lovable, Replit ou Claude Code","Limité au développement d''applications SaaS"],"de":["Benötigt Zugang zu KI-Tools wie Lovable, Replit oder Claude Code","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von SaaS-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a ferramentas de IA como Lovable, Replit ou Claude Code","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações SaaS"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инструментам ИИ, таким как Lovable, Replit или Claude Code","Ограничен разработкой приложений SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Lovable و Replit و Claude Code","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات السحابة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0c1f4469b5c1138e2f9e9bf2445362fb0efc9a284f0e2f9b2990521cf056e5f6","qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/React Tooling', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'React Tooling', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:52:32.792Z', '0f952b478db30b5062a83a3be3e5952fcff21f8493fda23997ec2877e2eeeb0f', '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/React Tooling","name":"React Tooling","description":{"zh":"React","ja":"React","ko":"React ","es":"React Tooling es una colección de habilidades estándar para programación que ayuda a los desarrolladores a seguir las mejores prácticas en frameworks y lenguajes de programación.","fr":"React Tooling est un ensemble de compétences standard pour la programmation qui aide les développeurs à suivre les meilleures pratiques dans les frameworks et les langages de programmation.","de":"React-Tooling ist eine Sammlung von Standardfähigkeiten für die Programmierung, die Entwicklern hilft, die besten Praktiken in Frameworks und Programmiersprachen zu befolgen.","pt":"As ferramentas React ajudam a otimizar e depurar projetos, melhorando a performance e a experiência do usuário. Aprenda a usá-las aqui","ru":"Инструменты React помогают оптимизировать и отладить проекты, улучшая производительность и пользовательский опыт. Узнайте, как их использовать","ar":"أدوات ري액ت تساعد على تحسين وتصحيح مشاريع، لتحسين الأداء وتجربة المستخدم. تعرف على كيفية استخدامها هنا","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"React Tooling","ja":"React ","ko":"React ","es":"Herramientas de React","fr":"Outils de React","de":"React-Tooling","pt":"Ferramentas React: Otimização e Depuração","ru":"Инструменты React: оптимизация и отладка","ar":"أدوات ري액ت: تحسين وتصحيح","en":"React Tooling"},"description":{"zh":"React","ja":"React","ko":"React ","es":"React Tooling es una colección de habilidades estándar para programación que ayuda a los desarrolladores a seguir las mejores prácticas en frameworks y lengu...","fr":"React Tooling est un ensemble de compétences standard pour la programmation qui aide les développeurs à suivre les meilleures pratiques dans les frameworks e...","de":"React-Tooling ist eine Sammlung von Standardfähigkeiten für die Programmierung, die Entwicklern hilft, die besten Praktiken in Frameworks und Programmierspra...","pt":"As ferramentas React ajudam a otimizar e depurar projetos, melhorando a performance e a experiência do usuário. Aprenda a usá-las aqui","ru":"Инструменты React помогают оптимизировать и отладить проекты, улучшая производительность и пользовательский опыт. Узнайте, как их использовать","ar":"أدوات ري액ت تساعد على تحسين وتصحيح مشاريع، لتحسين الأداء وتجربة المستخدم. تعرف على كيفية استخدامها هنا","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["DevTools","Debugger","Performance","Bundle","Linting","Strict Mode"],"ja":["DevTools","Debugger","Performance","Bundle","Linting","Strict Mode"],"ko":["DevTools","Debugger","Performance","Bundle","Linting","Strict Mode"],"es":["DevTools","Debugger","Análisis de rendimiento","Optimización de bundles","Linting"],"fr":["DevTools","Debugger","Analyse de performance","Optimisation de bundles","Linting"],"de":["DevTools","Debugger","Leistungsanalyse","Bundle-Optimierung","Linting"],"pt":["DevTools para análise de renderização","Debugger para hooks personalizados","Otimização de performance com why-did-you-render","Análise de bundle com source-map-explorer","Linting com eslint-plugin-react-hooks"],"ru":["DevTools для анализа рендеринга","Debugger для пользовательских хуков","Оптимизация производительности с why-did-you-render","Анализ пакета с source-map-explorer","Linting с eslint-plugin-react-hooks"],"ar":["أدوات التطوير لتحليل العرض","متصفح الأخطاء ل Hooks مخصصة","تحسين الأداء مع why-did-you-render","تحليل الحزمة مع source-map-explorer","Linting مع eslint-plugin-react-hooks"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React","React Tooling","DevTools","Debugger","Performance Optimization","Bundle Optimization","Linting","Strict Mode"],"ja":["React","React ","DevTools","Debugger","Performance","Bundle","Linting","Strict Mode"],"ko":["React","React ","DevTools","Debugger","Performance","Bundle","Linting","Strict Mode"],"es":["React","Tooling","Desarrollo web","Análisis de rendimiento","Depuración","Optimización de bundles"],"fr":["React","Tooling","Développement web","Analyse de performance","Débogage","Optimisation de bundles"],"de":["React","Tooling","Webentwicklung","Leistungsanalyse","Debugging","Bundle-Optimierung"],"pt":["React","Ferramentas React","Otimização de performance","Depuração de projetos","DevTools","Debugger","why-did-you-render","source-map-explorer","eslint-plugin-react-hooks"],"ru":["React","Инструменты React","Оптимизация производительности","Отладка проектов","DevTools","Debugger","why-did-you-render","source-map-explorer","eslint-plugin-react-hooks"],"ar":["ري액ت","أدوات ري액ت","تحسين الأداء","تصحيح مشاكل","أدوات التطوير","متصفح الأخطاء","why-did-you-render","source-map-explorer","eslint-plugin-react-hooks"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"React Tooling","description":"Debugging, build analysis, and ecosystem tools.","bodyPreview":"# React Tooling\n\n## **Priority: P2 (OPTIONAL)**\n\nTools for analysis and debugging.\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **DevTools**: Use \"Highlight Updates\" to spot re-renders.\n- **Debugger**: `useDebugValue` for custom hooks.\n- **Performance**: `why-did-you-render` to catch wasted renders.\n- **Bundle**: `source-map-explorer` or `bundle-visualizer`.\n- **Linting**: `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` (Errors) + `react-refresh`.\n- **Strict Mode**: Enable for double-invoke checks (effects/reducers).\n\n## Code","body":"# React Tooling\n\n## **Priority: P2 (OPTIONAL)**\n\nTools for analysis and debugging.\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **DevTools**: Use \"Highlight Updates\" to spot re-renders.\n- **Debugger**: `useDebugValue` for custom hooks.\n- **Performance**: `why-did-you-render` to catch wasted renders.\n- **Bundle**: `source-map-explorer` or `bundle-visualizer`.\n- **Linting**: `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` (Errors) + `react-refresh`.\n- **Strict Mode**: Enable for double-invoke checks (effects/reducers).\n\n## Code\n\n```tsx\n// Debugging Hooks\nuseDebugValue(isOnline ? ''Online'' : ''Offline'');\n\n// why-did-you-render\nif (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'') {\n  const whyDidYouRender = require(''@welldone-software/why-did-you-render'');\n  whyDidYouRender(React, {\n    trackAllPureComponents: true,\n  });\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:52:32.792Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focused on optimizing React applications with advanced tooling and debugging capabilities.","zh":"适用于专注于优化React应用程序的前端代理，具有高级工具和调试功能。","ja":"Reactアプリケーションの最適化に焦点を当てたフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。高度なツールとデバッグ機能を備えています。","ko":"React 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 데 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 고급 도구 및 디버깅 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend centrados en optimizar aplicaciones de React con herramientas avanzadas y capacidades de depuración.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend axés sur l''optimisation des applications React avec des outils avancés et des capacités de débogage.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die auf die Optimierung von React-Anwendungen mit erweiterten Werkzeugen und Debugging-Funktionen ausgerichtet sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend focados na otimização de aplicações React com ferramentas avançadas e capacidades de depuração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, ориентированных на оптимизацию приложений React с помощью продвинутых инструментов и возможностей отладки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم المعني بتحسين تطبيقات React باستخدام أدوات متقدمة وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React performance using tools like `why-did-you-render` for catching wasted renders, `source-map-explorer` for bundle analysis, and `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` for strict linting, ensuring efficient and error-free code execution.","zh":"赋予代理优化React性能的能力，使用诸如`why-did-you-render`捕获浪费渲染、`source-map-explorer`进行包分析和`eslint-plugin-react-hooks`进行严格的代码检查等工具，确保代码的高效和无错误执行。","ja":"エージェントにReactのパフォーマンスを最適化する能力を与えます。`why-did-you-render`を使用して不要な再描画をキャッチし、`source-map-explorer`を使用してバンドル分析を実行し、`eslint-plugin-react-hooks`を使用して厳格なリンティングを実行するなど、効率的でエラーのないコード実行を保証します。","ko":"에이전트에 React 성능을 최적화하는 능력을 부여합니다. `why-did-you-render`를 사용하여 쓸모없는 재描画를捕获하고, `source-map-explorer`를 사용하여 번들 분석을 수행하며, `eslint-plugin-react-hooks`를 사용하여 엄격한 린팅을 수행하여 효율적이고 오류가 없는 코드 실행을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el rendimiento de React utilizando herramientas como `why-did-you-render` para detectar renderizados desperdiciados, `source-map-explorer` para el análisis de paquetes y `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` para una verificación estricta, garantizando una ejecución de código eficiente y sin errores.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances de React en utilisant des outils comme `why-did-you-render` pour détecter les rendus inutiles, `source-map-explorer` pour l''analyse des bundles et `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` pour une vérification stricte, garantissant une exécution de code efficace et sans erreurs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Leistung von React zu optimieren, indem sie Tools wie `why-did-you-render` zur Erkennung von verschwendeten Renderungen, `source-map-explorer` zur Bundle-Analyse und `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` für eine strenge Überprüfung verwenden, um eine effiziente und fehlerfreie Codeausführung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do React usando ferramentas como `why-did-you-render` para capturar renderizações desperdiçadas, `source-map-explorer` para análise de pacotes e `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` para linting estrito, garantindo execução de código eficiente e sem erros.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность оптимизировать производительность React с помощью инструментов như `why-did-you-render` для поимки бесполезных рендеров, `source-map-explorer` для анализа пакетов и `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` для строгого линтинга, гарантируя эффективную и безошибочную выполнение кода.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين أداء React باستخدام أدوات مثل `why-did-you-render` للقبض على عمليات التصفح المهدرة، و `source-map-explorer` لتحليل الحزم، و `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` للتحليل المتخفيض، مما يضمن تنفيذ 코드 فعالاً وخاليًا من الأخطاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging re-renders with DevTools'' Highlight Updates","Analyzing bundle sizes with `source-map-explorer` or `bundle-visualizer`","Implementing custom hooks with `useDebugValue` for enhanced debugging"],"zh":["使用DevTools的Highlight Updates调试重新渲染","使用`source-map-explorer`或`bundle-visualizer`分析包大小","使用`useDebugValue`实现自定义钩子以增强调试"],"ja":["DevToolsのHighlight Updatesを使用して再描画をデバッグする","`source-map-explorer`または`bundle-visualizer`を使用してバンドルサイズを分析する","`useDebugValue`を使用してカスタムフックを実装してデバッグを強化する"],"ko":["DevTools의 Highlight Updates를 사용하여 재描画를 디버깅합니다.","`source-map-explorer` 또는 `bundle-visualizer`를 사용하여 번들 크기 분석","`useDebugValue`를 사용하여 사용자 정의 후크를 구현하여 디버깅을 강화합니다."],"es":["Depuración de nuevas renderizaciones con DevTools'' Highlight Updates","Análisis de tamaños de paquetes con `source-map-explorer` o `bundle-visualizer`","Implementación de ganchos personalizados con `useDebugValue` para una depuración mejorada"],"fr":["Débogage des re-rendus avec DevTools'' Highlight Updates","Analyse des tailles de bundles avec `source-map-explorer` ou `bundle-visualizer`","Implémentation de crochets personnalisés avec `useDebugValue` pour un débogage amélioré"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung von Neu-Renderungen mit DevTools'' Highlight Updates","Analyse von Bundle-Größen mit `source-map-explorer` oder `bundle-visualizer`","Implementierung von benutzerdefinierten Hooks mit `useDebugValue` für eine verbesserte Fehlersuche"],"pt":["Depuração de re-renderizações com Highlight Updates do DevTools","Análise de tamanhos de pacotes com `source-map-explorer` ou `bundle-visualizer`","Implementação de ganchos personalizados com `useDebugValue` para depuração aprimorada"],"ru":["Отладка повторных рендеров с помощью Highlight Updates от DevTools","Анализ размеров пакетов с помощью `source-map-explorer` или `bundle-visualizer`","Реализация пользовательских крючков с помощью `useDebugValue` для улучшенной отладки"],"ar":["فحص إعادة التصيير باستخدام أداة DevTools'' Highlight Updates","تحليل أحجام الحزم باستخدام `source-map-explorer` أو `bundle-visualizer`","تطبيق مشابك مخصصة باستخدام `useDebugValue` من أجل فحص محسّن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React framework","Limited to JavaScript ecosystem","Dependent on compatible versions of `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` and `react-refresh`"],"zh":["需要React框架","仅限于JavaScript生态系统","依赖于`eslint-plugin-react-hooks`和`react-refresh`的兼容版本"],"ja":["Reactフレームワークが必要","JavaScriptエコシステムに限定される","`eslint-plugin-react-hooks`と`react-refresh`の互換バージョンに依存する"],"ko":["React 프레임워크가 필요합니다.","JavaScript 생태계에만 국한됩니다.","`eslint-plugin-react-hooks` 및 `react-refresh`의 호환 버전에 종속됩니다."],"es":["Requiere el marco de React","Limitado al ecosistema de JavaScript","Dependiente de versiones compatibles de `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` y `react-refresh`"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework React","Limité à l''écosystème JavaScript","Dépendant de versions compatibles de `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` et `react-refresh`"],"de":["Benötigt das React-Framework","Begrenzt auf das JavaScript-Ökosystem","Abhängig von kompatiblen Versionen von `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` und `react-refresh`"],"pt":["Exige o framework React","Limitado ao ecossistema JavaScript","Dependente de versões compatíveis de `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` e `react-refresh`"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка React","Ограничен экосистемой JavaScript","Зависит от совместимых версий `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` и `react-refresh`"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار عمل React","محدود ببيئة JavaScript","يعتمد على إصدارات متوافقة من `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` و `react-refresh`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0f952b478db30b5062a83a3be3e5952fcff21f8493fda23997ec2877e2eeeb0f","qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Flutter UI Widgets', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'Flutter UI Widgets', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:53:12.145Z', '3dd8dd5d49c71b0f47c07fadb47cd1a1b6658df445a0861dff2a6d16e0879c5d', '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Flutter UI Widgets","name":"Flutter UI Widgets","description":{"zh":"Flutter UI ","ja":"Flutter UI","ko":"Flutter UI ","es":"Estándares para crear widgets de UI de Flutter reutilizables y de alto rendimiento. Mejores prácticas para programadores.","fr":"Normes pour créer des widgets d''interface utilisateur Flutter réutilisables et performants. Meilleures pratiques pour les programmeurs.","de":"Standards für die Erstellung wiederverwendbarer und leistungsfähiger Flutter-UI-Widgets. Best Practices für Entwickler.","pt":"Este artigo apresenta os padrões e melhores práticas para construir widgets UI reutilizáveis e performáticos com Flutter.","ru":"Эта статья представляет стандарты и лучшие практики для создания ре利用уемых и производительных виджетов UI с помощью Flutter.","ar":"يقدم هذا المقال معايير وأفضل الممارسات لبناء أدوات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والكفاءة مع Flutter.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Flutter UI ","ja":"Flutter UI","ko":"Flutter UI ","es":"Mejores prácticas para widgets de UI de Flutter","fr":"Meilleures pratiques pour les widgets d''interface utilisa...","de":"Best Practices für Flutter-UI-Widgets","pt":"Widgets UI Flutter: Padrões e Melhores Práticas","ru":"Flutter UI Виджеты: Стандарты и Лучшие Практики","ar":"أدوات واجهة المستخدم Flutter: معايير وأفضل الممارسات","en":"Flutter UI Widgets"},"description":{"zh":"Flutter UI ","ja":"Flutter UI","ko":"Flutter UI ","es":"Estándares para crear widgets de UI de Flutter reutilizables y de alto rendimiento. Mejores prácticas para programadores.","fr":"Normes pour créer des widgets d''interface utilisateur Flutter réutilisables et performants. Meilleures pratiques pour les programmeurs.","de":"Standards für die Erstellung wiederverwendbarer und leistungsfähiger Flutter-UI-Widgets. Best Practices für Entwickler.","pt":"Este artigo apresenta os padrões e melhores práticas para construir widgets UI reutilizáveis e performáticos com Flutter.","ru":"Эта статья представляет стандарты и лучшие практики для создания ре利用уемых и производительных виджетов UI с помощью Flutter.","ar":"يقدم هذا المقال معايير وأفضل الممارسات لبناء أدوات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والكفاءة مع Flutter.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["StatelessWidget","StatefulWidget","UI ","Theme.of(context)","Flex + Gap/SizedBox","widget_keys.dart"],"ja":["StatelessWidget","StatefulWidget","UI ","Theme.of(context)","Flex + Gap/SizedBox","widget_keys.dart"],"ko":["StatelessWidget","StatefulWidget","UI ","Theme.of(context)","Flex + Gap/SizedBox","widget_keys.dart"],"es":["Uso de StatelessWidget por defecto","Extracción de UI en pequeños widgets atómicos","Uso de Theme.of(context) para theming","Uso de Flex y Gap/SizedBox para diseño","Uso de claves de widget para elementos interactivos","Optimización del tamaño de archivo"],"fr":["Utilisation de StatelessWidget par défaut","Extraction de l''UI en petits widgets atomiques","Utilisation de Theme.of(context) pour le thème","Utilisation de Flex et Gap/SizedBox pour la mise en page","Utilisation de clés de widget pour les éléments interactifs","Optimisation de la taille du fichier"],"de":["Verwendung von StatelessWidget standardmäßig","Extraktion von UI in kleine atomare Widgets","Verwendung von Theme.of(context) für das Theming","Verwendung von Flex und Gap/SizedBox für das Layout","Verwendung von Widget-Schlüsseln für interaktive Elemente","Optimierung der Dateigröße"],"pt":["Uso de `StatelessWidget` por padrão","Extração de UI em pequenos widgets atômicos","Uso de `Theme.of(context)` para theming","Uso de `Flex` e `Gap/SizedBox` para layout","Uso de chaves de widget de `widget_keys.dart`","Controle de tamanho de arquivo"],"ru":["Использование `StatelessWidget` по умолчанию","Извлечение UI в небольшие атомарные виджеты","Использование `Theme.of(context)` для темизации","Использование `Flex` и `Gap/SizedBox` для компоновки","Использование ключей виджета из `widget_keys.dart`","Контроль размера файла"],"ar":["استخدام `StatelessWidget` افتراضيًا","استخراج واجهة المستخدم في أدوات صغيرة ذرية","استخدام `Theme.of(context)` للتحكم في الشكل","استخدام `Flex` و `Gap/SizedBox` للتنسيق","استخدام مفاتيح الأداة من `widget_keys.dart`","مراقبة حجم الملف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flutter UI","Flutter ","UI ","StatelessWidget","StatefulWidget","Flutter "],"ja":["Flutter UI","Flutter ","UI ","StatelessWidget","StatefulWidget","Flutter "],"ko":["Flutter UI","Flutter ","UI ","StatelessWidget","StatefulWidget","Flutter "],"es":["widgets de UI de Flutter","mejores prácticas para Flutter","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","programación de aplicaciones","diseño de UI","optimización de rendimiento","Flutter para desarrolladores","widgets reutilizables","componentes de UI"],"fr":["widgets d''interface utilisateur Flutter","meilleures pratiques pour Flutter","développement d''applications mobiles","programmation d''applications","conception d''interface utilisateur","optimisation des performances","Flutter pour les développeurs","widgets réutilisables","composants d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Flutter-UI-Widgets","Best Practices für Flutter","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Anwendungsprogrammierung","Benutzeroberflächendesign","Leistungsoptimierung","Flutter für Entwickler","wiederverwendbare Widgets","Benutzeroberflächenelemente"],"pt":["Flutter","Widgets UI","padrões","melhores práticas","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","interface do usuário","reutilização","performance"],"ru":["Flutter","Виджеты UI","стандарты","лучшие практики","разработка приложений","пользовательский интерфейс","ре利用уемость","производительность"],"ar":["Flutter","أدوات واجهة المستخدم","معايير","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير التطبيقات","واجهة المستخدم","إعادة الاستخدام","الكفاءة"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Flutter UI Widgets","description":"Principles for maintainable UI components.","bodyPreview":"# UI & Widgets\n\n## **Priority: P1 (OPERATIONAL)**\n\nStandards for building reusable, performant Flutter widgets and UI components.\n\n- **State**: Use `StatelessWidget` by default. `StatefulWidget` only for local state/controllers.\n- **Composition**: Extract UI into small, atomic `const` widgets.\n- **Theming**: Use `Theme.of(context)`. No hardcoded colors.\n- **Layout**: Use `Flex` + `Gap/SizedBox`.\n- **Widget Keys**: All interactive elements must use keys from `widget_keys.dart`.\n- **File Size**: I","body":"# UI & Widgets\n\n## **Priority: P1 (OPERATIONAL)**\n\nStandards for building reusable, performant Flutter widgets and UI components.\n\n- **State**: Use `StatelessWidget` by default. `StatefulWidget` only for local state/controllers.\n- **Composition**: Extract UI into small, atomic `const` widgets.\n- **Theming**: Use `Theme.of(context)`. No hardcoded colors.\n- **Layout**: Use `Flex` + `Gap/SizedBox`.\n- **Widget Keys**: All interactive elements must use keys from `widget_keys.dart`.\n- **File Size**: If a UI file exceeds ~80 lines, extract sub-widgets into private classes.\n- **Specialized**:\n  - `SelectionArea`: For multi-widget text selection.\n  - `InteractiveViewer`: For zoom/pan.\n  - `ListWheelScrollView`: For pickers.\n  - `IntrinsicWidth/Height`: Avoid unless strictly required.\n- **Large Lists**: Always use `ListView.builder`.\n\n```dart\nclass AppButton extends StatelessWidget {\n  final String label;\n  final VoidCallback onPressed;\n  const AppButton({super.key, required this.label, required this.onPressed});\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) => ElevatedButton(onPressed: onPressed, child: Text(label));\n}\n```\n\n## Related Topics\n\nperformance | testing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:53:12.145Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile App Agents requiring efficient Flutter UI development with reusable and performant widgets.","zh":"适用于需要高效的Flutter UI开发和可重用、性能优化的widget的移动应用代理。","ja":"Flutter UI開発が効率的に行え、再利用可能でパフォーマンスの高いウィジェットを必要とするモバイルアプリエージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 Flutter UI 개발 및 재사용 가능한 고성능 위젯이 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que requieren un desarrollo de interfaz de usuario de Flutter eficiente con widgets reutilizables y de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Applications Mobiles nécessitant un développement d''interface utilisateur Flutter efficace avec des widgets réutilisables et performants.","de":"Ideal für Mobile App-Agents, die eine effiziente Flutter-Benutzeroberflächen-Entwicklung mit wiederverwendbaren und leistungsstarken Widgets erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que requerem desenvolvimento de UI do Flutter eficiente com widgets reutilizáveis e de alto desempenho.","ru":"Идеально для агентов мобильных приложений, требующих эффективного разработки интерфейса Flutter с многократным использованием и эффективными виджетами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الهاتف المحمول الذي يتطلب تنمية واجهة المستخدم Flutter فعالة مع أدوات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام وعلى أداء عالي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build consistent UI components using StatelessWidget and StatefulWidget, while leveraging Theme.of(context) for theming and Flex for layout management, ensuring adherence to best practices for widget keys and file size optimization.","zh":"赋予代理构建一致的UI组件的能力，使用StatelessWidget和StatefulWidget，同时利用Theme.of(context)进行主题设置和Flex进行布局管理，确保遵守最佳实践以优化小部件键和文件大小。","ja":"StatelessWidgetとStatefulWidgetを使用して一貫したUIコンポーネントを構築し、Theme.of(context)を使用してテーマ設定を行い、Flexを使用してレイアウト管理を行うことで、ウィジェットキーのベストプラクティスとファイルサイズの最適化に従うことができます。","ko":"무상태 위젯과 상태 위젯을 사용하여 일관된 UI 구성 요소를 구축하고 Theme.of(context)를 사용하여 테마 설정을 수행하며 Flex를 사용하여 레이아웃 관리를 수행하여 위젯 키와 파일 크기 최적화에 대한 모범 사례를 준수할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear componentes de interfaz de usuario coherentes utilizando StatelessWidget y StatefulWidget, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha Theme.of(context) para la tematización y Flex para la administración de diseños, garantizando el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas para claves de widgets y optimización de tamaño de archivo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants d''interface utilisateur cohérents en utilisant StatelessWidget et StatefulWidget, tout en exploitant Theme.of(context) pour le thème et Flex pour la gestion du layout, en garantissant le respect des meilleures pratiques pour les clés de widgets et l''optimisation de la taille de fichier.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, konsistente Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit StatelessWidget und StatefulWidget zu erstellen, während sie gleichzeitig Theme.of(context) für die Thematisierung und Flex für die Layoutverwaltung nutzen, um die Einhaltung der Best Practices für Widget-Schlüssel und Dateigrößenoptimierung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir componentes de UI consistentes usando StatelessWidget e StatefulWidget, aproveitando Theme.of(context) para temas e Flex para gerenciamento de layout, garantindo a adesão às melhores práticas para chaves de widgets e otimização de tamanho de arquivo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать последовательные компоненты интерфейса, используя StatelessWidget и StatefulWidget, используя при этом Theme.of(context) для тем и Flex для управления макетом, обеспечивая соблюдение лучших практик для ключей виджетов и оптимизацию размера файла.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتسقة باستخدام StatelessWidget و StatefulWidget، مع الاستفادة من Theme.of(context) للسمات و Flex لإدارة التصميم، مع ضمان الالتزام بأفضل الممارسات لمفاتيح أدوات واجهة المستخدم وتحسين حجم الملف."},"useCases":{"en":["Building reusable and performant Flutter widgets","Implementing consistent theming across mobile apps using Theme.of(context)","Optimizing UI component layout with Flex and Gap/SizedBox","Ensuring interactive elements use standardized widget keys from widget_keys.dart"],"zh":["构建可重用和高效的Flutter小部件","使用Theme.of(context)在移动应用中实现一致的主题设置","使用Flex和Gap/SizedBox优化UI组件布局","确保交互元素使用来自widget_keys.dart的标准化小部件键"],"ja":["再利用可能でパフォーマンスの高いFlutterウィジェットを構築する","Theme.of(context)を使用してモバイルアプリ全体で一貫したテーマ設定を行う","FlexとGap/SizedBoxを使用してUIコンポーネントのレイアウトを最適化する","インタラクティブ要素がwidget_keys.dartからの標準化ウィジェットキーを使用していることを確認する"],"ko":["재사용 가능하고 효율적인 Flutter 위젯을 구축하는 것","Theme.of(context)를 사용하여 모바일 애플리케이션 전반에 일관된 테마 설정을 구현하는 것","Flex와 Gap/SizedBox를 사용하여 UI 구성 요소 레이아웃을 최적화하는 것","상호 작용 요소가 widget_keys.dart에서 표준화된 위젯 키를 사용하고 있는지 확인하는 것"],"es":["Creación de widgets de Flutter reutilizables y de alto rendimiento","Implementación de una tematización coherente en aplicaciones móviles utilizando Theme.of(context)","Optimización del diseño de componentes de interfaz de usuario con Flex y Gap/SizedBox","Garantía de que los elementos interactivos utilicen claves de widgets estandarizadas desde widget_keys.dart"],"fr":["Création de widgets Flutter réutilisables et performants","Mise en œuvre d''un thème cohérent dans les applications mobiles en utilisant Theme.of(context)","Optimisation du layout des composants d''interface utilisateur avec Flex et Gap/SizedBox","Assurance que les éléments interactifs utilisent des clés de widgets standardisées depuis widget_keys.dart"],"de":["Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren und leistungsstarken Flutter-Widgets","Implementierung einer konsistenten Thematisierung in mobilen Apps unter Verwendung von Theme.of(context)","Optimierung des Layouts von Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit Flex und Gap/SizedBox","Sicherstellung, dass interaktive Elemente standardisierte Widget-Schlüssel aus widget_keys.dart verwenden"],"pt":["Construir widgets do Flutter reutilizáveis e de alto desempenho","Implementar temas consistentes em aplicativos móveis usando Theme.of(context)","Otimizar o layout de componentes de UI com Flex e Gap/SizedBox","Garantir que os elementos interativos usem chaves de widgets padronizadas de widget_keys.dart"],"ru":["Создание многократного использования и эффективных виджетов Flutter","Реализация последовательных тем в мобильных приложениях с помощью Theme.of(context)","Оптимизация макета компонентов интерфейса с помощью Flex и Gap/SizedBox","Обеспечение использования интерактивными элементами стандартизированных ключей виджетов из widget_keys.dart"],"ar":["بناء أدوات واجهة المستخدم Flutter قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام وعلى أداء عالي","تنفيذ السمات المتسقة عبر تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول باستخدام Theme.of(context)","تحسين تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم مع Flex و Gap/SizedBox","ضمان استخدام العناصر التفاعلية لمفاتيح أدوات واجهة المستخدم الموحدة من widget_keys.dart"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Flutter framework and Dart programming language","Limited to building UI components for mobile apps"],"zh":["需要了解Flutter框架和Dart编程语言","仅限于构建移动应用的UI组件"],"ja":["FlutterフレームワークとDartプログラミング言語の知識が必要","モバイルアプリのUIコンポーネントの構築のみに限定される"],"ko":["Flutter 프레임워크와 Dart 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 지식이 필요","모바일 애플리케이션의 UI 구성 요소 구축에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del framework Flutter y del lenguaje de programación Dart","Limitado a la creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario para aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances du framework Flutter et du langage de programmation Dart","Limité à la création de composants d''interface utilisateur pour les applications mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Flutter-Frameworks und der Programmiersprache Dart","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten für mobile Apps"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento do framework Flutter e da linguagem de programação Dart","Limitado à construção de componentes de UI para aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Требует знания фреймворка Flutter и языка программирования Dart","Ограничен строительством компонентов интерфейса для мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة إطار Flutter ولغة البرمجة Dart","محدود ببناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم لتطبيقات الهاتف المحمول"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3dd8dd5d49c71b0f47c07fadb47cd1a1b6658df445a0861dff2a6d16e0879c5d","qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar/Command Development', 'community', 'Galaxy-Dawn', 'claude-scholar', 'Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar', 'Command Development', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:53:08.032Z', '76014a8e26c35b0f9396ec4ba7531526259d24f5afff13553365a1c5cb03f447', '{"id":"Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar/Command Development","name":"Command Development","description":{"zh":"命令开发是 Claude Code 的一个综合配置，用于简化数据科学、AI 研究和学术写作工作流程","ja":"コマンド開発は、データサイエンス、AI 研究、学術論文のワークフローを最適化するための Claude Code 構成です","ko":"명령 개발은 데이터 과학, AI 연구, 학술 저술의 워크플ロー를 간소화하기 위한 Claude Code 구성입니다","es":"El desarrollo de comandos para Claude Code permite crear flujos de trabajo personalizados para la investigación y el desarrollo de IA.","fr":"Le développement de commandes pour Claude Code permet de créer des flux de travail personnalisés pour la recherche et le développement de l''IA.","de":"Die Befehlsentwicklung für Claude Code ermöglicht die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Workflows für die Forschung und die Entwicklung von KI.","pt":"O desenvolvimento de comandos para Claude Code permite criar fluxos de trabalho personalizados para pesquisa e publicação","ru":"Разработка команд для Claude Code позволяет создавать пользовательские рабочие процессы для исследований и публикаций","ar":"تطوير الأوامر ل Claude Code يسمح بإنشاء سير عمل مخصصة للبحث والنشر","en":"A comprehensive Claude Code configuration for data science, AI research, and academic writing. Streamline the complete research workflow—from idea to publication."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"命令开发 - Claude Code 配置指南","ja":"コマンド開発 - Claude Code 構成ガイド","ko":"명령 개발 - Claude Code 구성 가이드","es":"Desarrollo de Comandos para Claude Code","fr":"Développement de Commandes pour Claude Code","de":"Befehlsentwicklung für Claude Code","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Comandos para Claude Code","ru":"Разраб