ppeurs d''exécuter plusieurs tâches de manière simultanée, améliorant l''efficacité et les performances dans les...","de":"Das Skill für parallele Aufgaben ermöglicht es Entwicklern, mehrere Aufgaben gleichzeitig auszuführen, um die Effizienz und Leistung in Entwicklungsprojekten...","pt":"O ''parallel-task'' é uma habilidade de agente de IA que permite a execução de tarefas simultâneas, melhorando a eficiência do desenvolvimento","ru":"Параллельные задачи - это навык ИИ Агента, который позволяет выполнять задачи одновременно, повышая эффективность разработки","ar":"المهمة الموازية هي مهارة أداة الوكيل الذكي التي تسمح بتنفيذ مهام متزامنة، لتحسين كفاءة التطوير","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Ejecución de tareas paralelas","Mejora de la eficiencia y el rendimiento","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Soporte para programación concurrente"],"fr":["Exécution de tâches parallèles","Amélioration de l''efficacité et des performances","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Support pour la programmation concurrente"],"de":["Ausführung von parallelen Aufgaben","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Leistung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für konkurrierende Programmierung"],"pt":["Execução de tarefas simultâneas","Melhoria da eficiência do desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) fácil de usar"],"ru":["Выполнение задач одновременно","Повышение эффективности разработки","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Простой интерфейс командной строки (CLI)"],"ar":["تنفيذ مهام متزامنة","تحسين كفاءة التطوير","دعم منصات متعددة","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"es":["cómo utilizar tareas paralelas","qué es un agente de AI","herramientas de AI para desarrollo","tareas paralelas en Node.js","alternativas a tareas paralelas","guias de instalación de agentes de AI","tareas paralelas en Python"],"fr":["comment utiliser des tâches parallèles","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","outils d''IA pour le développement","tâches parallèles en Node.js","alternatives aux tâches parallèles","guides d''installation d''agents d''IA","tâches parallèles en Python"],"de":["wie man parallele Aufgaben verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","AI-Tools für die Entwicklung","parallele Aufgaben in Node.js","Alternativen zu parallelen Aufgaben","Installationsanleitungen für AI-Agents","parallele Aufgaben in Python"],"pt":["como usar agente de ia","o que é agente de ia","agente de ia vs robô","instalar agente de ia","guia de configuração do agente de ia","alternativa ao agente de ia","agente de ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агент vs робот","установить ИИ Агент","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента","альтернатива ИИ Агенту","ИИ Агент для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الوكيل الذكي","ما هي أداة الوكيل الذكي","أداة الوكيل الذكي مقابل الروبوت","تثبيت أداة الوكيل الذكي","دليل إعداد أداة الوكيل الذكي","بديل لأداة الوكيل الذكي","أداة الوكيل الذكي لمطوري البرامج"]}},"owner":"am-will","repo":"codex-skills","repoPath":"am-will/codex-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.984Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"parallel-task","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Parallel Task Executor\n\nYou are an Orchestrator for subagents. Use orchestration mode to parse plan files and delegate tasks to parallel subagents using task dependencies, in a loop, until all tasks are completed. Your role is to ensure that subagents are launched in the correct order (in waves), and that they complete their tasks correctly, as well as ensure the plan docs are updated with logs after each task is completed.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Parse Request\n\nExtract from user request:\n1.","body":"# Parallel Task Executor\n\nYou are an Orchestrator for subagents. Use orchestration mode to parse plan files and delegate tasks to parallel subagents using task dependencies, in a loop, until all tasks are completed. Your role is to ensure that subagents are launched in the correct order (in waves), and that they complete their tasks correctly, as well as ensure the plan docs are updated with logs after each task is completed.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Parse Request\n\nExtract from user request:\n1. **Plan file**: The markdown plan to read\n2. **Task subset** (optional): Specific task IDs to run\n\nIf no subset provided, run the full plan.\n\n### Step 2: Read & Parse Plan\n\n1. Find task subsections (e.g., `### T1:` or `### Task 1.1:`)\n2. For each task, extract:\n   - Task ID and name\n   - **depends_on** list (from `- **depends_on**: [...]`)\n   - Full content (description, location, acceptance criteria, validation)\n3. Build task list\n4. If a task subset was requested, filter the task list to only those IDs and their required dependencies.\n\n### Step 3: Launch Subagents\n\nFor each **unblocked** task, launch subagent with:\n- **description**: \"Implement task [ID]: [name]\"\n- **prompt**: Use template below\n\nLaunch all unblocked tasks in parallel. A task is unblocked if all IDs in its depends_on list are complete.\n\n### Task Prompt Template\n\n```\nYou are implementing a specific task from a development plan.\n\n## Context\n- Plan: [filename]\n- Goals: [relevant overview from plan]\n- Dependencies: [prerequisites for this task]\n- Related tasks: [tasks that depend on or are depended on by this task]\n- Constraints: [risks from plan]\n\n## Your Task\n**Task [ID]: [Name]**\n\nLocation: [File paths]\nDescription: [Full description]\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n[List from plan]\n\nValidation:\n[Tests or verification from plan]\n\n## Instructions\n1. Examine working plan and any relevant or dependent files\n2. Implement changes for all acceptance criteria\n3. Keep work **atomic and committable**\n4. For each file: read first, edit carefully, preserve formatting\n5. Run validation if feasible\n6. **ALWAYS mark completed tasks IN THE *-plan.md file AS SOON AS YOU COMPLETE IT!** and update with:\n    - Concise work log\n    - Files modified/created\n    - Errors or gotchas encountered\n7. Commit your work\n   - Note: There are other agents working in parallel to you, so only stage and commit the files you worked on. NEVER PUSH. ONLY COMMIT.\n8. Double Check that you updated the *-plan.md file and committed your work before yielding\n9. Return summary of:\n   - Files modified/created\n   - Changes made\n   - How criteria are satisfied\n   - Validation performed or deferred\n\n## Important\n- Be careful with paths\n- Stop and describe blockers if encountered\n- Focus on this specific task\n```\n\nEnsure that the agent marked its task complete before moving on to the next task or set of tasks.\n\n### Step 4: Check and Validate.\n\nAfter subagents complete their work:\n1. Inspect their outputs for correctness and completeness.\n2. Validate the results against the expected outcomes.\n3. If the task is truly completed correctly, ENSURE THAT TASK WAS MARKED COMPLETE WITH LOGS.\n4. If a task was not successful, have the agent retry or escalate the issue.\n5. Ensure that that wave of work has been committed to github before moving on to the next wave of tasks.\n\n### Step 5: Repeat\n\n1. Review the plan again to see what new set of unblocked tasks are available.\n2. Continue launching unblocked tasks in parallel until plan is done.\n3. Repeat the process until *all** tasks are both complete, validated, and working without errors. \n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Task subset not found: List available task IDs\n- Parse failure: Show what was tried, ask for clarification\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```\n''Implement the plan using parallel task skill''\n/parallel-task plan.md\n/parallel-task ./plans/auth-plan.md T1 T2 T4\n/parallel-task user-profile-plan.md --tasks T3 T7\n```\n\n## Execution Summary Template\n\n```markdown\n# Execution Summary\n\n## Tasks Assigned: [N]\n\n### Completed\n- Task [ID]: [Name] - [Brief summary]\n\n### Issues\n- Task [ID]: [Name]\n  - Issue: [What went wrong]\n  - Resolution: [How resolved or what''s needed]\n\n### Blocked\n- Task [ID]: [Name]\n  - Blocker: [What''s preventing completion]\n  - Next Steps: [What needs to happen]\n\n## Overall Status\n[Completion summary]\n\n## Files Modified\n[List of changed files]\n\n## Next Steps\n[Recommendations]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:58:56.982Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Orchestrator Agents managing complex multi-agent workflows with task dependencies.","zh":"适用于Orchestrator Agents管理具有任务依赖关系的复杂多agent工作流","ja":"タスク依存関係を持つ複雑なマルチエージェントワークフローを管理するOrchestratorエージェントに不可欠","ko":"タスク 의존 관계가 있는 복잡한 多 에이전트 워크플로를 관리하는 Orchestrator 에이전트에 필수","es":"Essential for Orchestrator Agents managing complex multi-agent workflows with task dependencies.","fr":"Essential for Orchestrator Agents managing complex multi-agent workflows with task dependencies.","de":"Essential for Orchestrator Agents managing complex multi-agent workflows with task dependencies.","pt":"Essential for Orchestrator Agents managing complex multi-agent workflows with task dependencies.","ru":"Essential for Orchestrator Agents managing complex multi-agent workflows with task dependencies.","ar":"Essential for Orchestrator Agents managing complex multi-agent workflows with task dependencies."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables parallel subagent orchestration through plan file parsing and dependency-aware task delegation. Provides wave-based execution management and automated plan document logging after each task completion.","zh":"通过计划文件解析和依赖感知任务委托实现并行子代理编排。提供基于波的执行管理和每个任务完成后的自动计划文档记录","ja":"プランファイルの解析と依存関係に基づくタスクの委任を通じて、並行サブエージェントのオーケストレーションを可能にします。波に基づく実行管理と、各タスクの完了後に自動的にプラン文書を記録する機能を提供します","ko":"계획 파일 파싱 및 의존성 인식 작업 위임을 통해 병렬 서브 에이전트 오케스트레이션을 가능하게 합니다. 파도 기반 실행 관리 및 각 작업 완료 후 자동 계획 문서 기록을 제공합니다","es":"Enables parallel subagent orchestration through plan file parsing and dependency-aware task delegation. Provides wave-based execution management and automated plan document logging after each task completion.","fr":"Enables parallel subagent orchestration through plan file parsing and dependency-aware task delegation. Provides wave-based execution management and automated plan document logging after each task completion.","de":"Enables parallel subagent orchestration through plan file parsing and dependency-aware task delegation. Provides wave-based execution management and automated plan document logging after each task completion.","pt":"Enables parallel subagent orchestration through plan file parsing and dependency-aware task delegation. Provides wave-based execution management and automated plan document logging after each task completion.","ru":"Enables parallel subagent orchestration through plan file parsing and dependency-aware task delegation. Provides wave-based execution management and automated plan document logging after each task completion.","ar":"Enables parallel subagent orchestration through plan file parsing and dependency-aware task delegation. Provides wave-based execution management and automated plan document logging after each task completion."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating multi-agent development workflows","Managing task dependencies in parallel processing","Automating plan documentation updates","Coordinating subagent execution waves"],"zh":["编排多agent开发工作流","在并行处理中管理任务依赖关系","自动化计划文档更新","协调子代理执行波"],"ja":["マルチエージェント開発ワークフローのオーケストレーション","並行処理におけるタスク依存関係の管理","プラン文書の自動更新","サブエージェントの実行波の調整"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 개발 워크플로 오케스트레이션","병렬 처리에서 작업 의존성 관리","계획 문서 자동 업데이트","서브 에이전트 실행 波 조정"],"es":["Orchestrating multi-agent development workflows","Managing task dependencies in parallel processing","Automating plan documentation updates","Coordinating subagent execution waves"],"fr":["Orchestrating multi-agent development workflows","Managing task dependencies in parallel processing","Automating plan documentation updates","Coordinating subagent execution waves"],"de":["Orchestrating multi-agent development workflows","Managing task dependencies in parallel processing","Automating plan documentation updates","Coordinating subagent execution waves"],"pt":["Orchestrating multi-agent development workflows","Managing task dependencies in parallel processing","Automating plan documentation updates","Coordinating subagent execution waves"],"ru":["Orchestrating multi-agent development workflows","Managing task dependencies in parallel processing","Automating plan documentation updates","Coordinating subagent execution waves"],"ar":["Orchestrating multi-agent development workflows","Managing task dependencies in parallel processing","Automating plan documentation updates","Coordinating subagent execution waves"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires structured plan files with dependency metadata","Depends on subagent availability and compatibility","Needs filesystem access for plan document updates"],"zh":["需要具有依赖元数据的结构化计划文件","依赖于子代理的可用性和兼容性","需要文件系统访问以进行计划文档更新"],"ja":["依存関係メタデータを含む構造化されたプランファイルが必要","サブエージェントの可用性と互換性に依存","プラン文書を更新するためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["의존성 메타데이터를 포함하는 구조화된 계획 파일이 필요","서브 에이전트의 가용성 및 호환성에 의존","계획 문서를 업데이트하는 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requires structured plan files with dependency metadata","Depends on subagent availability and compatibility","Needs filesystem access for plan document updates"],"fr":["Requires structured plan files with dependency metadata","Depends on subagent availability and compatibility","Needs filesystem access for plan document updates"],"de":["Requires structured plan files with dependency metadata","Depends on subagent availability and compatibility","Needs filesystem access for plan document updates"],"pt":["Requires structured plan files with dependency metadata","Depends on subagent availability and compatibility","Needs filesystem access for plan document updates"],"ru":["Requires structured plan files with dependency metadata","Depends on subagent availability and compatibility","Needs filesystem access for plan document updates"],"ar":["Requires structured plan files with dependency metadata","Depends on subagent availability and compatibility","Needs filesystem access for plan document updates"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"845989617d00f5a2c40be92ceee34604d310ce877b1a530056b298a155e53f72","qualityScore":55}');
