설치","vibe coding 지원"],"es":["Generación de imágenes con la API de Google Gemini","Edición de imágenes con Pillow","Compatibilidad con Python 3","Instalación fácil con pip","Configuración mediante variables de entorno"],"fr":["Génération d''images avec l''API Google Gemini","Édition d''images avec Pillow","Compatibilité avec Python 3","Installation facile avec pip","Configuration via des variables d''environnement"],"de":["Bildgenerierung mit der Google-Gemini-API","Bildbearbeitung mit Pillow","Kompatibilität mit Python 3","Einfache Installation mit pip","Konfiguration über Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Geração de imagens com Google Gemini API","Configuração de chave de API","Instalação de pacotes Python","Edição de imagens","Suporte a várias linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Генерация изображений с помощью API Google Gemini","Настройка ключа API","Установка пакетов Python","Редактирование изображений","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования"],"ar":["генерация الصور باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جوجل جيميني","إعداد مفتاح واجهة البرمجة","تثبيت حزم بايثون","تحرير الصور","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nanobanana 技能","Google Gemini API","图像生成","图像编辑","vibe coding","Python 依赖包"],"ja":["Nanobanana スキル","Google Gemini API","画像生成","画像編集","vibe coding","Python 依存パッケージ"],"ko":["나노바나나 스킬","Google Gemini API","이미지 생성","이미지 편집","vibe coding","Python 의존 패키지"],"es":["generación de imágenes","API de Google Gemini","Nanobanana","Pillow","Python 3","desarrollo de software","herramientas de código abierto"],"fr":["génération d''images","API Google Gemini","Nanobanana","Pillow","Python 3","développement de logiciels","outils open source"],"de":["Bildgenerierung","Google-Gemini-API","Nanobanana","Pillow","Python 3","Software-Entwicklung","Open-Source-Tools"],"pt":["nanobanana skill","geração de imagens","Google Gemini API","python","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de código aberto"],"ru":["Нанобананский навык","генерация изображений","API Google Gemini","python","разработка программного обеспечения","открытые инструменты"],"ar":["مهارة النانوبانانا","генерация الصور","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جوجل جيميني","بايثون","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات مفتوحة المصدر"]}},"owner":"feiskyer","repo":"codex-settings","repoPath":"feiskyer/codex-settings","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nanobanana-skill","description":"Generate or edit images using Google Gemini API via nanobanana. Use when the user asks to create, generate, edit images with nanobanana, or mentions image generation/editing tasks.","bodyPreview":"# Nanobanana Image Generation Skill\n\nGenerate or edit images using Google Gemini API through the nanobanana tool.\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **GEMINI_API_KEY**: Must be configured in `~/.nanobanana.env` or `export GEMINI_API_KEY=<your-api-key>`\n2. **Python3 with depedent packages installed**: google-genai, Pillow, python-dotenv. They could be installed via `python3 -m pip install -r ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/requirements.txt` if not installed yet.\n3. **Executable**: `~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-","body":"# Nanobanana Image Generation Skill\n\nGenerate or edit images using Google Gemini API through the nanobanana tool.\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **GEMINI_API_KEY**: Must be configured in `~/.nanobanana.env` or `export GEMINI_API_KEY=<your-api-key>`\n2. **Python3 with depedent packages installed**: google-genai, Pillow, python-dotenv. They could be installed via `python3 -m pip install -r ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/requirements.txt` if not installed yet.\n3. **Executable**: `~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/nanobanana.py`\n\nExample `.nanobanana.env`:\n\n```bash\nGEMINI_API_KEY=sk-dummy\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\n### For image generation\n\n1. Ask the user for:\n   - What they want to create (the prompt)\n   - Desired aspect ratio/size (optional, defaults to 9:16 portrait)\n   - Output filename (optional, auto-generates UUID if not specified)\n   - Model preference (optional, defaults to gemini-3-pro-image-preview)\n   - Resolution (optional, defaults to 1K)\n\n2. Run the nanobanana script with appropriate parameters:\n\n   ```bash\n   python3 ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/nanobanana.py --prompt \"description of image\" --output \"filename.png\"\n   ```\n\n3. Show the user the saved image path when complete\n\n### For image editing\n\n1. Ask the user for:\n   - Input image file(s) to edit\n   - What changes they want (the prompt)\n   - Output filename (optional)\n\n2. Run with input images:\n\n   ```bash\n   python3 ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/nanobanana.py --prompt \"editing instructions\" --input image1.png image2.png --output \"edited.png\"\n   ```\n\n## Available Options\n\n### Aspect Ratios (--size)\n\n- `1024x1024` (1:1) - Square\n- `832x1248` (2:3) - Portrait\n- `1248x832` (3:2) - Landscape\n- `864x1184` (3:4) - Portrait\n- `1184x864` (4:3) - Landscape\n- `896x1152` (4:5) - Portrait\n- `1152x896` (5:4) - Landscape\n- `768x1344` (9:16) - Portrait (default)\n- `1344x768` (16:9) - Landscape\n- `1536x672` (21:9) - Ultra-wide\n\n### Models (--model)\n\n- `gemini-3-pro-image-preview` (default) - Higher quality\n- `gemini-2.5-flash-image` - Faster generation\n\n### Resolution (--resolution)\n\n- `1K` (default)\n- `2K`\n- `4K`\n\n### Optional Flags\n\n- `--enable-google-search` Enable Google Search tool for the model (default: disabled)\n- `--include-thoughts` Include model thinking in output (default: disabled)\n\n## Examples\n\n### Generate a simple image\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/nanobanana.py --prompt \"A serene mountain landscape at sunset with a lake\"\n```\n\n### Generate with specific size and output\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/nanobanana.py \\\n  --prompt \"Modern minimalist logo for a tech startup\" \\\n  --size 1024x1024 \\\n  --output \"logo.png\"\n```\n\n### Generate landscape image with high resolution\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/nanobanana.py \\\n  --prompt \"Futuristic cityscape with flying cars\" \\\n  --size 1344x768 \\\n  --resolution 2K \\\n  --output \"cityscape.png\"\n```\n\n### Edit existing images\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/nanobanana.py \\\n  --prompt \"Add a rainbow in the sky\" \\\n  --input photo.png \\\n  --output \"photo-with-rainbow.png\"\n```\n\n### Use faster model\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.codex/skills/nanobanana-skill/nanobanana.py \\\n  --prompt \"Quick sketch of a cat\" \\\n  --model gemini-2.5-flash-image \\\n  --output \"cat-sketch.png\"\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf the script fails:\n\n- Check that `GEMINI_API_KEY` is exported or set in ~/.nanobanana.env\n- Verify input image files exist and are readable\n- Ensure the output directory is writable\n- If no image is generated, try making the prompt more specific about wanting an image\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. Be descriptive in prompts - include style, mood, colors, composition\n2. For logos/graphics, use square aspect ratio (1024x1024)\n3. For social media posts, use 9:16 for stories or 1:1 for posts\n4. For wallpapers, use 16:9 or 21:9\n5. Start with 1K resolution for testing, upgrade to 2K/4K for final output\n6. Use gemini-3-pro-image-preview for best quality, gemini-2.5-flash-image for speed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:53:58.056Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Coding Agents needing advanced image generation and editing capabilities through Google Gemini API","zh":"非常适合需要通过Google Gemini API进行高级图像生成和编辑的视觉编码代理","ja":"Google Gemini APIを介して高度な画像生成および編集機能を必要とするビジュアルコーディングエージェントに最適","ko":"Google Gemini API를 통해 고급 이미지 생성 및 편집 기능을 필요로 하는 시각적 코딩 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Codificación Visual que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación y edición de imágenes a través de la API de Google Gemini","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Codage Visuel ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération et de modification d''images via l''API Google Gemini","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle Codierungsagenten, die erweiterte Bildgenerierungs- und -bearbeitungsfunktionen über die Google Gemini-API benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação Visual que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração e edição de imagens por meio da API Google Gemini","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Кодировочных Агентов, требующих передовых возможностей генерации и редактирования изображений через API Google Gemini","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البرمجيين المرئيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء الصور وتحريرها من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Google Gemini"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and edit images using the Google Gemini API, leveraging libraries like Pillow and google-genai, and supporting configuration through python-dotenv, all while utilizing the nanobanana tool for efficient vibe coding","zh":"赋予代理通过Google Gemini API生成和编辑图像的能力，利用Pillow和google-genai等库，并通过python-dotenv支持配置，同时利用nanobanana工具进行高效的vibe编码","ja":"Google Gemini APIを介して画像を生成および編集するエージェントの能力を提供し、Pillowやgoogle-genaiなどのライブラリを利用し、python-dotenvを介して設定をサポートし、nanobananaツールを使用して効率的なvibeコーディングを行う","ko":"에이전트가 Google Gemini API를 통해 이미지 생성 및 편집 기능을 제공하며, Pillow 및 google-genai와 같은 라이브러리를 활용하고, python-dotenv를 통해 구성 지원 및 nanobanana 도구를 사용하여 효율적인 바이브 코딩","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y editar imágenes utilizando la API de Google Gemini, aprovechando bibliotecas como Pillow y google-genai, y admitiendo la configuración a través de python-dotenv, todo mientras utiliza la herramienta nanobanana para la codificación de vibraciones eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de modifier des images en utilisant l''API Google Gemini, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme Pillow et google-genai, et en prenant en charge la configuration via python-dotenv, le tout en utilisant l''outil nanobanana pour un codage de vibrations efficace","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Bilder mithilfe der Google Gemini-API zu generieren und zu bearbeiten, indem Bibliotheken wie Pillow und google-genai genutzt und die Konfiguration über python-dotenv unterstützt werden, während die nanobanana-Tool für effizientes Vibe-Coding verwendet wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e editar imagens usando a API Google Gemini, aproveitando bibliotecas como Pillow e google-genai, e suportando configuração através do python-dotenv, tudo isso utilizando a ferramenta nanobanana para codificação de vibração eficiente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и редактировать изображения с помощью API Google Gemini, используя библиотеки seperti Pillow и google-genai, и поддерживая конфигурацию через python-dotenv, все это при помощи инструмента nanobanana для эффективного кодирования вибраций","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء الصور وتحريرها باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Google Gemini، مستفيدة من المكتبات مثل Pillow وgoogle-genai، وداعمة للتحكم من خلال python-dotenv، وكل ذلك باستخدام أداة nanobanana للترميز الفعال"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating images for web applications","Editing existing images using the Google Gemini API","Automating image processing tasks with Python3 and dependent packages"],"zh":["为Web应用程序生成图像","使用Google Gemini API编辑现有图像","使用Python3和依赖包自动执行图像处理任务"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションのために画像を生成する","Google Gemini APIを使用して既存の画像を編集する","Python3と依存パッケージを使用して画像処理タスクを自動化する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 이미지 생성","Google Gemini API를 사용하여 기존 이미지를 편집","Python3 및 종속 패키지를 사용하여 이미지 처리 작업 자동화"],"es":["Generar imágenes para aplicaciones web","Editar imágenes existentes utilizando la API de Google Gemini","Automatizar tareas de procesamiento de imágenes con Python3 y paquetes dependientes"],"fr":["Générer des images pour les applications Web","Modifier des images existantes en utilisant l''API Google Gemini","Automatiser les tâches de traitement d''images avec Python3 et des packages dépendants"],"de":["Bilder für Webanwendungen generieren","Vorhandene Bilder mithilfe der Google Gemini-API bearbeiten","Bildverarbeitungsaufgaben mit Python3 und abhängigen Paketen automat