amenta de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho para ...","ru":"Ralph: Автоматизированный инструмент для разработчиков","ar":"رالف: أداة تلقائية لتنفيذ تطبيقات للطورين","en":"ralph"},"description":{"zh":"Ralph是一种自动化工作流构建工具，使用Claude Code描述需求和构建应用程序","ja":"Ralphは、Claude Codeを使用して必要なものを説明し、アプリケーションを構築する自動化ワークフロー構築ツールです","ko":"Ralph는 Claude Code를 사용하여 필요한 것을 설명하고 애플리케이션을 구축하는 자동화 워크플로우 구축 도구입니다","es":"Ralph es una herramienta de automatización de flujos de trabajo que permite a los desarrolladores crear aplicaciones de manera autónoma con Claude Code.","fr":"Ralph est un outil d''automatisation de flux de travail qui permet aux développeurs de créer des applications de manière autonome avec Claude Code.","de":"Ralph ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Workflows, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Anwendungen autonom mit Claude Code zu erstellen.","pt":"O Ralph é uma ferramenta de automação de fluxo de trabalho que permite aos desenvolvedores criar aplicativos de forma autônoma com Claude Code","ru":"Ralph - это инструмент для автоматизации рабочего процесса, который позволяет разработчикам создавать приложения автономно с помощью Claude Code","ar":"رالف هو أداة تلقائية لتنفيذ تطبيقات تمكن المطورين من إنشاء التطبيقات بشكل مستقل باستخدام Claude Code","en":"Automated workflow for building apps with Claude Code. Describe what you want, answer questions, let it build autonomously."},"definition":{"en":"Automated workflow for building apps with Claude Code. Describe what you want, answer questions, let it build autonomously."},"features":{"zh":["自动化工作流构建","使用Claude Code描述需求","自主构建应用程序","支持PRD转换","输出prd.json格式"],"ja":["自動化ワークフロー構築","Claude Codeを使用して必要なものを説明","自動でアプリケーションを構築","PRD変換をサポート","prd.json形式を出力"],"ko":["자동화 워크플로우 구축","Claude Code를 사용하여 필요한 것을 설명","자동으로 애플리케이션을 구축","PRD 변환을 지원","prd.json 형식을 출력"],"es":["Conversión de PRDs a formato prd.json","Ejecución autónoma de flujos de trabajo","Integración con Claude Code","Automatización de tareas de desarrollo","Mejora de la eficiencia del desarrollo"],"fr":["Conversion de PRDs au format prd.json","Exécution autonome de flux de travail","Intégration avec Claude Code","Automatisation des tâches de développement","Amélioration de l''efficacité du développement"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRDs in das prd.json-Format","Autonome Ausführung von Workflows","Integration mit Claude Code","Automatisierung von Entwicklungsaufgaben","Verbesserung der EntwicklungsEffizienz"],"pt":["Automação de fluxo de trabalho","Criação de aplicativos autônomos","Integração com Claude Code","Conversão de PRDs para formato prd.json","Execução autônoma de tarefas"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочего процесса","Создание автономных приложений","Интеграция с Claude Code","Преобразование PRD в формат prd.json","Автономное выполнение задач"],"ar":["التلقين التلقائي لتنفيذ التطبيقات","إنشاء تطبيقات مستقلة","التكامل مع Claude Code","تحويل PRDs إلى تنسيق prd.json","تنفيذ مهام تلقائي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动化工作流构建","Claude Code","应用程序构建","PRD转换","prd.json","Ralph","自动化工具"],"ja":["自動化ワークフロー構築","Claude Code","アプリケーション構築","PRD変換","prd.json","Ralph","自動化ツール"],"ko":["자동화 워크플로우 구축","Claude Code","애플리케이션 구축","PRD 변환","prd.json","Ralph","자동화 도구"],"es":["Ralph","automatización de flujos de trabajo","Claude Code","prd.json","desarrollo de aplicaciones","autonomía","eficiencia","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Ralph","automatisation de flux de travail","Claude Code","prd.json","développement d''applications","autonomie","efficacité","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Ralph","Automatisierung von Workflows","Claude Code","prd.json","Anwendungsentwicklung","Autonomie","Effizienz","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["automação de fluxo de trabalho","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","execução autônoma","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["автоматизация рабочего процесса","разработка приложений","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","автономное выполнение","разработчики"],"ar":["التلقين التلقائي لتنفيذ التطبيقات","تطوير التطبيقات","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","تنفيذ تلقائي","المطورين"]}},"owner":"rohunj","repo":"claude-build-workflow","repoPath":"rohunj/claude-build-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph","description":"Convert PRDs to prd.json format for the Ralph autonomous agent system. Use when you have an existing PRD and need to convert it to Ralphs JSON format. Triggers on: convert this prd, turn this into ralph format, create prd.json from this, ralph json.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph PRD Converter\n\nConverts existing PRDs to the prd.json format that Ralph uses for autonomous execution.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\nTake a PRD (markdown file or text) and convert it to `prd.json` in your ralph directory.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"[Project Name]\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/[feature-name-kebab-case]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Feature description from PRD title/intro]\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"[Story title]\",\n      \"description\": \"As","body":"# Ralph PRD Converter\n\nConverts existing PRDs to the prd.json format that Ralph uses for autonomous execution.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\nTake a PRD (markdown file or text) and convert it to `prd.json` in your ralph directory.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"[Project Name]\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/[feature-name-kebab-case]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Feature description from PRD title/intro]\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"[Story title]\",\n      \"description\": \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Criterion 1\",\n        \"Criterion 2\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Story Size: The Number One Rule\n\n**Each story must be completable in ONE Ralph iteration (one context window).**\n\nRalph spawns a fresh Amp instance per iteration with no memory of previous work. If a story is too big, the LLM runs out of context before finishing and produces broken code.\n\n### Right-sized stories:\n- Add a database column and migration\n- Add a UI component to an existing page\n- Update a server action with new logic\n- Add a filter dropdown to a list\n\n### Too big (split these):\n- \"Build the entire dashboard\" - Split into: schema, queries, UI components, filters\n- \"Add authentication\" - Split into: schema, middleware, login UI, session handling\n- \"Refactor the API\" - Split into one story per endpoint or pattern\n\n**Rule of thumb:** If you cannot describe the change in 2-3 sentences, it is too big.\n\n---\n\n## Story Ordering: Dependencies First\n\nStories execute in priority order. Earlier stories must not depend on later ones.\n\n**Correct order:**\n1. Schema/database changes (migrations)\n2. Server actions / backend logic\n3. UI components that use the backend\n4. Dashboard/summary views that aggregate data\n\n**Wrong order:**\n1. UI component (depends on schema that does not exist yet)\n2. Schema change\n\n---\n\n## Acceptance Criteria: Must Be Verifiable\n\nEach criterion must be something Ralph can CHECK, not something vague.\n\n### Good criteria (verifiable):\n- \"Add `status` column to tasks table with default ''pending''\"\n- \"Filter dropdown has options: All, Active, Completed\"\n- \"Clicking delete shows confirmation dialog\"\n- \"Typecheck passes\"\n- \"Tests pass\"\n\n### Bad criteria (vague):\n- \"Works correctly\"\n- \"User can do X easily\"\n- \"Good UX\"\n- \"Handles edge cases\"\n\n### Always include as final criterion:\n```\n\"Typecheck passes\"\n```\n\nFor stories with testable logic, also include:\n```\n\"Tests pass\"\n```\n\n### For stories that change UI, also include:\n```\n\"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n```\n\nFrontend stories are NOT complete until visually verified. Ralph will use the dev-browser skill to navigate to the page, interact with the UI, and confirm changes work.\n\n---\n\n## Conversion Rules\n\n1. **Each user story becomes one JSON entry**\n2. **IDs**: Sequential (US-001, US-002, etc.)\n3. **Priority**: Based on dependency order, then document order\n4. **All stories**: `passes: false` and empty `notes`\n5. **branchName**: Derive from feature name, kebab-case, prefixed with `ralph/`\n6. **Always add**: \"Typecheck passes\" to every story''s acceptance criteria\n\n---\n\n## Splitting Large PRDs\n\nIf a PRD has big features, split them:\n\n**Original:**\n> \"Add user notification system\"\n\n**Split into:**\n1. US-001: Add notifications table to database\n2. US-002: Create notification service for sending notifications\n3. US-003: Add notification bell icon to header\n4. US-004: Create notification dropdown panel\n5. US-005: Add mark-as-read functionality\n6. US-006: Add notification preferences page\n\nEach is one focused change that can be completed and verified independently.\n\n---\n\n## Example\n\n**Input PRD:**\n```markdown\n# Task Status Feature\n\nAdd ability to mark tasks with different statuses.\n\n## Requirements\n- Toggle between pending/in-progress/done on task list\n- Filter list by status\n- Show status badge on each task\n- Persist status in database\n```\n\n**Output prd.json:**\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"TaskApp\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/task-status\",\n  \"description\": \"Task Status Feature - Track task progress with status indicators\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Add status field to tasks table\",\n      \"description\": \"As a developer, I need to store task status in the database.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Add status column: ''pending'' | ''in_progress'' | ''done'' (default ''pending'')\",\n        \"Generate and run migration successfully\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Display status badge on task cards\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to see task status at a glance.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each task card shows colored status badge\",\n        \"Badge colors: gray=pending, blue=in_progress, green=done\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 2,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Add status toggle to task list rows\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to change task status directly from the list.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each row has status dropdown or toggle\",\n        \"Changing status saves immediately\",\n        \"UI updates without page refresh\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 3,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-004\",\n      \"title\": \"Filter tasks by status\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to filter the list to see only certain statuses.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Filter dropdown: All | Pending | In Progress | Done\",\n        \"Filter persists in URL params\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 4,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Archiving Previous Runs\n\n**Before writing a new prd.json, check if there is an existing one from a different feature:**\n\n1. Read the current `prd.json` if it exists\n2. Check if `branchName` differs from the new feature''s branch name\n3. If different AND `progress.txt` has content beyond the header:\n   - Create archive folder: `archive/YYYY-MM-DD-feature-name/`\n   - Copy current `prd.json` and `progress.txt` to archive\n   - Reset `progress.txt` with fresh header\n\n**The ralph.sh script handles this automatically** when you run it, but if you are manually updating prd.json between runs, archive first.\n\n---\n\n## Checklist Before Saving\n\nBefore writing prd.json, verify:\n\n- [ ] **Previous run archived** (if prd.json exists with different branchName, archive it first!)\n- [ ] **ALL stories have `passes: false`** (CRITICAL - never copy old pass status!)\n- [ ] Each story is completable in one iteration (small enough)\n- [ ] Stories are ordered by dependency (schema to backend to UI)\n- [ ] Every story has \"Typecheck passes\" as criterion\n- [ ] UI stories have \"Verify in browser\" as criterion\n- [ ] Acceptance criteria are verifiable (not vague)\n- [ ] No story depends on a later story\n\n## CRITICAL: Always Reset passes to false\n\nWhen creating a new prd.json, **ALWAYS** set `passes: false` for every story. Never:\n- Copy pass status from an old prd.json\n- Leave stories marked as `passes: true`\n- Assume previous work carries over\n\nEach new prd.json is a fresh start. The Ralph loop will mark stories as `passes: true` only after successfully implementing them.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:54:56.981Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Development Agents utilizing Claude Code for app building and workflow automation.","zh":"适用于使用 Claude Code 进行应用开发和工作流自动化的自主开发代理。","ja":"Claude Code を使用してアプリ開発とワークフローの自動化を行う自律開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드를 사용하여 애플리케이션 개발 및 워크플로 자동화를 수행하는 자율 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Autónomos que utilizan Claude Code para la creación de aplicaciones y la automatización de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement autonomes utilisant Claude Code pour la création d''applications et l''automatisation des flux de travail.","de":"Ideal für autonome Entwicklungssagenten, die Claude Code für die Erstellung von Anwendungen und die Automatisierung von Workflows verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Autônomo que utilizam Claude Code para construção de aplicativos e automação de fluxos de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов разработки, использующих Claude Code для создания приложений и автоматизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير المستقلة التي تستخدم Claude Code لبناء التطبيقات وآليّة اتخاذ الإجراءات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to autonomously execute workflows by converting existing PRDs to the prd.json format, leveraging markdown files or text, and utilizing the ralph directory for seamless project integration with JSON output formats.","zh":"使代理能够通过将现有的 PRD 转换为 prd.json 格式、利用 markdown 文件或文本以及利用 ralph 目录来实现无缝的项目集成和 JSON 输出格式来自治执行工作流。","ja":"エージェントが既存の PRD を prd.json 形式に変換し、マークダウンファイルまたはテキストを利用し、ralph ディレクトリを使用してプロジェクトの統合と JSON 出力形式を無縫に実現することで、ワークフローを自律的に実行できるようにします。","ko":"기존의 PRD를 prd.json 형식으로 변환하고, 마크다운 파일이나 텍스트를 활용하며, ralph 디렉토리를 사용하여 프로젝트 통합과 JSON 출력 형식을无缝하게 구현함으로써 에이전트가 워크플ロー를 자율적으로 실행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar flujos de trabajo de forma autónoma convirtiendo los PRD existentes al formato prd.json, aprovechando archivos markdown o texto y utilizando el directorio ralph para una integración de proyectos sin problemas con formatos de salida JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des flux de travail de manière autonome en convertissant les PRD existants au format prd.json, en exploitant les fichiers markdown ou le texte et en utilisant le répertoire ralph pour une intégration de projets transparente avec des formats de sortie JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Workflows autonom auszuführen, indem sie vorhandene PRD im prd.json-Format konvertieren, Markdown-Dateien oder Text nutzen und das ralph-Verzeichnis für eine nahtlose Projektintegration mit JSON-Ausgabeformaten verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar fluxos de trabalho de forma autônoma, convertendo PRDs existentes para o formato prd.json, utilizando arquivos markdown ou texto e utilizando o diretório ralph para integração de projeto sem interrupções com formatos de saída JSON.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автономно выполнять рабочие процессы, преобразуя существующие PRD в формат prd.json, используя файлы markdown или текст и используя каталог ralph для бесшовной интеграции проекта с форматами вывода JSON.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ سير العمل بشكل مستقل عن طريق تحويل مواصفات المنتج الموجودة إلى صيغة prd.json، واستخدام ملفات markdown أو نص، واستخدام دليل ralph من أجل دمج مشروع متكامل مع تنسيقات إخراج JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting PRDs to prd.json for autonomous execution","Automating app development workflows with Claude Code","Generating project configurations in ralph directory"],"zh":["将 PRD 转换为 prd.json 以实现自主执行","使用 Claude Code 自动化应用开发工作流","在 ralph 目录中生成项目配置"],"ja":["PRD を prd.json に変換して自律実行を可能にする","Claude Code を使用してアプリ開発ワークフローを自動化する","ralph ディレクトリ内でプロジェクト構成を生成する"],"ko":["PRD를 prd.json으로 변환하여 자율 실행을 가능하게 함","클라우드 코드를 사용하여 애플리케이션 개발 워크플ロー 자동화","ralph 디렉토리에서 프로젝트 구성 생성"],"es":["Conversión de PRD a prd.json para ejecución autónoma","Automatización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de aplicaciones con Claude Code","Generación de configuraciones de proyecto en el directorio ralph"],"fr":["Conversion de PRD en prd.json pour exécution autonome","Automatisation des flux de travail de développement d''applications avec Claude Code","Génération de configurations de projet dans le répertoire ralph"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRD in prd.json für autonome Ausführung","Automatisierung von App-Entwicklungsworkflows mit Claude Code","Generierung von Projekt-Konfigurationen im ralph-Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Conversão de PRDs para prd.json para execução autônoma","Automação de fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de aplicativos com Claude Code","Geração de configurações de projeto no diretório ralph"],"ru":["Преобразование PRD в формат prd.json для автономного выполнения","Автоматизация рабочих процессов разработки приложений с помощью Claude Code","Генерация конфигураций проекта в каталоге ralph"],"ar":["تحويل مواصفات المنتج إلى صيغة prd.json من أجل التنفيذ المستقل","آليّة تطوير التطبيقات مع Claude Code","توليد تكوين المشروع في دليل ralph"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing PRD in markdown or text format","Specific to ralph directory and prd.json format"],"zh":["需要现有的 PRD 以 markdown 或文本格式存在","仅限于 ralph 目录和 prd.json 格式"],"ja":["既存の PRD がマークダウンまたはテキスト形式で存在する必要がある","ralph ディレクトリと prd.json 形式に限定される"],"ko":["기존의 PRD가 마크다운 또는 텍스트 형식으로 존재해야 함","ralph 디렉토리와 prd.json 형식으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un PRD existente en formato markdown o texto","Específico del directorio ralph y del formato prd.json"],"fr":["Nécessite un PRD existant au format markdown ou texte","Spécifique au répertoire ralph et au format prd.json"],"de":["Benötigt ein vorhandenes PRD im Markdown- oder Textformat","Spezifisch für das ralph-Verzeichnis und das prd.json-Format"],"pt":["Exige PRD existente em formato markdown ou texto","Específico para diretório ralph e formato prd.json"],"ru":["Требует существующей PRD в формате markdown или текста","Специфичен для каталога ralph и формата prd.json"],"ar":["يتطلب مواصفات منتج موجودة في صيغة markdown أو نص","محدد لدليل ralph و صيغة prd.json"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a6a8733abaee5b370957ebd6745a56db88712697fc1262f388d2438b6bbcc021","qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/React Native Performance', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'React Native Performance', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:55:25.453Z', '06763d1c451303cb236d53be0bd99260296270d4ca621a6bf4387a1ca8ee469d', '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/React Native Performance","name":"React Native Performance","description":{"zh":"React Native , windowSize, getItemLayout, removeClippedSubviews","ja":"React Native, windowSize, getItemLayout, removeClippedSubviews","ko":"React Native , windowSize, getItemLayout, removeClippedSubviews","es":"Aprenda a mejorar el rendimiento de sus aplicaciones de React Native con técnicas de optimización como FlatList y useCallback","fr":"Découvrez comment améliorer les performances de vos applications React Native avec des techniques d''optimisation comme FlatList et useCallback","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Leistung Ihrer React Native-Anwendungen mit Optimierungstechniken wie FlatList und useCallback verbessern können","pt":"Otimização de desempenho do React Native é crucial para garantir uma experiência de usuário fluída. Aprenda técnicas de otimização como FlatList e evitar funções anônimas","ru":"Оптимизация производительности React Native имеет решающее значение для обеспечения плавного пользовательского опыта. Узнайте техники оптимизации, такие как FlatList и избегайте анонимных функций","ar":"تحسين أداء رياكت نيتيف ضروري لضمان تجربة مستخدم سلسة. تعلم تقنيات تحسين الأداء مثل FlatList وتجنب الوظائف المجهولة","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"React Native ","ja":"React Native","ko":"React Native ","es":"Mejora del Rendimiento de React Native","fr":"Améliorer les Performances de React Native","de":"React Native Leistungsverbesserung","pt":"Otimização de Desempenho do React Native","ru":"Оптимизация производительности React Native","ar":"تحسين أداء رياكت نيتيف","en":"React Native Performance"},"description":{"zh":"React Native , windowSize, getItemLayout, removeClippedSubviews","ja":"React Native, windowSize, getItemLayout, removeClippedSubviews","ko":"React Native , windowSize, getItemLayout, removeClippedSubviews","es":"Aprenda a mejorar el rendimiento de sus aplicaciones de React Native con técnicas de optimización como FlatList y useCallback","fr":"Découvrez comment améliorer les performances de vos applications React Native avec des techniques d''optimisation comme FlatList et useCallback","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Leistung Ihrer React Native-Anwendungen mit Optimierungstechniken wie FlatList und useCallback verbessern können","pt":"Otimização de desempenho do React Native é crucial para garantir uma experiência de usuário fluída. Aprenda técnicas de otimização como FlatList e evitar fun...","ru":"Оптимизация производительности React Native имеет решающее значение для обеспечения плавного пользовательского опыта. Узнайте техники оптимизации, такие как ...","ar":"تحسين أداء رياكت نيتيف ضروري لضمان تجربة مستخدم سلسة. تعلم تقنيات تحسين الأداء مثل FlatList وتجنب الوظائف المجهولة","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["windowSize","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Avoid Anonymous Functions"],"ja":["windowSize","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Avoid Anonymous Functions"],"ko":["windowSize","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Avoid Anonymous Functions"],"es":["Optimización de FlatList","Uso de useCallback","Mejora del rendimiento de la lista","Reducción del tamaño de la ventana","Uso de identificadores únicos","Evitación de funciones anónimas"],"fr":["Optimisation de FlatList","Utilisation de useCallback","Amélioration des performances de la liste","Réduction de la taille de la fenêtre","Utilisation d''identifiants uniques","Évitement des fonctions anonymes"],"de":["Optimierung von FlatList","Verwendung von useCallback","Leistungsverbesserung der Liste","Größenreduzierung des Fensters","Verwendung eindeutiger Identifikatoren","Vermeidung von anonymen Funktionen"],"pt":["Otimização de FlatList","Definição de getItemLayout","Ativação de removeClippedSubviews","Limitação de maxToRenderPerBatch","Uso de keyExtractor","Evitar funções anônimas"],"ru":["Оптимизация FlatList","Определение getItemLayout","Активация removeClippedSubviews","Ограничение maxToRenderPerBatch","Использование keyExtractor","Избегание анонимных функций"],"ar":["تحسين FlatList","تعريف getItemLayout","تنشيط removeClippedSubviews","تحديد الحد الأقصى ل maxToRenderPerBatch","استخدام keyExtractor","تجنب الوظائف المجهولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native","React Native ","windowSize","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Avoid Anonymous Functions"],"ja":["React Native","React Native","windowSize","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Avoid Anonymous Functions"],"ko":["React Native","React Native ","windowSize","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Avoid Anonymous Functions"],"es":["React Native","rendimiento","optimización","FlatList","useCallback","desempeño de la lista","técnicas de optimización","mejora del rendimiento"],"fr":["React Native","performances","optimisation","FlatList","useCallback","performances de la liste","techniques d''optimisation","amélioration des performances"],"de":["React Native","Leistung","Optimierung","FlatList","useCallback","Leistung der Liste","Optimierungstechniken","Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["React Native","Otimização de desempenho","FlatList","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Funções anônimas"],"ru":["React Native","Оптимизация производительности","FlatList","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Анонимные функции"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","FlatList","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","الوظائف المجهولة"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"React Native Performance","description":"Optimization strategies for smooth 60fps mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# React Native Performance\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\n## FlatList Optimization\n\n- **windowSize**: Reduce to 5-10 for long lists (default 21).\n- **getItemLayout**: Provide for fixed-height items. Skips measurement.\n- **removeClippedSubviews**: Enable for Android (default true).\n- **maxToRenderPerBatch**: Limit to 5-10 items per frame.\n- **keyExtractor**: Use stable unique IDs, never index.\n- **Avoid Anonymous Functions**: Define `renderItem` outside component or use `useCallback`.\n\n## React","body":"# React Native Performance\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\n## FlatList Optimization\n\n- **windowSize**: Reduce to 5-10 for long lists (default 21).\n- **getItemLayout**: Provide for fixed-height items. Skips measurement.\n- **removeClippedSubviews**: Enable for Android (default true).\n- **maxToRenderPerBatch**: Limit to 5-10 items per frame.\n- **keyExtractor**: Use stable unique IDs, never index.\n- **Avoid Anonymous Functions**: Define `renderItem` outside component or use `useCallback`.\n\n## React Optimization\n\n- **React.memo**: Wrap presentational components to prevent re-renders.\n- **useMemo**: Cache expensive calculations.\n- **useCallback**: Stabilize function refs for child props.\n- **Avoid Inline Objects**: Extract to constants or `useMemo`.\n\n## Navigation\n\n- **Lazy Screens**: Use `lazy` prop for stack screens (enabled by default).\n- **Avoid Listeners**: Remove navigation event listeners in cleanup.\n\n## Images\n\n- **Image Caching**: Use `react-native-fast-image` for network images.\n- **Resize**: Provide `resizeMode` and fixed dimensions.\n- **Format**: Use WebP for smaller size.\n\n## Bundle Size\n\n- **Hermes**: Enable for faster startup (default in RN 0.70+).\n- **Tree Shaking**: Remove unused imports.\n- **ProGuard/R8**: Enable code shrinking on Android.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **No ScrollView for Large Lists**: Use FlatList.\n- **No Inline Styles**: Use `StyleSheet.create` (optimized).\n- **No console.log in Production**: Strip with babel plugin.\n\n## Reference & Examples\n\nSee [references/optimization-guide.md](references/optimization-guide.md) for FlatList configuration, memoization rules, and bundle analysis.\n\n## Related Topics\n\nreact/performance | common/performance-engineering\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:55:25.453Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile App Agents focused on optimizing React Native applications for seamless user experiences.","zh":"适用于专注于优化React Native应用以提供无缝用户体验的移动应用代理。","ja":"React Nativeアプリケーションを無制限なユーザーエクスペリエンスのために最適化することに重点を置いたモバイルアプリエージェントに最適です。","ko":"무결점의 사용자 경험을 제공하기 위해 리액트 네이티브 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de aplicaciones móviles centrados en optimizar aplicaciones de React Native para experiencias de usuario sin problemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''applications mobiles axés sur l''optimisation des applications React Native pour des expériences utilisateur sans problème.","de":"Ideal für Mobile-App-Agents, die auf die Optimierung von React-Native-Anwendungen für eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung ausgerichtet sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis focados na otimização de aplicativos React Native para experiências de usuário sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, ориентированных на оптимизацию приложений React Native для бесшовного пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الجوال الذين يركزون على تحسين تطبيقات React Native لتجارب المستخدم бесшов"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enhance React Native performance by leveraging FlatList optimizations, such as configuring windowSize, getItemLayout, and removeClippedSubviews, while also avoiding anonymous functions and utilizing stable unique IDs for keyExtractor, thereby improving overall app responsiveness and efficiency.","zh":"赋予代理增强React Native性能的能力，方法是利用FlatList优化，例如配置windowSize、getItemLayout和removeClippedSubviews，同时避免匿名函数，并利用稳定的唯一ID来获取keyExtractor，从而提高整个应用的响应速度和效率。","ja":"FlatListの最適化（windowSize、getItemLayout、removeClippedSubviewsの構成など）を利用して、React Nativeのパフォーマンスを強化するエージェントの能力を付与します。また、アノニマス関数を避け、keyExtractorの取得に安定した一意のIDを使用することで、アプリの全体的なレスポンス性と効率を向上させます。","ko":"플랫리스트 최적화를 활용하여 리액트 네이티브 성능을 강화할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. 예를 들어, windowSize, getItemLayout 및 removeClippedSubviews를 구성하며, 익명 함수를 피하고, keyExtractor의 가져오기에 안정적인 고유 ID를 사용하여, 전체 애플리케이션의 응답 속도와 효율성을 향상합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mejorar el rendimiento de React Native mediante la utilización de optimizaciones de FlatList, como la configuración de windowSize, getItemLayout y removeClippedSubviews, y al mismo tiempo evitar funciones anónimas y utilizar identificadores únicos estables para keyExtractor, lo que mejora la respuesta y la eficiencia generales de la aplicación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''améliorer les performances de React Native en exploitant les optimisations de FlatList, telles que la configuration de windowSize, getItemLayout et removeClippedSubviews, tout en évitant les fonctions anonymes et en utilisant des ID uniques stables pour keyExtractor, ce qui améliore la réactivité et l''efficacité globales de l''application.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Leistung von React Native zu verbessern, indem FlatList-Optimierungen wie die Konfiguration von windowSize, getItemLayout und removeClippedSubviews genutzt werden, während gleichzeitig anonyme Funktionen vermieden und stabile eindeutige IDs für keyExtractor verwendet werden, um so die Gesamtreaktivität und -effizienz der App zu verbessern.","pt":"Permite que os agentes melhorem o desempenho do React Native, aproveitando as otimizações do FlatList, como configurar windowSize, getItemLayout e removeClippedSubviews, além de evitar funções anônimas e utilizar IDs únicos estáveis para keyExtractor, melhorando assim a responsividade e eficiência geral do aplicativo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам повысить производительность React Native, используя оптимизации FlatList, такие как настройка windowSize, getItemLayout и removeClippedSubviews, а также избегая анонимных функций и используя стабильные уникальные идентификаторы для keyExtractor, тем самым улучшая общую отзывчивость и эффективность приложения.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تحسين أداء React Native من خلال الاستفادة من تحسينات FlatList، مثل تكوين windowSize وgetItemLayout وremoveClippedSubviews، بالإضافة إلى تجنب الدوال المجهولة واستخدام معرفات فريدة مستقرة لـ keyExtractor، مما يحسن من الاستجابة والفعالية العامة للتطبيق"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing long lists in React Native applications","Improving app performance on Android devices by enabling removeClippedSubviews","Enhancing rendering efficiency by limiting maxToRenderPerBatch and using useCallback for renderItem functions"],"zh":["在React Native应用中优化长列表","通过在Android设备上启用removeClippedSubviews来提高应用性能","通过限制maxToRenderPerBatch并为renderItem函数使用useCallback来提高渲染效率"],"ja":["React Nativeアプリケーション内の長いリストを最適化する","Androidデバイス上でremoveClippedSubviewsを有効にしてアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを向上させる","maxToRenderPerBatchの制限とrenderItem関数のuseCallbackを使用してレンダリング効率を向上させる"],"ko":["리액트 네이티브 애플리케이션에서 긴 목록을 최적화하는 것","안드로이드 기기에서 removeClippedSubviews를 활성화하여 애플리케이션 성능을 향상시키는 것","maxToRenderPerBatch 제한 및 renderItem 함수의 useCallback 사용으로 렌더링 효율성을 높이는 것"],"es":["Optimizar listas largas en aplicaciones de React Native","Mejorar el rendimiento de la aplicación en dispositivos Android habilitando removeClippedSubviews","Mejorar la eficiencia de renderizado limitando maxToRenderPerBatch y utilizando useCallback para funciones renderItem"],"fr":["Optimiser les listes longues dans les applications React Native","Améliorer les performances de l''application sur les appareils Android en activant removeClippedSubviews","Améliorer l''efficacité de rendu en limitant maxToRenderPerBatch et en utilisant useCallback pour les fonctions renderItem"],"de":["Optimieren von langen Listen in React-Native-Anwendungen","Verbesserung der App-Leistung auf Android-Geräten durch Aktivierung von removeClippedSubviews","Verbesserung der Render-Effizienz durch Begrenzung von maxToRenderPerBatch und Verwendung von useCallback für renderItem-Funktionen"],"pt":["Otimizando listas longas em aplicativos React Native","Melhorando o desempenho do aplicativo em dispositivos Android, habilitando removeClippedSubviews","Aumentando a eficiência de renderização, limitando maxToRenderPerBatch e usando useCallback para funções renderItem"],"ru":["Оптимизация длинных списков в приложениях React Native","Улучшение производительности приложения на устройствах Android, включая removeClippedSubviews","Повышение эффективности рендеринга, ограничивая maxToRenderPerBatch и используя useCallback для функций renderItem"],"ar":["تحسين القوائم الطويلة في تطبيقات React Native","تحسين أداء التطبيق على أجهزة Android من خلال تمكين removeClippedSubviews","تعزيز كفاءة العرض، بتحديد الحد الأقصى لعدد العناصر التي سيتم عرضها في الدفعة واستخدام useCallback للدوال renderItem"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React Native and its components","Limited to optimizing FlatList and related components","May require adjustments based on specific app requirements and device platforms"],"zh":["需要了解React Native及其组件","仅限于优化FlatList和相关组件","可能需要根据特定应用需求和设备平台进行调整"],"ja":["React Nativeとそのコンポーネントの知識が必要","FlatListと関連コンポーネントの最適化のみに限定される","特定のアプリケーション要件とデバイスプラットフォームに基づいて調整が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["리액트 네이티브及其 구성요소에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","플랫리스트 및 관련 구성요소의 최적화에만 한정됨","특정 애플리케이션 요구 사항 및 장치 플랫폼에 따라 조정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React Native y sus componentes","Limitado a la optimización de FlatList y componentes relacionados","Puede requerir ajustes basados en requisitos de aplicaciones y plataformas de dispositivos específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React Native et ses composants","Limité à l''optimisation de FlatList et des composants associés","Peut nécessiter des ajustements basés sur les exigences spécifiques des applications et des plateformes de périphériques"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React Native und dessen Komponenten","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von FlatList und verwandten Komponenten","Kann Anpassungen basierend auf spezifischen App-Anforderungen und Geräteplattformen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React Native e seus componentes","Limitado à otimização do FlatList e componentes relacionados","Pode exigir ajustes com base em requisitos específicos do aplicativo e plataformas de dispositivos"],"ru":["Требует знания React Native и его компонентов","Ограничен оптимизацией FlatList и связанных компонентов","Может потребовать корректировки на основе конкретных требований приложения и платформ устройств"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React Native ومكوناته","محدود بتحسين FlatList والمكونات ذات الصلة","قد يتطلب تعديلات dựa على متطلبات تطبيق محددة ومنصات الأجهزة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"06763d1c451303cb236d53be0bd99260296270d4ca621a6bf4387a1ca8ee469d","qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rmyndharis/antigravity-skills/fastapi-templates', 'community', 'rmyndharis', 'antigravity-skills', 'rmyndharis/antigravity-skills', 'fastapi-templates', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:55:22.945Z', '281d79d7bb9e8cbd1cbae1411e80a143b4dc253b02a5284d2a29bb2fa7a176f7', '{"id":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills/fastapi-templates","name":"fastapi-templates","description":{"en":"A curated collection of Agent Skills for Google Antigravity"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"fastapi-templates"},"description":{"en":"A curated collection of Agent Skills for Google Antigravity"},"definition":{"en":"A curated collection of Agent Skills for Google Antigravity"},"features":{"en":[]},"keywords":{"en":[]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fastapi-templates","description":"Create production-ready FastAPI projects with async patterns, dependency injection, and comprehensive error handling. Use when building new FastAPI applications or setting up backend API projects.","bodyPreview":"# FastAPI Project Templates\n\nProduction-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, middleware, and best practices for building high-performance APIs.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting new FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Implementing async REST APIs with Python\n- Building high-performance web services and microservices\n- Creating async applications with PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing\n\n## Do not use this skill when","body":"# FastAPI Project Templates\n\nProduction-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, middleware, and best practices for building high-performance APIs.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting new FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Implementing async REST APIs with Python\n- Building high-performance web services and microservices\n- Creating async applications with PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to fastapi project templates\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns and examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:55:22.945Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Backend Development Agents building high-performance async APIs with FastAPI.","zh":"Ideal for Backend Development Agents building high-performance async APIs with FastAPI.","ja":"Ideal for Backend Development Agents building high-performance async APIs with FastAPI.","ko":"Ideal for Backend Development Agents building high-performance async APIs with FastAPI.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de backend que crean APIs asíncronas de alto rendimiento con FastAPI.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement de backend qui créent des API asynchrones à haute performance avec FastAPI.","de":"Ideal für Backend-Entwicklungsagenten, die Hochleistungs-Async-APIs mit FastAPI erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Backend que constroem APIs de alto desempenho assíncronas com FastAPI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бэкенд-разработки, строящих высокопроизводительные асинхронные API с FastAPI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطور الخلفية لبناء APIsعالية الأداء غير متزامنة مع FastAPI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides production-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, and middleware configurations. Enables rapid setup of high-performance web services and microservices with PostgreSQL or MongoDB integration.","zh":"Provides production-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, and middleware configurations. Enables rapid setup of high-performance web services and microservices with PostgreSQL or MongoDB integration.","ja":"Provides production-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, and middleware configurations. Enables rapid setup of high-performance web services and microservices with PostgreSQL or MongoDB integration.","ko":"Provides production-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, and middleware configurations. Enables rapid setup of high-performance web services and microservices with PostgreSQL or MongoDB integration.","es":"Proporciona estructuras de proyecto de FastAPI listas para producción con patrones asíncronos, inyección de dependencias y configuraciones de middleware. Permite la configuración rápida de servicios web y microservicios de alto rendimiento con integración de PostgreSQL o MongoDB.","fr":"Fournit des structures de projet FastAPI prêtes pour la production avec des modèles asynchrones, une injection de dépendances et des configurations de middleware. Permet la configuration rapide de services web et de microservices à haute performance avec une intégration PostgreSQL ou MongoDB.","de":"Bietet produktionsreife FastAPI-Projektstrukturen mit asynchronen Mustern, Abhängigkeitsinjektion und Middleware-Konfigurationen. Ermöglicht die schnelle Einrichtung von Hochleistungs-Webdiensten und Microservices mit PostgreSQL- oder MongoDB-Integration.","pt":"Fornece estruturas de projeto FastAPI prontas para produção com padrões assíncronos, injeção de dependência e configurações de middleware. Permite a configuração rápida de serviços web e microsserviços de alto desempenho com integração PostgreSQL ou MongoDB.","ru":"Предоставляет готовые к производству структуры проектов FastAPI с асинхронными паттернами, внедрением зависимостей и конфигурациями middleware. Позволяет быстро настраивать веб-сервисы и микросервисы с высоким уровнем производительности с интеграцией PostgreSQL или MongoDB.","ar":"يوفر هياكل مشروع FastAPI جاهزة للإنتاج مع أنماط غير متزامنة وحقن التبعية وتفاصيل التهيئة. يتيح الإعداد السريع لخدمات الويب والميكروسيرفيسات عالية الأداء مع دمج PostgreSQL أو MongoDB."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new FastAPI projects with proper async structure","Implementing dependency injection patterns for API endpoints","Configuring middleware for high-performance web services"],"zh":["Scaffolding new FastAPI projects with proper async structure","Implementing dependency injection patterns for API endpoints","Configuring middleware for high-performance web services"],"ja":["Scaffolding new FastAPI projects with proper async structure","Implementing dependency injection patterns for API endpoints","Configuring middleware for high-performance web services"],"ko":["Scaffolding new FastAPI projects with proper async structure","Implementing dependency injection patterns for API endpoints","Configuring middleware for high-performance web services"],"es":["Crear estructuras de proyecto de FastAPI nuevo con estructura asíncrona adecuada","Implementar patrones de inyección de dependencias para puntos finales de API","Configurar middleware para servicios web de alto rendimiento"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles structures de projet FastAPI avec une structure asynchrone appropriée","Implémenter des modèles d''injection de dépendances pour les points de terminaison de l''API","Configurer le middleware pour les services web à haute performance"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen FastAPI-Projektstrukturen mit geeigneter asynchroner Struktur","Implementieren von Abhängigkeitsinjektionsmustern für API-Endpunkte","Konfigurieren von Middleware für Hochleistungs-Webdienste"],"pt":["Criação de novos projetos FastAPI com estrutura assíncrona adequada","Implementação de padrões de injeção de dependência para pontos de extremidade de API","Configuração de middleware para serviços web de alto desempenho"],"ru":["Создание новых проектов FastAPI с правильной асинхронной структурой","Реализация паттернов внедрения зависимостей для конечных точек API","Настройка middleware для веб-сервисов с высоким уровнем производительности"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع FastAPI جديدة مع هيكل غير متزامن مناسب","تنفيذ أنماط حقن التبعية لنقاط النهاية API","تهيئة middleware لخدمات الويب عالية الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["FastAPI-specific implementation only","Requires Python async environment","Primarily focused on PostgreSQL/MongoDB backends"],"zh":["FastAPI-specific implementation only","Requires Python async environment","Primarily focused on PostgreSQL/MongoDB backends"],"ja":["FastAPI-specific implementation only","Requires Python async environment","Primarily focused on PostgreSQL/MongoDB backends"],"ko":["FastAPI-specific implementation only","Requires Python async environment","Primarily focused on PostgreSQL/MongoDB backends"],"es":["Implementación específica de FastAPI solo","Requiere entorno asíncrono de Python","Se centra principalmente en backends de PostgreSQL/MongoDB"],"fr":["Implémentation spécifique à FastAPI uniquement","Nécessite un environnement asynchrone Python","Se concentre principalement sur les backends PostgreSQL/MongoDB"],"de":["Nur FastAPI-spezifische Implementierung","Benötigt asynchrones Python-Umfeld","Konzentriert sich in erster Linie auf PostgreSQL/MongoDB-Backends"],"pt":["Implementação específica do FastAPI apenas","Requer ambiente assíncrono Python","Focado principalmente em backends PostgreSQL/MongoDB"],"ru":["Только реализация специфичная для FastAPI","Требуется асинхронная среда Python","В основном ориентирован на бэкенды PostgreSQL/MongoDB"],"ar":["تنفيذ محدد ل FastAPI فقط","يتطلب بيئة غير متزامنة Python","يركز بشكل رئيسي على الخلفيات PostgreSQL/MongoDB"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"281d79d7bb9e8cbd1cbae1411e80a143b4dc253b02a5284d2a29bb2fa7a176f7","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/iOS Dependency Injection', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'iOS Dependency Injection', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:55:24.126Z', 'e2e2907b0582d740408cf2106b0fffabdacafd2304b89ca7f98aa9571c5a2bd5', '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/iOS Dependency Injection","name":"iOS Dependency Injection","description":{"zh":"iOS,Protocol-Based DI,Modern Property Wrappers","ja":"iOS,Protocol-Based DI,Modern Property Wrappers","ko":"iOS,Protocol-Based DI,Modern Property Wrappers","es":"La inyección de dependencias en iOS es una técnica de programación que permite una mayor flexibilidad y reutilización de código. Nuestro enfoque proporciona una guía detallada para implementar esta técnica de manera efectiva","fr":"L''injection de dépendances dans iOS est une technique de programmation qui permet une plus grande flexibilité et réutilisation de code. Notre approche fournit un guide détaillé pour mettre en œuvre cette technique de manière efficace","de":"Die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in iOS ist eine ProgrammierTechnik, die eine größere Flexibilität und Wiederverwendbarkeit von Code ermöglicht. Unser Ansatz bietet eine detaillierte Anleitung zur effektiven Implementierung dieser Technik","pt":"Injeção de dependência em iOS é uma técnica para gerenciar dependências entre objetos, melhorando a testabilidade e manutenção do código.","ru":"Внедрение зависимостей в iOS - это техника для управления зависимостями между объектами, улучшающая тестируемость и поддержку кода.","ar":"حقن التبعية في iOS هو تقنية لتدبير التبعيات بين الكائنات، مما يحسن من قابليتها للتجريبและการصيانة","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"iOS ","ja":"iOS","ko":"iOS ","es":"Inyección de Dependencias en iOS","fr":"Injection de Dépendances iOS","de":"iOS Abhängigkeitsinjektion","pt":"Injeção de Dependência iOS","ru":"Внедрение зависимостей в iOS","ar":"حقن التبعية في iOS","en":"iOS Dependency Injection"},"description":{"zh":"iOS,Protocol-Based DI,Modern Property Wrappers","ja":"iOS,Protocol-Based DI,Modern Property Wrappers","ko":"iOS,Protocol-Based DI,Modern Property Wrappers","es":"La inyección de dependencias en iOS es una técnica de programación que permite una mayor flexibilidad y reutilización de código. Nuestro enfoque proporciona ...","fr":"L''injection de dépendances dans iOS est une technique de programmation qui permet une plus grande flexibilité et réutilisation de code. Notre approche fourni...","de":"Die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in iOS ist eine ProgrammierTechnik, die eine größere Flexibilität und Wiederverwendbarkeit von Code ermöglicht. Unser Ansatz biete...","pt":"Injeção de dependência em iOS é uma técnica para gerenciar dependências entre objetos, melhorando a testabilidade e manutenção do código.","ru":"Внедрение зависимостей в iOS - это техника для управления зависимостями между объектами, улучшающая тестируемость и поддержку кода.","ar":"حقن التبعية في iOS هو تقنية لتدبير التبعيات بين الكائنات، مما يحسن من قابليتها للتجريبและการصيانة","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["Protocol-Based DI","Modern Property Wrappers","Initializer Injection","Factory","Swinject"],"ja":["Protocol-Based DI","Modern Property Wrappers","Initializer Injection","Factory","Swinject"],"ko":["Protocol-Based DI","Modern Property Wrappers","Initializer Injection","Factory","Swinject"],"es":["Inyección de dependencias basada en protocolos","Uso de inicializadores para pasar dependencias","Inyección de abstracciones en lugar de clases concretas","Uso de la biblioteca Factory para una inyección de dependencias ligera","Integración con Swinject para contenedores de grado empresarial"],"fr":["Injection de dépendances basée sur les protocoles","Utilisation d''initialiseurs pour passer les dépendances","Injection d''abstractions au lieu de classes concrètes","Utilisation de la bibliothèque Factory pour une injection de dépendances légère","Intégration avec Swinject pour des conteneurs de grade entreprise"],"de":["Abhängigkeitsinjektion basierend auf Protokollen","Verwendung von Initialisierern zum Übergeben von Abhängigkeiten","Injektion von Abstraktionen anstelle von konkreten Klassen","Verwendung der Factory-Bibliothek für eine leichte Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Integration mit Swinject für Containern im Unternehmensbereich"],"pt":["Injeção de dependência baseada em protocolos","Injeção de inicializadores","Uso de abstrações para facilitar testes","Uso da biblioteca Factory para injeção de dependência","Uso da biblioteca Swinject para contêineres de dependência"],"ru":["Внедрение зависимостей на основе протоколов","Внедрение инициализаторов","Использование абстракций для облегчения тестирования","Использование библиотеки Factory для внедрения зависимостей","Использование библиотеки Swinject для контейнеров зависимостей"],"ar":["حقن التبعية المستندة إلى البروتوكولات","حقن المُبادئ","استخدام التstractions لتسهيل الاختبارات","استخدام مكتبة Factory لحقن التبعية","استخدام مكتبة Swinject لحاويات التبعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iOS","Dependency Injection","Protocol-Based DI","Modern Property Wrappers","Initializer Injection","Factory","Swinject"],"ja":["iOS","Dependency Injection","Protocol-Based DI","Modern Property Wrappers","Initializer Injection","Factory","Swinject"],"ko":["iOS","Dependency Injection","Protocol-Based DI","Modern Property Wrappers","Initializer Injection","Factory","Swinject"],"es":["inyección de dependencias","iOS","programación","diseño de software","protocolos","inicializadores","abstracciones","Factory","Swinject"],"fr":["injection de dépendances","iOS","programmation","conception de logiciel","protocoles","initialiseurs","abstractions","Factory","Swinject"],"de":["Abhängigkeitsinjektion","iOS","Programmierung","Software-Design","Protokolle","Initialisierer","Abstraktionen","Factory","Swinject"],"pt":["injeção de dependência ios","desenvolvimento de software ios","padrões de design de software","testabilidade de código","manutenção de código","injeção de dependência baseada em protocolos"],"ru":["внедрение зависимостей ios","разработка программного обеспечения ios","паттерны проектирования программного обеспечения","тестируемость кода","поддержка кода","внедрение зависимостей на основе протоколов"],"ar":["حقن التبعية ios","تطوير البرمجيات ios","أنماط تصميم البرمجيات","قابلية الاختبار","صيانة الكود","حقن التبعية المستندة إلى البروتوكولات"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"iOS Dependency Injection","description":"Standards for Protocol-based DI, Property Wrappers, and Factory/Needle.","bodyPreview":"# iOS Dependency Injection Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Protocol-Based DI (Manual)\n\n- **Initializer Injection**: Preferred method. Pass dependencies through `init`.\n- **Abstractions**: Inject protocols instead of concrete classes to facilitate testing (Mocks/Stubs).\n\n### Modern Property Wrappers (Factory/Resolver)\n\n- **Factory**: Use the `Factory` library for lightweight, type-safe navigation-friendly DI.\n- **Swinject**: Use for enterprise-grade container-bas","body":"# iOS Dependency Injection Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Protocol-Based DI (Manual)\n\n- **Initializer Injection**: Preferred method. Pass dependencies through `init`.\n- **Abstractions**: Inject protocols instead of concrete classes to facilitate testing (Mocks/Stubs).\n\n### Modern Property Wrappers (Factory/Resolver)\n\n- **Factory**: Use the `Factory` library for lightweight, type-safe navigation-friendly DI.\n- **Swinject**: Use for enterprise-grade container-based DI in large modular projects.\n- **Injected**: Use `@Injected` property wrappers for cleaner syntax in ViewModels.\n\n### Scoping\n\n- **Singleton**: Use for app-wide services (Auth, Network, Database).\n- **Unique/Transient**: Default for ViewModels and temporary workers.\n- **Graph/Cached**: Use for shared data within a specific feature flow (Coordinator scope).\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Singletitis**: `**No global Shared singleton access everywhere**: Inject the service via initializer.`\n- **Service Locator**: `**No Resolver.resolve() inside logic**: Pass dependency via constructor or property wrapper.`\n- **Concrete Dependency**: `**No direct class instantiation**: Depend on protocols for testability.`\n\n## References\n\n- [Manual & Library DI Setup](references/implementation.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:55:24.126Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Swift-based AI Agents needing robust iOS app development with Dependency Injection frameworks like Factory and Swinject.","zh":"非常适合需要在iOS应用开发中使用依赖注入框架（如Factory和Swinject）的Swift-based AI代理","ja":"SwiftベースのAIエージェントがiOSアプリ開発で依存性注入フレームワーク（FactoryやSwinjectなど）を使用する場合に最適","ko":"Swift 기반 AI 에이전트가 iOS 애플리케이션 개발에서 디펜던시 인젝션 프레임워크(예: Factory 및 Swinject)를 사용해야 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Swift que necesitan un desarrollo de aplicaciones de iOS robusto con marcos de inyección de dependencias como Factory y Swinject.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Swift qui nécessitent un développement d''applications iOS robuste avec des frameworks d''injection de dépendances tels que Factory et Swinject.","de":"Perfekt für auf Swift basierende KI-Agents, die eine robuste iOS-App-Entwicklung mit Abhängigkeitsinjektionsframeworks wie Factory und Swinject benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Swift que precisam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos iOS robusto com frameworks de Injeção de Dependência como Factory e Swinject.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Swift, которым требуется надежная разработка приложений iOS с фреймворками внедрения зависимостей, такими как Factory и Swinject.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي التي تعتمد على سويفت وتحتاج إلى تطوير تطبيقات آي أو إس قوي مع إطارات حقن التبعية مثل Factory و Swinject."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement protocol-based Dependency Injection using initializer injection and abstractions, while also leveraging Modern Property Wrappers such as Factory and Swinject for enterprise-grade container-based DI, facilitating testing with mocks and stubs.","zh":"使代理能够使用初始化注入和抽象实现基于协议的依赖注入，同时利用现代属性包装器（如Factory和Swinject）进行企业级的容器式依赖注入，方便使用模拟和存根进行测试","ja":"エージェントがイニシャライザ注入と抽象を使用してプロトコルベースの依存性注入を実装できるようにし、FactoryやSwinjectなどのモダンなプロパティラッパーを使用してエンタープライズグレードのコンテナベースのDIを実現し、モックとスタブを使用したテストを容易にします","ko":"에이전트가 초기화 삽입 및 추상화를 사용하여 프로토콜 기반 의존성 주입을 구현할 수 있도록 하며, Factory 및 Swinject와 같은 최신 속성 래퍼를 사용하여 엔터프라이즈급의 컨테이너 기반 DI를 구현하여 모의 및 스텁을 사용한 테스트를容易하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar inyección de dependencias basada en protocolos utilizando inyección de inicializadores y abstracciones, y también a aprovechar los Modern Property Wrappers como Factory y Swinject para un contenedor de nivel empresarial basado en DI, lo que facilita las pruebas con mocks y stubs.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre l''injection de dépendances basée sur les protocoles en utilisant l''injection d''initialiseurs et des abstractions, tout en exploitant les Modern Property Wrappers tels que Factory et Swinject pour un conteneur de niveau entreprise basé sur le DI, facilitant ainsi les tests avec des mocks et des stubs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, protokollbasierte Abhängigkeitsinjektion mithilfe von Initialisierungsinjektion und Abstraktionen zu implementieren und gleichzeitig moderne Eigenschaftswrapper wie Factory und Swinject für einen unternehmensgradigen, containerbasierten DI zu nutzen, wodurch das Testen mit Mocks und Stubs erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar Injeção de Dependência baseada em protocolo usando injeção de inicializador e abstrações, além de aproveitar Wrappers de Propriedade Modernas, como Factory e Swinject, para DI baseada em contêiner de nível empresarial, facilitando testes com mocks e stubs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать внедрение зависимостей на основе протоколов с использованием инъекции инициализатора и абстракций, а также использовать современные обертки свойств, такие как Factory и Swinject, для контейнерного внедрения зависимостей уровня предприятия, что облегчает тестирование с помощью макетов и заглушек.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تنفيذ حقن التبعية القائمة على البروتوكول باستخدام حقن المُشغل والتنقيحات ، بالإضافة إلى استخدام غلاف الملكية الحديث مثل Factory و Swinject لتحقيق حقن التبعية القائم على الحاويات درجات الشركات ، و تسهيل الاختبارات مع المزيف و النماذج."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing protocol-based Dependency Injection for iOS apps","Configuring initializer injection for dependencies","Utilizing Factory and Swinject for type-safe navigation-friendly DI"],"zh":["为iOS应用实现基于协议的依赖注入","配置依赖的初始化注入","使用Factory和Swinject进行类型安全的导航友好DI"],"ja":["iOSアプリのプロトコルベースの依存性注入の実装","依存関係のイニシャライザ注入の構成","FactoryやSwinjectを使用したタイプセーフなナビゲーションに優しいDI"],"ko":["iOS 애플리케이션의 프로토콜 기반 의존성 주입 구현","의존성 초기화 삽입 구성","Factory 및 Swinject를 사용한 유형 안전导航 친화적 DI"],"es":["Implementar inyección de dependencias basada en protocolos para aplicaciones de iOS","Configurar inyección de inicializadores para dependencias","Utilizar Factory y Swinject para un DI de tipo seguro y amigable con la navegación"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre l''injection de dépendances basée sur les protocoles pour les applications iOS","Configurer l''injection d''initialiseurs pour les dépendances","Utiliser Factory et Swinject pour un DI de type sécurisé et convivial pour la navigation"],"de":["Implementierung von protokollbasierter Abhängigkeitsinjektion für iOS-Anwendungen","Konfiguration von Initialisierungsinjektion für Abhängigkeiten","Verwendung von Factory und Swinject für einen typsicheren und navigationsfreundlichen DI"],"pt":["Implementação de Injeção de Dependência baseada em protocolo para aplicativos iOS","Configuração de injeção de inicializador para dependências","Utilização de Factory e Swinject para DI de navegação de tipo seguro"],"ru":["Реализация внедрения зависимостей на основе протоколов для приложений iOS","Настройка инъекции инициализатора для зависимостей","Использование Factory и Swinject для типа-безопасного внедрения зависимостей с навигацией"],"ar":["تنفيذ حقن التبعية القائمة على البروتوكول لتطبيقات آي أو إس","تكوين حقن المُشغل للتبعيات","استخدام Factory و Swinject لتحقيق حقن التبعية آمنة من النوع مع التوجيه"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Swift programming language","iOS platform only","Limited to Dependency Injection frameworks mentioned"],"zh":["需要Swift编程语言","仅限iOS平台","仅限于提到的依赖注入框架"],"ja":["Swiftプログラミング言語が必要","iOSプラットフォームのみ","依存性注入フレームワークは記載されたもののみ"],"ko":["Swift 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","iOS 플랫폼만 해당","의존성 주입 프레임워크는 언급된 것만 해당"],"es":["Requiere lenguaje de programación Swift","Solo plataforma iOS","Limitado a los marcos de inyección de dependencias mencionados"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Swift","Plate-forme iOS uniquement","Limité aux frameworks d''injection de dépendances mentionnés"],"de":["Erfordert die Swift-Programmiersprache","Nur iOS-Plattform","Begrenzt auf die genannten Abhängigkeitsinjektionsframeworks"],"pt":["Exige a linguagem de programação Swift","Plataforma iOS apenas","Limitado a frameworks de Injeção de Dependência mencionados"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Swift","Только платформа iOS","Ограничен фреймворками внедрения зависимостей, упомянутыми выше"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة برمجة سويفت","منصة آي أو إس فقط","محدود بإطارات حقن التبعية المذكورة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e2e2907b0582d740408cf2106b0fffabdacafd2304b89ca7f98aa9571c5a2bd5","qualityScore":30}');
