لي","en":"opi"},"description":{"zh":"Opi 是一个自动学习提取器，帮助开发者从最近的工作中自动提取学习成果，改善未来的 Claude 会话。它提供了一系列命令来收集学习材料","ja":"Opi は、最近の作業から学習成果を自動的に抽出するツールです。開発者は、将来的に Claude セッションを改善するために、Opi を使用して学習材料を収集できます","ko":"Opi는 자동 학습 추출기로, 개발자가 최근 작업에서 학습 결과를 자동으로 추출하여 향후 Claude 세션을 개선하는 데 도움을 줍니다. 명령어를 통해 학습 자료를 수집할 수 있습니다","es":"Opi es un skill que extrae automáticamente aprendizajes de commits recientes para mejorar futuras sesiones de Claude","fr":"Opi est un skill qui extrait automatiquement les apprentissages à partir de commits récents pour améliorer les futures sessions Claude","de":"Opi ist ein Skill, der Lernerfahrungen aus aktuellen Commits automatisch extrahiert, um zukünftige Claude-Sitzungen zu verbessern","pt":"Opi é um skill que extrai aprendizados de trabalhos recentes para melhorar futuras sessões do Claude","ru":"Opi - это навык, который извлекает обучение из недавних работ для улучшения будущих сессий Claude","ar":"أوبي هو مهارة تقوم باستخراج التعلم من الأعمال الحديثة لتحسين جلسات كلود المستقبلية","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["自动提取学习成果","收集学习材料","改善 Claude 会话","支持 Git 命令","自动分析 fixCommits"],"ja":["学習成果の自動抽出","学習材料の収集","Claude セッションの改善","Git コマンドのサポート","fixCommits の自動分析"],"ko":["학습 결과 자동 추출","학습 자료 수집","Claude 세션 개선","Git 명령어 지원","fixCommits 자동 분석"],"es":["Extracción automática de aprendizajes","Mejora de las sesiones de Claude","Análisis de commits recientes","Soporte para múltiples formatos de commits","Integración con el registro de código de Claude"],"fr":["Extraction automatique des apprentissages","Amélioration des sessions Claude","Analyse des commits récents","Prise en charge de plusieurs formats de commits","Intégration avec l''enregistrement de code de Claude"],"de":["Automatische Extraktion von Lernerfahrungen","Verbesserung von Claude-Sitzungen","Analyse aktueller Commits","Unterstützung für mehrere Commit-Formate","Integration mit dem Code-Registrier-System von Claude"],"pt":["Extração automática de aprendizado","Análise de commits recentes","Identificação de commits de fixação","Melhoria de sessões do Claude","Integração com git","Automatização de workflows"],"ru":["Автоматическое извлечение обучения","Анализ недавних коммитов","Определение коммитов исправления","Улучшение сессий Claude","Интеграция с git","Автоматизация рабочих процессов"],"ar":["استخراج التعلم الآلي","تحليل الالتزامات الحديثة","تحديد الالتزامات التصحيحية","تحسين جلسات كلود","دمج مع جيت","تأتمة سير العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Opi","自动学习提取器","Claude 会话","Git 命令","学习材料","fixCommits"],"ja":["Opi","学習自動抽出ツール","Claude セッション","Git コマンド","学習材料","fixCommits"],"ko":["Opi","자동 학습 추출기","Claude 세션","Git 명령어","학습 자료","fixCommits"],"es":["Opi","Claude","extracción de aprendizaje","commits","desarrollo de software","automatización","eficiencia","registro de código"],"fr":["Opi","Claude","extraction d''apprentissage","commits","développement de logiciels","automatisation","efficacité","enregistrement de code"],"de":["Opi","Claude","Lern-Extraktion","Commits","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung","Effizienz","Code-Registrierung"],"pt":["Opi","Extração de aprendizado","Claude","Git","Commits","Fixação","Refatoração","Desenvolvimento de software","Automatização"],"ru":["Opi","Извлечение обучения","Claude","Git","Коммиты","Исправление","Рефакторинг","Разработка программного обеспечения","Автоматизация"],"ar":["أوبي","استخراج التعلم","كلود","جيت","الالتزامات","التصحيح","إعادة هيكلة","تطوير البرمجيات","تأتمة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opi","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Opi - Learning Extractor\n\nAutomatically extract learnings from recent work to improve future Claude sessions.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Gather Sources\n\nRun these commands to collect learning material:\n\n```bash\n# Recent commits (last 20)\ngit log --oneline -20\n\n# Today''s commits with details\ngit log --since=\"midnight\" --format=\"%h %s\"\n\n# Commits with \"fix\", \"korjaus\", \"refactor\"\ngit log --oneline -50 | grep -iE \"(fix|korja|refactor|bugfix)\"\n```\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Fix Commits\n\nFor each fix/refa","body":"# Opi - Learning Extractor\n\nAutomatically extract learnings from recent work to improve future Claude sessions.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Gather Sources\n\nRun these commands to collect learning material:\n\n```bash\n# Recent commits (last 20)\ngit log --oneline -20\n\n# Today''s commits with details\ngit log --since=\"midnight\" --format=\"%h %s\"\n\n# Commits with \"fix\", \"korjaus\", \"refactor\"\ngit log --oneline -50 | grep -iE \"(fix|korja|refactor|bugfix)\"\n```\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Fix Commits\n\nFor each fix/refactor commit, examine what changed:\n\n```bash\ngit show <commit-hash> --stat\ngit show <commit-hash> -- \"*.tsx\" \"*.ts\"  # Code changes\n```\n\nLook for patterns:\n- **What was wrong?** (the bug/issue)\n- **What fixed it?** (the solution)\n- **Why?** (root cause)\n\n### Step 3: Check Current Conversation\n\nReview current conversation for:\n- User corrections (\"ei, tee näin...\" / \"no, do it this way...\")\n- Failed attempts that were fixed\n- Non-obvious solutions discovered\n- Repeated patterns\n\n### Step 4: Categorize Learnings\n\nDetermine where each learning belongs:\n\n| Learning Type | Destination |\n|--------------|-------------|\n| React/TypeScript pattern | `.claude/LEARNINGS.md` |\n| Supabase/DB pattern | `.claude/LEARNINGS.md` |\n| CI/CD specific | `ci-doctor/references/learnings.md` |\n| Lint specific | `lint-fixer/references/learnings.md` |\n| Test specific | `test-writer/references/learnings.md` |\n| Skill-specific | `[skill]/references/learnings.md` |\n\n### Step 5: Propose Learnings\n\nFormat each learning proposal:\n\n```markdown\n## Proposed Learning\n\n**Source:** commit abc123 / conversation\n**Category:** [Global / Skill-specific]\n**File:** [target file path]\n\n### [Issue Title]\n- **Pattern:** What triggers this\n- **Wrong:** ❌ The incorrect approach\n- **Right:** ✅ The correct approach\n- **Why:** Root cause\n```\n\n### Step 6: Get Approval & Write\n\n1. Present all proposed learnings to user\n2. User approves/rejects each\n3. Write approved learnings to appropriate files\n4. Commit changes\n\n## Learning Quality Criteria\n\nOnly propose learnings that are:\n\n- [ ] **Non-obvious** - Claude wouldn''t know this without being told\n- [ ] **Actionable** - Can be applied in future situations\n- [ ] **Specific** - Has concrete wrong/right examples\n- [ ] **Recurring** - Likely to come up again\n\nSkip:\n- Typo fixes\n- One-off configuration issues\n- Project-specific constants\n- Things Claude already knows\n\n## Example Session\n\n```\nUser: /opi\n\nClaude: Let me analyze recent commits...\n\nFound 3 potential learnings:\n\n1. **useCallback for useEffect deps** (commit a1b2c3)\n   - Source: AdminTranslationsPage infinite loop fix\n   - File: .claude/LEARNINGS.md\n   - Pattern: Functions in useEffect deps cause re-renders\n\n2. **GitHub API dismiss format** (commit d4e5f6)\n   - Source: CodeQL alert dismissal\n   - File: ci-doctor/references/learnings.md\n   - Pattern: Use \"false positive\" not \"false_positive\"\n\n3. **Controlled Tabs state** (conversation)\n   - Source: Feedback popup tab fix\n   - File: .claude/LEARNINGS.md\n   - Pattern: Radix Tabs need value+onValueChange for control\n\nAdd these learnings? [Y/n for each]\n```\n\n## Commands Reference\n\n```bash\n# Commits since specific date\ngit log --since=\"2025-01-10\" --oneline\n\n# Commits by pattern\ngit log --all --oneline | grep -i \"fix\"\n\n# Show specific commit\ngit show <hash> --name-only\n\n# Diff for a commit\ngit diff <hash>^..<hash>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:58:14.937Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude Code Agents needing automated learning extraction and improvement of future sessions.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化学习提取和改进未来会话的 Claude Code Agents。","ja":"Claude Code Agents が自動化された学習の抽出と将来のセッションの改善が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":" 将来的 세션의 자동화된 학습 추출 및 개선이 필요한 Claude Code 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de código Claude que necesitan extracción de aprendizaje automatizada y mejora de sesiones futuras.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de code Claude qui ont besoin d''une extraction d''apprentissage automatisée et d''une amélioration des sessions futures.","de":"Perfekt für Claude-Code-Agents, die eine automatisierte Lernextraktion und Verbesserung zukünftiger Sitzungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Código Claude que necessitam de extração de aprendizado automatizado e melhoria de sessões futuras.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Claude Code, которым необходим автоматизированный вывод обучения и улучшение будущих сессий.","ar":"مثالي لعميل كلود كود الذي يحتاج إلى استخلاص تعليمات自动ي وتحسين الجلسات المستقبلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automatically extract learnings from recent work using Git commands, such as analyzing fix commits and recent code changes, to improve future Claude sessions with enhanced workflow efficiency and accuracy through protocols like Git log and grep.","zh":"赋予代理自动从最近的工作中提取学习成果的能力，使用 Git 命令，例如分析 fix 提交和最近的代码更改，以提高未来的 Claude 会话的工作流效率和准确性，通过 Git 日志和 grep 等协议。","ja":"エージェントに、Git コマンドを使用して最近の作業から学習を自動的に抽出する能力を与え、fix コミットや最近のコード変更を分析して、Git ログや grep などのプロトコルを通じて、将来の Claude セッションのワークフロー効率と精度を向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 Git 명령을 사용하여 최근 작업에서 학습을 자동으로 추출할 수 있도록 하여, 수정 커밋 및 최근 코드 변경을 분석하고 Git 로그 및 grep과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 향후 Claude 세션의 워크플로 효율성과 정확성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer automáticamente los conocimientos de trabajos recientes utilizando comandos Git, como analizar commits de corrección y cambios de código recientes, para mejorar las sesiones futuras de Claude con una mayor eficiencia y precisión del flujo de trabajo a través de protocolos como Git log y grep.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire automatiquement les apprentissages des travaux récents en utilisant des commandes Git, telles que l''analyse des commits de correction et des changements de code récents, pour améliorer les sessions futures de Claude avec une efficacité et une précision accrues du flux de travail via des protocoles tels que Git log et grep.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Lerninhalte aus aktuellen Arbeiten automatisch mithilfe von Git-Befehlen zu extrahieren, wie z.B. die Analyse von Korrektur-Commits und aktuellen Code-Änderungen, um zukünftige Claude-Sitzungen mit verbesserter Workflow-Effizienz und Genauigkeit durch Protokolle wie Git-Log und grep zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair automaticamente conhecimentos do trabalho recente usando comandos Git, como análise de commits de correção e alterações de código recentes, para melhorar as futuras sessões do Claude com eficiência de fluxo de trabalho aprimorada e precisão por meio de protocolos como Git log e grep.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически извлекать знания из недавней работы, используя команды Git, такие как анализ исправляющих коммитов и недавних изменений кода, для улучшения будущих сессий Claude с повышенной эффективностью рабочего процесса и точностью с помощью протоколов, таких как Git log и grep.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من استخلاص المعارف تلقائيًا من العمل الحديث باستخدام أوامر Git، مثل تحليل تعديلات الإصلاح والتعديلات الأخيرة على الشفرة، لتحسين جلسات كلود المستقبلية بفعالية وحساسية محسّنة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل سجل Git و grep."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating learning extraction from recent commits","Analyzing fix commits for improved code quality","Generating summaries of recent code changes"],"zh":["自动从最近的提交中提取学习成果","分析 fix 提交以改进代码质量","生成最近代码更改的摘要"],"ja":["最近のコミットから学習を自動的に抽出する","fix コミットを分析してコード品質を向上させる","最近のコード変更の要約を生成する"],"ko":["최근 커밋에서 학습을 자동으로 추출하는 것","수정 커밋을 분석하여 코드 품질을 개선하는 것","최근 코드 변경의 요약을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la extracción de aprendizaje de commits recientes","Analizar commits de corrección para mejorar la calidad del código","Generar resúmenes de cambios de código recientes"],"fr":["Automatiser l''extraction d''apprentissage des commits récents","Analyser les commits de correction pour améliorer la qualité du code","Générer des résumés des changements de code récents"],"de":["Automatisierung der Lernextraktion aus aktuellen Commits","Analyse von Korrektur-Commits zur Verbesserung der Code-Qualität","Generierung von Zusammenfassungen aktueller Code-Änderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a extração de aprendizado de commits recentes","Analisar commits de correção para melhorar a qualidade do código","Gerar resumos de alterações de código recentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать извлечение обучения из недавних коммитов","Анализировать исправляющие коммиты для улучшения качества кода","Генерировать сводки недавних изменений кода"],"ar":["تأتميم استخلاص التعلم من التعديلات الحديثة","تحليل تعديلات الإصلاح لتحسين جودة الشفرة","إنتاج ملخصات للتعديلات الحديثة على الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git access and configuration","Limited to analyzing recent commits and fix/refactor logs"],"zh":["需要 Git 访问和配置","仅限分析最近的提交和 fix/refactor 日志"],"ja":["Git アクセスと設定が必要","最近のコミットと fix/refactor ログのみを分析可能"],"ko":["Git 접근 및 구성이 필요하다","최근 커밋 및 수정/리팩토링 로그만 분석 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso y configuración de Git","Limitado al análisis de commits y registros de corrección/refactorización recientes"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès et une configuration Git","Limité à l''analyse des commits et des journaux de correction/refactorisation récents"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Zugriff und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Commits und Korrektur/Refaktorisierungs-Logs"],"pt":["Requer acesso e configuração do Git","Limitado à análise de commits recentes e logs de fix/refatoração"],"ru":["Требует доступа и настройки Git","Ограничен анализом недавних коммитов и журналов исправления/рефакторинга"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تكوين Git","محدود بتحليل التعديلات الحديثة وسجلات الإصلاح/إعادة الهيكلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"eac42ebcb705510ef0afcef2e6fee12dcce8ea7d54ec36ead1ae13b327ce7abc","qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/psi', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'psi', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:58:27.814Z', 'b9e814607af13fc53b0c340de10be60ca2249b5482529d3ed30bbc3a7086b4ca', '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/psi","name":"psi","description":{"zh":"PSI是一种结构化的工作流，用于计划、规范和实施变更，采用文档优先的方法","ja":"PSIは、計画、仕様、実装の変更に文書優先のアプローチを使用する構造化されたワークフローです","ko":"PSI는 계획, 사양, 구현의 변경에 문서 우선 접근 방식을 사용하는 구조화된 워크플로입니다","es":"PSI es un flujo de trabajo estructurado para planificar, especificar e implementar cambios con un enfoque de documentación primero","fr":"PSI est un workflow structuré pour planifier, spécifier et mettre en œuvre des modifications avec une approche de documentation première","de":"PSI ist ein strukturierter Workflow zum Planen, Spezifizieren und Implementieren von Änderungen mit einem dokumentationsbasierten Ansatz","pt":"O PSI é um fluxo de trabalho estruturado para planejar, especificar e implementar mudanças com documentação em primeiro lugar, garantindo uma abordagem consistente e eficaz","ru":"PSI - это структурированный рабочий процесс для планирования, спецификации и реализации изменений с документацией в первую очередь, обеспечивающий последовательный и эффективный подход","ar":"PSI هو تدفق عمل منظم لتخطيط وتصميم وتنفيذ التغييرات بأولوية للتوثيق، مما يضمن نهجًا متسقًا وفعالًا","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PSI技能：计划、规范和实施的结构化工作流","ja":"PSIスキル：計画、仕様、実装の構造化されたワークフロー","ko":"PSI 스킬: 계획, 사양, 구현을 위한 구조화된 워크플로","es":"PSI: Flujo de trabajo estructurado para cambios","fr":"PSI : Workflow structuré pour les modifications","de":"PSI: Strukturierter Workflow für Änderungen","pt":"PSI: Fluxo de Trabalho Estruturado para Desenvolvedores","ru":"PSI: Структурированный рабочий процесс для разработчиков","ar":"PSI: تدفق العمل المنظم لل مطورين","en":"psi"},"description":{"zh":"PSI是一种结构化的工作流，用于计划、规范和实施变更，采用文档优先的方法","ja":"PSIは、計画、仕様、実装の変更に文書優先のアプローチを使用する構造化されたワークフローです","ko":"PSI는 계획, 사양, 구현의 변경에 문서 우선 접근 방식을 사용하는 구조화된 워크플로입니다","es":"PSI es un flujo de trabajo estructurado para planificar, especificar e implementar cambios con un enfoque de documentación primero","fr":"PSI est un workflow structuré pour planifier, spécifier et mettre en œuvre des modifications avec une approche de documentation première","de":"PSI ist ein strukturierter Workflow zum Planen, Spezifizieren und Implementieren von Änderungen mit einem dokumentationsbasierten Ansatz","pt":"O PSI é um fluxo de trabalho estruturado para planejar, especificar e implementar mudanças com documentação em primeiro lugar, garantindo uma abordagem consi...","ru":"PSI - это структурированный рабочий процесс для планирования, спецификации и реализации изменений с документацией в первую очередь, обеспечивающий последоват...","ar":"PSI هو تدفق عمل منظم لتخطيط وتصميم وتنفيذ التغييرات بأولوية للتوثيق، مما يضمن نهجًا متسقًا وفعالًا","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["计划、规范和实施的独立阶段","文档优先的方法","核心原则包括计划、规范和实施","可选的工作流，不是默认设置"],"ja":["計画、仕様、実装の独立した段階","文書優先のアプローチ","核心原則には計画、仕様、実装が含まれる","オプトインのワークフロー、デフォルトではありません"],"ko":["계획, 사양, 구현의 독립적인 단계","문서 우선 접근 방식","핵심 원칙에는 계획, 사양, 구현이 포함됨","선택적인 워크플로, 기본 설정이 아님"],"es":["Flujo de trabajo estructurado","Enfoque de documentación primero","Planificación, especificación e implementación de cambios","Independencia de fases","Actualización de documentación en tiempo real"],"fr":["Workflow structuré","Approche de documentation première","Planification, spécification et mise en œuvre de modifications","Indépendance des phases","Mise à jour de la documentation en temps réel"],"de":["Strukturierter Workflow","Dokumentationsbasierter Ansatz","Planen, Spezifizieren und Implementieren von Änderungen","Unabhängigkeit der Phasen","Echtzeit-Aktualisierung der Dokumentation"],"pt":["Fluxo de trabalho estruturado","Abordagem de documentação em primeiro lugar","Fases independentes","Garantia de documentação atualizada","Opt-in workflow"],"ru":["Структурированный рабочий процесс","Документация в первую очередь","Независимые фазы","Гарантия актуальной документации","Опт-ин рабочий процесс"],"ar":["تدفق عمل منظم","أولوية للتوثيق","مراحل مستقلة","ضمان توثيق محدث","تدفق عمل اختياري"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PSI技能","结构化工作流","计划规范实施","文档优先","开发效率","核心原则"],"ja":["PSIスキル","構造化されたワークフロー","計画仕様実装","文書優先","開発の効率","核心原則"],"ko":["PSI 스킬","구조화된 워크플로","계획 사양 구현","문서 우선","개발 효율성","핵심 원칙"],"es":["PSI","flujo de trabajo estructurado","documentación primero","planificación de cambios","especificación de cambios","implementación de cambios","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["PSI","workflow structuré","documentation première","planification de modifications","spécification de modifications","mise en œuvre de modifications","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["PSI","strukturierter Workflow","dokumentationsbasierter Ansatz","Planung von Änderungen","Spezifizierung von Änderungen","Implementierung von Änderungen","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["PSI","fluxo de trabalho","desenvolvimento de software","documentação","planejamento","especificação","implementação"],"ru":["PSI","структурированный рабочий процесс","разработка программного обеспечения","документация","планирование","спецификация","реализация"],"ar":["PSI","تدفق العمل","تطوير البرمجيات","التوثيق","التخطيط","التصميم","التنفيذ"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"psi","description":"Plan-spec-implement workflow for structured development. Only use when explicitly directed by user or when mentioned in project AGENTS.md file. Generates ephemeral plans in ~/.dot-agent/, applies specs to project docs, then implements test-first.","bodyPreview":"# PSI - Plan Spec Implement\n\nStructured workflow for planning, specifying, and implementing changes with documentation-first approach.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Only use when:**\n- Explicitly directed by the user\n- Mentioned in project `AGENTS.md` file\n\n**Do not use automatically** - this is an opt-in workflow, not a default.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n**Plan → Spec → Implement**\n\nPhases are **independent** - you can start with any phase, but all must ensure documentation stays up-to-date.\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1","body":"# PSI - Plan Spec Implement\n\nStructured workflow for planning, specifying, and implementing changes with documentation-first approach.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Only use when:**\n- Explicitly directed by the user\n- Mentioned in project `AGENTS.md` file\n\n**Do not use automatically** - this is an opt-in workflow, not a default.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n**Plan → Spec → Implement**\n\nPhases are **independent** - you can start with any phase, but all must ensure documentation stays up-to-date.\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Ephemeral planning** - Plans stored in `~/.dot-agent/` (not committed)\n2. **Documentation-first** - Specs applied to project docs/READMEs/AGENTS.md\n3. **Test-first implementation** - Tests for docs/user journeys before code\n4. **Design/review embedded** - Design and review integrated into Plan/Spec phases\n5. **Phase independence** - Each phase can work standalone, all update docs\n\n## Phase Overview\n\n### Plan Phase\n- Generates detailed plans in `~/.dot-agent/repo/YYYY-MM-work-name.plan.md`\n- Research stored in `~/.dot-agent/working-dir/repo/YYYY-MM-work-name.research.md`\n- Embeds design considerations\n- Includes review before proceeding\n\n### Spec Phase\n- Generates specs for: API schemas, interfaces, DTOs, database models, config, env vars, architecture, user journeys, package structure, tech choices\n- Embeds design considerations\n- Reviews specs before applying\n- Applies to: `docs/`, README.md files, AGENTS.md files\n\n### Implement Phase\n- Test-first: tests for docs/user journeys before code\n- CI verification: verify types, tests, lint pass before committing\n- Atomic commits: group related changes with tests\n- Updates docs, README.md, AGENTS.md as code evolves\n- Can work independently if specs exist in docs\n\n## Research Management\n\nDetects phrases like:\n- \"looking at your research\" → Loads research file\n- \"refine your research\" → Updates research file, narrows focus\n\n## Documentation Structure\n\n- **README.md**: Aim for < 1000 lines (not hard rule), can be longer if needed\n- **AGENTS.md**: < 200 lines, inline at root/packages/modules/code level\n- **docs/**: Architecture, roadmap, tech-choices, setup/, user-journeys/, design/\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed protocols, see:\n- `references/plan-phase.md` - Plan generation with embedded design/review\n- `references/spec-phase.md` - Spec generation and application\n- `references/implement-phase.md` - Test-first implementation\n- `references/review-protocol.md` - Reviewing plans/specs/design\n- `references/research-management.md` - Research file handling\n- `references/docs-structure.md` - Documentation organization rules\n- `references/file-paths.md` - Storage paths and conventions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:58:27.814Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Methodical Agents requiring a structured workflow for planning, specifying, and implementing changes with a documentation-first approach.","zh":"适合需要结构化工作流程的方法论代理，用于规划、指定和实现更改，并采用文档优先的方法。","ja":"計画、仕様の作成、変更の実施を文書化した上で実行するための構造化されたワークフローを必要とするメソッド論的エージェントに最適です。","ko":"계획, 세부 사항 지정, 변경 사항 구현을 구조화된 워크플로우를 통해 문서화하여 처리하는 메소드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes metódicos que requieren un flujo de trabajo estructurado para planificar, especificar e implementar cambios con un enfoque de documentación primero.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents méthodiques nécessitant un workflow structuré pour planifier, spécifier et mettre en œuvre des changements avec une approche de documentation première.","de":"Ideal für methodische Agenten, die ein strukturiertes Workflow für Planung, Spezifikation und Implementierung von Änderungen mit einem dokumentationsbasierten Ansatz benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Metódicos que requerem um fluxo de trabalho estruturado para planejamento, especificação e implementação de alterações com uma abordagem de documentação em primeiro lugar.","ru":"Идеально для Методических Агентов, требующих структурированного рабочего процесса для планирования, спецификации и реализации изменений с подходом документации в первую очередь.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Phương phápية يتطلب تدفق عمل منظم للتخطيط والتحديد والتنفيذ للتغييرات مع نهج وثائق أولاً."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to follow a documentation-first approach, ensuring that all phases of the workflow, from planning to implementation, maintain up-to-date documentation using a structured Plan Spec Implement (PSI) methodology, incorporating protocols such as explicit user direction and project file specifications like AGENTS.md.","zh":"赋予代理采用文档优先的方法，确保工作流程的所有阶段，从规划到实施，都保持最新的文档，使用结构化的计划、规范、实施（PSI）方法论，融入诸如明确的用户指引和项目文件规范（如 AGENTS.md）等协议。","ja":"エージェントに文書優先アプローチを採用する権限を与え、計画から実装までのワークフローのすべての段階で最新のドキュメントを維持することを保証する。構造化された計画・仕様・実装（PSI）メソッド論を使用し、明示的なユーザー指示やプロジェクトファイル仕様（例：AGENTS.md）などのプロトコルを組み込む。","ko":"에이전트가 문서 우선 접근 방식을 따르도록 허용하여, 계획에서 구현까지 워크플로의 모든 단계에서最新의 문서를 유지하도록 보장합니다. 구조화된 계획-세부사항-구현(PSI) 방법론을 사용하며, 명확한 사용자 지침 및 프로젝트 파일 사양(예: AGENTS.md)과 같은 프로토콜을 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes seguir un enfoque de documentación primero, asegurando que todas las fases del flujo de trabajo, desde la planificación hasta la implementación, mantengan una documentación actualizada utilizando una metodología estructurada Plan Spec Implement (PSI), que incorpora protocolos como direcciones de usuario explícitas y especificaciones de archivos de proyecto como AGENTS.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre une approche de documentation première, en garantissant que toutes les phases du workflow, de la planification à la mise en œuvre, maintiennent une documentation à jour en utilisant une méthodologie structurée Plan Spec Implement (PSI), qui intègre des protocoles tels que des instructions utilisateur explicites et des spécifications de fichiers de projet comme AGENTS.md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, einem dokumentationsbasierten Ansatz zu folgen, um sicherzustellen, dass alle Phasen des Workflows, von der Planung bis zur Implementierung, eine aktuelle Dokumentation mithilfe einer strukturierten Plan Spec Implement (PSI)-Methodik beibehalten, die Protokolle wie explizite Benutzeranweisungen und Projektdateispezifikationen wie AGENTS.md einbezieht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a seguir uma abordagem de documentação em primeiro lugar, garantindo que todas as fases do fluxo de trabalho, desde o planejamento até a implementação, mantenham documentação atualizada usando uma metodologia estruturada de Plano Especificação Implementação (PSI), incorporando protocolos como direção explícita do usuário e especificações de arquivo de projeto como AGENTS.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью следовать подходу документации в первую очередь, гарантируя, что все фазы рабочего процесса, от планирования до реализации, поддерживают актуальную документацию с использованием структурированной методологии План Спецификация Реализация (PSI), включающей протоколы, такие как явное руководство пользователя и спецификации файла проекта, такие как AGENTS.md.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من اتباع نهج الوثائق أولاً، مما يضمن أن جميع مراحل تدفق العمل، من التخطيط إلى التنفيذ، تحتفظ بالوثائق محدثة باستخدام منهجية مخطط تفاصيل تنفيذ (PSI) منظم، ودمج بروتوكولات مثل توجيه المستخدم الصريح ومواصفات ملف المشروع مثل AGENTS.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing changes with thorough documentation","Specifying project requirements with clarity","Planning workflows with a structured approach"],"zh":["实施变更并记录详细文档","使用清晰的方式指定项目需求","采用结构化方法规划工作流程"],"ja":["変更を実施し、詳細なドキュメントを作成する","プロジェクトの要件を明確に指定する","構造化された方法でワークフローを計画する"],"ko":["변경 사항을 구현하고 자세한 문서를 기록하는 것","프로젝트 요구 사항을 명확하게 지정하는 것","구조화된 방법으로 워크플로우를 계획하는 것"],"es":["Implementar cambios con una documentación exhaustiva","Especificar los requisitos del proyecto con claridad","Planificar flujos de trabajo con un enfoque estructurado"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des changements avec une documentation exhaustive","Spécifier les exigences du projet avec clarté","Planifier des flux de travail avec une approche structurée"],"de":["Änderungen mit umfassender Dokumentation implementieren","Projektanforderungen mit Klarheit spezifizieren","Workflows mit einem strukturierten Ansatz planen"],"pt":["Implementação de alterações com documentação aprofundada","Especificação de requisitos de projeto com clareza","Planejamento de fluxos de trabalho com uma abordagem estruturada"],"ru":["Реализация изменений с тщательной документацией","Спецификация требований проекта с ясностью","Планирование рабочих процессов с структурированным подходом"],"ar":["تنفيذ التغييرات مع وثائق متعمقة","تحديد متطلبات المشروع بوضوح","تخطيط تدفقات العمل بطريقة منضبطة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit user direction","Mention in project AGENTS.md file necessary","Do not use automatically, opt-in workflow only"],"zh":["需要明确的用户指引","需要在项目 AGENTS.md 文件中提及","不能自动使用，仅支持选择加入的工作流程"],"ja":["明示的なユーザー指示が必要","プロジェクトのAGENTS.mdファイルに記載する必要がある","自動では使用できず、オプトインワークフローのみ"],"ko":["명확한 사용자 지침이 필요합니다.","프로젝트의 AGENTS.md 파일에 언급해야 합니다.","자동으로 사용할 수 없으며, 선택加入 워크플로우만 지원합니다."],"es":["Requiere una dirección de usuario explícita","Mención en el archivo de proyecto AGENTS.md necesaria","No usar de forma automática, flujo de trabajo de opt-in solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une direction utilisateur explicite","Mention dans le fichier de projet AGENTS.md nécessaire","Ne pas utiliser de manière automatique, workflow de opt-in uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt eine explizite Benutzeranweisung","Erwähnung in der Projektdatei AGENTS.md erforderlich","Nicht automatisch verwenden, nur opt-in-Workflow"],"pt":["Requer direção explícita do usuário","Menção no arquivo de projeto AGENTS.md é necessária","Não use automaticamente, fluxo de trabalho opt-in apenas"],"ru":["Требует явного руководства пользователя","Упоминание в файле проекта AGENTS.md необходимо","Не используйте автоматически, только рабочий процесс opt-in"],"ar":["يتطلب توجيه المستخدم الصريح","الاشارة في ملف المشروع AGENTS.md ضرورية","لا تستخدم تلقائيًا، تدفق عمل خيار فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b9e814607af13fc53b0c340de10be60ca2249b5482529d3ed30bbc3a7086b4ca","qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dojoengine/book/dojo-indexer', 'community', 'dojoengine', 'book', 'dojoengine/book', 'dojo-indexer', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z', '2026-02-20T04:58:28.068Z', 'c6712331d16ddffd6952a19ef54a650ef23588e2ec297d24345ea7680a9130db', '{"id":"dojoengine/book/dojo-indexer","name":"dojo-indexer","description":{"zh":"Dojo Indexer Torii, ","ja":"Dojo ","ko":"Dojo ","es":"El indexador Dojo, Torii, permite consultas eficientes y suscripciones en tiempo real. Configura Torii para mejorar el rendimiento de tus consultas","fr":"L''indexeur Dojo, Torii, permet des requêtes efficaces et des abonnements en temps réel. Configurez Torii pour améliorer les performances de vos requêtes","de":"Der Dojo-Indexer, Torii, ermöglicht effiziente Abfragen und Echtzeitsubskriptionen. Konfigurieren Sie Torii, um die Leistung Ihrer Abfragen zu verbessern","pt":"O Dojo Indexer é uma ferramenta para consultas eficientes e assinaturas em tempo real. Configure o Torii para gerenciar seu estado de mundo","ru":"Dojo Индексер — это инструмент для эффективных запросов и подписок в реальном времени. Настройте Torii для управления своим состоянием мира","ar":"مؤشر دوچو هو أداة للاستفسارات الفعالة والتسجيلات في الوقت الفعلي. 구성 تورى لإدارة حالتك العالمية","en":"The Dojo Book"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Dojo Indexer Torii","ja":"Dojo ","ko":"Dojo ","es":"Indexador Dojo: Torii para consultas eficientes","fr":"Indexeur Dojo : Torii pour des requêtes efficaces","de":"Dojo-Indexer: Torii für effiziente Abfragen","pt":"Dojo Indexer: Torii para Consultas Eficientes","ru":"Dojo Индексер: Torii для Эффективных Запросов","ar":"مؤشر دوچو: تورى للاستفسارات الفعالة","en":"dojo-indexer"},"description":{"zh":"Dojo Indexer Torii, ","ja":"Dojo ","ko":"Dojo ","es":"El indexador Dojo, Torii, permite consultas eficientes y suscripciones en tiempo real. Configura Torii para mejorar el rendimiento de tus consultas","fr":"L''indexeur Dojo, Torii, permet des requêtes efficaces et des abonnements en temps réel. Configurez Torii pour améliorer les performances de vos requêtes","de":"Der Dojo-Indexer, Torii, ermöglicht effiziente Abfragen und Echtzeitsubskriptionen. Konfigurieren Sie Torii, um die Leistung Ihrer Abfragen zu verbessern","pt":"O Dojo Indexer é uma ferramenta para consultas eficientes e assinaturas em tempo real. Configure o Torii para gerenciar seu estado de mundo","ru":"Dojo Индексер — это инструмент для эффективных запросов и подписок в реальном времени. Настройте Torii для управления своим состоянием мира","ar":"مؤشر دوچو هو أداة للاستفسارات الفعالة والتسجيلات في الوقت الفعلي. 구성 تورى لإدارة حالتك العالمية","en":"The Dojo Book"},"definition":{"en":"The Dojo Book"},"features":{"zh":["Torii","GraphQL","","SQL",""],"ja":["Torii","GraphQL","","SQL",""],"ko":["Torii","GraphQL","","SQL",""],"es":["Configuración de Torii","Creación de consultas GraphQL","Suscripciones en tiempo real","Acceso directo a la base de datos SQL"],"fr":["Configuration de Torii","Création de requêtes GraphQL","Abonnements en temps réel","Accès direct à la base de données SQL"],"de":["Konfiguration von Torii","Erstellung von GraphQL-Abfragen","Echtzeitsubskriptionen","Direkter Zugriff auf die SQL-Datenbank"],"pt":["Configuração do Torii","Criação de consultas GraphQL","Assinaturas em tempo real","Acesso direto ao banco de dados SQL","Gerenciamento de estado de mundo"],"ru":["Настройка Torii","Создание запросов GraphQL","Подписки в реальном времени","Прямой доступ к базе данных SQL","Управление состоянием мира"],"ar":["تكوين تورى","إنشاء استفسارات جرافكول","التسجيلات في الوقت الفعلي","الدخول المباشر إلى قاعدة بيانات إس كيو إل","إدارة حالة العالم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Dojo Indexer","Torii","GraphQL","SQL","",""],"ja":["Dojo ","Torii","GraphQL","SQL","",""],"ko":["Dojo ","Torii","GraphQL","SQL","",""],"es":["indexador Dojo","Torii","consultas eficientes","suscripciones en tiempo real","GraphQL","base de datos SQL"],"fr":["indexeur Dojo","Torii","requêtes efficaces","abonnements en temps réel","GraphQL","base de données SQL"],"de":["Dojo-Indexer","Torii","effiziente Abfragen","Echtzeitsubskriptionen","GraphQL","SQL-Datenbank"],"pt":["Dojo Indexer","Torii","Consultas Eficientes","Assinaturas em Tempo Real","GraphQL","SQL","Desenvolvimento de Software","Estado de Mundo"],"ru":["Dojo Индексер","Torii","Эффективные Запросы","Подписки в Реальном Времени","GraphQL","SQL","Разработка Программного Обеспечения","Состояние Мира"],"ar":["مؤشر دوچو","تورى","الاستفسارات الفعالة","التسجيلات في الوقت الفعلي","جرافكول","إس كيو إل","تطوير البرمجيات","حالة العالم"]}},"owner":"dojoengine","repo":"book","repoPath":"dojoengine/book","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dojo-indexer","description":"Set up and configure Torii indexer for GraphQL queries, gRPC subscriptions, and SQL access. Use when indexing your deployed world for client queries or real-time updates.","bodyPreview":"# Dojo Indexer (Torii)\n\nSet up and use Torii, the Dojo indexer, for efficient querying and real-time subscriptions to your world state.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- \"Set up Torii indexer\"\n- \"Configure GraphQL for my world\"\n- \"Create subscriptions for entity updates\"\n- \"Query world state efficiently\"\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nManages Torii indexer:\n- Start and configure Torii\n- Create GraphQL queries\n- Set up real-time subscriptions\n- Access SQL database directly\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Start Torii:*","body":"# Dojo Indexer (Torii)\n\nSet up and use Torii, the Dojo indexer, for efficient querying and real-time subscriptions to your world state.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- \"Set up Torii indexer\"\n- \"Configure GraphQL for my world\"\n- \"Create subscriptions for entity updates\"\n- \"Query world state efficiently\"\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nManages Torii indexer:\n- Start and configure Torii\n- Create GraphQL queries\n- Set up real-time subscriptions\n- Access SQL database directly\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Start Torii:**\n```bash\ntorii --world <WORLD_ADDRESS>\n```\n\nThis starts Torii with default settings:\n- GraphQL API at `http://localhost:8080/graphql`\n- gRPC API at `http://localhost:8080`\n- In-memory database (for development)\n\n**With Controller indexing (recommended):**\n```bash\ntorii --world <WORLD_ADDRESS> --indexing.controllers\n```\n\n**Production configuration:**\n```bash\ntorii --world <WORLD_ADDRESS> --db-dir ./torii-db --indexing.controllers\n```\n\n## What is Torii?\n\nTorii is the Dojo indexer that:\n- Watches blockchain for world events\n- Indexes model state changes\n- Provides GraphQL API for queries\n- Provides gRPC API for subscriptions\n- Offers SQL access for complex queries\n\n**Why use Torii:**\n- Faster than direct RPC queries\n- Complex queries (filters, pagination)\n- Real-time subscriptions\n- Type-safe GraphQL schema\n\n## GraphQL API\n\nTorii provides GraphQL endpoint at `http://localhost:8080/graphql`\n\nUse the GraphiQL IDE in your browser to explore the schema and test queries.\n\n### Schema Structure\n\nTorii generates two types of queries:\n\n**Generic Queries:**\n- `entities` - Access all entities with filtering\n- `models` - Retrieve model definitions\n- `transactions` - Query indexed transactions\n\n**Model-Specific Queries:**\n- `{modelName}Models` - Custom queries for each model\n- Example: `positionModels`, `movesModels`\n\n### Basic Queries\n\n**Get all entities of a model:**\n```graphql\nquery {\n    movesModels {\n        edges {\n            node {\n                player\n                remaining\n                last_direction\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Get model metadata:**\n```graphql\nquery {\n    models {\n        edges {\n            node {\n                id\n                name\n                classHash\n                contractAddress\n            }\n        }\n        totalCount\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\n**Cursor-based pagination:**\n```graphql\nquery {\n    entities(first: 10) {\n        edges {\n            cursor\n            node {\n                id\n            }\n        }\n        pageInfo {\n            hasNextPage\n            endCursor\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Get next page:**\n```graphql\nquery {\n    entities(first: 10, after: \"cursor_value\") {\n        edges {\n            cursor\n            node { id }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Offset/limit pagination:**\n```graphql\nquery {\n    entities(offset: 20, limit: 10) {\n        edges {\n            node { id }\n        }\n        totalCount\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Real-time Subscriptions\n\nSubscribe to world state changes via WebSocket.\n\n### Entity Updates\n\n```graphql\nsubscription {\n    entityUpdated(id: \"0x54f58...\") {\n        id\n        updatedAt\n        models {\n            __typename\n            ... on Position {\n                vec {\n                    x\n                    y\n                }\n            }\n            ... on Moves {\n                remaining\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Event Stream\n\nMonitor all world events:\n\n```graphql\nsubscription {\n    eventEmitted {\n        id\n        keys\n        data\n        transactionHash\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Model Registration\n\nListen for new model registrations:\n\n```graphql\nsubscription {\n    modelRegistered {\n        id\n        name\n        namespace\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## SQL Access\n\nTorii stores data in SQLite, accessible for complex queries.\n\n**Connect to database:**\n```bash\nsqlite3 torii.db\n```\n\n**Example queries:**\n```sql\n-- Count entities\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM entities;\n\n-- Custom aggregations\nSELECT AVG(value) FROM model_data WHERE model_name = ''Health'';\n```\n\n## Client Integration\n\n### JavaScript/TypeScript\n\n```typescript\nimport { createClient } from ''@dojoengine/torii-client'';\n\nconst client = await createClient({\n    rpcUrl: \"http://localhost:5050\",\n    toriiUrl: \"http://localhost:8080\",\n    worldAddress: WORLD_ADDRESS,\n});\n\n// Query entities\nconst positions = await client.getEntities({\n    model: \"Position\",\n    limit: 10\n});\n\n// Subscribe to updates\nawait client.onEntityUpdated(\n    [{ model: \"Position\", keys: [playerId] }],\n    (entity) => console.log(\"Position updated:\", entity)\n);\n```\n\n### Apollo Client (GraphQL)\n\n```typescript\nimport { ApolloClient, InMemoryCache, gql } from ''@apollo/client'';\n\nconst client = new ApolloClient({\n    uri: ''http://localhost:8080/graphql'',\n    cache: new InMemoryCache(),\n});\n\nconst { data } = await client.query({\n    query: gql`\n        query GetMoves {\n            movesModels {\n                edges {\n                    node {\n                        player\n                        remaining\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    `\n});\n```\n\n## Configuration Options\n\n| Option | Description | Default |\n|--------|-------------|---------|\n| `--world` | World contract address | Optional (since Torii 1.6.0) |\n| `--rpc` | RPC endpoint URL | `http://localhost:5050` |\n| `--db-dir` | Database directory | In-memory |\n| `--config` | Path to TOML configuration file | None |\n| `--http.cors_origins` | CORS origins | `*` |\n\n## Slot Deployment (Remote)\n\n[Slot](https://docs.cartridge.gg/slot) provides hosted Torii instances. Slot requires a TOML configuration file.\n\n### Create Configuration\n\n```toml\n# torii.toml\nworld_address = \"<WORLD_ADDRESS>\"\nrpc = \"<RPC_URL>\"\n\n[indexing]\ncontrollers = true\n```\n\nSee the [Torii configuration guide](/toolchain/torii/configuration) for all TOML options (indexing, polling, namespaces, etc.).\n\n### Deploy\n\n```bash\nslot auth login\n\nslot deployments create <PROJECT_NAME> torii --config torii.toml --version <DOJO_VERSION>\n```\n\n### Manage\n\n```bash\n# Stream logs\nslot deployments logs <PROJECT_NAME> torii -f\n\n# Delete and recreate (safe — all data is on-chain)\nslot deployments delete <PROJECT_NAME> torii\n```\n\n## Development Workflow\n\n**Terminal 1: Start Katana**\n```bash\nkatana --dev --dev.no-fee\n```\n\n**Terminal 2: Deploy world**\n```bash\nsozo build && sozo migrate\n```\n\n**Terminal 3: Start Torii**\n```bash\ntorii --world <WORLD_ADDRESS> --http.cors_origins \"*\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Connection refused\"\n- Check Torii is running\n- Verify port (default 8080)\n- Check firewall rules\n\n### \"World not found\"\n- Verify world address is correct\n- Check RPC URL is accessible\n- Ensure world is deployed\n\n### \"Slow queries\"\n- Use model-specific queries instead of generic `entities`\n- Use pagination\n- Request only needed fields\n\n## Next Steps\n\nAfter Torii setup:\n1. Integrate with client (`dojo-client` skill)\n2. Create optimized queries\n3. Set up subscriptions\n4. Monitor performance\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **dojo-deploy**: Deploy world first\n- **dojo-client**: Use Torii in clients\n- **dojo-world**: Configure what Torii indexes\n- **dojo-migrate**: Restart Torii after migrations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:58:28.068Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing efficient querying and real-time subscriptions to their world state, such as those utilizing GraphQL and SQL databases.","zh":"适合需要高效查询和实时订阅其世界状态的AI代理，例如使用GraphQL和SQL数据库的代理。","ja":"GraphQLやSQLデータベースを使用するなど、効率的なクエリとリアルタイムのサブスクリプションが必要なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"GraphQL 및 SQL 데이터베이스를 사용하는 것과 같이 효율적인 쿼리 및 실시간 구독이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan consultas eficientes y suscripciones en tiempo real a su estado de mundo, como aquellos que utilizan GraphQL y bases de datos SQL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''interrogations efficaces et d''abonnements en temps réel à leur état de monde, tels que ceux utilisant GraphQL et des bases de données SQL.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die effiziente Abfragen und Echtzeitsubskriptionen zu ihrem Weltzustand benötigen, wie z.B. solche, die GraphQL und SQL-Datenbanken verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de consultas eficientes e assinaturas em tempo real para o estado do seu mundo, como aqueles que utilizam GraphQL e bancos de dados SQL.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы эффективные запросы и подписки в режиме реального времени на их состояние мира, такие как те, которые используют GraphQL и базы данных SQL.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى استفسارات فعالة وتسجيلات في الوقت الفعلي لcurrentState العالم، مثل تلك التي تستخدم GraphQL وقواعد البيانات SQL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Torii indexer for efficient querying and real-time subscriptions, leveraging GraphQL queries and direct SQL database access for optimized world state management.","zh":"赋予代理管理Torii索引器的能力，以实现高效的查询和实时订阅，利用GraphQL查询和直接的SQL数据库访问来优化世界状态管理。","ja":"Toriiインデクサーの管理をエージェントに可能にし、効率的なクエリとリアルタイムのサブスクリプションを実現します。GraphQLクエリと直接のSQLデータベースアクセスを利用して、世界状態の管理を最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Torii 인덱서를 관리하여 효율적인 쿼리 및 실시간 구독을 가능하게 하며, GraphQL 쿼리 및 직접 SQL 데이터베이스 액세스를 활용하여 세계 상태 관리를 최적화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar el indexador Torii para consultas eficientes y suscripciones en tiempo real, aprovechando las consultas GraphQL y el acceso directo a la base de datos SQL para una gestión óptima del estado de mundo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''indexeur Torii pour des interrogations efficaces et des abonnements en temps réel, en exploitant les requêtes GraphQL et l''accès direct à la base de données SQL pour une gestion optimale de l''état de monde.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den Torii-Indexer für effiziente Abfragen und Echtzeitsubskriptionen zu verwalten, indem es GraphQL-Abfragen und direkten SQL-Datenbankzugriff für eine optimale Weltzustandsverwaltung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o índice Torii para consultas eficientes e assinaturas em tempo real, aproveitando consultas GraphQL e acesso direto ao banco de dados SQL para gerenciamento otimizado do estado do mundo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять индексом Torii для эффективных запросов и подписок в режиме реального времени, используя запросы GraphQL и прямой доступ к базе данных SQL для оптимизированного управления состоянием мира.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة فهرس Torii للاستفسارات الفعالة والتسجيلات في الوقت الفعلي، مستفيداً من استفسارات GraphQL والوصول المباشر إلى قاعدة البيانات SQL لتدبير حالة العالم الأمثل."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up Torii indexer for real-time entity updates","Configuring GraphQL for efficient world state querying","Creating subscriptions for automated world state monitoring"],"zh":["设置Torii索引器以实现实体的实时更新","配置GraphQL以实现世界状态的高效查询","创建订阅以实现世界状态的自动监控"],"ja":["Toriiインデクサーの設定によるリアルタイムエンティティ更新","GraphQLの設定による効率的な世界状態のクエリ","サブスクリプションの作成による世界状態の自動モニタリング"],"ko":["Torii 인덱서 설정을 통해 엔티티의 실시간 업데이트","GraphQL 설정을 통해 세계 상태의 효율적인 쿼리","구독 생성을 통해 세계 상태의 자동 모니터링"],"es":["Configuración del indexador Torii para actualizaciones de entidades en tiempo real","Configuración de GraphQL para consultas eficientes del estado de mundo","Creación de suscripciones para la supervisión automática del estado de mundo"],"fr":["Configuration de l''indexeur Torii pour des mises à jour d''entités en temps réel","Configuration de GraphQL pour des interrogations efficaces de l''état de monde","Création d''abonnements pour la surveillance automatique de l''état de monde"],"de":["Einrichtung des Torii-Indexers für Echtzeit-Entitätsupdates","Konfiguration von GraphQL für effiziente Weltzustandsabfragen","Erstellung von Subskriptionen für automatisierte Weltzustandsüberwachung"],"pt":["Configurar o índice Torii para atualizações de entidades em tempo real","Configurar o GraphQL para consultas eficientes de estado do mundo","Criar assinaturas para monitoramento automático de estado do mundo"],"ru":["Настройка индекса Torii для обновлений сущностей в режиме реального времени","Настройка GraphQL для эффективных запросов состояния мира","Создание подписок для автоматического мониторинга состояния мира"],"ar":["تكوين فهرس Torii لتحديثات الكيانات في الوقت الفعلي","تكوين GraphQL للاستفسارات الفعالة لcurrentState العالم","إنشاء التسجيلات للت_MONITORING التلقائي لcurrentState العالم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Torii indexer setup","GraphQL and SQL database compatibility needed"],"zh":["需要设置Torii索引器","需要GraphQL和SQL数据库的兼容性"],"ja":["Toriiインデクサーの設定が必要","GraphQLとSQLデータベースの互換性が必要"],"ko":["Torii 인덱서 설정이 필요","GraphQL 및 SQL 데이터베이스의 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración del indexador Torii","Se requiere compatibilidad con GraphQL y base de datos SQL"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de l''indexeur Torii","Nécessite la compatibilité avec GraphQL et la base de données SQL"],"de":["Benötigt Einrichtung des Torii-Indexers","Benötigt Kompatibilität mit GraphQL und SQL-Datenbank"],"pt":["Requer configuração do índice Torii","Compatibilidade com banco de dados GraphQL e SQL necessária"],"ru":["Требуется настройка индекса Torii","Необходима совместимость с базой данных GraphQL и SQL"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين فهرس Torii","التوافق مع قاعدة البيانات GraphQL و SQL ضروري"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c6712331d16ddffd6952a19ef54a650ef23588e2ec297d24345ea7680a9130db","qualityScore":65}');
