イブラリ","予測可能な UI の提供"],"ko":["4KB 미만의 코어 라이브러리","클로저 기반 상태 관리","수동 모드와 가벼운 API 모드 지원","JSX 기반 가상 DOM 라이브러리","예측 가능한 UI 제공"],"es":["Biblioteca de DOM virtual de 4KB","Gestión de estado basada en cerraduras","Modos de componente: manual y automático","Control explícito con la función renew()","Compatibilidad con JSX"],"fr":["Bibliothèque de DOM virtuel de 4KB","Gestion d''état basée sur des fermetures","Modes de composant : manuel et automatique","Contrôle explicite avec la fonction renew()","Compatibilité avec JSX"],"de":["4KB große virtuelle DOM-Bibliothek","Zustandsverwaltung basierend auf Closures","Komponentenmodi: manuell und automatisch","Explizite Kontrolle mit der Funktion renew()","Kompatibilität mit JSX"],"pt":["Biblioteca de DOM virtual leve (~4KB)","Gerenciamento de estado baseado em closure","Dois modos de componente: Manual e Light API","Suporte a JSX","Controle explícito com a função renew()","Modo auto-reativo com lstate e lstore"],"ru":["Лёгкая библиотека виртуального DOM (~4КБ)","Управление состоянием на основе замыкания","Два режима компонентов: Ручной и Light API","Поддержка JSX","Явный контроль с помощью функции renew()","Автореактивный режим с lstate и lstore"],"ar":["مكتبة DOM افتراضية خفيفة (~4KB)","إدارة الحالة القائمة على الإغلاق","وضعان لمكونات: اليدوي وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات الخفيفة","دعم JSX","التحكم الصريح مع وظيفة renew()","الوضع التفاعلي التلقائي مع lstate و lstore"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Lithent","虚拟 DOM","JSX","轻量级","状态管理","可预测的 UI","手动模式","轻量级 API 模式"],"ja":["Lithent","仮想 DOM","JSX","軽量","状態管理","予測可能な UI","マニュアルモード","Light API モード"],"ko":["Lithent","가상 DOM","JSX","가벼운","상태 관리","예측 가능한 UI","수동 모드","가벼운 API 모드"],"es":["Lithent","DOM virtual","gestión de estado","JSX","biblioteca de componentes","desarrollo de aplicaciones","interfaces de usuario","eficiencia en el rendimiento"],"fr":["Lithent","DOM virtuel","gestion d''état","JSX","bibliothèque de composants","développement d''applications","interfaces utilisateur","efficacité du rendement"],"de":["Lithent","virtuelles DOM","Zustandsverwaltung","JSX","Komponentenbibliothek","Anwendungsentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Leistungseffizienz"],"pt":["lithent","dom virtual","gerenciamento de estado","jsx","componentes","ui previsível","escalabilidade","desenvolvimento web","bibliotecas javascript"],"ru":["lithent","виртуальный dom","управление состоянием","jsx","компоненты","предсказуемый ui","масштабируемость","веб-разработка","библиотеки javascript"],"ar":["لithent","DOM افتراضية","إدارة الحالة","jsx","المكونات","واجهة المستخدم المتوقعة","التوسع","تطوير الويب","مكتبات جافاسكريبت"]}},"owner":"superlucky84","repo":"lithent","repoPath":"superlucky84/lithent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lithent","description":"AI agent skills for working with the Lithent library.","version":"{{VERSION}}","bodyPreview":"# Lithent Agent Skills\n\n> Version: {{VERSION}}\n\nThis file provides AI agent skills for working with the Lithent library.\n\n## Overview\n\nLithent is a lightweight (~4KB) JSX-based virtual DOM library with closure-based state management. It offers two component modes:\n- **Manual Mode** (`mount`): Explicit control with `renew()` function\n- **Light API Mode** (`lmount`): Auto-reactive with `lstate`/`lstore`\n\n## Component Creation\n\n### Manual Mode (mount)\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, render } from ''lithent''","body":"# Lithent Agent Skills\n\n> Version: {{VERSION}}\n\nThis file provides AI agent skills for working with the Lithent library.\n\n## Overview\n\nLithent is a lightweight (~4KB) JSX-based virtual DOM library with closure-based state management. It offers two component modes:\n- **Manual Mode** (`mount`): Explicit control with `renew()` function\n- **Light API Mode** (`lmount`): Auto-reactive with `lstate`/`lstore`\n\n## Component Creation\n\n### Manual Mode (mount)\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, render } from ''lithent'';\nimport { state } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Counter = mount<{ initial?: number }>((renew, props) => {\n  const count = state(props.initial ?? 0, renew);\n\n  return () => (\n    <div>\n      <p>Count: {count.value}</p>\n      <button onClick={() => count.value++}>+1</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\nrender(<Counter initial={10} />, document.getElementById(''app'')!);\n```\n\n### Light API Mode (lmount)\n\n```tsx\nimport { lmount, render } from ''lithent'';\nimport { lstate } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Counter = lmount<{ initial?: number }>((props) => {\n  const count = lstate(props.initial ?? 0);\n\n  return () => (\n    <div>\n      <p>Count: {count.value}</p>\n      <button onClick={() => count.value++}>+1</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\nrender(<Counter initial={10} />, document.getElementById(''app'')!);\n```\n\n## State Management\n\n### State (Manual Mode)\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { state, computed, effect } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Component = mount((renew) => {\n  const firstName = state(''John'', renew);\n  const lastName = state(''Doe'', renew);\n\n  // Derived value\n  const fullName = computed(() => `${firstName.value} ${lastName.value}`);\n\n  // Side effect\n  effect(() => {\n    console.log(''Name changed:'', fullName.value);\n    return () => console.log(''Cleanup'');\n  });\n\n  return () => <p>{fullName.value}</p>;\n});\n```\n\n### State (Light API Mode)\n\n```tsx\nimport { lmount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { lstate, computed, effect } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Component = lmount(() => {\n  const firstName = lstate(''John'');\n  const lastName = lstate(''Doe'');\n\n  const fullName = computed(() => `${firstName.value} ${lastName.value}`);\n\n  effect(() => {\n    console.log(''Name changed:'', fullName.value);\n  });\n\n  return () => <p>{fullName.value}</p>;\n});\n```\n\n### Global Store\n\n```tsx\n// Manual Mode\nimport { store } from ''lithent/helper'';\nconst userStore = store({ name: '''', loggedIn: false });\n\nconst Component = mount((renew) => {\n  const user = userStore(renew);\n  return () => <p>{user.name}</p>;\n});\n\n// Light API Mode\nimport { lstore } from ''lithent/helper'';\nconst userStore = lstore({ name: '''', loggedIn: false });\n\nconst Component = lmount(() => {\n  const user = userStore();\n  return () => <p>{user.name}</p>;\n});\n```\n\n## Lifecycle Hooks\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, mountCallback, updateCallback, mountReadyCallback } from ''lithent'';\n\nconst Component = mount((renew) => {\n  // After mount (return cleanup function for unmount)\n  mountCallback(() => {\n    console.log(''Mounted'');\n    return () => console.log(''Unmounted'');\n  });\n\n  // Before each update\n  updateCallback(() => {\n    console.log(''Will update'');\n  });\n\n  // After initial render complete\n  mountReadyCallback(() => {\n    console.log(''Initial render done'');\n  });\n\n  return () => <div>Hello</div>;\n});\n```\n\n## DOM References\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, ref } from ''lithent'';\n\nconst Component = mount((renew) => {\n  const inputRef = ref<HTMLInputElement>(null);\n\n  const focusInput = () => inputRef.value?.focus();\n\n  return () => (\n    <div>\n      <input ref={inputRef} type=\"text\" />\n      <button onClick={focusInput}>Focus</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n```\n\n## Context API\n\n```tsx\n// Manual Mode\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { createContext } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst ThemeContext = createContext<{ theme: string }>();\n\nconst Provider = mount((renew, _props, children) => {\n  return () => (\n    <ThemeContext.Provider value={{ theme: ''dark'' }}>\n      {children}\n    </ThemeContext.Provider>\n  );\n});\n\nconst Consumer = mount((renew) => {\n  const { theme } = ThemeContext.useContext(renew);\n  return () => <p>{theme}</p>;\n});\n\n// Light API Mode\nimport { lmount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { createLContext } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst ThemeContext = createLContext<{ theme: string }>();\n\nconst Consumer = lmount(() => {\n  const { theme } = ThemeContext.useContext();\n  return () => <p>{theme}</p>;\n});\n```\n\n## Portal\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, portal } from ''lithent'';\n\nconst Modal = mount((renew, props: { onClose: () => void }) => {\n  return () => portal(\n    <div class=\"modal-overlay\" onClick={props.onClose}>\n      <div class=\"modal-content\" onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}>\n        <h2>Modal</h2>\n        <button onClick={props.onClose}>Close</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>,\n    document.body\n  );\n});\n```\n\n## List Rendering\n\nAlways use `key` prop for lists:\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { state } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst TodoList = mount((renew) => {\n  const todos = state([\n    { id: 1, text: ''Learn Lithent'', done: false },\n    { id: 2, text: ''Build app'', done: false },\n  ], renew);\n\n  const toggle = (id: number) => {\n    todos.value = todos.value.map(t =>\n      t.id === id ? { ...t, done: !t.done } : t\n    );\n  };\n\n  return () => (\n    <ul>\n      {todos.value.map(todo => (\n        <li key={todo.id} onClick={() => toggle(todo.id)}>\n          {todo.text} {todo.done && ''✓''}\n        </li>\n      ))}\n    </ul>\n  );\n});\n```\n\n## SSR and Hydration\n\n```tsx\n// Server\nimport { renderToString } from ''lithent/ssr'';\nconst html = renderToString(<App />);\n\n// Client (hydrate existing DOM)\nimport { render } from ''lithent'';\nimport { hydration } from ''lithent/ssr'';\nrender(<App />, document.getElementById(''app'')!, hydration);\n```\n\n## FTags (No JSX)\n\n```ts\nimport { fTags, fMount } from ''lithent/ftags'';\nimport { state } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst { div, button, p } = fTags;\n\nconst Counter = fMount((renew) => {\n  const count = state(0, renew);\n  return () => div({},\n    p({}, `Count: ${count.value}`),\n    button({ onClick: () => count.value++ }, ''+1'')\n  );\n});\n```\n\n## HTM (Tagged Templates)\n\n```ts\nimport { lTag } from ''lithent/tag'';\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { state } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst html = lTag;\n\nconst Counter = mount((renew) => {\n  const count = state(0, renew);\n  return () => html`\n    <div>\n      <p>Count: ${count.value}</p>\n      <button onClick=${() => count.value++}>+1</button>\n    </div>\n  `;\n});\n```\n\n## Performance\n\n```tsx\nimport { cacheUpdate, nextTickRender } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\n// Batch multiple state updates into single render\ncacheUpdate(() => {\n  a.value = 1;\n  b.value = 2;\n  c.value = 3;\n});\n\n// Defer render to next tick\nnextTickRender(() => {\n  items.value = [...items.value, ...newItems];\n});\n```\n\n## Children Handling\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { unwrapChildren } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Card = mount((renew, props: { title: string }, children) => {\n  return () => (\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>{props.title}</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">{unwrapChildren(children)}</div>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\n// Usage\n<Card title=\"Title\"><p>Content</p></Card>\n```\n\n## Import Reference\n\n```tsx\n// Core\nimport {\n  mount, lmount, render, h, Fragment, portal,\n  ref, nextTick, mountCallback, updateCallback, mountReadyCallback\n} from ''lithent'';\n\n// Helper\nimport {\n  state, lstate,                    // Reactive state\n  computed, effect,                 // Derived values & side effects\n  store, lstore,                    // Global state\n  createContext, createLContext,   // Context API\n  cacheUpdate, nextTickRender,     // Performance\n  unwrapChildren                    // Utility\n} from ''lithent/helper'';\n\n// SSR\nimport { renderToString, hydration } from ''lithent/ssr'';\n\n// FTags\nimport { fTags, fFragment, fMount } from ''lithent/ftags'';\n\n// HTM\nimport { lTag } from ''lithent/tag'';\n```\n\n## Additional materials (optional)\n\n- `constraints/` (rules, mistakes, troubleshooting)\n- `reference/` (props types, children types, lstore inference)\n- `examples/` (quick examples)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:59:03.893Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing lightweight virtual DOM management with JSX and closure-based state.","zh":"非常适合需要轻量级虚拟DOM管理的前端代理，支持JSX和基于闭包的状态管理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが軽量の仮想DOM管理を必要とする場合に最適です。JSXとクロージャーベースの状態管理をサポートしています。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 가벼운 가상 DOM 관리를 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. JSX와 클로저 기반 상태 관리를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una gestión de DOM virtual ligera con JSX y estado basado en cierres.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une gestion de DOM virtuel légère avec JSX et état basé sur des fermetures.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine leichte Verwaltung des virtuellen DOM mit JSX und schließungsbasiertem Zustand benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento de DOM virtual leve com JSX e estado baseado em closure.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим легкий менеджмент виртуального DOM с JSX и закрытием на основе состояния.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة DOM الافتراضي الخفيفة مع JSX و状態 القائمة على الإغلاق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create predictable UIs with Lithent''s 4KB core, utilizing Manual Mode with `mount` and `renew()` or Light API Mode with `lmount` and `lstate`/`lstore`, all while leveraging JSX-based virtual DOM library capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建可预测的UI的能力，利用Lithent的4KB核心， Manual Mode下使用`mount`和`renew()`，或者Light API Mode下使用`lmount`和`lstate`/`lstore`，同时利用JSX基于的虚拟DOM库能力。","ja":"エージェントが予測可能なUIを作成する能力を与えます。Lithentの4KBコアを利用して、Manual Modeで`mount`と`renew()`、またはLight API Modeで`lmount`と`lstate`/`lstore`を使用します。また、JSXベースの仮想DOMライブラリの機能も利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 예측 가능한 UI를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. Lithent의 4KB 코어를 활용하여 수동 모드에서 `mount`와 `renew()`를 사용하거나 라이트 API 모드에서 `lmount`와 `lstate`/`lstore`를 사용하면서 JSX 기반의 가상 DOM 라이브러리 기능도 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario predecibles con el núcleo de 4KB de Lithent, utilizando el modo manual con `mount` y `renew()` o el modo de API ligero con `lmount` y `lstate`/`lstore`, todo mientras aprovecha las capacidades de la biblioteca de DOM virtual basada en JSX.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur prévisibles avec le noyau 4KB de Lithent, en utilisant le mode manuel avec `mount` et `renew()` ou le mode API léger avec `lmount` et `lstate`/`lstore`, le tout en exploitant les capacités de la bibliothèque de DOM virtuel basée sur JSX.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vorhersehbare Benutzeroberflächen mit Lithents 4KB-Kern zu erstellen, indem sie den manuellen Modus mit `mount` und `renew()` oder den leichten API-Modus mit `lmount` und `lstate`/`lstore` verwenden, während sie die Möglichkeiten der JSX-basierten virtuellen DOM-Bibliothek nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar UIs previsíveis com o núcleo de 4KB da Lithent, utilizando o Modo Manual com `mount` e `renew()` ou o Modo de API Leve com `lmount` e `lstate`/`lstore`, aproveitando todas as capacidades da biblioteca de DOM virtual baseada em JSX.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать предсказуемые интерфейсы пользователя с ядром Lithent объемом 4КБ, используя Ручной Режим с `mount` и `renew()` или Легкий Режим API с `lmount` и `lstate`/`lstore`, используя все возможности библиотеки виртуального DOM на основе JSX.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم يمكن توقعها باستخدام 핵ة ليثينت بحجم 4KB ، باستخدام الوضع اليدوي مع `mount` و `renew()` أو وضع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الخفيف مع `lmount` و `lstate`/`lstore` ، واستخدام جميع قابليات مكتبة DOM الافتراضي القائمة على JSX."},"useCases":{"en":["Building auto-reactive components with Light API Mode","Managing state with closure-based architecture in Manual Mode","Optimizing UI rendering with Lithent''s virtual DOM capabilities"],"zh":["使用Light API Mode构建自动反应组件","使用Manual Mode中的基于闭包的架构管理状态","使用Lithent的虚拟DOM能力优化UI渲染"],"ja":["Light API Modeを使用して自動反応コンポーネントを構築する","Manual Modeのクロージャーベースのアーキテクチャを使用して状態を管理する","Lithentの仮想DOM機能を使用してUIレンダリングを最適化する"],"ko":["라이트 API 모드를 사용하여 자동 반응 컴포넌트를 구축하는 것","수동 모드의 클로저 기반 아키텍처를 사용하여 상태를 관리하는 것","Lithent의 가상 DOM 기능을 사용하여 UI 렌더링을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Construir componentes auto-reactivos con el modo de API ligero","Gestionar el estado con arquitectura basada en cierres en el modo manual","Optimizar la representación de la interfaz de usuario con las capacidades de DOM virtual de Lithent"],"fr":["Construire des composants auto-réactifs avec le mode API léger","Gérer l''état avec une architecture basée sur des fermetures en mode manuel","Optimiser le rendu de l''interface utilisateur avec les capacités de DOM virtuel de Lithent"],"de":["Auto-reaktive Komponenten mit dem leichten API-Modus erstellen","Zustand mit schließungsbasierter Architektur im manuellen Modus verwalten","Benutzeroberflächen-Rendering mit den virtuellen DOM-Funktionen von Lithent optimieren"],"pt":["Construir componentes auto-reativos com o Modo de API Leve","Gerenciar estado com arquitetura baseada em closure no Modo Manual","Otimizar a renderização da UI com as capacidades de DOM virtual da Lithent"],"ru":["Построение автореактивных компонентов в Легком Режиме API","Управление состоянием с архитектурой на основе закрытия в Ручном Режиме","Оптимизация рендеринга интерфейса пользователя с возможностями виртуального DOM от Lithent"],"ar":["بناء المكونات التفاعلية ذاتيًا مع وضع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الخفيف","إدارة الحالة باستخدام هندسة القائمة على الإغلاق في الوضع اليدوي","تحسين عرض واجهة المستخدم باستخدام إمكانيات DOM الافتراضي من ليثينت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of JSX and virtual DOM concepts","Limited to frontend applications due to virtual DOM nature"],"zh":["需要了解JSX和虚拟DOM概念","由于虚拟DOM的性质，仅限于前端应用"],"ja":["JSXと仮想DOMの概念を理解する必要がある","仮想DOMの性質上、フロントエンドアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["JSX와 가상 DOM 개념을 이해해야 함","가상 DOM의 특성으로 인해 프론트엔드 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de conceptos de JSX y DOM virtual","Limitado a aplicaciones frontend debido a la naturaleza del DOM virtual"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des concepts de JSX et de DOM virtuel","Limité aux applications frontend en raison de la nature du DOM virtuel"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von JSX- und virtuellem DOM-Konzepten","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Anwendungen aufgrund der virtuellen DOM-Natur"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de conceitos de JSX e DOM virtual","Limitado a aplicações frontend devido à natureza do DOM virtual"],"ru":["Требует понимания концепций JSX и виртуального DOM","Ограничен фронтенд-приложениями из-за природы виртуального DOM"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مفاهيم JSX و DOM الافتراضي","محدود للتطبيقات الأمامية بسبب طبيعة DOM الافتراضي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ea049ee5b25a6a0c51bd1dc886405d1c58633986afcd6e51192b58e962dcfc11","qualityScore":45}');
