onorepo full-stack","desarrollo full-stack","React","Tailwind","Bun","Elysia","Drizzle","flujos de trabajo","guía de implementación"],"fr":["monorepo full-stack","développement full-stack","React","Tailwind","Bun","Elysia","Drizzle","flux de travail","guide d''implémentation"],"de":["Full-Stack-Monorepo","Full-Stack-Entwicklung","React","Tailwind","Bun","Elysia","Drizzle","monorepo-spezifische Workflows","Implementierungsanleitung"],"pt":["monorepo full-stack","desenvolvimento full-stack","React 19","Tailwind v4","Bun","Elysia","Drizzle","workflows de monorepo"],"ru":["монорепозиторий full-stack","разработка full-stack","React 19","Tailwind v4","Bun","Elysia","Drizzle","рабочие процессы монорепозитория"],"ar":["مونوريبو فول ستاك","تطوير فول ستاك","رياكت 19","تايلويند 4","بن","إيليسيا","درزل","سير العمل لمونوريبو"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"link","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Wellness Link - Full-Stack Monorepo Expert\n\nExpert for the wellness-link monorepo. Combines frontend (React 19 + Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui) and backend (Bun + Elysia + Drizzle) development with monorepo-specific workflows.\n\n## Available Documentation\n\n### Patterns\n- **[Full-Stack Workflow](patterns/fullstack-workflow.md)** - Complete guide for implementing features across packages\n- **[Monorepo Commands](patterns/monorepo-commands.md)** - Bun workspace commands, development, and troubleshooting","body":"# Wellness Link - Full-Stack Monorepo Expert\n\nExpert for the wellness-link monorepo. Combines frontend (React 19 + Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui) and backend (Bun + Elysia + Drizzle) development with monorepo-specific workflows.\n\n## Available Documentation\n\n### Patterns\n- **[Full-Stack Workflow](patterns/fullstack-workflow.md)** - Complete guide for implementing features across packages\n- **[Monorepo Commands](patterns/monorepo-commands.md)** - Bun workspace commands, development, and troubleshooting\n\n### Agent References\n- **[Web Agent](reference/web-agent.md)** - Quick reference to `.claude/agent/web.md`\n- **[API Agent](reference/api-agent.md)** - Quick reference to `.claude/agent/api.md`\n\n## Monorepo Structure\n\n```\nwellness-link/\n├── packages/\n│   ├── web/          # React 19 + Vite (port 5176)\n│   └── api/          # Bun + Elysia (port 5300)\n├── bunfig.toml       # Bun workspaces\n└── package.json      # Root workspace\n```\n\n## Critical Cross-Package Rules\n\n### 1. Type Sharing\n```typescript\n// API defines types, web imports via edenTreaty\n// packages/api/src/index.ts\nexport const app = new Elysia()...\n\n// packages/web/src/lib/api.ts\nimport type { App } from \"@wellness-link/api\"\nexport const api = edenTreaty<App>(\"http://localhost:5300\")\n```\n\n### 2. Language & Theme\n- **User-facing text**: Spanish (buttons, forms, messages)\n- **Technical docs**: English (code, comments, README)\n- **Theme**: Always use CSS variables (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`)\n\n### 3. Workspace Commands\n```bash\n# Run from root\nbun --filter @wellness-link/web dev    # Frontend only\nbun --filter @wellness-link/api dev    # Backend only\n\n# Development (both in parallel)\nbun run dev                             # Runs both packages\n```\n\n## Web Package (packages/web)\n\n### Stack\n- React 19 + React Router 7 (file-based)\n- Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui\n- TanStack Query (server state)\n- React Hook Form + Zod (forms)\n\n### Critical Rules\n```typescript\n// ALWAYS use @/ alias\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\n// ALWAYS use cn() for classes\n<div className={cn(\"flex\", className, isActive && \"bg-primary\")} />\n\n// ALWAYS Spanish UI text\n<Button>Guardar Cambios</Button>\ntoast.success(\"Perfil actualizado\")\n```\n\n### Data Fetching\n```typescript\nconst { data, isLoading } = useQuery({\n  queryKey: [\"profiles\"],\n  queryFn: async () => {\n    const { data, error } = await api.api.profiles.get()\n    if (error) throw error\n    return data\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## API Package (packages/api)\n\n### Stack\n- Bun (runtime)\n- Elysia (framework)\n- Drizzle ORM (PostgreSQL)\n- Better Auth (authentication)\n\n### Critical Rules\n```typescript\n// Table names are SINGULAR\nimport { profile, asset, socialLink } from \"../../db/schema\"\n\n// ALWAYS register services in plugins/services.ts\nexport const servicesPlugin = new Elysia({ name: \"services\" }).derive(\n  { as: \"global\" },\n  async () => {\n    const featureRepo = new FeatureRepository();\n    const featureService = new FeatureService(featureRepo);\n    return { services: { featureRepo, featureService } };\n  },\n);\n\n// Access relations via name\nconst platform = click.socialLink.platform; // ✅\nconst platform = click.platform;            // ❌\n```\n\n### Route Pattern\n```typescript\nexport const featureRoutes = new Elysia({ prefix: \"/feature\" })\n  .use(errorMiddleware)\n  .use(servicesPlugin)\n  .use(authGuard)\n  .get(\"/\", ({ ctx, services }) => services.featureService.getAll(ctx!))\n  .post(\"/\", ({ body, ctx, services, set }) => {\n    set.status = 201;\n    return services.featureService.create(ctx!, body);\n  }, { body: t.Object({ name: t.String() }) });\n```\n\n## Full-Stack Feature Workflow\n\n### 1. Define API Contract\n```typescript\n// packages/api/src/api/routes/feature.ts\nexport const featureRoutes = new Elysia({ prefix: \"/feature\" })\n  .get(\"/\", () => [...])\n  .post(\"/\", ({ body }) => body, {\n    body: t.Object({\n      name: t.String(),\n      description: t.String(),\n    })\n  });\n```\n\n### 2. Add Route to App\n```typescript\n// packages/api/src/index.ts\nimport { featureRoutes } from \"./api/routes/feature\"\n\nexport const app = new Elysia()\n  .use(featureRoutes)\n  ...\n```\n\n### 3. Frontend Integration\n```typescript\n// packages/web/src/hooks/use-features.ts\nexport function useFeatures() {\n  return useQuery({\n    queryKey: [\"features\"],\n    queryFn: async () => {\n      const { data, error } = await api.api.feature.get()\n      if (error) throw error\n      return data\n    },\n  })\n}\n\n// packages/web/src/components/FeatureForm.tsx\nconst mutation = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: async (values: { name: string; description: string }) => {\n    const { data, error } = await api.api.feature.post(values)\n    if (error) throw error\n    return data\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Authentication Flow\n```typescript\n// API: Better Auth automatic\n// packages/api/src/lib/auth.ts\nexport const auth = betterAuth({ ... })\n\n// Web: Use auth client\n// packages/web/src/hooks/use-auth.ts\nconst { data: session } = useSession()\n```\n\n### File Upload (Full-Stack)\n```typescript\n// API: Asset service\nconst asset = await services.assetService.create(ctx, {\n  file: request.file,\n  type: \"avatar\",\n})\n\n// Web: Form with file input\nconst { mutate } = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: async (file: File) => {\n    const formData = new FormData()\n    formData.append(\"file\", file)\n    const { data } = await api.api.assets.post(formData)\n    return data\n  },\n})\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n```typescript\n// API: HTTP exceptions\nthrow new NotFoundException(\"Profile not found\")     // 404\nthrow new ConflictException(\"Username exists\")       // 409\n\n// Web: React Query + toast\nonError: (error) => {\n  toast.error(error.message || \"Error al guardar\")\n}\n```\n\n## Monorepo Best Practices\n\n### 1. Development Setup\n```bash\n# Install all dependencies\nbun install\n\n# Start both packages\nbun run dev\n\n# Type check entire monorepo\nbun run typecheck\n```\n\n### 2. Database Migrations\n```bash\n# Generate migration\ncd packages/api && bun run db:generate\n\n# Apply migration\nbun run db:migrate\n\n# Seed data\nbun run db:seed\n```\n\n### 3. Cross-Package Changes\n**Order**: API first, then Web\n1. Add DB schema/migration\n2. Create repository + service\n3. Add API route\n4. Create frontend hook\n5. Build UI component\n\n### 4. Type Safety\n```typescript\n// API exports App type\nexport type App = typeof app\n\n// Web imports and uses it\nimport type { App } from \"@wellness-link/api\"\nexport const api = edenTreaty<App>(\"http://localhost:5300\")\n```\n\n## Key Tables\n\n- **user**: Better Auth authentication\n- **profile**: Wellness professional info\n- **socialLink**: Orderable social media links\n- **healthSurvey**: Visitor survey responses\n- **analytics**: Views and clicks tracking\n- **asset**: File uploads (avatars, images)\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Web development\ncd packages/web\nbun run dev          # Port 5176\nbun run build\nbun run lint\n\n# API development\ncd packages/api\nbun run dev          # Port 5300\nbun run db:seed\nbun run db:reset\nbun run lint\n\n# Monorepo (from root)\nbun run dev          # Both packages\nbun install          # All dependencies\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing features that span both web and api\n- Setting up new API endpoints with frontend integration\n- Working with shared types across packages\n- Monorepo workflow questions\n- Cross-package refactoring\n- Full-stack feature development\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:59:23.388Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack AI Agents needing expertise in monorepo development with React, Tailwind, and Bun.","zh":"适合需要在monorepo开发中使用React、Tailwind和Bun的全栈AI代理的理想选择","ja":"React、Tailwind、Bunを使用したmonorepo開発を必要とするフルスタックAIエージェントに最適","ko":"React, Tailwind, Bun을 사용한 모노레포 개발을 필요로 하는 풀스택 AI 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA de pila completa que necesitan experiencia en desarrollo de monorepo con React, Tailwind y Bun.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA full-stack nécessitant une expertise en développement de monorepo avec React, Tailwind et Bun.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-KI-Agents, die Erfahrung in der Monorepo-Entwicklung mit React, Tailwind und Bun benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA de pilha completa que necessitam de especialização em desenvolvimento de monorepo com React, Tailwind e Bun.","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов ИИ, которым требуется экспертиза в разработке монорепозитория с использованием React, Tailwind и Bun.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الكامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى الخبرة في تطوير مونوربو مع رياكت وتيولاند وبون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement features across packages using full-stack workflows, combining frontend development with React 19 and Tailwind v4, and backend development with Bun, Elysia, and Drizzle, while leveraging monorepo-specific commands and troubleshooting techniques.","zh":"赋予代理实现功能跨包使用全栈工作流的能力，结合React 19和Tailwind v4的前端开发，以及使用Bun、Elysia和Drizzle的后端开发，同时利用monorepo特定的命令和故障排除技术","ja":"フルスタックワークフローを使用して機能をパッケージ間で実装する能力をエージェントに与え、React 19とTailwind v4を使用したフロントエンド開発と、Bun、Elysia、Drizzleを使用したバックエンド開発を組み合わせ、monorepo特有のコマンドとトラブルシューティング技術を活用","ko":"전체 스택 워크플로를 사용하여 기능을 패키지 사이에서 구현할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하며, React 19과 Tailwind v4를 사용한 프론트엔드 개발과 Bun, Elysia, Drizzle를 사용한 백엔드 개발을 결합하고, 모노레포 특有的 명령어와 문제 해결 기술을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar características en varios paquetes utilizando flujos de trabajo de pila completa, combinando el desarrollo frontend con React 19 y Tailwind v4, y el desarrollo backend con Bun, Elysia y Drizzle, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha comandos y técnicas de depuración específicos de monorepo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités à travers des packages en utilisant des flux de travail full-stack, combinant le développement frontend avec React 19 et Tailwind v4, et le développement backend avec Bun, Elysia et Drizzle, tout en exploitant des commandes et des techniques de débogage spécifiques à monorepo.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Funktionen über Pakete hinweg mithilfe von Full-Stack-Workflows umzusetzen, die Frontend-Entwicklung mit React 19 und Tailwind v4 mit Backend-Entwicklung mit Bun, Elysia und Drizzle kombinieren, während sie monorepo-spezifische Befehle und Fehlersuche-Techniken nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar recursos em vários pacotes usando fluxos de trabalho de pilha completa, combinando desenvolvimento de frontend com React 19 e Tailwind v4, e desenvolvimento de backend com Bun, Elysia e Drizzle, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita comandos e técnicas de solução de problemas específicos do monorepo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать функции во всех пакетах, используя полнофункциональные рабочие процессы, объединяя разработку frontend с React 19 и Tailwind v4, и разработку backend с Bun, Elysia и Drizzle, а также использует команды и методы устранения неполадок, специфичные для монорепозитория.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ الميزات عبر الحزم باستخدام سير عمل الكامل الحزمة، بإضافة تطوير واجهة المستخدم مع رياكت 19 وتايل ويند 4، وتطوير الخلفية مع بون، إليسيا، ودرزل، مع الاستفادة من أوامر وحل TECHNIQUES محددة لمشاكل مونوربو."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing features across frontend and backend packages in a monorepo","Troubleshooting issues with Bun workspace commands and development","Developing full-stack applications with shadcn/ui and Drizzle"],"zh":["在monorepo中跨前端和后端包实现功能","排除使用Bun工作空间命令和开发时遇到的问题","使用shadcn/ui和Drizzle开发全栈应用"],"ja":["monorepo内でフロントエンドとバックエンドのパッケージ間で機能を実装","Bunワークスペースコマンドと開発時の問題をトラブルシューティング","shadcn/uiとDrizzleを使用したフルスタックアプリケーションの開発"],"ko":["모노레포에서 프론트엔드와 백엔드 패키지 사이에서 기능을 구현","Bun 작업공간 명령어와 개발시 발생하는 문제를 해결","shadcn/ui와 Drizzle를 사용한 풀스택 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Implementar características en paquetes frontend y backend en un monorepo","Depurar problemas con comandos de espacio de trabajo de Bun y desarrollo","Desarrollar aplicaciones full-stack con shadcn/ui y Drizzle"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités à travers des packages frontend et backend dans un monorepo","Déboguer des problèmes avec des commandes d''espace de travail de Bun et de développement","Développer des applications full-stack avec shadcn/ui et Drizzle"],"de":["Funktionen über Frontend- und Backend-Pakete in einem Monorepo umsetzen","Probleme mit Bun-Arbeitsbereichsbefehlen und -entwicklung beheben","Full-Stack-Anwendungen mit shadcn/ui und Drizzle entwickeln"],"pt":["Implementar recursos em pacotes de frontend e backend em um monorepo","Solucionar problemas com comandos de espaço de trabalho do Bun e desenvolvimento","Desenvolver aplicações de pilha completa com shadcn/ui e Drizzle"],"ru":["Реализация функций во фронтенд и бэкенд-пакетах в монорепозитории","Устранение неполадок с командами рабочего пространства Bun и разработки","Разработка полнофункциональных приложений с shadcn/ui и Drizzle"],"ar":["تنفيذ الميزات عبر حزم واجهة المستخدم والخلفية في مونوربو","حل مشاكل مع أوامر مساحة العمل بون والتنمية","تطوير تطبيقات الكامل الحزمة مع شادكن/واجهة المستخدم ودرزل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React, Tailwind, and Bun","Limited to monorepo development","Specific to frontend and backend development with mentioned libraries and frameworks"],"zh":["需要了解React、Tailwind和Bun","仅限monorepo开发","仅适用于前端和后端开发，使用指定的库和框架"],"ja":["React、Tailwind、Bunの知識が必要","monorepo開発のみに限定","前端とバックエンド開発のみに適し、指定されたライブラリとフレームワークを使用"],"ko":["React, Tailwind, Bun에 대한 지식이 필요","모노레포 개발만 해당","프론트엔드와 백엔드 개발만 해당하며, 지정된 라이브러리와 프레임워크를 사용"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React, Tailwind y Bun","Limitado al desarrollo de monorepo","Específico para el desarrollo frontend y backend con las bibliotecas y frameworks mencionados"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React, Tailwind et Bun","Limité au développement de monorepo","Spécifique au développement frontend et backend avec les bibliothèques et les frameworks mentionnés"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React, Tailwind und Bun","Begrenzt auf Monorepo-Entwicklung","Spezifisch für Frontend- und Backend-Entwicklung mit den genannten Bibliotheken und Frameworks"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React, Tailwind e Bun","Limitado 