يانة الكود","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Const Types Pattern","Flat Interfaces","单一事实来源","运行时值","自动补全","易于重构"],"ja":["Const Types Pattern","Flat Interfaces","単一の真実源","実行時値","自動補完","容易なリファクタリング"],"ko":["Const Types Pattern","Flat Interfaces","단일 사실 출처","실행시 값","자동 완성","쉽게 리팩토링"],"pt":["Padrões de tipo para melhorar a manutenção do código","Interfaces planas para simplificar a estrutura do código","Tipagem estática para reduzir erros em tempo de execução","Autocompletar para melhorar a produtividade do desenvolvedor","Refatoração fácil para manter o código atualizado"],"ru":["Шаблоны типов для улучшения поддержки кода","Плоские интерфейсы для упрощения структуры кода","Статическая типизация для снижения ошибок во время выполнения","Автозаполнение для повышения производительности разработчика","Легкая рефакторинг для поддержания кода в актуальном состоянии"],"ar":["أنماط النوع لتحسين صيانة الكود","الواجهات المسطحة لتسهيل هيكل الكود","نوعية ثابتة لتقليل الأخطاء في وقت التشغيل","التحكم التلقائي لتحسين إنتاجية المطور","إعادة هيكلة سهلة لتحديث الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript","Const Types Pattern","Flat Interfaces","静态类型检查","JavaScript超集","代码质量","开发效率"],"ja":["TypeScript","Const Types Pattern","Flat Interfaces","静的型チェック","JavaScriptの超集合","コード品質","開発効率"],"ko":["타입스크립트","Const Types Pattern","Flat Interfaces","정적 타입 체크","자바스크립트의 상위 집합","코드 품질","개발 효율"],"pt":["TypeScript","desenvolvimento de software","padrões de tipo","interfaces planas","tipagem estática","autocompletar","refatoração"],"ru":["TypeScript","разработка программного обеспечения","шаблоны типов","плоские интерфейсы","статическая типизация","автозаполнение","рефакторинг"],"ar":["TypeScript","تطوير البرمجيات","أنماط النوع","الواجهات المسطحة","نوعية ثابتة","التحكم التلقائي","إعادة هيكلة"]}},"owner":"sernafernando","repo":"pricing-app","repoPath":"sernafernando/pricing-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"typescript","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## Const Types Pattern (REQUIRED)\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ ALWAYS: Create const object first, then extract type\nconst STATUS = {\n  ACTIVE: \"active\",\n  INACTIVE: \"inactive\",\n  PENDING: \"pending\",\n} as const;\n\ntype Status = (typeof STATUS)[keyof typeof STATUS];\n\n// ❌ NEVER: Direct union types\ntype Status = \"active\" | \"inactive\" | \"pending\";\n```\n\n**Why?** Single source of truth, runtime values, autocomplete, easier refactoring.\n\n## Flat Interfaces (REQUIRED)\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ ALWAYS: One level depth,","body":"## Const Types Pattern (REQUIRED)\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ ALWAYS: Create const object first, then extract type\nconst STATUS = {\n  ACTIVE: \"active\",\n  INACTIVE: \"inactive\",\n  PENDING: \"pending\",\n} as const;\n\ntype Status = (typeof STATUS)[keyof typeof STATUS];\n\n// ❌ NEVER: Direct union types\ntype Status = \"active\" | \"inactive\" | \"pending\";\n```\n\n**Why?** Single source of truth, runtime values, autocomplete, easier refactoring.\n\n## Flat Interfaces (REQUIRED)\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ ALWAYS: One level depth, nested objects → dedicated interface\ninterface UserAddress {\n  street: string;\n  city: string;\n}\n\ninterface User {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  address: UserAddress;  // Reference, not inline\n}\n\ninterface Admin extends User {\n  permissions: string[];\n}\n\n// ❌ NEVER: Inline nested objects\ninterface User {\n  address: { street: string; city: string };  // NO!\n}\n```\n\n## Never Use `any`\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use unknown for truly unknown types\nfunction parse(input: unknown): User {\n  if (isUser(input)) return input;\n  throw new Error(\"Invalid input\");\n}\n\n// ✅ Use generics for flexible types\nfunction first<T>(arr: T[]): T | undefined {\n  return arr[0];\n}\n\n// ❌ NEVER\nfunction parse(input: any): any { }\n```\n\n## Utility Types\n\n```typescript\nPick<User, \"id\" | \"name\">     // Select fields\nOmit<User, \"id\">              // Exclude fields\nPartial<User>                 // All optional\nRequired<User>                // All required\nReadonly<User>                // All readonly\nRecord<string, User>          // Object type\nExtract<Union, \"a\" | \"b\">     // Extract from union\nExclude<Union, \"a\">           // Exclude from union\nNonNullable<T | null>         // Remove null/undefined\nReturnType<typeof fn>         // Function return type\nParameters<typeof fn>         // Function params tuple\n```\n\n## Type Guards\n\n```typescript\nfunction isUser(value: unknown): value is User {\n  return (\n    typeof value === \"object\" &&\n    value !== null &&\n    \"id\" in value &&\n    \"name\" in value\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Import Types\n\n```typescript\nimport type { User } from \"./types\";\nimport { createUser, type Config } from \"./utils\";\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:01:09.949Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing advanced TypeScript type management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级TypeScript类型管理功能的代码生成代理。","ja":"TypeScriptの高度な型管理機能を必要とするコード生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 TypeScript 타입 관리 기능이 필요한 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de código que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de administración de tipos de TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de code nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion de types TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte TypeScript-Typverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing advanced TypeScript type management capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing advanced TypeScript type management capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing advanced TypeScript type management capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce const types patterns and utilize flat interfaces, providing a single source of truth, runtime values, and easier refactoring using TypeScript''s type inference and keyof operator.","zh":"赋予代理强制执行const类型模式和利用平坦接口的能力，提供单一的真相来源、运行时值以及使用TypeScript的类型推断和keyof运算符进行更容易的重构。","ja":"constタイプパターンを強制実行し、平坦なインターフェイスを利用する機能をエージェントに与え、単一の真実源、ランタイム値、およびTypeScriptの型推論とkeyof演算子を使用したより簡単なリファクタリングを提供します。","ko":"const 타입 패턴을 강제로 적용하고, 평면 인터페이스를 활용하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여, 단일의 진실 源, 런타임 값, 및 TypeScript의 타입 추론과 keyof 연산자를 사용한 더 쉬운 리팩토링을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar patrones de tipos const y utilizar interfaces planas, proporcionando una única fuente de verdad, valores de tiempo de ejecución y una refactorización más sencilla utilizando la inferencia de tipos y el operador keyof de TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des modèles de types const et d''utiliser des interfaces planes, fournissant une source unique de vérité, des valeurs de runtime et une refactoring plus facile en utilisant l''inférence de types et l''opérateur keyof de TypeScript.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, const-Typmuster durchzusetzen und flache Schnittstellen zu nutzen, wodurch eine einzige Wahrheitsquelle, Laufzeitwerte und eine einfachere Refaktorierung unter Verwendung der Typinferenz und des keyof-Operators von TypeScript bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to enforce const types patterns and utilize flat interfaces, providing a single source of truth, runtime values, and easier refactoring using TypeScript''s type inference and keyof operator.","ru":"Empowers agents to enforce const types patterns and utilize flat interfaces, providing a single source of truth, runtime values, and easier refactoring using TypeScript''s type inference and keyof operator.","ar":"Empowers agents to enforce const types patterns and utilize flat interfaces, providing a single source of truth, runtime values, and easier refactoring using TypeScript''s type inference and keyof operator."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing const types patterns for runtime values","Creating flat interfaces for easier refactoring","Utilizing keyof operator for type-safe property access"],"zh":["执行const类型模式以获得运行时值","创建平坦接口以便于重构","利用keyof运算符进行类型安全的属性访问"],"ja":["ランタイム値を取得するためのconstタイプパターンの適用","リファクタリングを容易にするための平坦なインターフェイスの作成","型安全なプロパティアクセスを行うためのkeyof演算子の利用"],"ko":["런타임 값을 얻기 위한 const 타입 패턴의 적용","리팩토링을 쉽게 하기 위한 평면 인터페이스의 생성","타입 안전한 속성 접근을 위한 keyof 연산자의 활용"],"es":["Aplicar patrones de tipos const para valores de tiempo de ejecución","Crear interfaces planas para una refactorización más sencilla","Utilizar el operador keyof para un acceso a propiedades seguros mediante tipos"],"fr":["Appliquer des modèles de types const pour les valeurs de runtime","Créer des interfaces planes pour une refactoring plus facile","Utiliser l''opérateur keyof pour un accès aux propriétés sécurisé par type"],"de":["Durchsetzen von const-Typmustern für Laufzeitwerte","Erstellen von flachen Schnittstellen für eine einfachere Refaktorierung","Verwenden des keyof-Operators für einen typsicheren Eigenschaftenzugriff"],"pt":["Enforcing const types patterns for runtime values","Creating flat interfaces for easier refactoring","Utilizing keyof operator for type-safe property access"],"ru":["Enforcing const types patterns for runtime values","Creating flat interfaces for easier refactoring","Utilizing keyof operator for type-safe property access"],"ar":["Enforcing const types patterns for runtime values","Creating flat interfaces for easier refactoring","Utilizing keyof operator for type-safe property access"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript 4.1+ for const assertions","Limited to TypeScript projects only"],"zh":["需要TypeScript 4.1+才支持const断言","仅限于TypeScript项目"],"ja":["constアサーションのサポートにはTypeScript 4.1+が必要","TypeScriptプロジェクトのみに限定"],"ko":["const断言을 지원하려면 TypeScript 4.1+가 필요","TypeScript 프로젝트에만 محدود"],"es":["Requiere TypeScript 4.1+ para afirmaciones const","Limitado a proyectos de TypeScript solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite TypeScript 4.1+ pour les assertions const","Limité aux projets TypeScript uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript 4.1+ für const-Aussagen","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-Projekte nur"],"pt":["Requires TypeScript 4.1+ for const assertions","Limited to TypeScript projects only"],"ru":["Requires TypeScript 4.1+ for const assertions","Limited to TypeScript projects only"],"ar":["Requires TypeScript 4.1+ for const assertions","Limited to TypeScript projects only"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"54d935b2fabfc1e25909b800fd28d6347d358a017ac37d0f0adfeb53a4f4e1e7","qualityScore":0}');
