wie Sie die Best Practices in Ihren API-Projekten anwenden.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["HTTP ","RFC 7807 "," "," "," "," "],"ja":["HTTP ","RFC 7807 "," "," "," "," "],"ko":["HTTP ","RFC 7807 "," "," "," "," "],"es":["Manejo de errores con códigos de estado HTTP","Validación y saneamiento de entrada","Formatos de respuesta consistentes","Identificadores de correlación de solicitudes","Límites de velocidad","Mensajes de error de seguridad"],"fr":["Gestion des erreurs avec des codes d''état HTTP","Validation et nettoyage de l''entrée","Formats de réponse cohérents","Identificateurs de corrélation de requêtes","Limites de débit","Messages d''erreur de sécurité"],"de":["Fehlerbehandlung mit HTTP-Statuscodes","Validierung und Sanierung von Eingaben","Konsistente Antwortformate","Korrelations-IDs für Anfragen","Ratenbegrenzung","Sicherheitsfehlermeldungen"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API ","REST API","API "," "," ","API "],"ja":["API ","REST API","API "," "," ","API "],"ko":["API ","REST API","API "," "," ","API "],"es":["desarrollo de API","API REST","manejo de errores","validación de entrada","formatos de respuesta","seguridad de API","mejores prácticas de API","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["développement d''API","API REST","gestion des erreurs","validation de l''entrée","formats de réponse","sécurité de l''API","meilleures pratiques d''API","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["API-Entwicklung","REST-API","Fehlerbehandlung","Validierung von Eingaben","Antwortformate","API-Sicherheit","Best Practices für APIs","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"API Development","description":"Build REST APIs with proper error handling, status codes, request validation, response formatting, and rate limiting. Apply when creating API routes, handling errors, validating input, or designing API responses.","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# API Development\n\nSystematic REST API development with error handling, validation, and consistent response formats.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis Skill enforces:\n- HTTP status codes (appropriate, not overused)\n- RFC 7807 Problem Details for errors\n- Input validation and sanitization\n- Consistent response formatting\n- Request correlation IDs\n- Rate limiting\n- Security-first error messages\n- Centralized error handling\n\nApply when building API routes, handling errors, or designing responses.\n\n## HTTP Status","body":"# API Development\n\nSystematic REST API development with error handling, validation, and consistent response formats.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis Skill enforces:\n- HTTP status codes (appropriate, not overused)\n- RFC 7807 Problem Details for errors\n- Input validation and sanitization\n- Consistent response formatting\n- Request correlation IDs\n- Rate limiting\n- Security-first error messages\n- Centralized error handling\n\nApply when building API routes, handling errors, or designing responses.\n\n## HTTP Status Codes\n\n### Status Code Categories\n\n| Range | Purpose | Common Examples |\n|-------|---------|-----------------|\n| 200-299 | Success | 200 OK, 201 Created, 204 No Content |\n| 300-399 | Redirection | 301 Moved Permanently, 302 Found |\n| 400-499 | Client Errors | 400 Bad Request, 401 Unauthorized, 404 Not Found |\n| 500-599 | Server Errors | 500 Internal Error, 503 Service Unavailable |\n\n### Correct Status Codes\n\n```ts\n// ✅ GOOD: Specific status codes\n200  // GET: Resource retrieved\n201  // POST: Resource created\n204  // DELETE: Resource deleted (no content)\n400  // Bad Request: Validation failed\n401  // Unauthorized: Not authenticated\n403  // Forbidden: Authenticated but no permission\n404  // Not Found: Resource doesn''t exist\n409  // Conflict: Duplicate email\n422  // Unprocessable Entity: Semantic error\n429  // Too Many Requests: Rate limited\n500  // Internal Server Error: Server bug\n\n// ❌ BAD: Vague status codes\n200  // Success response for everything\n500  // Error response for everything\n200  // Returned even when validation failed\n```\n\n## Error Response Format (RFC 7807)\n\n### Problem Details Structure\n\n```ts\n// RFC 7807 Problem Details\ntype ProblemDetails = {\n  type: string;        // URL to error type documentation\n  title: string;       // Short error title\n  status: number;      // HTTP status code\n  detail: string;      // Specific error details\n  instance?: string;   // Request ID for tracking\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;  // Field-level errors\n};\n```\n\n### Implementation\n\n```ts\n// lib/errors.ts\nexport class ApiError extends Error {\n  constructor(\n    public status: number,\n    public title: string,\n    public detail: string,\n    public type: string = ''about:blank'',\n    public errors?: Record<string, string[]>\n  ) {\n    super(detail);\n    this.name = ''ApiError'';\n  }\n\n  toJSON() {\n    return {\n      type: this.type,\n      title: this.title,\n      status: this.status,\n      detail: this.detail,\n      instance: this.instance,\n      ...(this.errors && { errors: this.errors })\n    };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Error Responses\n\n```ts\n// ✅ GOOD: RFC 7807 format\n{\n  \"type\": \"https://api.example.com/errors/validation-failed\",\n  \"title\": \"Validation Failed\",\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"detail\": \"The request body contains invalid data\",\n  \"instance\": \"req-12345\",\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"email\": [\"Invalid email format\"],\n    \"age\": [\"Must be >= 18\"]\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ GOOD: Unauthorized (no sensitive details)\n{\n  \"type\": \"https://api.example.com/errors/unauthorized\",\n  \"title\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"detail\": \"Authentication required\",\n  \"instance\": \"req-12346\"\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: Leaks internal details\n{\n  \"error\": \"User not found in database\",\n  \"stack\": \"Error: query failed at line 42...\"\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: Not structured\n{\n  \"message\": \"Something went wrong\"\n}\n```\n\n## Centralized Error Handler\n\n```ts\n// middleware/error-handler.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport { ApiError } from ''@/lib/errors'';\n\nexport function errorHandler(error: unknown) {\n  const requestId = crypto.randomUUID();\n\n  // Log error (internal, never exposed)\n  console.error(`[${requestId}] Error:`, error);\n\n  // ApiError (predictable)\n  if (error instanceof ApiError) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      {\n        type: error.type,\n        title: error.title,\n        status: error.status,\n        detail: error.detail,\n        instance: requestId,\n        ...(error.errors && { errors: error.errors })\n      },\n      { status: error.status }\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Validation error\n  if (error instanceof ZodError) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      {\n        type: ''https://api.example.com/errors/validation-failed'',\n        title: ''Validation Failed'',\n        status: 400,\n        detail: ''The request body contains invalid data'',\n        instance: requestId,\n        errors: error.flatten().fieldErrors\n      },\n      { status: 400 }\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Unknown error (generic message)\n  return NextResponse.json(\n    {\n      type: ''https://api.example.com/errors/internal-server-error'',\n      title: ''Internal Server Error'',\n      status: 500,\n      detail: ''An unexpected error occurred'',\n      instance: requestId\n    },\n    { status: 500 }\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Using Error Handler\n\n```ts\n// app/api/users/route.ts\nimport { errorHandler } from ''@/middleware/error-handler'';\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json();\n\n    // Validate\n    const validated = CreateUserSchema.parse(body);\n\n    // Check duplicate\n    const existing = await db.user.findUnique({\n      where: { email: validated.email }\n    });\n\n    if (existing) {\n      throw new ApiError(\n        409,\n        ''Conflict'',\n        ''A user with this email already exists'',\n        ''https://api.example.com/errors/duplicate-email''\n      );\n    }\n\n    // Create\n    const user = await db.user.create({ data: validated });\n\n    return new Response(JSON.stringify(user), {\n      status: 201,\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' }\n    });\n  } catch (error) {\n    return errorHandler(error);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Input Validation\n\n### Schema Validation\n\n```ts\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst CreateUserSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(''Invalid email format''),\n  name: z.string().min(1, ''Name required'').max(255),\n  age: z.number().int().min(0).max(150),\n  role: z.enum([''admin'', ''user'', ''guest'']).default(''user'')\n});\n\n// Validate request\nconst validated = CreateUserSchema.parse(body);\n```\n\n### Sanitization\n\n```ts\nimport DOMPurify from ''isomorphic-dompurify'';\n\nconst sanitized = {\n  ...validated,\n  name: DOMPurify.sanitize(validated.name)\n};\n```\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\n```ts\nimport rateLimit from ''express-rate-limit'';\n\n// General rate limiter\nconst limiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,  // 15 minutes\n  max: 100,                   // 100 requests per window\n  message: ''Too many requests, please try again later'',\n  standardHeaders: true,      // Return rate limit info in headers\n  legacyHeaders: false\n});\n\n// Auth rate limiter (stricter)\nconst authLimiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,\n  max: 5,                      // 5 attempts\n  skipSuccessfulRequests: true // Don''t count successful logins\n});\n\napp.post(''/login'', authLimiter, loginHandler);\napp.use(''/api/'', limiter);\n```\n\n## Response Formatting\n\n### Success Response\n\n```ts\n// ✅ GOOD: Consistent response\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const users = await db.user.findMany();\n\n  return NextResponse.json({\n    status: ''success'',\n    data: users,\n    meta: {\n      count: users.length,\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  });\n}\n\n// ✅ GOOD: Paginated response\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const page = parseInt(request.nextUrl.searchParams.get(''page'') || ''1'');\n  const limit = parseInt(request.nextUrl.searchParams.get(''limit'') || ''20'');\n  const offset = (page - 1) * limit;\n\n  const [users, total] = await Promise.all([\n    db.user.findMany({ skip: offset, take: limit }),\n    db.user.count()\n  ]);\n\n  return NextResponse.json({\n    status: ''success'',\n    data: users,\n    meta: {\n      pagination: {\n        page,\n        limit,\n        total,\n        pages: Math.ceil(total / limit)\n      }\n    }\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Request Correlation\n\n```ts\n// middleware/correlation-id.ts\nimport { NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport type { NextRequest } from ''next/server'';\n\nexport function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  const correlationId = \n    request.headers.get(''x-correlation-id'') || \n    crypto.randomUUID();\n\n  const response = NextResponse.next();\n  response.headers.set(''x-correlation-id'', correlationId);\n\n  return response;\n}\n\n// Include in logs\nconsole.log(`[${correlationId}] User created:`, user);\n\n// Client can track requests\nfetch(''/api/users'', {\n  headers: { ''x-correlation-id'': myRequestId }\n});\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n```ts\n// ❌ BAD: Leaking stack traces\n{\n  \"error\": \"Cannot read property ''id'' of undefined at getUserData (line 42)\",\n  \"stack\": \"Error: ...\\nat app.js:42...\"\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: Generic error message\n{\n  \"error\": \"Something went wrong\"\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: No rate limiting\n// Anyone can hammer API endpoint\n\n// ❌ BAD: Overusing 500\n// Always return 500 for any error\n\n// ❌ BAD: No validation\nconst user = await db.user.create(request.body);\n// Raw user input!\n```\n\n## Verification Before Production\n\n- [ ] HTTP status codes specific and appropriate\n- [ ] Error responses RFC 7807 compliant\n- [ ] No stack traces or sensitive data exposed\n- [ ] Input validated on server side\n- [ ] Input sanitized before storage\n- [ ] Rate limiting configured\n- [ ] Correlation IDs for request tracking\n- [ ] Error messages user-friendly (not technical)\n- [ ] Centralized error handler\n- [ ] Response format consistent\n\n## Integration with Project Standards\n\nEnforces security and usability:\n- S-1: No sensitive data in errors\n- C-10: Input validated\n- AP-8: Validation on server side\n\n## Resources\n\n- RFC 7807 Problem Details: https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7807\n- HTTP Status Codes: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status\n- Express Rate Limiting: https://github.com/nfriedly/express-rate-limit\n---\n\n**Last Updated:** January 24, 2026\n**Compatibility:** Claude Opus 4.5, Claude Code v2.x\n**Status:** Production Ready\n\n> **January 2026 Update:** This skill is compatible with Claude Opus 4.5 and Claude Code v2.x. For complex tasks, use the `effort: high` parameter for thorough analysis.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:01:40.820Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for RESTful API Agents requiring systematic API development with robust error handling and validation","zh":"适用于需要系统化API开发、强大的错误处理和验证的RESTful API代理","ja":"RESTful APIエージェントが体系的にAPI開発を行うために、堅牢なエラーハンドリングと検証を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"시스템적인 API 개발과 강력한 오류 처리 및 검증이 필요한 RESTful API 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de API RESTful que requieren un desarrollo de API sistemático con control de errores robusto y validación","fr":"Idéal pour les agents API RESTful nécessitant un développement d''API systématique avec une gestion d''erreurs robuste et une validation","de":"Ideal für RESTful-API-Agents, die ein systematisches API-Entwicklung mit robuster Fehlerbehandlung und Validierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de API RESTful que exigem desenvolvimento de API sistemático com tratamento de erros robusto e validação","ru":"Идеально для агентов RESTful API, требующих системного развития API с устойчивым обработкой ошибок и проверкой","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء API RESTful الذين يتطلبون تطوير API منهجي مع معالجة أخطاء قوية و التحقق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop secure and consistent REST APIs using HTTP status codes, RFC 7807 Problem Details for errors, and input validation, while providing features like rate limiting and security-first error messages through protocols such as REST","zh":"赋予代理开发安全且一致的REST API的能力，使用HTTP状态码、RFC 7807问题详细信息进行错误处理和输入验证，同时通过REST等协议提供限速和安全优先的错误消息等功能","ja":"HTTPステータスコード、RFC 7807 Problem Detailsによるエラーハンドリングと入力検証を使用して、セキュアで一貫性のあるREST APIを開発するエージェントの能力を強化し、RESTなどのプロトコルを介してレート制限やセキュリティ優先のエラーメッセージなどの機能を提供する","ko":"HTTP 상태 코드, RFC 7807 문제 상세 정보를 통한 오류 처리 및 입력 검증을 사용하여 보안이 뛰고 일관성 있는 REST API를 개발할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화하며, REST 등의 프로토콜을 통해 속도 제한 및 보안 우선의 오류 메시지 등의 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar API REST seguras y coherentes utilizando códigos de estado HTTP, detalles de problemas RFC 7807 para errores y validación de entrada, mientras proporciona características como limitación de velocidad y mensajes de error de seguridad a través de protocolos como REST","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des API REST sécurisées et cohérentes en utilisant des codes d''état HTTP, des détails de problèmes RFC 7807 pour les erreurs et une validation des entrées, tout en fournissant des fonctionnalités telles que la limitation de débit et des messages d''erreur de sécurité à travers des protocoles tels que REST","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere und konsistente REST-APIs mithilfe von HTTP-Statuscodes, RFC 7807-Problem-details für Fehler und Eingabvalidierung zu entwickeln, während Funktionen wie Rate Limiting und sicherheitsorientierte Fehlermeldungen über Protokolle wie REST bereitgestellt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver APIs REST seguras e consistentes usando códigos de status HTTP, detalhes de problemas da RFC 7807 para erros e validação de entrada, enquanto fornece recursos como limitação de taxa e mensagens de erro com prioridade à segurança por meio de protocolos como REST","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разработки безопасных и последовательных REST API, используя коды состояния HTTP, детали проблем RFC 7807 для ошибок и проверку ввода, а также предоставляя функции, такие как ограничение скорости и сообщения об ошибках с приоритетом безопасности через протоколы, такие как REST","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير APIs REST آمنة ومستدامة باستخدام أكواد حالة HTTP وتفاصيل مشاكل RFC 7807 للأخطاء و التحقق من المدخلات، في حين توفر ميزات مثل التحكم في معدل النقل ورسائل الأخطاء مع الأولوية للأمان من خلال بروتوكولات مثل REST"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing scalable API routes with request correlation IDs","Implementing centralized error handling with RFC 7807","Enforcing consistent response formatting across API endpoints"],"zh":["使用请求关联ID开发可扩展的API路由","使用RFC 7807实现集中式错误处理","在API端点间强制一致的响应格式"],"ja":["リクエスト相関IDを使用してスケーラブルなAPIルートを開発する","RFC 7807を使用して集中エラーハンドリングを実装する","APIエンドポイント間で一貫したレスポンス形式を強制する"],"ko":["요청 상관관계 ID를 사용하여 확장 가능한 API 路由 개발","RFC 7807을 사용하여集中식 오류 처리 구현","API 엔드포인트 간에 일관된 응답 형식을 적용"],"es":["Desarrollar rutas de API escalables con IDs de correlación de solicitudes","Implementar una gestión centralizada de errores con RFC 7807","Aplicar un formato de respuesta coherente en todos los puntos de conexión de la API"],"fr":["Développer des routes d''API escalables avec des ID de corrélation de requêtes","Mettre en œuvre une gestion centralisée des erreurs avec la RFC 7807","Assurer un formatage de réponse cohérent à travers tous les points de terminaison de l''API"],"de":["Entwicklung von skalierbaren API-Routen mit Anfragekorrelations-IDs","Implementierung einer zentralen Fehlerbehandlung mit RFC 7807","Durchsetzung eines konsistenten Antwortformats über alle API-Endpunkte hinweg"],"pt":["Desenvolver rotas de API escaláveis com IDs de correlação de solicitação","Implementar tratamento de erros centralizado com RFC 7807","Impor formatação de resposta consistente em todos os pontos de extremidade da API"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых маршрутов API с идентификаторами корреляции запросов","Реализация централизованного обработки ошибок с помощью RFC 7807","Внедрение последовательного формата ответов во всех конечных точках API"],"ar":["تطوير مسارات API قابلة للتوسيع مع معرفات ارتباط الطلب","تنفيذ معالجة أخطاء مركزية مع RFC 7807","فرض تنسيق استجابة مستدام في جميع نهايات نقطة API"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of HTTP status codes and RFC 7807","Limited to REST API development"],"zh":["需要了解HTTP状态码和RFC 7807","仅限于REST API开发"],"ja":["HTTPステータスコードとRFC 7807の理解が必要","REST API開発のみに限定"],"ko":["HTTP 상태 코드 및 RFC 7807에 대한 이해가 필요","REST API 개발에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los códigos de estado HTTP y la RFC 7807","Limitado al desarrollo de API REST"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des codes d''état HTTP et de la RFC 7807","Limité au développement d''API REST"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von HTTP-Statuscodes und RFC 7807","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von REST-APIs"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos códigos de status HTTP e da RFC 7807","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de API REST"],"ru":["Требует понимания кодов состояния HTTP и RFC 7807","Ограничен разработкой API REST"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم أكواد حالة HTTP وRFC 7807","محدود بتطوير API REST"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e1489fbfe053bd90b44f2f7bebdc22b3c262c6d553777679a5321ad9f0705e80","qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/develop-ai-functions-example', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'develop-ai-functions-example', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z', '2026-02-20T05:01:49.718Z', '9d77f7652e8edda503bb95db8032db3ce781904c4444ec22ecdc307e3ac7fc0d', '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/develop-ai-functions-example","name":"develop-ai-functions-example","description":{"es":"El directorio examples/ai-functions/ contiene scripts para validar, probar e iterar funciones de SDK de IA","fr":"Le répertoire examples/ai-functions/ contient des scripts pour valider, tester et itérer des fonctions de SDK d''IA","de":"Das Verzeichnis examples/ai-functions/ enthält Skripte zum Validieren, Testen und Iterieren von KI-SDK-Funktionen","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Desarrollar funciones de IA con ejemplos","fr":"Développer des fonctions d''IA avec des exemples","de":"Entwickeln von KI-Funktionen mit Beispielen","en":"develop-ai-functions-example"},"description":{"es":"El directorio examples/ai-functions/ contiene scripts para validar, probar e iterar funciones de SDK de IA","fr":"Le répertoire examples/ai-functions/ contient des scripts pour valider, tester et itérer des fonctions de SDK d''IA","de":"Das Verzeichnis examples/ai-functions/ enthält Skripte zum Validieren, Testen und Iterieren von KI-SDK-Funktionen","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"es":["Generación de texto no en streaming","Validación y prueba de funciones de SDK de IA","Iteración sobre funciones de SDK de IA","Ejemplos de código para desarrolladores","Compatibilidad con múltiples proveedores de IA"],"fr":["Génération de texte non en streaming","Validation et test de fonctions de SDK d''IA","Itération sur des fonctions de SDK d''IA","Exemples de code pour les développeurs","Compatibilité avec plusieurs fournisseurs d''IA"],"de":["Nicht-streaming Textgenerierung","Validierung und Testen von KI-SDK-Funktionen","Iteration über KI-SDK-Funktionen","Codebeispiele für Entwickler","Kompatibilität mit mehreren KI-Anbietern"]},"keywords":{"es":["desarrollar funciones de IA","ejemplos de IA","SDK de IA","generación de texto","validación de IA","prueba de IA","desarrollo de IA","IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["développer des fonctions d''IA","exemples d''IA","SDK d''IA","génération de texte","validation d''IA","test d''IA","développement d''IA","IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["KI-Funktionen entwickeln","KI-Beispiele","KI-SDK","Textgenerierung","KI-Validierung","KI-Test","KI-Entwicklung","KI für Entwickler"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"develop-ai-functions-example","description":"Develop examples for AI SDK functions. Use when creating, running, or modifying examples under examples/ai-functions/src to validate provider support, demonstrate features, or create test fixtures.","bodyPreview":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stre","body":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stream-text/`     | Streaming text generation with `streamText()`        |\n| `generate-object/` | Structured output generation with `generateObject()` |\n| `stream-object/`   | Streaming structured output with `streamObject()`    |\n| `agent/`           | `ToolLoopAgent` examples for agentic workflows       |\n| `embed/`           | Single embedding generation with `embed()`           |\n| `embed-many/`      | Batch embedding generation with `embedMany()`        |\n| `generate-image/`  | Image generation with `generateImage()`              |\n| `generate-speech/` | Text-to-speech with `generateSpeech()`               |\n| `transcribe/`      | Audio transcription with `transcribe()`              |\n| `rerank/`          | Document reranking with `rerank()`                   |\n| `middleware/`      | Custom middleware implementations                    |\n| `registry/`        | Provider registry setup and usage                    |\n| `telemetry/`       | OpenTelemetry integration                            |\n| `complex/`         | Multi-component examples (agents, routers)           |\n| `lib/`             | Shared utilities (not examples)                      |\n| `tools/`           | Reusable tool definitions                            |\n\n## File Naming Convention\n\nExamples follow the pattern: `{provider}-{feature}.ts`\n\n| Pattern                                  | Example                                    | Description                |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `{provider}.ts`                          | `openai.ts`                                | Basic provider usage       |\n| `{provider}-{feature}.ts`                | `openai-tool-call.ts`                      | Specific feature           |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}.ts`           | `amazon-bedrock-anthropic.ts`              | Provider with sub-provider |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}-{feature}.ts` | `google-vertex-anthropic-cache-control.ts` | Sub-provider with feature  |\n\n## Example Structure\n\nAll examples use the `run()` wrapper from `lib/run.ts` which:\n\n- Loads environment variables from `.env`\n- Provides error handling with detailed API error logging\n\n### Basic Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateText } from ''ai'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    prompt: ''Your prompt here.'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(result.text);\n  console.log(''Token usage:'', result.usage);\n  console.log(''Finish reason:'', result.finishReason);\n});\n```\n\n### Streaming Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { streamText } from ''ai'';\nimport { printFullStream } from ''../lib/print-full-stream'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = streamText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    prompt: ''Your prompt here.'',\n  });\n\n  await printFullStream({ result });\n});\n```\n\n### Tool Calling Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateText, tool } from ''ai'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    tools: {\n      myTool: tool({\n        description: ''Tool description'',\n        inputSchema: z.object({\n          param: z.string().describe(''Parameter description''),\n        }),\n        execute: async ({ param }) => {\n          return { result: `Processed: ${param}` };\n        },\n      }),\n    },\n    prompt: ''Use the tool to...'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(result, null, 2));\n});\n```\n\n### Structured Output Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateObject } from ''ai'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateObject({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    schema: z.object({\n      name: z.string(),\n      items: z.array(z.string()),\n    }),\n    prompt: ''Generate a...'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(result.object, null, 2));\n  console.log(''Token usage:'', result.usage);\n});\n```\n\n## Running Examples\n\nFrom the `examples/ai-functions` directory:\n\n```bash\npnpm tsx src/generate-text/openai.ts\npnpm tsx src/stream-text/openai-tool-call.ts\npnpm tsx src/agent/openai-generate.ts\n```\n\n## When to Write Examples\n\nWrite examples when:\n\n1. **Adding a new provider**: Create basic examples for each supported API (`generateText`, `streamText`, `generateObject`, etc.)\n\n2. **Implementing a new feature**: Demonstrate the feature with at least one provider example\n\n3. **Reproducing a bug**: Create an example that shows the issue for debugging\n\n4. **Adding provider-specific options**: Show how to use `providerOptions` for provider-specific settings\n\n5. **Creating test fixtures**: Use examples to generate API response fixtures (see `capture-api-response-test-fixture` skill)\n\n## Utility Helpers\n\nThe `lib/` directory contains shared utilities:\n\n| File                   | Purpose                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `run.ts`               | Error-handling wrapper with `.env` loading               |\n| `print.ts`             | Clean object printing (removes undefined values)         |\n| `print-full-stream.ts` | Colored streaming output for tool calls, reasoning, text |\n| `save-raw-chunks.ts`   | Save streaming chunks for test fixtures                  |\n| `present-image.ts`     | Display images in terminal                               |\n| `save-audio.ts`        | Save audio files to disk                                 |\n\n### Using print utilities\n\n```typescript\nimport { print } from ''../lib/print'';\n\n// Pretty print objects without undefined values\nprint(''Result:'', result);\nprint(''Usage:'', result.usage, { depth: 2 });\n```\n\n### Using printFullStream\n\n```typescript\nimport { printFullStream } from ''../lib/print-full-stream'';\n\nconst result = streamText({ ... });\nawait printFullStream({ result }); // Colored output for text, tool calls, reasoning\n```\n\n## Reusable Tools\n\nThe `tools/` directory contains reusable tool definitions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { weatherTool } from ''../tools/weather-tool'';\n\nconst result = await generateText({\n  model: openai(''gpt-4o''),\n  tools: { weather: weatherTool },\n  prompt: ''What is the weather in San Francisco?'',\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep examples focused**: Each example should demonstrate one feature or use case\n\n2. **Use descriptive prompts**: Make it clear what the example is testing\n\n3. **Handle errors gracefully**: The `run()` wrapper handles this automatically\n\n4. **Use realistic model IDs**: Use actual model IDs that work with the provider\n\n5. **Add comments for complex logic**: Explain non-obvious code patterns\n\n6. **Reuse tools when appropriate**: Use `weatherTool` or create new reusable tools in `tools/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:01:49.718Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced AI function development and testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合像 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要高级 AI 函数开发和测试能力。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの高度なAI関数開発およびテスト機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 고급 AI 함수 개발 및 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo y prueba de funciones de IA avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités de développement et de test de fonctions d''IA avancées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte KI-Funktionsentwicklungs- und Testfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento e teste de funções de IA avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки и тестирования функций ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير واختبار الوظائف الذكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate, test, and iterate on AI SDK functions across providers, leveraging directories like `generate-text/` for non-streaming text generation with `generateText()` and utilizing protocols for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理验证、测试和迭代AI SDK函数的能力，跨提供商使用目录，如 `generate-text/`，用于非流式文本生成，并利用协议实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントに、プロバイダー間でAI SDK関数を検証、テスト、およびイテレーションする機能を提供します。たとえば、`generate-text/` ディレクトリを使用してストリーミングされていないテキスト生成を行い、`generateText()` を使用し、シームレスな統合のためのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 제공자 간에 AI SDK 함수를 검증, 테스트 및 반복할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 예를 들어, `generate-text/` 디렉토리를 사용하여 스트리밍되지 않는 텍스트 생성을 수행하고, `generateText()`를 사용하며, 무결점 통합을 위한 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar, probar e iterar sobre funciones de SDK de IA a través de proveedores, aprovechando directorios como `generate-text/` para la generación de texto no en streaming con `generateText()` y utilizando protocolos para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider, tester et itérer sur les fonctions de SDK d''IA à travers les fournisseurs, en exploitant des répertoires tels que `generate-text/` pour la génération de texte non en streaming avec `generateText()` et en utilisant des protocoles pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die SDK-Funktionen von KI über Anbieter hinweg zu validieren, zu testen und zu iterieren, indem es Verzeichnisse wie `generate-text/` für die nicht-streaming Textgenerierung mit `generateText()` nutzt und Protokolle für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar, testar e iterar sobre funções de SDK de IA em vários fornecedores, utilizando diretórios como `generate-text/` para geração de texto não em streaming com `generateText()` e utilizando protocolos para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять, тестировать и совершенствовать функции SDK ИИ у различных поставщиков, используя каталоги вроде `generate-text/` для генерации текста без потоковой передачи с помощью `generateText()` и используя протоколы для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التحقق، والاختبار، وتكرار الوظائف الذكية عبر موفرين متعددين، مستخدماً دلائل مثل `generate-text/` لأغراض توليد النص غير المتدفق مع `generateText()` وتطبيق البروتوكولات من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating AI SDK functions for text generation","Testing and iterating on AI functions across multiple providers","Organizing AI function examples by category for efficient development"],"zh":["验证AI SDK函数用于文本生成","跨多个提供商测试和迭代AI函数","通过类别组织AI函数示例以实现高效开发"],"ja":["テキスト生成のためのAI SDK関数を検証する","複数のプロバイダーを横断してAI関数をテストおよびイテレーションする","開発の効率化のためにAI関数の例をカテゴリ別に組織する"],"ko":["텍스트 생성을 위한 AI SDK 함수를 검증하는 것","複数의 제공자를 통해 AI 함수를 테스트 및 반복하는 것","개발의 효율성을 높이기 위해 AI 함수 예를 범주별로 구성하는 것"],"es":["Validar funciones de SDK de IA para la generación de texto","Probar e iterar sobre funciones de IA en varios proveedores","Organizar ejemplos de funciones de IA por categoría para un desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["Valider les fonctions de SDK d''IA pour la génération de texte","Tester et itérer sur les fonctions d''IA à travers plusieurs fournisseurs","Organiser des exemples de fonctions d''IA par catégorie pour un développement efficace"],"de":["SDK-Funktionen von KI für die Textgenerierung validieren","KI-Funktionen über mehrere Anbieter hinweg testen und iterieren","KI-Funktionsbeispiele nach Kategorie für eine effiziente Entwicklung organisieren"],"pt":["Validar funções de SDK de IA para geração de texto","Testar e iterar sobre funções de IA em vários fornecedores","Organizar exemplos de funções de IA por categoria para desenvolvimento eficiente"],"ru":["Проверка функций SDK ИИ для генерации текста","Тестирование и совершенствование функций ИИ у нескольких поставщиков","Организация примеров функций ИИ по категориям для эффективного развития"],"ar":["التحقق من وظائف SDK الذكية لتوليد النص","اختبار وتكرار الوظائف الذكية عبر موفرين متعددين","تنظيم أمثلة الوظائف الذكية حسب الفئة من أجل التطوير الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the `examples/ai-functions/` directory","Limited to AI SDK functions and providers supported by the registry"],"zh":["需要访问 `examples/ai-functions/` 目录","仅限于注册表支持的AI SDK函数和提供商"],"ja":["`examples/ai-functions/` ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","レジストリによってサポートされているAI SDK関数およびプロバイダーに限定される"],"ko":["`examples/ai-functions/` 디렉토리에 액세스해야 함","등록된 레지스트리에서 지원하는 AI SDK 함수 및 제공자로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `examples/ai-functions/`","Limitado a funciones de SDK de IA y proveedores admitidos por el registro"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `examples/ai-functions/`","Limité aux fonctions de SDK d''IA et aux fournisseurs pris en charge par le registre"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `examples/ai-functions/`","Begrenzt auf KI-SDK-Funktionen und Anbieter, die vom Register unterstützt werden"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `examples/ai-functions/`","Limitado a funções de SDK de IA e fornecedores suportados pelo registro"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу `examples/ai-functions/`","Ограничен функциями SDK ИИ и поставщиками, поддерживаемыми реестром"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `examples/ai-functions/`","محدود بالوظائف الذكية SDK والموفرين المدعومين بواسطة السجل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9d77f7652e8edda503bb95db8032db3ce781904c4444ec22ecdc307e3ac7fc0d","qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mduecker/moltbot-sandbox/cloudflare-browser', 'community', 'mduecker', 'moltbot-sandbox', 'mduecker/moltbot-sandbox', 'cloudflare-browser', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z', '2026-02-20T05:02:06.513Z', '06f8f67410955ff10065b70d306e1c996a3cd12e429346099d495dfacec1f483', '{"id":"mduecker/moltbot-sandbox/cloudflare-browser","name":"cloudflare-browser","description":{"zh":"Cloudflare 浏览器渲染控制允许您通过 CDP 协议控制无头浏览器。它需要设置 CDP_SECRET 环境变量和配置浏览器-profile","ja":"Cloudflare ブラウザレンダリング制御は、CDP プロトコルでヘッドレスブラウザを制御できるようにします。CDP_SECRET 環境変数とブラウザプロファイルの設定が必要です","ko":"Cloudflare 브라우저 렌더링 제어는 CDP 프로토콜을 통해 헤드리스 브라우저를 제어할 수 있습니다. CDP_SECRET 환경 변수 및 브라우저 프로필 설정이 필요합니다","es":"Cloudflare Browser Rendering permite controlar navegadores headless mediante CDP. Configura perfiles de navegador y captura pantallas con facilidad.","fr":"Cloudflare Browser Rendering permet de contrôler les navigateurs headless via CDP. Configurez des profils de navigateur et capturez des écrans facilement.","de":"Cloudflare Browser Rendering ermöglicht die Steuerung von headless-Browsern über CDP. Konfigurieren Sie Browserprofile und erfassen Sie Bildschirmaufnahmen einfach.","pt":"O Cloudflare Browser Rendering permite controlar navegadores headless via CDP e WebSocket. Configure seu ambiente com facilidade.","ru":"Служба рендеринга браузера Cloudflare позволяет управлять безголовыми браузерами через CDP и WebSocket. Настройте среду с легкостью.","ar":"خدمة تقديم المتصفح من Cloudflare تسمح بالتحكم في المتصفحات الخفية عبر CDP و WebSocket. configure بيئة العمل بسهولة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Cloudflare 浏览器渲染控制","ja":"Cloudflare ブラウザレンダリング制御","ko":"Cloudflare 브라우저 렌더링 제어","es":"Control de navegador Cloudflare","fr":"Contrôle du navigateur Cloudflare","de":"Cloudflare-Browser-Steuerung","pt":"Controle de Navegador Cloudflare","ru":"Управление браузером Cloudflare","ar":"التحكم في متصفح Cloudflare","en":"cloudflare-browser"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare 浏览器渲染控制允许您通过 CDP 协议控制无头浏览器。它需要设置 CDP_SECRET 环境变量和配置浏览器-profile","ja":"Cloudflare ブラウザレンダリング制御は、CDP プロトコルでヘッドレスブラウザを制御できるようにします。CDP_SECRET 環境変数とブラウザプロファイルの設定が必要です","ko":"Cloudflare 브라우저 렌더링 제어는 CDP 프로토콜을 통해 헤드리스 브라우저를 제어할 수 있습니다. CDP_SECRET 환경 변수 및 브라우저 프로필 설정이 필요합니다","es":"Cloudflare Browser Rendering permite controlar navegadores headless mediante CDP. Configura perfiles de navegador y captura pantallas con facilidad.","fr":"Cloudflare Browser Rendering permet de contrôler les navigateurs headless via CDP. Configurez des profils de navigateur et capturez des écrans facilement.","de":"Cloudflare Browser Rendering ermöglicht die Steuerung von headless-Browsern über CDP. Konfigurieren Sie Browserprofile und erfassen Sie Bildschirmaufnahmen e...","pt":"O Cloudflare Browser Rendering permite controlar navegadores headless via CDP e WebSocket. Configure seu ambiente com facilidade.","ru":"Служба рендеринга браузера Cloudflare позволяет управлять безголовыми браузерами через CDP и WebSocket. Настройте среду с легкостью.","ar":"خدمة تقديم المتصفح من Cloudflare تسمح بالتحكم في المتصفحات الخفية عبر CDP و WebSocket. configure بيئة العمل بسهولة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["通过 WebSocket 的 CDP 协议控制无头浏览器","支持设置 CDP_SECRET 环境变量","支持配置浏览器-profile","使用 openclaw.json 配置浏览器-profile"],"ja":["WebSocket の CDP プロトコルでヘッドレスブラウザを制御","CDP_SECRET 環境変数の設定をサポート","ブラウザプロファイルの設定をサポート","openclaw.json でブラウザプロファイルを設定"],"ko":["WebSocket의 CDP 프로토콜로 헤드리스 브라우저를 제어","CDP_SECRET 환경 변수 설정 지원","브라우저 프로필 설정 지원","openclaw.json에서 브라우저 프로필 설정"],"es":["Control de navegadores headless","Configuración de perfiles de navegador","Captura de pantallas","Integración con CDP","Compatibilidad con WebSocket"],"fr":["Contrôle de navigateurs headless","Configuration de profils de navigateur","Capture d''écrans","Intégration avec CDP","Compatibilité avec WebSocket"],"de":["Steuerung von headless-Browsern","Konfiguration von Browserprofilen","Erfassung von Bildschirmaufnahmen","Integration mit CDP","Kompatibilität mit WebSocket"],"pt":["Controle de navegadores headless","Integração com CDP e WebSocket","Configuração de perfil de navegador personalizado","Suporte a screenshots","Integração com worker endpoint","Suporte a ambiente de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Управление безголовыми браузерами","Интеграция с CDP и WebSocket","Настройка пользовательского профиля браузера","Поддержка скриншотов","Интеграция с worker endpoint","Поддержка среды разработки"],"ar":["التحكم في المتصفحات الخفية","التكامل مع CDP و WebSocket","تكوين ملف تعريف متصفح مخصص","دعم لقطات الشاشة","التكامل مع نهاية عامل","دعم بيئة التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare","浏览器渲染控制","CDP 协议","WebSocket","无头浏览器","浏览器-profile"],"ja":["Cloudflare","ブラウザレンダリング制御","CDP プロトコル","WebSocket","ヘッドレスブラウザ","ブラウザプロファイル"],"ko":["Cloudflare","ブラウザ 렌더링 제어","CDP 프로토콜","WebSocket","헤드리스 브라우저","브라우저 프로필"],"es":["Cloudflare Browser Rendering","navegadores headless","CDP","WebSocket","captura de pantallas","configuración de perfiles de navegador"],"fr":["Cloudflare Browser Rendering","navigateurs headless","CDP","WebSocket","capture d''écrans","configuration de profils de navigateur"],"de":["Cloudflare Browser Rendering","headless-Browser","CDP","WebSocket","Bildschirmaufnahmen","Konfiguration von Browserprofilen"],"pt":["Cloudflare Browser Rendering","CDP","WebSocket","navegadores headless","desenvolvimento web","renderização de navegador","worker endpoint","screenshots"],"ru":["Рендеринг браузера Cloudflare","CDP","WebSocket","безголовые браузеры","веб-разработка","рендеринг браузера","worker endpoint","скриншоты"],"ar":["خدمة تقديم المتصفح من Cloudflare","CDP","WebSocket","المتصفحات الخفية","تطوير الويب","تقديم المتصفح","نهاية عامل","لقطات الشاشة"]}},"owner":"mduecker","repo":"moltbot-sandbox","repoPath":"mduecker/moltbot-sandbox","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloudflare-browser","description":"Control headless Chrome via Cloudflare Browser Rendering CDP WebSocket. Use for screenshots, page navigation, scraping, and video capture when browser automation is needed in a Cloudflare Workers environment. Requires CDP_SECRET env var and cdpUrl configured in browser.profiles.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Browser Rendering\n\nControl headless browsers via Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service using CDP (Chrome DevTools Protocol) over WebSocket.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `CDP_SECRET` environment variable set\n- Browser profile configured in openclaw.json with `cdpUrl` pointing to the worker endpoint:\n  ```json\n  \"browser\": {\n    \"profiles\": {\n      \"cloudflare\": {\n        \"cdpUrl\": \"https://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=...\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Screenshot\n```bas","body":"# Cloudflare Browser Rendering\n\nControl headless browsers via Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service using CDP (Chrome DevTools Protocol) over WebSocket.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `CDP_SECRET` environment variable set\n- Browser profile configured in openclaw.json with `cdpUrl` pointing to the worker endpoint:\n  ```json\n  \"browser\": {\n    \"profiles\": {\n      \"cloudflare\": {\n        \"cdpUrl\": \"https://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=...\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Screenshot\n```bash\nnode /path/to/skills/cloudflare-browser/scripts/screenshot.js https://example.com output.png\n```\n\n### Multi-page Video\n```bash\nnode /path/to/skills/cloudflare-browser/scripts/video.js \"https://site1.com,https://site2.com\" output.mp4\n```\n\n## CDP Connection Pattern\n\nThe worker creates a page target automatically on WebSocket connect. Listen for Target.targetCreated event to get the targetId:\n\n```javascript\nconst WebSocket = require(''ws'');\nconst CDP_SECRET = process.env.CDP_SECRET;\nconst WS_URL = `wss://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=${encodeURIComponent(CDP_SECRET)}`;\n\nconst ws = new WebSocket(WS_URL);\nlet targetId = null;\n\nws.on(''message'', (data) => {\n  const msg = JSON.parse(data.toString());\n  if (msg.method === ''Target.targetCreated'' && msg.params?.targetInfo?.type === ''page'') {\n    targetId = msg.params.targetInfo.targetId;\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Key CDP Commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| Page.navigate | Navigate to URL |\n| Page.captureScreenshot | Capture PNG/JPEG |\n| Runtime.evaluate | Execute JavaScript |\n| Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride | Set viewport size |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Navigate and Screenshot\n```javascript\nawait send(''Page.navigate'', { url: ''https://example.com'' });\nawait new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 3000)); // Wait for render\nconst { data } = await send(''Page.captureScreenshot'', { format: ''png'' });\nfs.writeFileSync(''out.png'', Buffer.from(data, ''base64''));\n```\n\n### Scroll Page\n```javascript\nawait send(''Runtime.evaluate'', { expression: ''window.scrollBy(0, 300)'' });\n```\n\n### Set Viewport\n```javascript\nawait send(''Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride'', {\n  width: 1280,\n  height: 720,\n  deviceScaleFactor: 1,\n  mobile: false\n});\n```\n\n## Creating Videos\n\n1. Capture frames as PNGs during navigation\n2. Use ffmpeg to stitch: `ffmpeg -framerate 10 -i frame_%04d.png -c:v libx264 -pix_fmt yuv420p output.mp4`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **No target created**: Race condition - wait for Target.targetCreated event with timeout\n- **Commands timeout**: Worker may have cold start delay; increase timeout to 30-60s\n- **WebSocket hangs**: Verify CDP_SECRET matches worker configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:02:06.513Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring automated browser rendering and screenshot capabilities via Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service","zh":"适用于需要通过Cloudflare的浏览器渲染服务实现自动浏览器渲染和截图功能的AI代理","ja":"Cloudflareのブラウザレンダリングサービスを介して自動ブラウザレンダリングとスクリーンショット機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"Cloudflare의 브라우저 렌더링 서비스를 통해 자동 브라우저 렌더링 및 스크린샷 기능을 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren renderizado de navegador automático y capacidad de captura de pantalla a través del servicio de renderizado de navegador de Cloudflare","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant un rendu de navigateur automatisé et des capacités de capture d''écran via le service de rendu de navigateur Cloudflare","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die automatisiertes Browser-Rendering und Screenshot-Funktionen über den Cloudflare-Browser-Rendering-Dienst benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que exigem renderização automática de navegador e capacidades de captura de tela por meio do serviço de Renderização de Navegador da Cloudflare","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих автоматизированной отрисовки браузера и возможностей для создания скриншотов через службу Cloudflare Browser Rendering","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون تعريف متصفح آلي وقدرات لقطة الشاشة عبر خدمة تعريف المتصفح من Cloudflare"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to control headless browsers using Chrome DevTools Protocol over WebSocket, enabling features like automated screenshot generation and browser profile management through openclaw.json configurations and CDP_SECRET environment variables","zh":"通过WebSocket上的Chrome DevTools Protocol使代理能够控制无头浏览器，实现诸如自动截图生成和浏览器配置文件管理等功能，通过openclaw.json配置和CDP_SECRET环境变量","ja":"WebSocket上的Chrome DevTools Protocolを使用して、エージェントがヘッドレスブラウザを制御できるようにし、自動スクリーンショット生成やブラウザプロファイル管理などの機能を可能にします。openclaw.json構成とCDP_SECRET環境変数を使用","ko":"WebSocket上的 Chrome DevTools Protocol을 통해 에이전트가 헤드리스 브라우저를 제어할 수 있도록 하여 자동 스크린샷 생성 및 브라우저 프로필 관리 등을 가능하게 함. openclaw.json 구성 및 CDP_SECRET 환경 변수를 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a controlar navegadores sin cabeza mediante el protocolo Chrome DevTools sobre WebSocket, lo que permite funciones como la generación automática de capturas de pantalla y la administración de perfiles de navegador a través de configuraciones openclaw.json y variables de entorno CDP_SECRET","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler les navigateurs sans tête à l''aide du protocole Chrome DevTools sur WebSocket, ce qui permet des fonctionnalités telles que la génération automatisée de captures d''écran et la gestion de profils de navigateur via des configurations openclaw.json et des variables d''environnement CDP_SECRET","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, headless-Browser mithilfe des Chrome-DevTools-Protokolls über WebSocket zu steuern, wodurch Funktionen wie automatisierte Screenshot-Erstellung und Browser-Profilverwaltung über openclaw.json-Konfigurationen und CDP_SECRET-Umgebungsvariablen ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita agentes a controlar navegadores headless usando o Protocolo Chrome DevTools sobre WebSocket, permitindo recursos como geração automática de capturas de tela e gerenciamento de perfis de navegador por meio de configurações openclaw.json e variáveis de ambiente CDP_SECRET","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять безголовыми браузерами с помощью протокола Chrome DevTools по WebSocket, что позволяет использовать функции, такие как автоматическое создание скриншотов и управление профилями браузера через конфигурации openclaw.json и переменные окружения CDP_SECRET","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من التحكم في المتصفحات بدون رأس باستخدام بروتوكول أدوات التطوير كروم عبر وеб سوكت، مما يتيح ميزات مثل توليد لقطة الشاشة تلقائيًا وإدارة ملفات تعريف المتصفح من خلال تكوينات openclaw.json ومتغيرات بيئة CDP_SECRET"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating website screenshots for monitoring","Debugging web applications through headless browser control","Generating visual content for reports using Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering"],"zh":["用于监控的网站截图自动化","通过无头浏览器控制调试Web应用程序","使用Cloudflare的浏览器渲染生成报告的视觉内容"],"ja":["監視用のWebサイトのスクリーンショット自動化","ヘッドレスブラウザ制御を使用したWebアプリケーションのデバッグ","Cloudflareのブラウザレンダリングを使用したレポートの視覚コンテンツの生成"],"ko":["모니터링을 위한 웹사이트 스크린샷 자동화","헤드리스 브라우저 제어를 통한 웹 애플리케이션 디버깅","Cloudflare의 브라우저 렌더링을 사용한 보고서의 시각적 콘텐츠 생성"],"es":["Automatizar capturas de pantalla de sitios web para monitoreo","Depurar aplicaciones web a través del control de navegadores sin cabeza","Generar contenido visual para informes utilizando el servicio de renderizado de navegador de Cloudflare"],"fr":["Automatiser les captures d''écran de sites web pour la surveillance","Déboguer les applications web via le contrôle de navigateurs sans tête","Générer du contenu visuel pour les rapports en utilisant le service de rendu de navigateur Cloudflare"],"de":["Automatisieren von Website-Screenshots für Überwachungszwecke","Debuggen von Webanwendungen durch Steuerung von headless-Browsern","Erstellen von visuellem Inhalt für Berichte mithilfe des Cloudflare-Browser-Rendering-Dienstes"],"pt":["Automatizar capturas de tela de sites para monitoramento","Depurar aplicações web por meio do controle de navegador headless","Gerar conteúdo visual para relatórios usando a Renderização de Navegador da Cloudflare"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание скриншотов веб-сайтов для мониторинга","Отлаживать веб-приложения посредством управления безголовым браузером","Генерировать визуальный контент для отчетов с помощью службы Cloudflare Browser Rendering"],"ar":["توتير لقطات الشاشة التلقائية للمواقع للرصد","تصحيح الأخطاء في التطبيقات الويب من خلال التحكم في متصفح بدون رأس","توليد المحتوى المرئي للتقارير باستخدام خدمة تعريف المتصفح من Cloudflare"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CDP_SECRET environment variable set","Needs browser profile configured in openclaw.json with cdpUrl pointing to the worker endpoint"],"zh":["需要设置CDP_SECRET环境变量","需要在openclaw.json中配置浏览器配置文件，且cdpUrl指向工人端点"],"ja":["CDP_SECRET環境変数を設定する必要がある","openclaw.jsonにブラウザプロファイルを構成する必要があり、cdpUrlはワーカーエンドポイントを指す"],"ko":["CDP_SECRET 환경 변수를 설정해야 함","openclaw.json에 브라우저 프로필을 구성해야 하며 cdpUrl은 워커 엔드포인트를 가리킴"],"es":["Requiere que la variable de entorno CDP_SECRET esté establecida","Necesita un perfil de navegador configurado en openclaw.json con cdpUrl que apunte al punto de conexión del trabajador"],"fr":["Nécessite que la variable d''environnement CDP_SECRET soit définie","Nécessite un profil de navigateur configuré dans openclaw.json avec cdpUrl pointant vers le point de terminaison du worker"],"de":["Benötigt die Umgebungsvariable CDP_SECRET","Benötigt ein Browser-Profil, das in openclaw.json mit cdpUrl auf den Worker-Endpunkt verweist"],"pt":["Exige a variável de ambiente CDP_SECRET definida","Necessita de perfil de navegador configurado em openclaw.json com cdpUrl apontando para o endpoint do trabalhador"],"ru":["Требует настройки переменной окружения CDP_SECRET","Требует настройки профиля браузера в openclaw.json с cdpUrl, указывающим на конечную точку рабочего процесса"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريف متغير بيئة CDP_SECRET","يحتاج إلى ملف تعريف متصفح مضبوط في openclaw.json مع cdpUrl يشير إلى نقطة النهاية للعامل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"06f8f67410955ff10065b70d306e1c996a3cd12e429346099d495dfacec1f483","qualityScore":40}');
