kumentation für die besten Praktiken","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Prompts für spezifische Anforderungen","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der UI-Generierung"],"pt":["Transformação de ideias de geração de UI em prompts otimizados","Consulte o guia de prompts eficazes da Stitch","Melhoria da qualidade dos resultados da geração de UI","Otimização de prompts para Stitch","Aumento da eficiência na geração de UI"],"ru":["Преобразование идей генерации UI в оптимизированные промпты","Посмотрите руководство по эффективным промптам Stitch","Улучшение качества результатов генерации UI","Оптимизация промптов для Stitch","Повышение эффективности генерации UI"],"ar":["تحويل أفكار توليد واجهة المستخدم إلى برومتات محسنة","استشر دليل البرومتات الفعالة لستيتش","تحسين جودة نتائج توليد واجهة المستخدم","تحسين البرومتات لستيتش","زيادة الكفاءة في توليد واجهة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Stitch 提升提示工程","UI 生成提示优化","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","提示工程","UI 生成","Stitch"],"ja":["Stitch プロンプトエンジニア","UI 生成のプロンプト最適化","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","プロンプトエンジニア","UI 生成","Stitch"],"ko":["Stitch 프롬프트 엔지니어","UI 생성 프롬프트 최적화","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","프롬프트 엔지니어","UI 생성","Stitch"],"es":["Stitch","prompt","ingeniero de prompts","UI","generación de UI","optimización de prompts","mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Stitch","prompt","ingénieur de prompts","UI","génération d''UI","optimisation de prompts","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Stitch","Prompt","Prompt-Ingenieur","UI","UI-Generierung","Prompt-Optimierung","beste Praktiken"],"pt":["enhance-prompt","stitch","geração de ui","prompts otimizados","guias de prompts eficazes","desenvolvimento de ui","otimização de prompts","stitch prompting guide"],"ru":["улучшение промптов","stitch","генерация ui","оптимизированные промпты","руководство по эффективным промптам","разработка ui","оптимизация промптов","stitch промпт гайд"],"ar":["تحسين البرومتات","ستيتش","توليد واجهة المستخدم","برومتات محسنة","دليل البرومتات الفعالة","تطوير واجهة المستخدم","تحسين البرومتات","ستيتش دليل البرومتات"]}},"owner":"Parthivjoshi29","repo":"agent-skills-npm-package","repoPath":"Parthivjoshi29/agent-skills-npm-package","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:03:39.965Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Model Agents needing advanced prompt engineering capabilities for optimized UI generation results from Stitch.","zh":"非常适合需要高级提示工程能力以优化Stitch UI生成结果的语言模型代理","ja":"Stitchからの最適化されたUI生成結果を必要とする言語モデルエージェントに最適","ko":"Stitch의 최적화된 UI 생성 결과를 필요로 하는 언어 모델 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Modelo de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de ingeniería de prompts para resultados de generación de UI optimizados desde Stitch.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modèle de langage ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''ingénierie de prompts pour des résultats de génération d''UI optimisés à partir de Stitch.","de":"Perfekt für Language-Model-Agents, die erweiterte Prompt-Engineering-Fähigkeiten für optimierte UI-Generierungs-Ergebnisse aus Stitch benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de engenharia de prompts para resultados de geração de UI otimizados do Stitch.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, которым требуются продвинутые возможности инженерии подсказок для оптимизированных результатов генерации пользовательского интерфейса Stitch.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء نموذج اللغة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات هندسة الإشارات المتقدمة لنتائج توليد واجهة المستخدم المُختزلة من Stitch."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts using the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide, ensuring better results through effective prompting techniques and best practices.","zh":"赋予代理将粗糙或模糊的UI生成想法转化为经过润色的、优化的提示，使用Stitch有效提示指南，确保通过有效的提示技术和最佳实践获得更好的结果","ja":"エージェントがStitchの効果的なプロンプティングガイドを使用して、粗いまたは漠然としたUI生成のアイデアを磨き上げた最適化されたプロンプトに変換できるようにし、効果的なプロンプティング技術とベストプラクティスを通じてより良い結果を得ることを保証する","ko":"에이전트가 Stitch 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 사용하여 거친 또는 모호한 UI 생성 아이디어를 다듬고 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환할 수 있도록 하여 효과적인 프롬프트 기술과 최고의 실践을 통해 더好的 결과를 얻도록 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar ideas de generación de UI vagas o poco definidas en prompts pulidos y optimizados utilizando la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch, lo que garantiza mejores resultados a través de técnicas y mejores prácticas de promoción efectiva.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées de génération d''UI peu claires ou vagues en prompts polis et optimisés en utilisant le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch, garantissant de meilleurs résultats grâce à des techniques et des meilleures pratiques de promotion efficace.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, grobe oder vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte, optimierte Prompts umzuwandeln, indem sie den Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfaden verwenden, der bessere Ergebnisse durch effektive Prompt-Techniken und Best-Practices gewährleistet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias de geração de UI vagas ou rudimentares em prompts polidos e otimizados, utilizando o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch, garantindo melhores resultados por meio de técnicas e práticas recomendadas de prompting eficaz.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать неясные или приблизительные идеи генерации пользовательского интерфейса в отполированные и оптимизированные подсказки, используя Руководство по эффективному подсказыванию Stitch, обеспечивая лучшие результаты посредством эффективных техник и рекомендаций по подсказыванию.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل أفكار توليد واجهة المستخدم الغامضة أو الخشنة إلى إشارات متطورة ومُختزلة، باستخدام دليل الإشارات الفعالة من Stitch، وضمان نتائج أفضل من خلال تقنيات الإشارات الفعالة وأفضل الممارسات."},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing vague UI generation ideas for Stitch","Optimizing prompts for better results from Stitch","Consulting the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide for up-to-date recommendations"],"zh":["增强Stitch的模糊UI生成想法","优化提示以获得Stitch的更好结果","参考Stitch有效提示指南以获取最新的建议"],"ja":["Stitchの漠然としたUI生成のアイデアを強化する","Stitchからのより良い結果を得るためのプロンプトを最適化する","最新の推奨事項を得るためにStitchの効果的なプロンプティングガイドを参照する"],"ko":["Stitch의 모호한 UI 생성 아이디어를 강화","Stitch로부터 더好的 결과를 얻기 위한 프롬프트를 최적화","최新的 추천을 얻기 위해 Stitch 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 참조"],"es":["Mejorar ideas vagas de generación de UI para Stitch","Optimizar prompts para mejores resultados desde Stitch","Consultar la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch para recomendaciones actualizadas"],"fr":["Améliorer des idées vagues de génération d''UI pour Stitch","Optimiser les prompts pour de meilleurs résultats à partir de Stitch","Consulter le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch pour des recommandations à jour"],"de":["Verbesserung vager UI-Generierungs-Ideen für Stitch","Optimierung von Prompts für bessere Ergebnisse aus Stitch","Konsultation des Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfadens für aktuelle Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Melhorar ideias vagas de geração de UI para Stitch","Otimizar prompts para melhores resultados do Stitch","Consultar o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch para recomendações atualizadas"],"ru":["Улучшение неясных идей генерации пользовательского интерфейса для Stitch","Оптимизация подсказок для лучших результатов Stitch","Консультирование по Руководству по эффективному подсказыванию Stitch для получения актуальных рекомендаций"],"ar":["تحسين أفكار توليد واجهة المستخدم الغامضة لبرنامج Stitch","تحسين الإشارات لتحقيق نتائج أفضل من برنامج Stitch","الاستشارة لدليل الإشارات الفعالة من برنامج Stitch للحصول على توصيات محدثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices","Specific to Stitch UI generation"],"zh":["需要查阅Stitch的官方文档以获取最新的最佳实践","仅适用于Stitch UI生成"],"ja":["最新のベストプラクティスを得るためにStitchの公式ドキュメントを参照する必要がある","Stitch UI生成専用"],"ko":["최新的 최고의 실践을 얻기 위해 Stitch의 공식 문서를 참조해야 함","Stitch UI 생성 전용"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la documentación oficial de Stitch para las mejores prácticas más recientes","Específico de la generación de UI de Stitch"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la documentation officielle de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques les plus récentes","Spécifique à la génération d''UI de Stitch"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation für die neuesten Best-Practices","Spezifisch für die UI-Generierung von Stitch"],"pt":["Exige consulta da documentação oficial do Stitch para as melhores práticas mais recentes","Específico para a geração de UI do Stitch"],"ru":["Требует консультации официальной до