étence jira-issues permet aux développeurs de créer et de gérer des problèmes Jira de manière efficace.","de":"Die Fähigkeit jira-issues ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Jira-Probleme effizient zu erstellen und zu verwalten.","pt":"O skill jira-issues permite criar e gerenciar issues Jira de forma unificada. Ele oferece detecção de tecnologia inteligente e instalação por projeto.","ru":"Навык jira-issues позволяет создавать и управлять задачами Jira в единой системе. Он предлагает умную детекцию технологий и установку по проекту.","ar":"المهارة jira-issues تسمح بإنشاء وإدارة قضايا جيرا بطريقة موحدة. أنها توفر الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا والتركيب للمشروع.","en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart..."},"definition":{"en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart tech   detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources."},"features":{"zh":["Jira REST API","MCP","414","38","57","API"],"ja":["Jira REST API","MCP","414","38","57","API"],"ko":["Jira REST API","MCP","414","38","57","API"],"es":["Creación de incidencias Jira","Gestión de incidencias Jira","Integración con la API de Jira","Instalación de servidor MCP","Configuración de variables de entorno","Sincronización automática desde fuentes de aguas arriba"],"fr":["Création de problèmes Jira","Gestion de problèmes Jira","Intégration à l''API Jira","Installation du serveur MCP","Configuration des variables d''environnement","Synchronisation automatique depuis les sources amont"],"de":["Erstellung von Jira-Problemen","Verwaltung von Jira-Problemen","Integration in die Jira-API","Installation des MCP-Servers","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen","Automatische Synchronisation von Quellen"],"pt":["Criação e gerenciamento de issues Jira","Detecção de tecnologia inteligente","Instalação por projeto","Sincronização automática de fontes de upstream","Integração com Jira REST API ou MCP","Suporte a múltiplos agentes"],"ru":["Создание и управление задачами Jira","Умная детекция технологий","Установка по проекту","Автоматическая синхронизация источников upstream","Интеграция с Jira REST API или MCP","Поддержка нескольких агентов"],"ar":["إنشاء وإدارة قضايا جيرا","الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا","التركيب للمشروع","التزامن التلقائي لمصادر Upstream","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا أو MCP","دعم وكلاء متعددين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jira API","Jira ","Jira REST API","MCP","AI","414","38","57","API"],"ja":["Jira API","Jira ","Jira REST API","MCP","AI","414","38","57","API"],"ko":["Jira API","Jira ","Jira REST API","MCP","AI","414","38","57","API"],"es":["jira issues","gestión de incidencias jira","api de jira","mcp server","desarrollo de software","integración de jira","creación de incidencias jira","gestión de problemas jira"],"fr":["jira issues","gestion de problèmes jira","api jira","serveur mcp","développement de logiciels","intégration de jira","création de problèmes jira","gestion de problèmes jira"],"de":["jira issues","jira-problemmangement","jira-api","mcp-server","softwareentwicklung","jira-integration","erstellung von jira-problemen","verwaltung von jira-problemen"],"pt":["jira issues","gerenciamento de issues","api rest jira","mcp","assistente de codificação ai","detecção de tecnologia","instalação por projeto","sincronização automática"],"ru":["jira issues","управление задачами","rest api jira","mcp","помощник кодирования ai","детекция технологий","установка по проекту","автоматическая синхронизация"],"ar":["قضايا جيرا","إدارة قضايا","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا","mcp","مساعد الترميز الذكاء الاصطناعي","الكشف عن التكنولوجيا","التركيب للمشروع","التزامن التلقائي"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jira-issues","description":"Create, update, and manage Jira issues from natural language. Use when the user wants to log bugs, create tickets, update issue status, or manage their Jira backlog.","bodyPreview":"# Jira Issue Management\n\nCreate and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Option 1: Jira MCP Server\nInstall the Jira MCP server for seamless integration:\n```bash\nnpx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct API\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nexport JIRA_BASE_URL=\"https://yourcompany.atlassian.net\"\nexport JIRA_EMAIL=\"your-email@company.com\"\nexport JIRA_API_TOKEN=\"your-api-token\"\n```\n\nGet your API token: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/sec","body":"# Jira Issue Management\n\nCreate and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Option 1: Jira MCP Server\nInstall the Jira MCP server for seamless integration:\n```bash\nnpx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct API\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nexport JIRA_BASE_URL=\"https://yourcompany.atlassian.net\"\nexport JIRA_EMAIL=\"your-email@company.com\"\nexport JIRA_API_TOKEN=\"your-api-token\"\n```\n\nGet your API token: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens\n\n## Creating Issues\n\n### Basic Issue\n```python\nimport requests\nfrom requests.auth import HTTPBasicAuth\nimport os\n\ndef create_issue(project_key, summary, description, issue_type=\"Task\"):\n    url = f\"{os.environ[''JIRA_BASE_URL'']}/rest/api/3/issue\"\n\n    auth = HTTPBasicAuth(\n        os.environ[''JIRA_EMAIL''],\n        os.environ[''JIRA_API_TOKEN'']\n    )\n\n    payload = {\n        \"fields\": {\n            \"project\": {\"key\": project_key},\n            \"summary\": summary,\n            \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"doc\",\n                \"version\": 1,\n                \"content\": [{\n                    \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                    \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": description}]\n                }]\n            },\n            \"issuetype\": {\"name\": issue_type}\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, json=payload, auth=auth)\n    return response.json()\n\n# Example\nissue = create_issue(\"PROJ\", \"Fix login bug\", \"Users can''t login with SSO\", \"Bug\")\nprint(f\"Created: {issue[''key'']}\")\n```\n\n### With Labels and Priority\n```python\ndef create_detailed_issue(project_key, summary, description,\n                          issue_type=\"Task\", priority=\"Medium\",\n                          labels=None, assignee=None):\n    payload = {\n        \"fields\": {\n            \"project\": {\"key\": project_key},\n            \"summary\": summary,\n            \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"doc\",\n                \"version\": 1,\n                \"content\": [{\n                    \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                    \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": description}]\n                }]\n            },\n            \"issuetype\": {\"name\": issue_type},\n            \"priority\": {\"name\": priority},\n        }\n    }\n\n    if labels:\n        payload[\"fields\"][\"labels\"] = labels\n    if assignee:\n        payload[\"fields\"][\"assignee\"] = {\"accountId\": assignee}\n\n    # ... make request\n```\n\n## Common Issue Types\n\n| Type | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| Bug | Something broken |\n| Task | Work item |\n| Story | User-facing feature |\n| Epic | Large initiative |\n| Sub-task | Part of larger task |\n\n## Updating Issues\n\n### Change Status\n```python\ndef transition_issue(issue_key, transition_name):\n    # Get available transitions\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/issue/{issue_key}/transitions\"\n    transitions = requests.get(url, auth=auth).json()\n\n    # Find matching transition\n    transition_id = None\n    for t in transitions[''transitions'']:\n        if t[''name''].lower() == transition_name.lower():\n            transition_id = t[''id'']\n            break\n\n    # Execute transition\n    requests.post(url, json={\"transition\": {\"id\": transition_id}}, auth=auth)\n```\n\n### Add Comment\n```python\ndef add_comment(issue_key, comment_text):\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/issue/{issue_key}/comment\"\n\n    payload = {\n        \"body\": {\n            \"type\": \"doc\",\n            \"version\": 1,\n            \"content\": [{\n                \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": comment_text}]\n            }]\n        }\n    }\n\n    requests.post(url, json=payload, auth=auth)\n```\n\n## Searching Issues\n\n### JQL Queries\n```python\ndef search_issues(jql):\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/search\"\n    params = {\"jql\": jql, \"maxResults\": 50}\n    response = requests.get(url, params=params, auth=auth)\n    return response.json()[''issues'']\n\n# Examples\nmy_bugs = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND type = Bug AND assignee = currentUser()\")\nopen_items = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND status != Done\")\nrecent = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND created >= -7d\")\n```\n\n## Quick Commands\n\nWhen user says... create this:\n\n| Command | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| \"log bug about X\" | Bug issue with description |\n| \"create task for X\" | Task issue |\n| \"what''s on my plate\" | JQL: assignee = currentUser() AND status != Done |\n| \"move X to done\" | Transition issue to Done |\n| \"add comment to X\" | Add comment to issue |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Summary**: Keep under 80 chars, start with verb (Fix, Add, Update)\n2. **Description**: Include steps to reproduce for bugs\n3. **Labels**: Use for categorization (frontend, backend, urgent)\n4. **Links**: Reference related issues when relevant\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:04:09.395Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Project Management Agents needing seamless Jira issue integration and automation.","zh":"适用于需要无缝集成Jira问题和自动化的项目管理代理。","ja":"Jiraの問題をシームレスに統合し、自動化する必要があるプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Jira 이슈를 무결점으로 통합하고 자동화해야 하는 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan una integración y automatización de problemas de Jira sin problemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une intégration et une automatisation transparentes des problèmes Jira.","de":"Ideal für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Jira-Probleminitialisierung und -automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de integração e automação de problemas do Jira sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по управлению проектами, которым необходима бесперебойная интеграция и автоматизация проблем Jira.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المشاريع التي تحتاج إلى دمج وتأتمة مشاكل جيرا بدون انقطاع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP, providing smart tech detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources, streamlining project management workflows with environment variables and API tokens.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理Jira问题的能力，使用Jira REST API或MCP，提供智能技术检测、每个项目安装和从上游源自动同步，利用环境变量和API令牌简化项目管理工作流程。","ja":"エージェントがJiraの問題を作成して管理できるようにし、Jira REST APIまたはMCPを使用して、スマートテクノロジー検出、プロジェクトごとのインストール、上流ソースからの自動同期を提供し、環境変数とAPIトークンを使用してプロジェクト管理ワークフローを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Jira 이슈를 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Jira REST API 또는 MCP를 사용하여 스마트 기술 감지, 프로젝트별 설치 및 업스트림 소스에서 자동 동기화를 제공하여 환경 변수와 API 토큰을 사용하여 프로젝트 관리 워크플ロー를 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar problemas de Jira mediante la API REST de Jira o MCP, proporcionando detección inteligente de tecnología, instalación por proyecto y sincronización automática desde fuentes de origen, lo que simplifica los flujos de trabajo de gestión de proyectos con variables de entorno y tokens de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des problèmes Jira à l''aide de l''API REST Jira ou de MCP, en fournissant une détection intelligente de la technologie, une installation par projet et une synchronisation automatique à partir de sources en amont, rationalisant ainsi les flux de travail de gestion de projet avec des variables d''environnement et des jetons d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Jira-Probleme mithilfe der Jira-REST-API oder MCP zu erstellen und zu verwalten, wodurch eine intelligente Technologieerkennung, eine pro-Projekt-Installation und eine automatische Synchronisierung aus Quellen bereitgestellt wird, die Projektmanagement-Workflows mit Umgebungsvariablen und API-Tokens rationalisieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e gerenciem problemas do Jira usando a API REST do Jira ou o MCP, fornecendo detecção de tecnologia inteligente, instalação por projeto e sincronização automática de fontes upstream, otimizando os fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de projetos com variáveis de ambiente e tokens de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять проблемами Jira с помощью API REST Jira или MCP, обеспечивая интеллектуальное обнаружение технологий, установку на уровне проекта и автоматическую синхронизацию из источников upstream, оптимизируя рабочие процессы управления проектами с переменными среды и токенами API.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وتحديث مشاكل جيرا باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات جيرا REST أو MCP، مع توفير الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا والتركيب لكل مشروع والتنسيق التلقائي من المصادر المتchner، وتصميم تدفقات العمل لادارة المشاريع مع متغيرات البيئة وأكواد وصول API."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Jira issue creation","Managing project workflows with Jira MCP server","Syncing issues from upstream sources"],"zh":["自动化Jira问题创建","使用Jira MCP服务器管理项目工作流程","从上游源同步问题"],"ja":["Jiraの問題作成の自動化","Jira MCPサーバーを使用したプロジェクトワークフローの管理","上流ソースからの問題の同期"],"ko":["Jira 이슈 생성 자동화","Jira MCP 서버를 사용한 프로젝트 워크플ロー 관리","업스트림 소스에서 이슈 동기화"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas de Jira","Gestión de flujos de trabajo de proyectos con servidor Jira MCP","Sincronización de problemas desde fuentes de origen"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes Jira","Gestion des flux de travail de projet avec serveur Jira MCP","Synchronisation des problèmes depuis des sources en amont"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Jira-Problemen","Verwaltung von Projekt-Workflows mit Jira-MCP-Server","Synchronisierung von Problemen aus Quellen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas do Jira","Gerenciar fluxos de trabalho de projetos com o servidor Jira MCP","Sincronizar problemas de fontes upstream"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание проблем Jira","Управлять рабочими процессами проектов с помощью сервера Jira MCP","Синхронизировать проблемы из источников upstream"],"ar":["تأتمة إنشاء مشاكل جيرا","إدارة تدفقات العمل للمشاريع مع خادم جيرا MCP","تنسيق مشاكل من المصادر المتchner"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jira API token","Needs environment variables setup","Dependent on Jira REST API or MCP server installation"],"zh":["需要Jira API令牌","需要环境变量设置","依赖于Jira REST API或MCP服务器安装"],"ja":["Jira APIトークンが必要","環境変数の設定が必要","Jira REST APIまたはMCPサーバーのインストールに依存"],"ko":["Jira API 토큰가 필요","환경 변수 설정이 필요","Jira REST API 또는 MCP 서버 설치에 의존"],"es":["Requiere token de API de Jira","Necesita configuración de variables de entorno","Dependiente de la instalación de la API REST de Jira o del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''API Jira","Nécessite une configuration de variables d''environnement","Dépend de l''installation de l''API REST Jira ou du serveur MCP"],"de":["Benötigt Jira-API-Token","Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen-Einrichtung","Abhängig von der Installation der Jira-REST-API oder des MCP-Servers"],"pt":["Exige token de API do Jira","Necessita configuração de variáveis de ambiente","Depende da instalação da API REST do Jira ou do servidor MCP"],"ru":["Требует токена API Jira","Требует настройки переменных среды","Зависит от установки API REST Jira или сервера MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز وصول API جيرا","يحتاج إلى إعداد متغيرات البيئة","يتوقف على تثبيت واجهة برمجة التطبيقات جيرا REST أو خادم MCP"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"649a1012fe6ddb0e7e86e83e267dd23b27dad0ac22195311205d5d4e7b0632fc","qualityScore":75}');
