 de generación de UI en prompts optimizados","fr":"L''ingénieur de prompts Stitch transforme les idées de génération d''UI en prompts optimisés","de":"Der Stitch-Prompt-Ingenieur wandelt UI-Generierungsideen in optimierte Prompts um","pt":"O enhance-prompt é uma habilidade que permite transformar ideias vagas de geração de UI em prompts polidos e otimizados","ru":"Enhance-prompt - это навык, который позволяет преобразовать неясные идеи генерации UI в отполированные и оптимизированные промпты","ar":"تعزز الدفعة هو مهارة تتيح تحويل الأفكار الغامضة لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم إلى دفعات منقحة ومحسنة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["优化Stitch UI生成提示","提高生成结果的质量和效率","根据Stitch官方文档的最佳实践","设计精心的提示以获得更好的结果","提高开发效率和生产力"],"ja":["Stitch UI生成のプロンプトを最適化","生成結果の質と効率を向上させる","Stitch公式ドキュメントのベストプラクティスに基づく","慎重に設計されたプロンプトでより良い結果を取得","開発効率と生産性の向上"],"ko":["스티치 UI 생성 프롬프트 최적화","생성 결과의 품질과 효율성을 향상시키기","스티치 공식 문서의 베스트 프랙티스에 따라","신중하게 설계된 프롬프트를 통해 더好的 결과를 얻기","개발 효율성과 생산성을 향상시키기"],"es":["Transformación de ideas de generación de UI en prompts optimizados","Mejora de la calidad de los resultados de Stitch","Consulta de la guía oficial de Stitch para las mejores prácticas","Optimización de prompts para la generación de UI","Creación de prompts claros y concisos"],"fr":["Transformation d''idées de génération d''UI en prompts optimisés","Amélioration de la qualité des résultats de Stitch","Consultation du guide officiel de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques","Optimisation de prompts pour la génération d''UI","Création de prompts clairs et concis"],"de":["Umwandlung von UI-Generierungsideen in optimierte Prompts","Verbesserung der Qualität der Stitch-Ergebnisse","Konsultation der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation für die besten Praktiken","Optimierung von Prompts für die UI-Generierung","Erstellung von klaren und präzisen Prompts"],"pt":["Criação de prompts otimizados","Melhoria dos resultados da UI gerada","Consulta à documentação oficial do Stitch","Aumento da eficiência na geração de UI","Prompts personalizados para necessidades específicas"],"ru":["Создание оптимизированных промптов","Улучшение результатов генерации UI","Консультация официальной документации Stitch","Повышение эффективности генерации UI","Промпты на заказ для конкретных потребностей"],"ar":["إنشاء دفعات محسنة","تحسين نتائج واجهة المستخدم التي تم إنشاؤها","الاستشارة إلى وثائق ستيتش الرسمية","زيادة الكفاءة في إنشاء واجهة المستخدم","دفعات مخصصة لاحتياجات محددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Stitch UI生成","增强提示","优化提示","Stitch开发","UI生成","提示设计","开发效率","生产力"],"ja":["Stitch UI生成","プロンプトの強化","プロンプトの最適化","Stitch開発","UI生成","プロンプト設計","開発効率","生産性"],"ko":["스티치 UI 생성","프롬프트 강화","프롬프트 최적화","스티치 개발","UI 생성","프롬프트 설계","개발 효율성","생산성"],"es":["prompts de Stitch","generación de UI","ingeniero de prompts","optimización de prompts","mejora de resultados","guía oficial de Stitch","prácticas recomendadas"],"fr":["prompts de Stitch","génération d''UI","ingénieur de prompts","optimisation de prompts","amélioration des résultats","guide officiel de Stitch","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Stitch-Prompts","UI-Generierung","Prompt-Ingenieur","Optimierung von Prompts","Verbesserung der Ergebnisse","offizielle Stitch-Dokumentation","beste Praktiken"],"pt":["enhance-prompt","Stitch","UI gerada","prompts otimizados","desenvolvimento de UI","otimização de prompts","guia de prompting do Stitch","melhoria de resultados"],"ru":["enhance-prompt","Stitch","генерация UI","оптимизированные промпты","разработка UI","оптимизация промптов","руководство по промптингу Stitch","улучшение результатов"],"ar":["تعزز الدفعة","ستيتش","واجهة المستخدم التي تم إنشاؤها","دفعات محسنة","تطوير واجهة المستخدم","تحسين الدفعات","دليل الدفعات لستيتش","تحسين النتائج"]}},"owner":"phuchau26","repo":"giatsay","repoPath":"phuchau26/giatsay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:03:59.810Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Model Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, or LangChain needing to refine user input for better UI generation results from Stitch.","zh":"适合需要完善用户输入以获得更好Stitch UI生成结果的语言模型代理，如Claude Code、AutoGPT或LangChain","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、またはLangChainのような言語モデルエージェントが、Stitchからのより良いUI生成結果を得るためにユーザーの入力を洗練する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"Stitch 에서 더 나은 UI 생성 결과를 얻으려면 사용자 입력을 정련해야 하는 Claude Code, AutoGPT 또는 LangChain과 같은 언어 모델 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Modelo de Lenguaje como Claude Code, AutoGPT o LangChain que necesitan refinar la entrada del usuario para obtener mejores resultados de generación de UI desde Stitch.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modèle de langage comme Claude Code, AutoGPT ou LangChain ayant besoin d''affiner les entrées utilisateur pour obtenir de meilleurs résultats de génération d''UI à partir de Stitch.","de":"Ideal für Sprachmodellagenten wie Claude Code, AutoGPT oder LangChain, die Benutzereingaben verfeinern müssen, um bessere UI-Generierungsergebnisse von Stitch zu erzielen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem como Claude Code, AutoGPT ou LangChain que precisam refinar a entrada do usuário para obter melhores resultados de geração de UI do Stitch.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT или LangChain, которые нуждаются в усовершенствовании пользовательского ввода для достижения лучших результатов генерации UI из Stitch.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء نموذج اللغة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT أو LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى توضيح إدخال المستخدم للحصول على نتائج جيدة لتشغيل واجهة المستخدم من Stitch."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform vague UI ideas into polished prompts using the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide, optimizing results through best practices and up-to-date recommendations, and leveraging protocols like https for documentation access.","zh":"赋予代理能力，利用Stitch有效提示指南将模糊的UI创意转化为精致的提示，通过最佳实践和最新的建议优化结果，并利用像https这样的协议访问文档","ja":"Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを使用して、エージェントが漠然としたUIアイデアを洗練されたプロンプトに変換できるようにし、ベストプラクティスや最新の推奨事項を通じて結果を最適化し、httpsなどのプロトコルを使用してドキュメントにアクセス","ko":"에이전트가 불분명한 UI 아이디어를 정교한 프롬프트로 변환 할 수 있도록 Stitch Effective Prompting Guide를 사용하여 결과를 최적화하고 최신 추천을 통해 결과를 최적화하고 https와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 문서에 액세스","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar ideas de UI vagas en instrucciones pulidas utilizando la Guía de solicitudes efectivas de Stitch, optimizando los resultados a través de las mejores prácticas y recomendaciones actualizadas, y aprovechando protocolos como https para el acceso a la documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées d''UI vagues en invites polies en utilisant le Guide de requêtes efficaces de Stitch, en optimisant les résultats grâce aux meilleures pratiques et recommandations à jour, et en exploitant des protocoles comme https pour l''accès à la documentation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, vage UI-Ideen in polierte Anweisungen umzuwandeln, indem sie den Leitfaden für effektive Anfragen von Stitch verwenden, Ergebnisse durch bewährte Verfahren und aktuelle Empfehlungen optimieren und Protokolle wie https für den Zugriff auf die Dokumentation nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias vagas de UI em prompts polidos usando o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch, otimizando os resultados por meio de práticas recomendadas e recomendações atualizadas, e aproveitando protocolos como https para acesso à documentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать расплывчатые идеи UI в отполированные запросы с помощью Руководства по эффективному запросу Stitch, оптимизируя результаты посредством передовой практики и актуальных рекомендаций, а также используя протоколы, такие как https, для доступа к документации.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحويل أفكار واجهة المستخدم الغامضة إلى طلبات متطورة باستخدام دليل التوجيه الفعال من Stitch، وضبط النتائج من خلال الممارسات الموصى بها والتوصيات الحديثة، وتسخير البروتوكولات مثل https للوصول إلى الوثائق."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining rough UI generation ideas","Optimizing prompts for Stitch","Consulting the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide for best practices"],"zh":["完善粗糙的UI生成创意","为Stitch优化提示","参考Stitch有效提示指南以获得最佳实践"],"ja":["UI生成のアイデアを洗練する","Stitchのプロンプトを最適化する","Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを参考し、ベストプラクティスを学ぶ"],"ko":["조잡한 UI 생성 아이디어를 정련","Stitch를 위한 프롬프트 최적화","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide를 참고하여 최선의 관행 학습"],"es":["Refinar ideas de generación de UI poco precisas","Optimizar instrucciones para Stitch","Consultar la Guía de solicitudes efectivas de Stitch para las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Affiner les idées de génération d''UI peu précises","Optimiser les invites pour Stitch","Consulter le Guide de requêtes efficaces de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Verfeinern von ungenauen UI-GenerierungsIDEEN","Optimieren von Anweisungen für Stitch","Konsultieren des Leitfadens für effektive Anfragen von Stitch für bewährte Verfahren"],"pt":["Refinamento de ideias de geração de UI rudimentares","Otimização de prompts para Stitch","Consulta do Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch para as melhores práticas"],"ru":["Уточнение грубых идей генерации UI","Оптимизация запросов для Stitch","Консультирование по Руководству по эффективному запросу Stitch для передовой практики"],"ar":["تحسين أفكار توليد واجهة المستخدم الخشنة","تحسين الطلبات لبرنامج Stitch","الاستشارة لدليل التوجيه الفعال من Stitch لأفضل الممارسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","Stitch-specific prompting expertise needed"],"zh":["需要参考Stitch有效提示指南","需要Stitch特定的提示专长"],"ja":["Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを参考する必要がある","Stitch特有のプロンプト専門知識が必要"],"ko":["Stitch Effective Prompting Guide를 참조해야 함","Stitch 특정 프롬프트 전문 지식 필요"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la Guía de solicitudes efectivas de Stitch","Se necesita experiencia en solicitudes específicas de Stitch"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation du Guide de requêtes efficaces de Stitch","Une expertise en matière de requêtes spécifiques à Stitch est nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation des Leitfadens für effektive Anfragen von Stitch","Stitch-spezifische Anfrage-Expertise ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige consulta do Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch","É necessária especialização em prompting específica do Stitch"],"ru":["Требует консультации Руководства по эффективному запросу Stitch","Требуется экспертиза в области запросов, специфичная для Stitch"],"ar":["يتطلب استشارة دليل التوجيه الفعال من Stitch","يتطلب خبرة في مجال الطلبات الخاصة ببرنامج Stitch"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ccb200c798072438b642b1fa6a5c515563159e2fab3d56e813d76d8afa9a7ce6","qualityScore":60}');
