t GitHub Copilot-Agentensitzungen","Führt automatisierte Codeänderungen durch","Verwendet die Kommandozeile zur Interaktion mit dem Agenten","Integriert mit GitHub Copilot","Ermöglicht die Automatisierung von Codeaufgaben"],"pt":["Criação de sessões de agente GitHub via linha de comando","Alterações de código automatizadas com base em instruções de linguagem natural","Integração com o GitHub Copilot","Suporte a issues especializadas","Automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание сессий агента GitHub через командную строку","Автоматические изменения кода на основе инструкций естественного языка","Интеграция с GitHub Copilot","Поддержка специализированных вопросов","Автоматизация задач разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء جلسات وكلاء.github عبر سطر الأوامر","تغييرات الكود التلقائية بناءً على تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية","التكامل مع وكلاء.github","دعم مشاكل متخصصة","أتمتة مهام التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub Copilot","代理会话扩展","自动代码更改","命令行工具","自然语言指令","GitHub 问题跟踪"],"ja":["GitHub Copilot","エージェントセッション拡張","自動コード変更","コマンドラインツール","自然言語指令","GitHub の問題追跡"],"ko":["GitHub Copilot","에이전트 세션 확장","자동 코드 변경","명령줄 도구","자연어 지시문","GitHub 이슈 추적"],"es":["github cli","agente de github","sesión de agente","cambios de código automatizados","github copilot","automatización de código","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["github cli","agent github","session d''agent","modifications de code automatisées","github copilot","automatisation de code","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["github cli","github-agent","agentensitzung","automatisierte codeänderungen","github copilot","codeautomatisierung","softwareentwicklung","entwicklungstools"],"pt":["github agent session","automatização de código","github copilot","issues especializadas","desenvolvimento de software","linha de comando","instruções de linguagem natural"],"ru":["сессия агента github","автоматизация кода","github copilot","специализированные вопросы","разработка программного обеспечения","командная строка","инструкции естественного языка"],"ar":["جلسة وكلاء.github","أتمتة الكود","وكلاء.github","مشاكل متخصصة","تطوير البرمجيات","سطر الأوامر","تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية"]}},"owner":"maxfraieho","repo":"garden-bloom","repoPath":"maxfraieho/garden-bloom","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-agent-session","description":"GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension\n\nThe `gh agent-task` CLI extension enables creating GitHub Copilot agent sessions through the command line. An agent session is a specialized GitHub issue that triggers GitHub Copilot to perform automated code changes based on natural language instructions.\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/github/agent-task (internal GitHub extension)\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent sessions are GitHub issues that:\n- Contain natural language instructions for code changes\n- Trigger Git","body":"# GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension\n\nThe `gh agent-task` CLI extension enables creating GitHub Copilot agent sessions through the command line. An agent session is a specialized GitHub issue that triggers GitHub Copilot to perform automated code changes based on natural language instructions.\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/github/agent-task (internal GitHub extension)\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent sessions are GitHub issues that:\n- Contain natural language instructions for code changes\n- Trigger GitHub Copilot to autonomously execute the task\n- Create pull requests with the implemented changes\n- Provide a workflow for reviewing and merging automated code modifications\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall via GitHub CLI:\n\n```bash\ngh extension install github/agent-task\n```\n\n**Note**: This extension requires authentication with a Personal Access Token (PAT) that has appropriate permissions for creating issues and pull requests.\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Create Agent Task\n\nCreate a new agent session from a description:\n\n```bash\n# Create task with inline description\ngh agent-task create \"Fix the bug in authentication flow\"\n\n# Create task from file\ngh agent-task create --from-file task-description.md\n\n# Specify base branch\ngh agent-task create --base develop \"Implement new feature\"\n\n# Create in different repository\ngh agent-task create --repo owner/repo \"Update documentation\"\n```\n\n**Command Parameters:**\n- **Description** (positional): Natural language description of the task\n- **`--from-file <path>`**: Read task description from file\n- **`--base <branch>`**: Base branch for the pull request (default: repository default branch)\n- **`--repo <owner/repo>`**: Target repository (default: current repository)\n\n**Output Format:**\nThe command outputs the URL of the created agent session:\n```\nhttps://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\n```\n\n### List Agent Tasks\n\nList agent sessions in a repository:\n\n```bash\n# List all agent sessions\ngh agent-task list\n\n# List with filters\ngh agent-task list --state open\ngh agent-task list --state closed\ngh agent-task list --state all\n```\n\n### View Agent Task\n\nView details of a specific agent session:\n\n```bash\n# View by number\ngh agent-task view 123\n\n# View by URL\ngh agent-task view https://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\n```\n\n### Update Agent Task\n\nUpdate an existing agent session:\n\n```bash\n# Update description\ngh agent-task update 123 \"Updated task description\"\n\n# Update from file\ngh agent-task update 123 --from-file updated-description.md\n```\n\n## Task Description Format\n\nAgent session descriptions should be clear, specific natural language instructions:\n\n**Good Example:**\n```markdown\n# Refactor User Authentication\n\nRefactor the user authentication flow in `src/auth/login.js` to:\n1. Use async/await instead of callbacks\n2. Add proper error handling with specific error messages\n3. Add input validation for email format\n4. Update tests to cover the new implementation\n\nMaintain backward compatibility with the existing API.\n```\n\n**Poor Example:**\n```markdown\nFix auth\n```\n\n**Best Practices:**\n- Be specific about what needs to change\n- Reference file paths when relevant\n- Include acceptance criteria\n- Specify any constraints or requirements\n- Mention testing expectations\n\n## Integration with GitHub Agentic Workflows\n\nThe `gh agent-task` extension is used by the `create-agent-session` safe output feature in GitHub Agentic Workflows (gh-aw).\n\n### Safe Output Configuration\n\n```yaml\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: main                       # Base branch for agent session PR\n    target-repo: \"owner/target-repo\" # Cross-repository task creation\n```\n\n### Workflow Example\n\n```yaml\non:\n  issues:\n    types: [labeled]\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  actions: read\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: main\n\n# Code Task Delegator\n\nWhen an issue is labeled with \"code-task\", analyze the requirements and create a GitHub Copilot agent session with detailed instructions for implementing the requested changes.\n```\n\n### Implementation Details\n\nThe safe output processor:\n1. Reads agent output from the workflow execution\n2. Extracts `create_agent_task` items from the structured output\n3. Writes task descriptions to temporary files\n4. Executes `gh agent-task create --from-file <file> --base <branch>`\n5. Captures the created task URL and number\n6. Reports results in job summary\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- `GITHUB_AW_AGENT_TASK_BASE`: Base branch for the pull request\n- `GITHUB_AW_TARGET_REPO`: Target repository for cross-repo task creation\n- `GITHUB_AW_SAFE_OUTPUTS_STAGED`: Preview mode flag\n\n## Authentication Requirements\n\nAgent session creation requires elevated permissions beyond the default `GITHUB_TOKEN`:\n\n**Required Permissions:**\n- `contents: write` - To create branches and commits\n- `issues: write` - To create the agent session issue\n- `pull-requests: write` - To create pull requests\n\n**Token Precedence:**\n1. `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` - Dedicated Copilot operations token (recommended)\n2. `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` - General override token (legacy)\n3. Custom token via `github-token` configuration field\n\n**Note**: The default `GITHUB_TOKEN` is **not** supported as it lacks required permissions. The `COPILOT_CLI_TOKEN` and `GH_AW_COPILOT_TOKEN` secrets are no longer supported as of v0.26+.\n\n### Setting Up Authentication\n\nStore your Personal Access Token in repository secrets:\n\n```bash\n# In your repository settings, add secret:\n# Name: COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN (recommended)\n# Value: ghp_YourPersonalAccessToken\n```\n\n:::note[Backward Compatibility]\nLegacy token name `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` is still supported for backward compatibility. The `GH_AW_COPILOT_TOKEN` token is no longer supported as of v0.26+.\n:::\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Authentication Errors\n\n```\nError: failed to create agent session\nauthentication required\n```\n\n**Solution**: Configure `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` or legacy `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` with a PAT.\n\n### Permission Errors\n\n```\nError: 403 Forbidden\nResource not accessible by integration\n```\n\n**Solution**: Ensure the token has `contents: write`, `issues: write`, and `pull-requests: write` permissions.\n\n### Repository Not Found\n\n```\nError: repository not found\n```\n\n**Solution**: Verify the target repository exists and the token has access to it.\n\n## Testing in Staged Mode\n\nWhen `safe-outputs.staged: true`, agent sessions are previewed without creation:\n\n```yaml\nsafe-outputs:\n  staged: true\n  create-agent-session:\n```\n\n**Staged Output:**\n```markdown\n## 🎭 Staged Mode: Create Agent Tasks Preview\n\nThe following agent sessions would be created if staged mode was disabled:\n\n### Task 1\n\n**Description:**\nRefactor authentication to use async/await pattern\n\n**Base Branch:** main\n\n**Target Repository:** owner/repo\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Issue-Triggered Agent Tasks\n\n```yaml\non:\n  issues:\n    types: [labeled]\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n\nWhen issue is labeled with \"needs-implementation\", create an agent session with implementation instructions.\n```\n\n### Scheduled Code Improvements\n\n```yaml\non:\n  schedule:\n    - cron: \"0 9 * * 1\"  # Monday 9AM\nengine: copilot\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: develop\n\nAnalyze codebase for improvement opportunities and create agent sessions for top 3 improvements.\n```\n\n### Cross-Repository Task Delegation\n\n```yaml\non: workflow_dispatch\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    target-repo: \"organization/backend-repo\"\n    base: main\n\nCreate agent session in backend repository to implement the API changes described in this issue.\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Task Description Guidelines\n\n1. **Be Specific**: Include file paths, function names, and exact requirements\n2. **Include Context**: Explain why the change is needed\n3. **Define Success**: Specify acceptance criteria or expected outcomes\n4. **Mention Tests**: Request test coverage for changes\n5. **Set Constraints**: Note any compatibility requirements or limitations\n\n### Security Considerations\n\n1. **Token Security**: Store PATs as secrets, never commit to repository\n2. **Permission Scope**: Use minimum required permissions on tokens\n3. **Repository Access**: Validate target repository before task creation\n4. **Review Process**: Establish review workflow for agent-generated code\n\n### Operational Guidelines\n\n1. **Monitor Usage**: Track agent session creation and completion rates\n2. **Review Output**: Always review agent-generated pull requests\n3. **Iterate**: Refine task descriptions based on agent performance\n4. **Document**: Maintain patterns for common task types\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Task Creation Fails Silently\n\n**Symptom**: No error but no task created\n\n**Check**:\n1. Verify `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` is set in repository secrets\n2. Confirm token has required permissions\n3. Check job logs for error messages\n4. Verify target repository exists and is accessible\n\n### Agent Task Not Triggering Copilot\n\n**Symptom**: Task created but no automated PR\n\n**Possible Causes**:\n1. GitHub Copilot not enabled for repository\n2. Task description unclear or ambiguous\n3. Repository settings blocking automated PRs\n4. Copilot service issues\n\n**Solution**: Check repository Copilot settings and refine task description.\n\n### Cross-Repository Tasks Fail\n\n**Symptom**: Error when creating tasks in different repository\n\n**Check**:\n1. Token has access to target repository\n2. Target repository exists and is spelled correctly\n3. Token has required permissions in target repository\n\n## Output Structure\n\nWhen used via safe outputs, the create-agent-session job provides outputs:\n\n```yaml\noutputs:\n  task_number: \"123\"\n  task_url: \"https://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\"\n```\n\n**Usage in Dependent Jobs:**\n```yaml\njobs:\n  follow_up:\n    needs: create_agent_task\n    steps:\n      - name: Notify team\n        run: |\n          echo \"Agent session created: ${{ needs.create_agent_task.outputs.task_url }}\"\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [GitHub Copilot Documentation](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot)\n- [GitHub CLI Extensions](https://docs.github.com/en/github-cli/github-cli/using-github-cli-extensions)\n- [Safe Outputs Documentation](https://github.github.com/gh-aw/reference/safe-outputs/)\n- [Personal Access Tokens](https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/creating-a-personal-access-token)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:04:45.686Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated code changes through natural language instructions on GitHub","zh":"非常适合需要通过 GitHub 自然语言指令自动化代码更改的开发代理","ja":"GitHub における自然言語によるコード変更の自動化が必要な開発エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub에서 자연어 지시를 통해 코드 변경을 자동화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan cambios de código automatizados a través de instrucciones de lenguaje natural en GitHub","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de modifications de code automatisées via des instructions de langage naturel sur GitHub","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die automatisierte Codeänderungen durch natürliche Sprachanweisungen auf GitHub benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de alterações de código automatizadas por meio de instruções em linguagem natural no GitHub","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих автоматических изменений кода через инструкции на естественном языке в GitHub","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تغييرات في الكود أتمتيكية من خلال تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية على جيت هاب"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger GitHub Copilot for automated code changes based on natural language instructions through GitHub issues, utilizing the GitHub CLI and natural language processing","zh":"赋予代理触发 GitHub Copilot 实现基于自然语言指令的自动代码更改的能力，利用 GitHub CLI 和自然语言处理","ja":"エージェントが GitHub CLI および自然言語処理を利用して、GitHub の問題に対する自然言語による指示に基づいて GitHub Copilot をトリガーし、自動コード変更を実行する能力を付与","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub CLI 및 자연어 처리를 활용하여 GitHub 문제에 대한 자연어 지시를 기반으로 GitHub Copilot를 트리거하여 자동 코드 변경을 수행할 수 있는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desencadenar GitHub Copilot para cambios de código automatizados en función de instrucciones de lenguaje natural a través de problemas de GitHub, utilizando GitHub CLI y procesamiento de lenguaje natural","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher GitHub Copilot pour des modifications de code automatisées en fonction d''instructions de langage naturel via les problèmes GitHub, en utilisant GitHub CLI et le traitement du langage naturel","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, GitHub Copilot für automatisierte Codeänderungen auf der Grundlage von natürlichen Sprachanweisungen über GitHub-Probleme auszulösen, unter Verwendung von GitHub CLI und natürlicher Sprachverarbeitung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acionar o GitHub Copilot para alterações de código automatizadas com base em instruções de linguagem natural por meio de problemas do GitHub, utilizando o GitHub CLI e o processamento de linguagem natural","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать GitHub Copilot для автоматических изменений кода на основе инструкций естественного языка через проблемы GitHub, используя GitHub CLI и обработку естественного языка","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل جيت هاب كوبيلوت للتعديلات التutomatike للكود على أساس تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية من خلال مشاكل جيت هاب، باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر جيت هاب ومعالجة اللغة الطبيعية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews with natural language feedback","Generating pull requests based on issue instructions","Triggering GitHub Copilot for automated bug fixes"],"zh":["使用自然语言反馈自动化代码审查","根据问题指令生成拉取请求","触发 GitHub Copilot 实现自动化 Bug 修复"],"ja":["自然言語によるフィードバックでコードレビューを自動化","問題の指示に基づいてプルリクエストを生成","GitHub Copilot をトリガーして自動バグ修正を実行"],"ko":["자연어 피드백을 통해 코드 리뷰 자동화","문제 지시에 따라 プル リクエスト 생성","GitHub Copilot 트리거를 통해 자동 버그 수정 수행"],"es":["Automatizar revisiones de código con comentarios de lenguaje natural","Generar solicitudes de extracción en función de instrucciones de problema","Desencadenar GitHub Copilot para solucionar errores automatizados"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code avec des commentaires de langage naturel","Générer des demandes d''extraction en fonction d''instructions de problème","Déclencher GitHub Copilot pour des correctifs de bogue automatisés"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews mit natürlicher Sprachrückmeldung","Erzeugen von Pull-Requests auf der Grundlage von Problem-Anweisungen","Auslösen von GitHub Copilot für automatisierte Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código com feedback em linguagem natural","Gerar solicitações de pull com base em instruções de problema","Acionar o GitHub Copilot para correções de bugs automatizadas"],"ru":["Автоматизация обзоров кода с обратной связью на естественном языке","Генерация запросов на включение на основе инструкций проблемы","Запуск GitHub Copilot для автоматического исправления ошибок"],"ar":["أتمتة مراجعة الكود مع ملاحظات اللغة الطبيعية","إنشاء طلبات السحب بناءً على تعليمات المشكلة","تشغيل جيت هاب كوبيلوت لتصحيح الأخطاء أتمتيكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI extension installation","Limited to GitHub Copilot functionality","Needs access to GitHub repository and issues"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI 扩展","仅限 GitHub Copilot 功能","需要访问 GitHub 仓库和问题"],"ja":["GitHub CLI 拡張機能のインストールが必要","GitHub Copilot の機能に限定","GitHub リポジトリおよび問題へのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 확장 기능 설치 필요","GitHub Copilot 기능만 사용 가능","GitHub 저장소 및 문제에 대한 액세스 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la extensión GitHub CLI","Limitado a la funcionalidad de GitHub Copilot","Necesita acceso al repositorio y problemas de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''extension GitHub CLI","Limité à la fonctionnalité de GitHub Copilot","Nécessite l''accès au référentiel et aux problèmes GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der GitHub-CLI-Erweiterung","Begrenzt auf die Funktionalität von GitHub Copilot","Benötigt den Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository und die GitHub-Probleme"],"pt":["Requer instalação da extensão do GitHub CLI","Limitado à funcionalidade do GitHub Copilot","Necessita acesso ao repositório e problemas do GitHub"],"ru":["Требуется установка расширения GitHub CLI","Ограничен функциональностью GitHub Copilot","Требуется доступ к репозиторию и проблемам GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ملحق واجهة سطر أوامر جيت هاب","محدود بالوظائف جيت هاب كوبيلوت","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى مستودع جيت هاب والمشاكل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a25dec86f649c29a991837ecbe5ab91f5fe02323fc987ebb8aaaebbdf15484d8","qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('maxfraieho/garden-seedling/gh-agent-session', 'community', 'maxfraieho', 'garden-seedling', 'maxfraieho/garden-seedling', 'gh-agent-session', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z', '2026-02-20T05:04:37.572Z', 'a25dec86f649c29a991837ecbe5ab91f5fe02323fc987ebb8aaaebbdf15484d8', '{"id":"maxfraieho/garden-seedling/gh-agent-session","name":"gh-agent-session","description":{"zh":"GitHub CLI 代理会话扩展允许开发者通过命令行创建 GitHub 代理会话，触发自动代码更改","ja":"GitHub CLI エージェント セッション拡張により、開発者はコマンドラインから GitHub エージェント セッションを作成し、自動コード変更をトリガーできる","ko":"GitHub CLI 에이전트 세션 확장을 통해 개발자는 명령줄을 통해 GitHub 에이전트 세션을 생성하고 자동 코드 변경을 트리거할 수 있습니다","es":"La extensión de línea de comandos gh agent-task permite crear sesiones de agente de GitHub para automatizar cambios de código mediante instrucciones de lenguaje natural.","fr":"L''extension de ligne de commande gh agent-task permet de créer des sessions d''agent GitHub pour automatiser les modifications de code à l''aide d''instructions de langage naturel.","de":"Die Befehlszeilen-Erweiterung gh agent-task ermöglicht die Erstellung von GitHub-Agent-Sitzungen, um Codeänderungen mithilfe natürlicher Sprachanweisungen zu automatisieren.","pt":"A extensão do CLI do agente do GitHub permite criar sessões de agente do GitHub para alterações automatizadas de código","ru":"Расширение CLI агента GitHub позволяет создавать сессии агента GitHub для автоматических изменений кода","ar":"ممتد CLI وكيل GitHub يسمح بإنشاء جلسات وكيل GitHub لتعديلات الكود الآلية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub CLI Agent 会议扩展","ja":"GitHub CLI エージェント セッション拡張","ko":"GitHub CLI 에이전트 세션 확장","es":"Sesión de agente de GitHub CLI","fr":"Session d''agent GitHub CLI","de":"GitHub CLI-Agent-Sitzung","pt":"Sessão de Agente GitHub: Automatize Alterações de Código","ru":"Сессия агента GitHub: автоматизируйте изменения кода","ar":"جلسة وكيل GitH