 Rolldown und Oxc","Bedingte Konfiguration","Laden von Umgebungen"],"pt":["Servidor de desenvolvimento rápido","Compilação de produção otimizada","Suporte a TypeScript","Suporte a ESM","Configuração condicional","Carregamento de ambiente"],"ru":["Быстрый сервер разработки","Оптимизированное производство","Поддержка TypeScript","Поддержка ESM","Условная конфигурация","Загрузка окружения"],"ar":["خادم تطوير سريع","ترجمة إنتاج محسنة","دعم TypeScript","دعم ESM","تكوين شرطي","تحميل البيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite","前端构建工具","TypeScript","ES 模块","快速开发服务器","优化的生产构建"],"ja":["Vite","フロントエンドビルドツール","TypeScript","ES モジュール","高速な開発サーバー","最適化されたプロダクションビルド"],"ko":["Vite","프론트엔드 빌드 도구","TypeScript","ES 모듈","빠른 개발 서버","최적화된 프로덕션 빌드"],"es":["Vite","herramienta de compilación frontend","Rolldown","Oxc","TypeScript","ESM","HMR","desarrollo frontend","construcción de producción"],"fr":["Vite","outil de construction frontend","Rolldown","Oxc","TypeScript","ESM","HMR","développement frontend","construction de production"],"de":["Vite","Frontend-Build-Tool","Rolldown","Oxc","TypeScript","ESM","HMR","Frontend-Entwicklung","Produktionsbuild"],"pt":["Vite","ferramenta de build frontend","servidor de desenvolvimento rápido","compilação de produção otimizada","TypeScript","ESM","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Vite","инструмент построения frontend","быстрый сервер разработки","оптимизированное производство","TypeScript","ESM","веб-разработка"],"ar":["Vite","أداة بناء واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","خادم تطوير سريع","ترجمة إنتاج فعالة","TypeScript","ESM","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"ajiu9","repo":"skills","repoPath":"ajiu9/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vite","description":"Vite build tool configuration, plugin API, SSR, and Vite 8 Rolldown migration. Use when working with Vite projects, vite.config.ts, Vite plugins, or building libraries/SSR apps with Vite.","version":"2026.1.31","bodyPreview":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](refere","body":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| Features | `import.meta.glob`, asset queries (`?raw`, `?url`), `import.meta.env`, HMR API | [core-features](references/core-features.md) |\n| Plugin API | Vite-specific hooks, virtual modules, plugin ordering | [core-plugin-api](references/core-plugin-api.md) |\n\n## Build & SSR\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Build & SSR | Library mode, SSR middleware mode, `ssrLoadModule`, JavaScript API | [build-and-ssr](references/build-and-ssr.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Environment API | Vite 6+ multi-environment support, custom runtimes | [environment-api](references/environment-api.md) |\n| Rolldown Migration | Vite 8 changes: Rolldown bundler, Oxc transformer, config migration | [rolldown-migration](references/rolldown-migration.md) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### CLI Commands\n\n```bash\nvite              # Start dev server\nvite build        # Production build\nvite preview      # Preview production build\nvite build --ssr  # SSR build\n```\n\n### Common Config\n\n```ts\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [],\n  resolve: { alias: { ''@'': ''/src'' } },\n  server: { port: 3000, proxy: { ''/api'': ''http://localhost:8080'' } },\n  build: { target: ''esnext'', outDir: ''dist'' },\n})\n```\n\n### Official Plugins\n\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue` - Vue 3 SFC support\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx` - Vue 3 JSX\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react` - React with Oxc/Babel\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react-swc` - React with SWC\n- `@vitejs/plugin-legacy` - Legacy browser support\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:05:19.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Development Agents requiring rapid and optimized build processes with native ESM and HMR support.","zh":"适用于需要快速和优化的构建过程，支持原生 ESM 和 HMR 的前端开发代理。","ja":"ネイティブの ESM と HMR をサポートする高速化されたビルド プロセスを必要とするフロントエンド開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"네이티브 ESM과 HMR를 지원하는 빠르고 최적화된 빌드 프로세스가 필요한 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Frontend que requieren procesos de compilación rápidos y optimizados con soporte nativo de ESM y HMR.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement frontend nécessitant des processus de construction rapides et optimisés avec un support natif ESM et HMR.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die schnelle und optimierte Build-Prozesse mit nativem ESM- und HMR-Unterstützung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento frontend que requerem processos de compilação rápidos e otimizados com suporte nativo a ESM e HMR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки frontend, требующих быстрых и оптимизированных процессов сборки с родной поддержкой ESM и HMR.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى عمليات بناء سريعة ومحسنة مع دعم أصلي لـ ESM و HMR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Vite''s fast dev server and optimized production builds, utilizing Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer for enhanced performance, while preferring TypeScript and ESM over CommonJS.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Vite 快速的开发服务器和优化的生产构建，利用 Rolldown 捆绑器和 Oxc 转换器来提高性能，同时更喜欢使用 TypeScript 和 ESM 而不是 CommonJS。","ja":"Vite の高速開発サーバーと最適化されたプロダクション ビルドを利用し、Rolldown バンドラーと Oxc トランスフォーマーを使用してパフォーマンスを向上させ、TypeScript と ESM を CommonJS よりも好みます。","ko":"Vite의 빠른 개발 서버와 최적화된 프로덕션 빌드를 사용하고, Rolldown 번들러와 Oxc 트랜스포ーマ를 사용하여 성능을 향상시키며, TypeScript와 ESM을 CommonJS보다 선호합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar el servidor de desarrollo rápido de Vite y las compilaciones de producción optimizadas, utilizando el empacador Rolldown y el transformador Oxc para un rendimiento mejorado, prefiriendo TypeScript y ESM sobre CommonJS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti du serveur de développement rapide de Vite et des builds de production optimisés, en utilisant le bundleur Rolldown et le transformateur Oxc pour des performances améliorées, en préférant TypeScript et ESM à CommonJS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Vites schnellen Dev-Server und optimierte Produktionsbuilds zu nutzen, indem sie den Rolldown-Bundler und den Oxc-Transformer für verbesserte Leistung verwenden, wobei TypeScript und ESM gegenüber CommonJS bevorzugt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o servidor de desenvolvimento rápido do Vite e compilações de produção otimizadas, utilizando o empacotador Rolldown e o transformador Oxc para desempenho aprimorado, preferindo TypeScript e ESM em relação ao CommonJS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать быстрый сервер разработки Vite и оптимизированные сборки для производства, используя пакетный менеджер Rolldown и трансформатор Oxc для повышения производительности, отдавая предпочтение TypeScript и ESM над CommonJS.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من خادم التطوير السريع من Vite وعمليات البناء المُحسنة للإنتاج، باستخدام حزمة Rolldown ومحول Oxc لتحسين الأداء، مع تفضيل TypeScript و ESM على CommonJS."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Vite 