versiones de control","contenerización","ci/cd","infraestructura","patrones de github actions"],"fr":["github actions","devops basics","automatisation de tâches","versions de contrôle","conteneurisation","ci/cd","infrastructure","modèles de github actions"],"de":["github actions","devops basics","automatisierung von aufgaben","versionskontrolle","containerisierung","ci/cd","infrastruktur","muster für github actions"],"pt":["github actions","devops basics","automatização de tarefas","controle de versão","containerização","ci/cd","infraestrutura","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["github actions","devops basics","автоматизация задач","контроль версий","контейнеризация","ci/cd","инфраструктура","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["github actions","أساسيات devops","أتمتة المهام","مراقبة الإصدار","تحويل البرمجيات إلى حاويات","ci/cd","البنية التحتية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-actions-starter","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Github Actions Starter\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for github actions starter tasks within the DevOps Basics domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"github actions starter\" in your request\n- Ask about github actions starter patterns or best practices\n- Need help with foundational devops skills covering version control, containerization, basic ci/cd, and infrastructure fundamentals.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step gu","body":"# Github Actions Starter\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for github actions starter tasks within the DevOps Basics domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"github actions starter\" in your request\n- Ask about github actions starter patterns or best practices\n- Need help with foundational devops skills covering version control, containerization, basic ci/cd, and infrastructure fundamentals.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for github actions starter\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with github actions starter\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of devops basics concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **DevOps Basics** skill category.\nTags: devops, git, docker, ci-cd, infrastructure\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:06:17.450Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated assistance with GitHub Actions starter tasks and foundational CI/CD skills","zh":"适用于需要自动化 GitHub Actions 入门任务和基础 CI/CD 技能的 DevOps Agent","ja":"GitHub Actions のスターター タスクおよび基礎的な CI/CD スキルを自動化する必要がある DevOps エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub Actions 시작 태스크 및 기본 CI/CD 기술을 자동화해야 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren asistencia automatizada con tareas iniciales de GitHub Actions y habilidades fundamentales de CI/CD","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une assistance automatisée pour les tâches de démarrage GitHub Actions et les compétences fondamentales en CI/CD","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die automatisierte Unterstützung bei GitHub Actions-Startaufgaben und grundlegenden CI/CD-Fähigkeiten benötigen","pt":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated assistance with GitHub Actions starter tasks and foundational CI/CD skills","ru":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated assistance with GitHub Actions starter tasks and foundational CI/CD skills","ar":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated assistance with GitHub Actions starter tasks and foundational CI/CD skills"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate DevOps workflows using GitHub Actions, providing step-by-step guidance on version control, containerization, and infrastructure fundamentals, leveraging YAML files and GitHub APIs","zh":"赋予代理自动化 DevOps 工作流的能力，使用 GitHub Actions 提供版本控制、容器化和基础设施基础的步骤指南，利用 YAML 文件和 GitHub API","ja":"エージェントに DevOps ワークフローを自動化する能力を与え、GitHub Actions を使用してバージョン管理、コンテナ化、インフラストラクチャの基礎に関するステップバイステップのガイダンスを提供し、YAML ファイルと GitHub API を活用","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub Actions를 사용하여 DevOps 워크플ロー 자동화를 가능하게 하며 버전 제어, 컨테이너화 및 인프라 기본에 대한 단계별 지침을 제공하고 YAML 파일 및 GitHub API를 활용","es":"Capacita a los agentes para automatizar flujos de trabajo de DevOps utilizando GitHub Actions, proporcionando orientación paso a paso sobre control de versiones, containerización y fundamentos de infraestructura, aprovechando archivos YAML y las API de GitHub","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail DevOps en utilisant GitHub Actions, en fournissant des conseils étape par étape sur le contrôle de version, la conteneurisation et les fondamentaux de l''infrastructure, en exploitant les fichiers YAML et les API GitHub","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, DevOps-Workflows mit GitHub Actions zu automatisieren, bietet Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitungen zur Versionskontrolle, Containerisierung und In